window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2501,"title":"Chapter 2501: Chapter 2500 Dissociation! II","paragraphs":["2500 Dissociation! II","From their ranks, one being rose up as its sleek black fur radiated grandeur in the surroundings.","It came to float in front of the visage of the True Emperor of Quintessence as it spoke with reverence!","\"Master, grant me the honor to be the first to experience and show off a hint of your majesty.\"","...!","The Emperor Penguin bent its sleek head, golden beak, and flippers as Noah smiled with a nod.","The first one to experience Realm Reconstruction as it currently held the Nine Natures Extremity Foundation.","It would be the first to undergo Existence Dissociation as while gazing at the Emperor Penguin, Noah's finger tapped out.","HOONG!","Essence seethed and surged as emerald light bloomed.","The Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity filled the environment as those nearby felt their Boundaries tremble with happiness at only being near such a pristine authority!","And on the body of the Emperor Penguin...","\"OOOH!\"","A grand bellow released from it as a blinding emerald singularity bloomed and was then subsequently pulled out from its body, its bright luster momentarily fading as beside it, the emerald light formed into nothing else other than...the Vitalistic Seed of Rebirth.","A seed that released blinding radiance as it began to burn and released gorgeous emerald flames- flames that sought more qi and Vitality as this was where Noah's input of Soul and Mana Values came in.","And from him, essence flowed out freely as the burning Vitalistic Seed of Rebirth congealed to form an outline of the Emperor Penguin- his Aspects of Existence, Realm, foundation, and everything else about him being replicated in an extremely short period of time!","THUMP!","A symphony of grandeur rang out in the background as Xiaomi and a few others raised their heads around, wondering why the hell qi was causing sequences of symphonies to play out.","Yet before them, the sleek black-furred body of an Emperor Penguin formed, verdant streaks of fur painting over its body like an ancient vital tattoo as its golden beak had majestic emerald lines etched on it.","Its pupils emanated pure emerald light as it roared out, everything about it being exactly the same as the Original as the first Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity was born!","Just like the original, this body of the Emperor Penguin bowed to Noah as he nodded while speaking out.","\"This second body is entirely dissociated from the Original one as it can be treated as an Experimental Body, being capable of cultivating and pondering on concepts of Extremity by itself as only when the Main Existence recalls it will its advancement and benefits be assimilated. With such a body, one can do many things...\"","As he spoke, Noah focused on the Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity of the Emperor Penguin as he asked a question that caused mouths to gape open in shock.","\"Do you wish to be the first to undergo Apexification?\"","...!","He asked such a dreadfully ridiculous question as many mouths flung open and nearly dropped to the verdant floor!","Others proceeded with Apexification when they had built their Foundation and could not gain any more power in their current stage.","When they had confidence that their Foundation and Boundaries had prepared them enough.","When they swallowed an Extremity Panacea and attained an Extremity Foundation, their bodies would condense Meridians that affirmed their Foundation as the more Extremity Meridians there were, the stronger one was in their Foundation!","This was the progression for others.","Noah...he was still growing rapidly as there was no ceiling as he knew...there was still much he could do before undergoing Apexification.","It meant that when the time came for him to actually take this step, it would outstrip any beings who had undergone Apexification before!","He held 81 Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds.","Each one would bloom into a Meridian during Apexification as he needed to make sure each of these seeds held a Boundary that could be taken to the 10th Boundary Layer at the time of his Apexification.","He needed to increase his total number of Boundaries to 81 before anything could be done as he couldn't waste an easy pathway of taking Boundaries to the 10th Layer while also enacting a foundation nobody else had done before!","It meant that apart from Wrath in the Seven Deadly Sins, there other concepts would be getting elevated towards Extremity next.","It meant that other concepts that defined him in the past and a few new ones would be added to his roster!","As Noah gazed towards the Clone of the Emperor Penguin and put on this grand show that would express a glimpse of just what would be happening in the coming Apex War, his Soul was already sending multiple commands.","'Elevate Pride towards Extremity...and Gluttony, Devouring, Lust, Envy, and Sloth.\"","...!","Deep within him, his Soul burned brightly as the remaining concepts of the Seven Deadly Sins were expanded to have Boundary Layers.","This wasn't all as to reach the 81 Boundaries number, Noah continued!","'Expand Commandment towards Extremity...along with Antediluvian, Cthulhu, Summoning, Runes, Smithing...'","Within him where nobody could see, a great deal of changes occurred as over a dozen concepts were expanded towards Extremity, many more to follow until Noah hit the number 81!","And at this time, the verdant gold beak of the Vitalistic Clone of Extremity bowed even further down as the Emperor Penguin replied with valor.","\"May Master please grace me with this opportunity as well.\"","WAA!","The clone had the same fealty as the original as Noah began to release a pulse of his Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Value and Mana towards the Origin of this being that he forged himself!","An Origin that gave way to the Nine Natures Extremity Foundation forged from the 9 Natural Laws that stated the following prompt when it was first forged.","[...When all of the 9 Natures correlating to its Origin reach the 9th Boundary Layer and the 9 Planes of Nature reach complete saturation, the First Spiritual Beast can undergo Apexification with a 100% chance of rising to become an Apex Aeonic Lifeform with a Nine Natures Meridian Apex Aeonic Foundation...]","He used his qi to Reconstruct the realm of this being before him as an input of more of his essence could bring its 9 Planes of Nature within its Origin towards saturation.","The condition of the 9 Natural Laws achieving the 9th Boundary Layer was even easier!","It would directly meet all the prerequisites to birth an Apex Aeonic Lifeform with a 100% certainty, even though the soul of the Emperor Penguin and its Foundation could have spent a longer period of time making itself even more perfect before proceeding towards this step!","But...this was why the Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity was here.","To do things the Main Body may not want to do yet.","As Noah was about to take an utterly magisterial action, his voice echoed once more.","\"What I'm about to do is meant to show all those who were beginning to cower that in the Apex War to come, your presence will not even be required.\"","...!","The faces of some Apex Aeonic Lernaeans changed and became dark as Noah continued.","\"In the days and weeks to come, I will produce Apex Aeonic Lifeforms in my ranks that far exceed any of you, or any common Apex Aeonic Lifeforms. Those who wish to be a part of this grandeur can either bend the knee and follow ...or seek their opportunities elsewhere.\"","WAA!"]},{"number":2502,"title":"Chapter 2502: Chapter 2501 Merely Forging An Apex Aeonic Lifeform! I","paragraphs":["2501 Merely Forging an Apex Aeonic Lifeform! I","His words were utterly ruthless towards the Apex Aeonic Lernaeans as he let them know that their presence here...was something that wasn't entirely required!","But if they did wish to embark on a glorious path unlike any other, they had to bend the knee towards an existence that had yet to undergo Apexification, and yet he claimed he could produce as many Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as he wished!","Aurelia and Orion were silent.","They had already seen too many things from this being as they wouldn't be quick to dismiss his words, but the moment they took them seriously...the sheer gravity and possibilities if he could actually do what he said he could...it was mind blowing to even speculate!","But the True Emperor of Quintessence didn't speculate or speak nonsense as the moment after he spoke, his authority surged from his body and entered the Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity before him.","His pristine Quintessential Hyperversal Soul and Mana Values that held traces of Indefatigable, Aletheian, and Vitalistic authorities!","They flowed into the Nine Natures Extremity Foundation- the Nine Planes of the Clone of the Emperor Penguin as within them, tens of billions of Cosmos proliferated every second.","They expanded and became reinforced by his pristine essence as they grew ever larger, the existence that the clone of the Emperor Penguin released beginning to exceed the original!","And to top all of this, multiple streams of Sources of Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity flowed from Noah and entered the soul of the Vitalistic Clone.","Loot that would take his 9 Boundaries of Nature to the 9th Boundary Layer!","And in addition to this, Noah also sent the expanded concept of Pride into the Emperor Penguin for it to be brought to the 9th Boundary Layer- this being a concept that this existence had defined itself with all this time!","It would be up to him to decide where this would be the concept that defined him.","This would get all the necessary conditions to match as the process of making an Apex Aeonic Lifeform was not an easy one.","What Noah was doing now...was something similar to what Hyperversal Extremities of Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity and those from the Seven Clans did for their most prized Scions!","They would allow their Hyperversal Extremity Authority to flow into their bodies and refine their Aspects of Existence after the Scions had their Foundation pushed to the extremes, and they would aid them in their Apex Transformation as it was the safest way to do so.","What Noah was doing...was building the foundation and boundaries of the Emperor Penguin along with inputting his authority as it was through his means of Realm Restructuring that the Nine Natures Extremity Foundation which guaranteed a successful Apexification was born!","He did everything.","THUMP!","The Origin within the Emperor Penguin thumped like a beating heart as it enlarged and grew more radiant by the second, swallowing all of Noah's authority and going towards Full Capacity as on top of Noah...even the very surroundings had streams of Gravitation, Polarity, Weak Nuclear Force...","streams of the Nine Natural Laws flowed from the very Infinite Hyperversal Haven as this process was made all that much faster.","The Nine Natures Extremity Foundation became all that much more exemplary until...","SHIING!","Like a dazzling emerald sun, the body of the Vitalistic Clone of Extremity radiated pure authority.","The surrounding reality buzzed and resonated with it as this...was truly an Extremity Foundation based on the Laws of Nature!","The rulings that kept together Reality itself!","It wasn't something to be scoffed at as prompts rode before Noah's eyes.","[The Nine Planes of Nature within the target have absorbed Quintessential Dominance and reached a level of saturation.]","[The Nine Natural Laws relating to the Nine Planes of Nature within the target have also reached the set requirement.]","[The process of Apex Transformation with 100% success can now take place on the selected target.]","Brilliance shone before Noah as he spoke out with a thunderous voice towards the Aspects of Existence of the Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity.","\"Advance.\"","WAA!","Even after he spoke, some still didn't entirely believe him.","Off to a floating verdant island on the side, Caesar watched with a somber gaze while Xiaomi felt her soul buzz when she looked at the ongoing transformations.","She was a once in a trillion years genius even after her affliction as her eyes could see many things others couldn't.","There was one other person beside her who saw many more things compared to even the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms here, his visage being located in the back as he had a radiant white lab coat adorned on his body.","They all watched the grandiosity blooming before them as the clone of the Emperor Penguin bellowed out with a mighty roar!","\"RAA!\"","A piercing cry that shook the surrounding reality as to the pure incredulity of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, this being truly did start the process of Apexification.","But unlike how it was for all of them when they started it...this existence instantly illuminated with 9 dazzling Extremity Meridians the moment he decided to break through.","...!","The Extremity Meridian was something called forth by one's own Boundaries when they sought a pathway past the 9th Boundary Layer.","The 9th Layer was a huge wall to pass as getting over it necessary the help of a Meridian- and if one's Foundation was great enough, many Meridians would be formed as an existence could successfully survive this process known as Apex Transformation as through it, they would attain another level as a lifeform!","If one's Foundation was weak, the called out Meridians would fracture and their very Aspects of Existence would be at risk of being destroyed- unless they held profound treasures or aid from more powerful existences.","When Caesar broke through, one Extremity Meridian had appeared as his Foundation made it possible for more and more to gradually form until he reached 9!","And yet for this being before them, 9 appeared right away as they seemed to resonate with the 9 Planes of Nature within its Origin!"]},{"number":2503,"title":"Chapter 2503: Chapter 2502 Merely Forging An Apex Aeonic Lifeform! II","paragraphs":["2502 Merely Forging an Apex Aeonic Lifeform! II","It was the finalizing of a foundation in order to take it to an even greater stage.","Taking all of one's accomplishments and culminating them into a single concept through the ushered Extremity Meridians!","THUMP!","The body of the Vitalistic Clone pulsed as after the appearance of 9 Extremity Meridians, another 9 flashed into existence soon after.","They rose like pillars that made his body as their light reflected into the surroundings, preposterous levels of authority blaring out as not too long after...","THUMP!","Another 9 Meridians flashed into existence.","\"...\"","The Apex Aeonic Lifeforms watching this became extremely quiet.","Their eyes felt like they were lying to them as the number of Extremity Meridians they could see had long since exceeded what any of them had managed to forge!","The average number amongst them was 7 as even this figure was pushed higher because Aurelia had forged 18 Extremity Meridians while Orion had formed 15!","Yet this being before them had already forged 27 as by the time they blinked again...","THUMP!","Another resounding boom echoed from his body as yet another 9 Meridians showed themselves.","\"...\"","Utter silence was all that could be heard along with the pulsing of glorious authority, 36 Extremity Meridians swirling within the Emperor Penguin's body as an instant later...its existence began to be drawn into these Meridians.","[36 Nine Natures Extremity Meridians have been forged on the selected target.]","[Awaiting for the target to define their Existence.]","\"...\"","To define oneself.","Almost always, existences had to choose a single concept that suited who they were the most in order to proceed with their Apexification successfully.","If they chose a concept they weren't truly compatible with or didn't truly define them, or if they chose multiple concepts that their Meridians could in no way handle...the fracture of their Meridians and possible death was all that waited for them!","So the Emperor Penguin looked deep into himself, and then made his choice rather quickly as the path was already laid out before him by his Master.","\"The Nine Natures shall define me.\"","WAA!","What his Origin and Foundation were made of.","The Emperor Penguin instinctively felt that his Meridians could handle such a definition- that his Nine Natures Extremity Meridians were made in order for him to define himself in such a manner!","But...he wasn't done as he also sought to define himself with something he had since the day he was born as the First Spiritual Beast.","\"Pride.\"","...!","\"Pride shall also define me.\"","His 36 Meridians spun as a golden light blared forth.","His body began to disappear into glimmers of light that were absorbed into these Meridians.","His forged Origin flickered and was also absorbed into these Meridians!","His soul released waves of glory as it sank into the 36 Nine Natures Extremity Meridian- these multicolored pillars of venous light seeming like the only thing that remained of the Vitalistic Clone of Extremity.","The moment of life and death.","All of the past self was absorbed into the Meridians as nothing of the past life form remained.","If one was successful, the concept that defined them would be stable and wondrous enough to be the spark that initiated their path of an entirely different Lifeform.","Of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","For the Emperor Penguin...it wasn't even a question of success or failure as his Extremity Foundation had already guaranteed brilliance!","And so...brilliance unfolded.","SHIING!","The 36 Nine Natures Extremity Meridians released glorious tendrils of light that began to reform the devoured Aspects of Existence.","They took in the ancient and erased it as they spat out something entirely new, with them standing as the backbone- as the skeletal structure of this new existence!","As he reformed...the clear and distinct aura of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform bloomed.","And it was a heavy one.","It was a mighty one that caused the recently advanced Caesar to open his Quasarian eyes in shock!","An aura that even caused the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms behind Aurelia and Orion to pulse in disbelief!","Because this aura...already gave off a feeling as if it was mightier than them!","Sleek black fur tinted with emerald and gold ancient like runic tattoos.","A piercing beak radiating gold and green splendor.","A presence that seemed larger than its Original body by miles as everything within its cells screamed power and grandiosity!","\"RAA!\"","Its bellow caused the surrounding Reality to splinter this time around as an overpowering aura emanated from him!","[The selected target has successfully undergone Apexification and obtained the Nine Natures Meridian Apex Foundation.]","[With enough effort and comprehension, the extrapolation and Convergence of an Absolute Seed of Extremity based on the Nine Natures Meridian Apex Foundation can occur.]","[You have successfully reformed the Aspects of an existence, Reconstructed their Realm, and forged them into a higher form of life for the first time.]","[Your Hyperversal Mastery had increased from .6 to .9]","[Your Hyperversal Dignity had increased from .6 to .9]","[The detailed panel of the forged Apex Aeonic Lifeform is now available.]","Waves of prompts thundered down as they culminated into a bright gold status panel that bloomed above the visage of the Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity!","[Name]:: Emperor Penguin","[Realm]:: Boundary Expansion(Aeonic Nature Haven)","[Lineage]:: Emperor Penguin","[Titles]:: The First Spiritual Beast, The Sin of Pride, RAA!...","[Nine Natures Apex Mana Value]:: 30","[Nine Natures Apex Vitality Value]:: 40","[Nine Natures Apex Soul Value]:: 30","[Nine Natures Apex Defense Value]:: 40","[Nine Natures Apex Damage Value]:: 30","[Dynamis of Extremity]:: None","[Boundaries of Extremity]:: Pride, Gravitation, Polarity, Weak Nuclear Force, Strong Nuclear Force...","\"...\"","Right after Apexification, most Lifeforms found themselves with a singular Apex Aeonic Soul Value of one.","Prized Scions and those with distinguished foundations could maybe exceed 10 and go higher.","The Emperor Penguin's clone...started out with a base of 30 Nine Natures Apex Soul Values!","And this number was bound to change as...","[A Boundary you have expanded is being elevated past the 9th Boundary Layer in the Extremity Meridians of your Vassal!]","...!"]},{"number":2504,"title":"Chapter 2504: Chapter 2503 Merely Forging An Apex Aeonic","paragraphs":["Lifeform! III","[A Boundary you have expanded is being elevated past the 9th Boundary Layer in the Extremity Meridians of your Vassal!] ...!","The Clone of the Emperor Penguin had defined itself with Pride and the Nine Natural Laws!","Ultimately these were the boundaries being elevated from the 9th and into the 10th Boundary Layer as the Infinite Hyperversal Haven began to buzz with grandeur.","When the Nine Natural Laws went ever closer to Extremity, the Infinite Hyperversal Haven benefitted.","The only issue now was that the existence who bound their sources had them at the 9th Boundary Layer- contained in his Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds that were simply waiting to bloom, but his Vassal was taking them to the next layer right now as his Meridians were fully established!","[An Absolute Nature of Extremity is in conflict!]","[The 10th Layer of Extremity and above require an Extremity Meridian to manifest and be utilized by your Existence freely.] [Yet the authority of 10 Boundaries expanded by you exceeding the 9th Boundary Layer is occurring within your Vassal!]","...!","A conflict on the flow of Extremity!","It occurred in a step by step manner as what was happening currently should not be a possibility.","Thus, a conflict was born as it needed to be corrected!","[The Boundary of Pride has attained the 10th Boundary Layer within your Vassal as even though you cannot grasp and manipulate its advanced authority, your 81 Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds absorb a portion of its authority!]","His body which was already magnificent radiated golden splendor.","His Foundation which held 81 dazzling seeds became even more exuberant as a wondrous light was seen being pulled within it!","[The absorbed authority of a Boundary that has achieved the 10th Layer will empower the 81 Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds.","When a sufficient amount of such authority is collected, there is a high probability that when a Meridian Seed Blooms, the concept contained within it will automatically cross the 10th and reach the 11th Boundary Layer.]","WAA!","As the glorious seeds of his foundation bathed in a unique authority, Noah received a massive potential boon for the future while the body of the Vitalistic Clone of Extremity before him only released a grander air of power!","And as this occurred...","[The Boundary of Gravitation has attained the 10th Boundary Layer within your Vassal as even though you cannot grasp and manipulate its advanced authority, your 81 Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds absorb a portion of its authority...]","[The Boundary of Polarity has attained the 10th Boundary Layer...] 9 more prompts came down after the first one of Pride as Noah drank in all of their power as well.","And towards the very end...","[The Infinite Hyperversal Haven has attained even greater authority due to its Natural Laws getting ever closer to Extremity, but it cannot express the full effect of such authority until the one who has bound their Source grasps this Authority themselves.] The Infinite Hyperversal Haven buzzed with bombastic waves of power as from this event, many sides made gains!","The suffocating might of an unrestrained Apex Aeonic Lifeform blazed out freely from the Emperor Penguin shining with black and gold fur, an emerald color covering his eyes and beak as he made himself known to all.","At such a juncture, Noah's piercing gaze turned towards Aurelia and Orion as he spoke calmly.","\"Send one of the Apex Aeonic Lernaeans behind you forward.\"","...!","\"Huh?\"","Amidst their shock at this being actually doing what he said he would do, their souls were roused as they gauged the situation before them.","Aurelia and Orion quickly understood the meaning of Noah's words as Orion sighed while voicing out loudly.","\"Lucia...step forward.\"","A dazzling woman adorned in a pink battledress was among the few who would entirely listen to Orion, and her eyes hardened as she heeded his call and floated towards one of the few empty verdant floating islands in this area!","Noah nodded when he saw this as he waved his hands and made his intentions clear to all.","\"Take a strike from my Vassal.\"","...!","Not even fight.","He simply said for this Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who had set up herself for an unknown number of years...to only just see if she could take a strike from his Vassal!","From a being who had freshly finished their Apexification!","\"RAA!\"","The Emperor Penguin followed the commands of the True Emperor of Quintessence as it appeared above the island Lucia stood on, its right flipper rising up as above it...a blinding golden point of light began to form.","It seemed too grand and glorious in color as even though it was small, it held within it an immense amount of pride!","It began to enlarge as since an Apex Aeonic Lifeform's essence was forming it, it ballooned from a small point into a massive golden sun that entirely encompassed even the verdant landmass Lucia stood on- her gaze changing greatly as pink layers of defensive lights began to manifest around her.","Yet the halcyon sun of pure Pride that the Emperor Penguin had called out above his flipper melted and vaporized the rising defenses Lucia was making before it even began to descend!","It should have burned everything nearby, and yet the Emperor Penguin seemed to have utmost control as the blazing heat of Pride was only focused on the being and region below him.","\"Ah...\" And Lucia couldn't help but cry out as the defensive layers she was forming burnt faster than she could call them out, her form feeling like it was under the crushing vaporizing heat of a deadly Singularity as before the strike could even come down...","\"I yield!\"","...!","The words left her mouth before she knew it as her bountiful chest heaved when facing the heat above. Her battle dress had nearly melted as before its pressure, she had nearly sunk to her knees!","The situation caused utter silence to descend as above her, the emerald gaze of the Emperor Penguin flashed gold as the sun instantly disappeared just as rapidly as it had appeared.","At a speed that those who weren't Apex Aeonic Lifeforms couldn't even follow!"]},{"number":2505,"title":"Chapter 2505: Chapter 2504 A Setting Battlefield!","paragraphs":["Silence.","\"...\"","The gazes of the Apex Aeonic Lernaeans were ashen as they looked at the scene ahead of them!","Xiaomi's eyes sparkled while beside her, her Father cursed inwardly at such a scene.","Because he very clearly remembered a promise he had made with the Man who had just forged an Apex Aeonic Lifeform that could dominate an established Apex Aeonic Lifeform- much less him who had just advanced!","Shock and incredulity spread all around as Noah's voice resounded out.","\"This was a presentation to show some of you that Apex Aeonic Lifeforms even stronger than you can be produced at the wave of my hand.\"","Silence reigned as all eyes focused on him.","\"And I can go much further to even reforge the Origin and Realms of Supreme Eternal Lifeforms.\"","...!","Words that caused even Aurelia's and Orion's eyes to open wide in shock rang out.","And his gaze was moreso focused on them as he didn't seem to care much for the others!","\"Did you advance without an Extremity Foundation? Do you actually wish to have a genuine chance of attaining Extremity? To have an Apex Foundation of Extreme Power that makes a possibility for you to form an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity? It's all possible for a small price!\"","WAA!","A small price.","A price of their souls.","A price of fealty!","Brilliance shone as the situation developed into a fantastical path in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","-","Meanwhile, in the area filled with tendrils of Ruin and Nullity where Noah had almost come to a full clash with the Noblesse Lineage.","This same location was determined to be where the Apex War would take place as it would be the Apex Battlefield!","Currently, there was an endless transparent veil that pierced up towards the skies and down towards a razed Crimson and silver earth as if it divided two sides. And it truly did so as above the skies of one side, an illusory blue runic character that read [LERNAEAN] was etched gorgeously as on the other side, an illusory black character that read [NOBLESSE] was carved wondrously.","And on the side shining with the blue light, one could see a cluster of 5 Primeval Shadow Ancients shrouded in darkness as their gazes were cold and somber.","This was because on the other side of the transparent barrier, they could see the figures of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms whom they recognized from their insignias and essence to be from the Genesis Institute of Extremity and Singularity Overseers!","They currently numbered 9 all together as their eyes were just as cold as theirs.","The parties that represented three Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity were all in a single location as before an Apex War began, any faction that wished to join in support of any side had to make it clear and have their forces stationed on the chosen side of the Apex Battlefield.","The 5 Primeval Shadow Ancients floated on the side of Lerneans as they had received much more information about the being that Grand Primeval Silas had made an unknown deal with- this buzz even reaching their Cult of Endless Shadows as their close allies had reached out to them to discern their relationship with the Scion that had forged an Ultimate Power of Extremity and massacred hundreds of other Scions in the ongoing Initiation Step of Extremity Sanctification of Dissolution!","And in the last few minutes, they had received a command through their shared communication channel as it didn't even come from Grand Primeval Silas- it stemmed from a Hyperversal Extremity of their Cult of Endless Shadows.","The command was singular in nature.","[Stand by the side of the Lernaeans and wait for the time when the Adjudicator moves to save his life. After the dust has settled, we will have a Scion who attained an Absolute Seed of Extremity before even undergoing Apexification in our Cult. This will further cement our rise as an Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity!]","...!","A command that revealed many beings had the mindset that the one who called himself the True Emperor of Quintessence- a being who had forged an Ultimate Power of Extremity even before Apexification...most beings believed he wouldn't perish in this Apex War even if he wanted to!","He was a critical tool that if he really died under the watch of the current Adjudicator, it would bring their capabilities to question!","Existences who had become Supreme Eternal Lifeforms were the ones who delved and combined multiple Boundaries to forge Dynamis of Extremity.","Only the most powerful ones who had achieved the 16th and 17th Boundary Layers were lucky and powerful enough to forge Absolute Seeds of Extremity- and this number was low even amongst such beings!","It required someone truly special.","It was commonly Mutated Entities or existences with unheard of Extremity Foundations that rose across the Extremity","Sanctifications of the other 6 Havens.","And any such existences were protected in powerful Inheritances or part of the Seven Clans as they were guaranteed future Hyperversal Extremities!","Now, you have a being who managed to condense his Boundaries that hadn't even reached the 10th Layer, and converge nine of them or even more to produce an Absolute Seed of Extremity?","As far the the Primeval Shadow Ancients knew, such a thing wasn't Recorded in any history that could be verified!","Maybe rumors.","Maybe Whispers across the eons.","But never verified as it was for the being who had one of his bodies accompanied by Grand Primeval Silas as they went towards their Cult of Endless Shadows even now!","\"He seems difficult to handle though...will everything unfold smoothly as expected?\"","One of the Primeval Shadow Ancients remembered how the True Emperor of Quintessence had proclaimed himself when he came back with Silas and took the reins of the Lernaean Lineage.","Beside him, a woman shrouded in darkness replied with a sharp gaze.","\"It doesn't matter. We are the only Inheritance he is thus far connected to, with our Shadowlings reporting that he even denied an Invitation from the Sima Clan! Now...we're no Sima Clan, so the prestige of having a Scion that even such a pristine behemoth would accept...Mmm, we shall see how it all unfolds.\"","Expectations were high as an Apex Battlefield was beginning to be filled with its combatants, unknown forces with their own thoughts moving behind the scenes as each person sought for their own ideal future!"]},{"number":2506,"title":"Chapter 2506: Chapter 2505 Alexander King! I","paragraphs":["Between the endless cracks of Havens.","Thick and heavy authority pressed all space in different directions as the grandeur of two Dynamis of Extremity wrapped around 2 beings, the leading one coming to a stop at this time as he turned around and stared at the one behind him.","\"You've exceeded all my expectations.\"","Silas voiced out with sharp eyes as he stared at Noah's visage.","\"So much so that you've caused a buzz when news of all that you had done circulated to us. Yet...I truly cannot understand some of your choices. An Apex War of Annihilation? Did you agree to it purely because of the belief that the Adjudicator of Dissolution would not let someone like you die?\"","Silas felt many emotions when he stared at this being before him as all the accomplishments that were spreading about him so far were unsettling!","Especially when he had an Oath of Extremity with this being that he was now scrutinizing and beginning to ponder much more deeply on.","But some of the things he did like agreeing to an Apex War of Annihilation...it confused the minds of others!","And towards such a question, Noah stared calmly at Grand Primeval Elder Silas as the shadowy strands of hair of this being seemed to age just a few more years.","\"I never enter battles that I cannot survive and win.\"","His eyes showed his confidence and conviction as he continued.","\"Whether it be an Apex War of Annihilation or an Oath of Extremity against a Grand Elder of an Inheritance.\"","WAA!","Explosive words that pulled at Silas's mind rang out.","He stared at this being for a few seconds silently before he sighed, his authority of a Dynamis of Extremity erupting out as he began to move once more- albeit much slower this time around.","Noah raised his brows at this as before he could even ask, Silas's voice rang out.","\"A Hyperversal Shadow Extremity will be coming to fetch us so that our journey may be even faster. We cannot stray too far from our current coordinates or run the risk of coming across any unsavory Entities when it has been realized your value is much different than anticipated.\"","...!","To cross the indomitable walls of the Aeonic Havens of Extremity and into the Haven of Penumbra, it would have taken an Apex Aeonic Lifeform like Silas a few days!","Yet as the news of Noah spread to the Cult of Endless Shadows, an Esteemed Hyperversal Extremity was coming to fetch them as a level of importance was placed on the True Emperor of","Quintessence!","-","In a region above many of the grand locations in the Haven of Dissolution.","Transparent layers of clouds filled with potent Hyperversal Extremity Authority- much more than normal as the whole region seemed to be suffocating with such an authority at this moment!","At its core, the authority stemmed from the Adjudicator of Dissolution as the visage of the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction was nowhere to be seen!","Her lone grand figure stared towards the clone Noah had made which stood before her as she voiced out coldly.","\"The small forces of two Aeonic Inheritances stand against you with the Noblesse while you have the backing of a lesser Inheritance.","This...is all part of your grand plan? A being as astute as you who forged an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity cannot be stupid, so I'm curious to hear why you chose this destructive path.\"","The veiled figure of Svetlana gazed towards Noah with cold eyes that seemed to be weighing him and whether she should be leaning towards disappointment!","Yet his gaze was calm.","Even while faced with the scrutiny of a Hyperversal Extremity, Noah's soul remained free as he replied while walking forward.","\"Part of the reason why I gained access to Vacuous Hyperversal Authority and forged an Absolute Seed of Extremity is because of my nature.\"","...!","\"When enemies throw themselves at my feet, I grind them down and devour their power and years of cultivation to make it mine.","This Apex War...it will merely be a feeding ground for my","advancement towards Extremity!\"","BOOM!","His words were filled with utmost surety.","The Adjudicator of Dissolution had her eyes became extremely sharp halfway through Noah's words as after staring at him intently for a few seconds, she spoke with a voice of gorgeous calmness and Extremity.","\"Listening to you just now...you sound eerily similar to 'them'!\"","Them!","Noah's own eyes became sharp as he questioned succinctly.","\"Them?\"","\"The Vacuous Malignancies that butcher and devour Hyperversal Extremities.\" The voice of the Adjudicator of Dissolution was utterly cold as she spoke out while turning to gaze above into the unknown.","\"The Vacuous Daimonikos who live outside of reality and time!\"","...!","-","In the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","Noah's eyes were bright as he handled both conversing with multiple powerful beings in the Aeonic Havens of Extremity and his actions within his domain.","From the Adjudicator of Dissolution, he just heard a rumble of information about the unknown enemies who thrived outside of reality and time!","Vacuous Malignancies.","Vacous Daimonikos!","There were mere names and titles to Noah at this moment, with his clone in the Haven of Dissolution staying close to the Adjudicator to continue benefitting from her pure aura of Hyperversal Extremity Authority as his Will in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven...it would focus on the many things that had to be done here!","His main body had just finished letting the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms here that he was capable of even altering their Realms- something none of them would have even thought to be possible as even they could gain an Extremity Foundation!","Even they had a chance to be reborn.","As their minds rattled from his words, Noah continued on doing what he had to as after seeing the impacts of the Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity that was cast on the Emperor Penguin...","SHIING!","An emerald light began to shine with splendor as Noah tapped his own head and silently cast [Existence Dissociation]!","had reached the stage of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform...to the eyes of all others, he was simply an Apex Aeonic Lifeform with multiple bodies as he now had some of them utterly sweeping the stage where no beings like him should be!","The Adjudicator of Dissolution would pluck his Reified Sources away faster than he could even blink as due to this and Noah's own workings, he felt the need to call out one of his lost identities.","An identity that had fused with him what seemed like forever ago!","A blinding emerald light took a portion of himself as Noah watched it leave his body, his eyes as bright as ever as he called out silently.","'Come out once more...Alexander King.'","WAA!","The blinding point of emerald singularity shone as a storm of authority and essence far larger than what had occurred with the Emperor Penguin unfolded.","After all, it was Noah's Foundation that had to be replicated and reforged into this Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity!","Noah's Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation.","His Origin, body, and his Soul!","All of it...would be supplied by his Quintessential Hyperversal Mana as it wouldn't be of any cost to him.","As this storm of authority began and the emerald point of Singularity sucked everything in, Noah's Main Body pulsed once more as from it, 7 Aletheian Chassis came out.","There was much for him to do.","And Soul nor Mana Values were an issue!","While his Vitalistic Clone formed, his task for the days to come was to completely reform his forces into utterly powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","He gained immense benefits just from the Emperor Penguin becoming one, with the authority of its Boundaries achieving the 10th Layer also being given to him as his 81 Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds devoured this authority to make it so that when a sufficient amount was gathered...Noah's Boundaries may add both the 10th and 11th Boundary Layers during the Apexification of his Main Body!","If he continued to turn more beings into Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, or even better yet- reforge the Realms of beings like Aurelia who no doubt had Layers at the very least exceeding 11...","The idea alone caused Noah's eyes to shine like Infinite suns as he began to move.","HOONG!","His hands motioned outwards multiple times as the environment began to change once more.","Space and time seemed to be twisting and distorting as circular domains were seemingly being carved out based on Noah's"]},{"number":2507,"title":"Chapter 2507: Chapter 2506 Alexander King! II","paragraphs":["Noah called forth an Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity for himself as it simply had too many boons for him not to, with the pathway he had to take being extremely clear at this moment.","His main body could continue accumulating power and bringing its foundation towards a shocking level, but this didn't mean he couldn't utilize the feature of the Vitalistic Clone to usher forth a version of himself with a potent amount of power.","There were so many positives with it- the only negative being the fact that no more clones or reified sources could emerge from the Vitalistic Clone of Extremity as it moved by itself!","He wouldn't be able to call forth the Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor fused form or any other","Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor form he could take with such a body as it had to rely purely on its base power.","But if he could replicate himself now and make such a clone undergo Apexification...it would be a being with an Unrecorded Extremity Foundation, multiple Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, and Soul Values exceeding even a newly advanced Apex Aeonic","Lifeform!","If the clone of the Emperor Penguin who only had 10 Boundaries reaching the 9th Boundary Layer and an Extremity Foundation Noah called forth himself could have the equivalence of 30 Apex Aeonic Soul Values...Noah's Clone was bound to be in the hundreds after Apexification- if not a ridiculous Value that even Noah himself didn't know of.","But this Clone couldn't be him.","In the Initiation Step of Extremity Sanctification, only those below the stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms could participate.","If a few days from now, he displayed another version of him that commands, his Vassals being left in a domain that contained his main body.","The figures of Caesar and Xiaomi found themselves in their own domain as a verdant robed Aletheian Chassis moved towards this domain, while Aurelia and the other Apex Aeonic Lifeforms were segmented into their own domains while Noah's voice rang out!","\"Everyone can make their own choices without an audience. You will at the very least have your privacy no matter which path you take.\"","...!","Land and space seemed to pull specific beings apart as Orion did not resist when he saw himself being isolated in his own domain, his eyes shining with a piercing light as he seemed deep in thought.","Aurelia was the same as her space was split to grant her own domain- the emerald light of a Dynamis of Extremity covering hers and all other domains with a thick circular wall filled with life as they were segmented across light years to different parts of the Prana Aletheian Haven!","When the dust settled, Orion found himself standing atop a lush verdant earth with the form of Noah gazing at him calmlyimpenetrable emerald walls erected all around them from afar as even the will of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform could not pierce it without having an equivalent Dynamis of Extremity.","Xiaomi and Caesar found themselves in their own separate domain with one of Noah's bodies, and so did Aurelia!","The only beings to remain in a cluster were the remaining Apex Aeonic Lernaeans as Noah has Lucia and the rest of them in a single domain, his gaze cold as his Quantum Aletheian Chassis voiced out coldly.","\"Decide. A restructuring of your Realms and an Extremity Foundation, or a pathway out of here for you to follow your own path.\"","...!","The eyes of prideful existences who should have been the Ancestors of this being before them shone with hesitation while some...already had their minds made up!","Within the isolated domain holding Aurelia.","\"Is your mind really not made up? You are the True Emperor of Fortune, so I know you recognize what lies before you.\"","His words were much calmer as his form of the Elysium Aletheian Chassis talked to Aurelia who had sat down on the lush verdant grassland around her that pulsed with life.","Her eyes were filled with a hazy gold as she voiced out while moving her hands across the stellar grass around her.","\"You are an enigma that every time I think I have you figured out, you prove me wrong yet again.\"","WAA!","\"I've always wanted to live peacefully atop mountains of Loot without a worry in the world, but I am not naive enough to believe that peace comes so easily or freely. There is the very real possibility of me attaining that peace through your ridiculous capabilities, so...\"","Her gaze rose up and locked onto Noah who had appeared a few inches away from her while adorned in grand golden robes.","His eyes were filled with a steady light as he nodded and spoke.","\"And there's also the fact that I can reforge your Realm to be based on the concepts that made the Infinite Forge you saw in my soul.","An Extremity Foundation purely geared towards Loot as-\"","BOOM!","Before his words even finished, the golden form of Aurelia rose up with power and bravery unadulterated majesty emanated from her!","\"Say less.\"","...!","\"You had me at Extremity Foundation geared towards Loot.\"","WAA!"]},{"number":2508,"title":"Chapter 2508: Chapter 2507 Alexander King! III","paragraphs":["Aurelia's eyes twinkled as they shone with an exuberant light of gold, excitement visible within them!","Such a genuine expression of excitement was not something commonly seen on an Apex Aeonic Lifeform who had gone through years of life as it gave her an otherworldly sense of unattainable beauty and wonder.","\"An Extremity Foundation based on Loot? That's all you had to say.","Mmm...what about my Boundaries and Dynamis of Extremity?","Layers above 9th cannot exist without Meridians as...\"","Even with her giddiness when it came to Loot, her rationality was still there as Noah waved his hands while they began to shine with the lights of Realm Reconstruction and Aspect Configuration.","\"Your Concepts and authority as an Apex Aeonic Lifeform will be set aside and utilized during the end of your Reconstruction. Nothing will be lost.\"","His abilities were ready to unfold.","Aurelia gazed at his hands pulsing with the authority of two different Absolute Dynamis of Extremity as she breathed out as if she prepared herself, shaking her head while voicing out.","\"Alright, let's do it. My forge better be at least the same level as yours if not more pristine after all this!\"","Aurelia of the Ancestral Lernaeans became the first Apex Aeonic Lifeform to choose which path she followed.","And Noah didn't delay as his authority moved like unstoppable tendrils of light of cherry and emerald lights that caused her golden hair to move wildly.","They sank into her body as this Apex Aeonic Lifeform didn't put up any defenses, allowing the essences of two Dynamis of Extremity to flow into her Aspects of Existence- wrapping around dazzling Extremity Meridians that supported her existences like pillars of supporting light.","They intricately wrapped around her very being as she granted Noah a profound level of access and control to the extent that he could shatter her very existence at this moment!","'How curious the fates of living beings are...'","Noah had such a passing thought as he thought of how just days ago, he was just grasping the 5th and 6th Boundary Layers while stepping into the Aeonic Havens of Extremity.","And now, here he was. He had eradicated two Apex Aeonic","Lifeforms not too long ago, and now he held the very Aspects of Existence of another such lifeform in his hands as...","BZZT...CRACK!","The undeniable authority of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity caused the Extremity Meridians of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform to crack along with the Origin of this being.","It wasn't so much a matter of Damage or Defense Values as it was the authority of [Realm Reconstruction] being carried out on a more powerful willing party!","\"Ah...\" Aurelia felt her life's work being broken at this moment as it was something any being would despair at, yet there was never even a thought that this was a mistake in her eyes as she watched the authority of the Broken Extremity Meridian that had her Boundaries coursing through them...she saw that even though they were broken down, everything about them was preserved and put aside!","The abundant authority of her lifeforce. Her Apex Aeonic Soul Values that had long since crossed the threshold of 200s. Her Forge in the very depths of her Soul.","Everything that made her was put aside to be utilized for later as her Realm was degraded to the lowest possible point!","Her vision slowly began to fade.","She didn't know how much time had passed, but after a certain point, she could only hear the voice of a single being.","\"Fortune shall be at the very basis of your makeup, and your Realm shall be composed of Fortune, Loot, Providence, Genesis, Conquest, Forgemaster, Destiny, Kismet...and Quintessence.\"","His voice determined the new Planes of her Realm.","Planes that would go on to determine her Extremity Foundation!","When she came to again, she found her body being reforged as her golden eyes saw dazzling golden words appear out of thin air!","[The Master of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven is Reconstructing your Realm and Aspects of Being ever closer to Extremity.] [You have been set on the path of the Quintessential Loot Extremity Foundation.]","...!","The words before her caused her eyes to widen as at this time, she felt the portion of her past self that was put aside begin to return to her.","They felt...foreign and not as pure as her current self.","She almost wanted to tell the being who was doing all this not to return the things from her past self when her will saw that everything returning back was being refined and reconstructed as well, her Realm beginning to rapidly reforge itself as her past accomplishments as an Supreme Aeonic Being were used as one of the many ingredients!","She then...felt the Forge that was locked away in her soul once more.","It seemed like a massive mountain of Loot as at its very core, her greatest treasure pulsed and radiated light at this moment.","Her Riviere of Fortune.","Her utmost treasure that she didn't even pull out on the deadly battle of an enemy more powerful than her and Orion who had chased them towards the Noblesse battlefield as she would only utilize it when she felt like there were no other options!","She felt the relic she had anchored into her Workshop since before she even became the True Emperor of Luck radiate wondrous light as...","[Your greatest creation resonates with the forming Quintessential Loot Extremity Foundation.]","[Your Workshop has begun basking in the light of Quintessential Spoils as it is transforming into a tool worthy of the Quintessential Loot Extremity Foundation!]","\"Ah...\"","Her will lit up with utmost excitement as she felt a sea of golden Spoils light wash over her mountains of Relics, Gems, and Aeonic Treasures of Extremity.","She felt like she was finally on the path of truly understanding Luck and Spoils as her Soul didn't question any of the golden prompts appearing before her, fully delving into her changes and whatever they may bring!"]},{"number":2509,"title":"Chapter 2509: Chapter 2508 Alexander King! IV","paragraphs":["As Aurelia did this, the person responsible for it all monitored everything occurring sharply as the transformation of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform was far faster than that of the Emperor Penguin during his initial Reconstruction.","The leftover essence that was being broken down and refined was so potent that her Realm and Foundation would be built and fully saturated in the coming seconds, and she could undergo","Apexification once more with an Extremity Foundation thereafter as when one put into account her Boundaries that Noah actually found the highest to be Fortune at the 14th Boundary Layer during the Reconstruction...he knew that her Apex Aeonic Soul Values were about to be utterly dreadful after her transformation!","But this was her.","Her choice here was not a singular one as in another enclosed domain, Orion- the True Emperor of Genesis, had made the same choice as her as he would experience a similar transformation.","Many others would undoubtedly become unimaginable versions of themselves, but this was not where Noah directed the attention of his main body.","Back in the domain holding his main body and his closest people, the emerald light shone brightly as another version of Noah had come to fruition.","Dense waves of authority still sank into him every second, but his pristine face was clear to all as it was distinctively different from Noah.","He seemed like an older version of the face of Alexander King in the past- with his face being more pristinely sculpted and carrying rugged devilish handsomeness.","Lush dark hair flowed from his head as streaks of Vitalistic emerald added to grant the total of 81 that would pristinely match with his 81 Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds, the process of","Apexification for Alexander King would begin.","\"And at such a time, the breadth of this soul will be much greater as it can handle another Absolute Seed of Extremity or two...\"","...!","The deep voice of Alexander thundered out as he breathed in.","The Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi surged within his body as the Indefatigable, Aletheian, and Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity were hidden deep within- other sources of Essences beginning to circulate within his as he began mixing dreadful and deathly authorities!","He was already setting the stage for the birth of yet another Absolute Seed of Extremity after he completed Apexification as this one would contain the Boundaries of Necromancy, Summoning, Apocalypse, Death, Pride, Gluttony, Sloth, Envy, Greed, Lust, and Wrath!","The myriad of authorities began to cycle across his very atoms as a devilish glint began to radiate from him.","\"Good!\"","Noah nodded at this fantastical sight as his gaze then turned towards the rest of his people.","Towards his son who shone with golden brilliance. Towards Athena, Kazuhiko, Barbatos, and the many others who gazed towards him with a profound light of eagerness.","\"The stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms is open to all as it is only a matter of who will go after the Emperor Penguin.\"","...!","Many were excited for it, but none moved forward as they would follow whichever sequence Noah chose to follow!","A fortunate light shone as Noah smiled and looked around, his gaze being taken towards a figure with observant eyes in the back.","Adorned in a stellar white labcoat, golden strands of hair nearly reached his shoulders as it was none other than...","\"Dr. Hall, it seems you hold something fortunate to share.\"","WAA!","Many eyes and gazes landed on him as he didn't falter or buckle from them!","His golden eyes hardened as he nodded and began to float towards Noah's visage.","\"Can we...expand the Boundary of Medicine? I seek to put this at the very center and lead forces that can heal our people endlessly and even stop the advancement of True Death.\"","...!"]},{"number":2510,"title":"Chapter 2510: Chapter 2509 Raising a Dreadful Army! I","paragraphs":["In the depths of the Noblesse Domains.","Commander Vladic's expression was an ugly one to look at currently.","This was because he had picked up on the whispers of his enemy from the Elders of Genesis Institute of Extremity as he learned of the identity this being held!","A holder of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity even before undergoing Apexification as it was even the consensus among the Genesis Elders that even after the Lernaeans were annihilated in the Apex War of Annihilation, the one known as Osmont would likely be saved by the very Adjudicator of Dissolution!","This utterly destroyed the whole purpose for him to incur this war as it was all for killing the one who took Euryale from him right before his eyes.","Even if all the Lernaeans were destroyed as they finally put to rest a long-standing grudge...so what?!","He had to have his due.","And his Will buzzed as he sought for a way.","A way out of such an unfair reality where he couldn't even get his full revenge because of forces more powerful than him!","---","While his enemies plotted and planned, Noah systematically continued his preparations as he had multiple bodies moving in conjunction with his Will- covering all aspects of what had to be done as his main body and a few other clones were contained in the emerald domain that held most of his important people.","He was looking towards the dashing golden haired Dr. Hall at this moment as he thought of the word this being had just said.","\"Medicine...huh?\"","The Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity was already one that was filled with the impulse of life and Vitality as Noah had no doubt ridiculous and newer capabilities would arise once it was fully converged.","But the field Dr. Hall wanted to delve into had its own merits as Noah allowed it!","\"Very well. Medicine shall be expanded, and your Realm shall be constructed.\"","WAA!","His permission was given as a new concept began to shine with brilliance, Dr. Hall nodding as he felt his Origin begin a fantastical process- his voice still continuing!","\"Yes, Master. Some additional concepts that may be useful to include in this endeavor are Biochemistry, Epidemiology, Essensology, and Pharmacology.\"","...!","This being was bold as he sought many more concepts from the True Emperor of Quintessence!","And Noah only smiled as his soul buzzed with the Sources of Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity, each of the aforementioned concepts being expanded towards Extremity as many new fields of interest opened up in his mind!","His main body then proceeded with the process of Realm","Reconstruction and Aspect Configuration just like he had done before- grand lights beginning to bloom as a similar process repeated.","But....there were other bodies here besides his main one.","His Aletheian Chassis came forward as one pointed towards Barbatos and Katelyn, another pointing towards Kazuhiko as they already had their Realms reconstructed and configured, and they would be opening their pathway of the Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity as their clones would then proceed towards","Apexification!","It was Noah efficiently beginning a process of producing an army of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms among his own people.","The process of raising a dreadful army that would far outstrip what any of the aboriginal Lineages of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution had!","This process would be a long one as it would be among the things that would make the coming hours pass by wondrously, the threeday counter already underway before an utterly fantastical reality unfolded.","And while all of this occurred, the visage of Alexander King was surrounded by crackling waves of essence- his foundation and Origin being taken to a sublime point as with a few more expanded concepts, his 81 Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds would be filled as this body of Noah's...it would also undergo Apexification!","---","In another region within the Prana Aletheian Haven.","Enclosed in their own verdant domain with walls nobody could peer across, one of Noah's bodies stared at a father and daughter as he spoke with a smile.","\"It seems you truly didn't understand your daughter, Caesar. The Singularity Overseers are so desperate for her that they offered me their support for turning you over, and now they're going to be fighting with the Noblesse after I told them to fuck off.\"","...!","The eyes of the Mad Apex Emperor constricted as his hands formed into buzzing fists.","He looked towards Noah with countless thoughts crossing through them as ultimately, he shook his head and sighed.","\"All of that can be put aside for now. I just want to make sure Xiaomi can be fully healed first. My deal with you still stands as it seems you will be the clear victor, so-\"","\"No.\"","A clear and sonorous voice rang out while the two men were talking.","The dazzling figure of Xiaomi who was made of up of pure stellar quasars spoke with undeniable conviction as the eyes of Noah and Caesar came to focus on her.","\"I am my own person. So whatever deal was made with my father, I will take it's weight on myself to fulfill it.\"","\"Xiaomi...\" Caesar had a troubled look as he tried to speak, but Xiaomi came to wrap her small stellar arms around him in an embrace as her slender and developed stature came up to half her father's height!","\"You've always taken care of me and know what a good set of eyes I have. Trust me in this and let me finally take on responsibility for myself again.\"","Her words rang out clearly as they didn't have any leeway of denial!","Caesar looked at his daughter with bright eyes as she pulled away from him and spoke without even looking back.","\"I will make and fulfill my choice in my own isolated domain.\"","...!","Her words were straightforward as the space around them twisted, paternal figure and daughter being pulled into different directions as an emerald wall rose up between them!","Soon enough, Caesar was left alone in this realm as a second later, another one of Noah's bodies appeared not too far from him.","His eyes locked onto his as with a glare, the fury and protectiveness of the Mad Apex Emperor rose as he spoke out slowly.","\"If you do anything untoward to my daughter...\"","His defensiveness towards his daughter would never even after another billion years as he would do anything for her!","Noah waved his hands at such words as he spoke with a smile.","\"Don't get suspicious now. Will you follow the route other Apex Aeonic Lifeforms have taken in here and have your Realm Reconstructed with an Extremity Foundation? You would gain genuine power to protect your daughter- strength to also fight against the military of the Genesis Institute of Extremity who forced you to undergo Apexification not too long ago since they will be engaging in this Apex War as well.\"","WAA!"]},{"number":2511,"title":"Chapter 2511: Chapter 2510 Raising a Dreadful Army! II","paragraphs":["Noah's words caused the Mad Apex Emperor to burn with a grand light as he turned up to stare into the verdant expanse.","Then...","\"Do it.\"","...!","His resolve shone brightly as he made his choice!","And the light of Realm Reconstruction and Aspect Configuration shone as Noah's Soul blazed with brilliance.","The more existences continued to utilize his authority of Dynamis of Extremity on- especially Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, the faster they went towards complete Convergence as Aletheian and Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity would soon follow the path of Indefatigable and blood with a Yggdrasil of Extremity!","In another region of space far from the one where yet another Apex Aeonic Lifeform had fallen into Noah's hands.","The figure of Xiaomi shone with stellar brilliance as she stared closely at Noah.","Her eyes had always been able to see things others could not easily discern as she was currently trying to formulate an understanding of this being before her!","Even though she was afflicted with a condition as her lifeforce was very faint, her beauty was unrivaled among many others as the way trillions of quasars came together to form her body made her seem like an innocent stellar flower that even Kings and Emperors could only gaze at from afar.","She knew that her father and herself had already fallen into the grasp of this being before her as she didn't need to take on any responsibility, but she wanted to understand him better, and thus she did what she did.","And she was the first one to speak.","\"When the Elder of the Singularity Overseers landed his eyes on me, his whole demeanor changed as after learning to what extent they're still trying to go through for me, I've theorized with 99% certainty that he must have seen something within my body that someone even more powerful than him wants.\"","...!","\"And it has to be someone more powerful than him, otherwise he wouldn't be able to mobilize all of the forces of Singularity Overseers in Dissolution to look for me. This means that whatever he saw was of interest to someone at the very peak of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms...or a Hyperversal Extremity. The only thing such beings would be interested in are possibly Mutated Aspects of","Existence...or an Innate Foundation that even its holder wasn't aware of.\"","WAA!","She spoke rapidly as Noah gazed towards her with an interested smile, nodding along the way as she continued.","\"And connecting the dots to the whole incident with RUIN that put me in my current state, I can only assume there is a secret foundation within me I was not able to grasp and control in time.","Something that even a peak Apex Aeonic Lifeform or Hyperversal Extremity wants to devour as it means it is a foundation potent enough to easily or quickly attain Extremity. Now...nobody would stop trying to get their hands on such a thing as this is where you come in.\"","Her gaze was brilliant.","She began walking towards Noah as the verdant grassland below her swayed with happiness.","\"Someone like you who hasn't attained Extremity...did not show the same devouring light of greed as the Singularity Overseer Elder.","Where even now as I speak of an opportunity of reaching Extremity, you are unphased by it.\"","\"Why of course.\" Noah's resonant voice rang out at such a juncture as he spoke calmly.","\"I have too many ways to reach Extremity, unlike others. What I do have though, is curiosity for what exactly it is that very likely...a Hyperversal Extremity wants from you.\"","The possibility that it was a very powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeform seeking what Xiaomi had was stricken out.","And...","\"No. It is not just curiosity you hold.\"","Xiaomi's sonorous voice rang out as she came a few inches away from Noah.","\"My eyes can see many things that others couldn't, and from your eyes...I see the light of possessiveness.\"","...!","\"You may not want to harm me or devour what I have, but you have a light of wanting to make my very being yours. It may not be easy for others to notice, but I can.\"","Her eyes didn't hold any hint of fear as she spoke, Noah's lips forming a calm smile at them as she continued!","\"Now, among the options of suitors in the Aeonic Haven of Extremity, there are some dirt poor options of being devoured by a Hyperversal Extremity for whatever I have or a Quasarian Prince with poor prospects. Or...there is an enigmatic being like you who can raise Apex Aeonic Lifeforms before even undergoing","Apexification yourself. I would like to get to know a being like you better as all I want is your help in me getting the strength to protect myself from the Hyperversal Extremity wishing to devour me. And then...\"","Inches from Noah, weak waves of Essence coiled around her feet as her figure floated forward with her arms behind her back, her dazzling face coming closer as her small lips lightly landed on Noah's before she pulled back!","\"...you can satiate that possessive light in your eyes by taking whatever you want from me.\"","Bravado and brilliance were apparent in her eyes, but the arms behind her back showed her fingers trembling with nervousness as they betrayed the strong front this being was putting up!","Noah glanced at the Quasarian before his eyes as his right hand flashed- bountiful lifeforce and an aura of Extremity bubbling from it as a celestial obsidian crystalline flower that was nothing other than an Obsidian Extremity Panacea.","His Reified Sources of Extremity in the Extremity Vein of Dissolution were making stupendous advancements from","massacred Leviathans of Dissolution and obtaining more Sources of Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity among other burning quantities of the Light of Loot, and obtaining Golden and Obsidian Extremity Panaceas only came easier after that as the exploration of this wondrous location continued!","What was even more stunning was that in the deeper areas, the golden lights of treasures unlike Panaceas had begun to shine.","They were things that likely allowed one to converge a Dynamis easier or the progression of Boundaries past the 9th Layer!","Noah smiled as he thought of what was to come, focusing back on the young woman before him as he spoke out.","\"We can leave everything else for later as we now have to understand why someone who has already attained Hyperversal Extremity Authority would want from you.\"","HOONG!","The light of the Obsidian Extremity Panacea began to blaze, turning into stellar black flames under Noah's hands that flowed into the body of Xiaomi.","Like many other healing panaceas in the past, Xiaomi's body was about to reject it as a pained expression rose on her face, Noah stabilizing her as the three authorities of his Dynamis of Extremity also surged out and coursed through her body!","Her vasculature was dried and filled with dead vessels that arched with the essence of Ruin.","Her very Foundation seemed feeble and about to die, and yet when the essence of the Extremity Panacea reached into it, it began to buzz and come back to life ever so slowly.","The Obsidian Extremity Panacea should have been a tool to aid one in forging an Extremity Foundation, and yet its essence was being drawn into the seemingly weakened Foundation in the depths of Xiaomi's body as it wasn't used to forge a foundation!","It seemed like it was simply going towards causing the current one to shine with even more brilliance.","BOOM!","An explosive boom of authority erupted as Noah's visage was nearly pushed away.","A dreadful and pristine aura began to ride from Xiaomi as her dead vasculature began to come back to life!","And it returned even greater and more immaculate than before as it had swallowed the burning light of an Obsidian Extremity Panacea!","More than this though, even Noah was surprised to find that from the aura blazing from Xiaomi, he could sense a similar grandeur compared to his own.","He could sense...","\"Hyperversal...?\"","WAA!","As soon as his words ended, prompts began to rise before him.","[You have unearthed the Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Foundation of Ruin!]","[Destined to disappear into oblivion after its holder failed to control its core essence, you have reversed its course and even directed it towards a grander path with the rejuvenation of a type of Natal Extremity Authority!]","Natal Extremity Authority.","This was the type of energy contained in an Obsidian Extremity Panacea!","So the Crimson Extremity Panacea Noah swallowed that aided in him obtaining the Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation... maybe something even greater!","[Due to a confluence of factors, the Unrecorded Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Extremity Foundation of Ruined Chaos has been born in the selected target!]","[The sole purpose of the Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Foundation of Ruin was to elevate the concept of Ruin towards Extremity in the shortest possible time. The Unrecorded Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Extremity Foundation of Ruined Chaos can now elevate 8 other Sources of Chaos apart from Ruin towards Extremity in an incredibly short period of time.]","...!","Dazzling prompts appeared before both Noah and Xiaomi.","Her slender, bountiful, and gorgeous visage pulsed as around the verdant domain, dense origins of chaos began to gather!","Along with this...","[The Sources of Chaos within your own foundation begin to resonate with the Unrecorded Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Extremity Foundation of Ruined Chaos.]","[As the one who unearthed this Unrecorded Foundation from facing oblivion, you are granted a distinctive authority to benefit from the same Sources of Chaos the holder of this Foundation raises towards Extremity!]","[Cultivating near or with the Holder of the Unrecorded Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Extremity Foundation of Ruined Chaos will increase the rate of advancement of select Boundaries connected to Sources of Chaos by 10,000% to 100,000%!]","A dazzling notification appeared before Noah's eyes.","And before the stellar quasarian eyes of Xiaomi who felt her entire Aspects of Existence undergo a revolution...","[As an existence holding the Unrecorded Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Extremity Foundation of Ruined Chaos, cultivating near or with the Holder of the Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation will increase the rate of advancement of all your Boundaries connected to Sources of Chaos by 100,000% to 1,000,000%.]","The 11th, 12th, 13th, 14th, 15th, 16th, 17th, and the final 18th Extremity Boundary Layer were immensely difficult to cross, each one being hundreds of times more difficult than the one prior.","Due to her Innate Foundation and the changes it had just gone through, connected with the being of a being that truly shouldn't exist with the Foundation that he held...Xiaomi was one of the few, rare existences that may just be able to traverse across the arduous upper Boundary Layers with utmost ease!"]},{"number":2512,"title":"Chapter 2512: Chapter 2511 Raising a Dreadful Army! III","paragraphs":["2511 Raising a Dreadful Army! III","Each of the trillions of quasars that made her felt like they were filled with boundless potential.","Her Aspects of Existence buzzed as they felt the unique authority coursing through them.","The same authority that nearly killed her.","The same authority that the moment it was being corrected...","[The 7th Boundary Layer of Ruin has been achieved.]","[The 8th Boundary Layer of Ruin has been achieved.]","Crimson gold words like these rose multiple times over as the tendrils of Ruin that had been wrecking her body all these years suddenly turned docile!","[The 9th Boundary Layer of Ruin has been achieved.]","[Enough understanding of Ruin by your Foundation still remains as it seeks your Extremity Meridians to progress even further.]","She felt it meld into her very soul as if she could control it to the finest threads!","As if her soul was meant just for this.","This...was her Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Foundation that nearly killed her!","It allowed her to absorb and turn the ruin that was killing her into pure understanding that only stopped at the 9th Boundary Layer because it couldn't go on any further.","This...was the ridiculous pace of progression she could make with her Foundation!","Her eyes fluttered with astonishment as she contained her nervousness when she gazed at the being who had made this change possible.","If she cultivated near him, or...did 'that' with him, her progression could go up to 1,000,000% faster!","Didn't this mean Extremity would be achieved in a ridiculously short period of time?","But when she thought about the action that would require such a thing, her stellar face reddened!","She may talk big and analyze things calmly, with her mind choosing the most opportune paths in dangerous scenarios, but her true timid nature that even her father had rarely seen was still there.","Since she fell from the high pedestal as a genius of the Quasarian Bloodline, she had resigned herself to death as never in her wildest dreams did she think a man like this would appear to solve everything.","He was nothing like the stellar knight in shining armor she always dreamed of. He was more like a celestial beast whose eyes clearly told her he wanted to possess everything about her entirely!","'Ah...'","She realized she had been blankly staring at him inches away while thinking all this as she collected herself an instant later and uttered out.","\"It...seems that whatever Hyperversal Extremity is in contact with the Singularity Overseers wanted to get a hold of my Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Foundation. We can continue and see how much more powerful it'll be once I undergo Apexification!\"","She didn't even mention the crimson gold words she saw as she chose to entirely move on for now.","He wouldn't have out anything about it anyway, right?","Before her figure, he smiled devilishly as his finger tapped out, authority flowing into her body as like many others- she was pushed towards Apexification!","This was Noah's goal as for such a thing...hours passed.","His authority of Dynamis of Extremity was utilized a great deal for the emergence of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as the gains he made were far too valuable.","In a matter of hours, the changes that would occur in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven were so drastic that if someone said a genuine Hyperversal Extremity was the one responsible for such changes...they wouldn't be believed!","---","The first day before the promised Apex War of Annihilation was passing swiftly for some and strangely slow for others.","But some beings were above the bindings of space and time itself.","Within the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution, near a region filled with molten mountains in the skies and the earth, tendrils of a dark state of verisimilitude bursting from the mountain peaks as they seemed potent enough to burn the very Souls of Lifeforms.","The few regions of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution occupied by Lernaeans and Noblesse were filled with Ruin and Nullity across it, but this wasn't the case for many other regions of this Haven.","The unexplored regions held their own dangers and natural phenomena as the current region with molten mountains covering the skies and earth had a massively radiant black crack that seemed to be swallowing the very surrounding space constantly!","It was filled with Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","If someone with sufficient power was able to enter this region, they would find that it was a specific zone of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority where in its very center, two figures could be seen floating freely without any concerns or care!","One sat in a meditative position as Vacuous Hyperversal Authority pulsed around his body, the other standing behind this being as dense and potent Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Destruction flowed from him freely.","It was the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction and his Scion that had been giving chase to Aurelia and the other Lernaeans!","\"Do you feel any closer?\"","The voice of the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction rang out as his disciple shook his head with a sigh.","\"The 17th Boundary Layer of Destruction seems further than ever. I feel like I am lacking in my soul, even after spending all these years surrounded by Vacous Hyperversal Authority, it is still not sufficient.\"","Slight regret could be felt from this disciple as his Master laughed with a cognizant light, his Hyperversal Extremity Authority receding after he completed what many Hyperversal Extremities do for their Clans and Inheritances!","They bathed their Apex Aeonic Lifeforms with their unique Hyperversal Authority- with those having the support of truly powerful Extremities that could impart their power and time with ease being capable of reaching the upper Boundaries towards Extremity with relative ease.","\"For you, it is not sufficient anymore to simply feel the end goal of Destruction from me. You need to experience a unique type of Destruction in order to advance to the 17th Boundary Layer. For me, it only came after I destroyed the Foundations of my Elder Brother who at the time already held the 17th Boundary Layer of Light. A once in a lifetime talent that nearly had an Absolute Seed of Extremity forged...and I snuffed his light just like that. I advanced the instant I did so.\"","\"Destruction can come in many forms, my dear disciple, but the destruction of an existence that has forged an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity and dipped his fingers into Vacous Hyperversal Authority even before Apexification...that is a type of Destruction that may take your Boundary Layer to the 17th level!\"","WAA!","A glorious statement was made as the eyes of Ahpuch glittered with brilliance.","."]},{"number":2513,"title":"Chapter 2513: Chapter 2512 Raising a Dreadful Army! IV","paragraphs":["\"It will be a loss for the Seven Havens for such a being to die, yes, but it will be a win for you. And I won't lie...this would be a heavy ordeal for you as this Osmont is in no way simple, and the Adjudicator should be very inclined to him. There may even be a relationship there that we aren't aware of.\"","Dangerous words were said as these two beings floated serenely amidst dangerous Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","\"If you do succeed amidst the chaos though, you will incur her Wrath as even with my appearance, she will likely force you with multiple Obsidian Haven Albatrosses or a Crimson Haven Albatrossafter all, you are also a crucial being who has attained 'that' which even some Hyperversal Extremities do not have, Svetlana would never dare to even put her hands on you personally. There are no true losses you can incur so...head towards the little mice known as Noblesse. You and your Junior Brothers will fight on their side during this. Your goal will only be destruction- whatever form that may take.\"","BOOM!","The Vacuous Hyperversal Authority pulsed around them as the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction made his will known towards his disciple- Ahpuch!","---","The seconds were like stellar dust that drifted into minutes.","Minutes turned into hours.","Different existences used this time in their own ways as some utilized it in a fashion that most wouldn't even be able to imagine.","Half the time before the Apex War of Annihilation that was being talked about with frequency had passed, with the chosen Apex Battlefield being filled with Legions of Noblesse led by Unequaled Dynamis of Extremity.","Among Noah's Vassals, there seemed to be something all of them were singularly missing.","It wasn't due to their souls being weak or their Foundations being faulty.","They were among the most perfectly clean newly advanced Apex Aeonic Lifeforms there could be across the Havens of Extremity!","Yet it seemed like there was an impossible to overcome wall ahead of them whenever they even thought of forming an Absolute Seed of Extremity.","Noah's Wills gazed at the dozens of auras of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms around him as he knew the issue.","He knew it well as his gaze turned towards his left.","There, across the veils of emerald light, was the domain that Aurelia was contained in along with one of his bodies.","And her figure was a stunning one as it seemed to be dripping with pure gold liquid light that hugged her curves and blessings, her expression that of shock as she spoke in disbelief while opening her eyes to lock onto Noah.","She had returned to being an Apex Aeonic Lifeform as in her body, the flash of 54 golden Extremity Meridians shone.","And every few seconds, they would flash with even greater brilliance as she couldn't help but look at the man responsible for this and say even more extreme words.","\"I...I think I may actually be able to converge enough Boundaries to form a Seed. An Absolute Seed!\"","Pure disbelief was all she felt as she breathed in once more.","And...","\"Ah...\"","She felt 24 essences course within her as some in particular seemed to be getting ever closer together with every breath.","She couldn't believe it.","She locked her eyes with the existence before her that had taught her this ridiculous breathing method not too long ago as she had no words.","Her golden hair danced wondrously on her bare fair shoulders while the rest of her dazzling figure was encased in liquified golden light, her calm eyes becoming more serious than ever before as she looked at the man before her while uttering out.","\"Who...no, what are you, really?\"","WAA!","She seemed to be asking out of pure curiosity and need as she continued.","\"None of this is normal. Even in the bounds of abnormal, it is even more abnormal. Just...\"","She didn't have any words.","And the being before her smiled as even though she should be immensely more powerful than him currently, she felt like she was gazing at an immovable force that was many times greater than her.","Such an outlook didn't make sense as her power now...was not something her past self could even fathom!","Yet this being before her still seemed as if he could snuff her out if he wished for it at any time.","And he looked at her with a stellar smile as he replied calmly.","\"I am simply a man who moves with purpose. And my purpose for you...is Extremity.\"","...!","Extremity.","For her, not even for him.","'Why...'","Why did he want Extremity for her?","As if he could read her gaze, he continued.","\"It is so that I can taste Extremity with my own lips as you head towards it and achieve it. I am basking in the Hyperversal Extremity Authority of an Esteemed Extremity right now, but I want to do more than bask in it. You can feel the beginnings of an Absolute Seed of Extremity, and your Fortune reached the 15th Boundary Layer after all these transformations, yes?\"","His gaze was so deep that she swallowed while nodding blankly, her eyes opening wide as she finally understood some of this being's purpose.","\"Good. Then I shall bring you ever closer to Extremity as we will focus on forming your Absolute Seed of Extremity first.\"","He called towards her.","Her golden hair flitted as she blinked a few times, her body finding itself going towards him instinctively as even now, she felt like she was floating towards an unfathomably powerful existence that held more mysteries than she could even imagine!"]},{"number":2514,"title":"Chapter 2514: Chapter 2513 Alexander King’s Apexification! I","paragraphs":["His eyes were serene and yet filled with a powerful light as he stared at the figure of Aurelia.","Her exquisite figure was literally adorned in the molten authority of Loot as her golden hair danced on her fair shoulders, her eyes empty as she came forward due to his words.","The True Emperor of an Age long past his as she was an Ancestor of a whole Lineage!","He would elevate her to an even grander stature as he voiced out towards her while gazing at her stat panel.","\"Don't already be dazed for this. I need you to be fully focused on what we're about to do.\"","...!","[Name]:: Caterina Aurelia Dismukes","[Realm]:: Boundary Expansion(Third Aeonic Loot Haven)","[Lineage]:: Lernaean","[Titles]:: The True Emperor of Fortune, The Power Behind the Shadows, Holder of the Reverie, The Seeker of Fortune, The Loot Fanatic...","[Loot Apex Mana Value]:: 1,250","[Loot Apex Vitality Value]:: 1,250","[Loot Apex Soul Value]:: 1,350","[Loot Apex Defense Value]:: 1,150","[Loot Apex Damage Value]:: 1,350","[Dynamis of Extremity]::Gilded, Redeemer, Auriferous, Languorous [Boundaries of Extremity]:: Fortune, Loot, Providence, Fate, Karma, Destiny...","Destiny...","Her achievements were already grand beforehand, and with Noah's Realm Reconstruction and Aspect Configuration...her values exploded to a ridiculous level as in terms of her Values, she currently exceeded all others in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","Of course, these values were already inflated as they were not the numbers of a newly risen Apex Aeonic Lifeform.","All of Aurelia's past achievements were utilized in her Reconstruction as her Realm was greatly advanced, along with a number of boosts from her Boundaries that had reached Layers past 10th!","And with her Foundation, it was now even easier to raise her Boundaries towards higher layers as by the time she consolidated her new boundaries and forged an Absolute Seed of Extremity, her foundation would be even more pristine as her Values would continue scaling upwards.","His words took her out of her stupor as her fair skin shone with a stellar radiance.","\"You...can't you at least be subtle? For some of us, this is the first time going through these experiences.\"","...!","Her golden eyes danced with power as they actually felt wronged at this moment!","All the years she had lived, she secluded herself from others as with her Golden Forge, she had no need to ever step foot outside her domain to go on any adventures or anything of that nature.","The only man she ever had prolonged contact with was Genesis as even then, she found his demeanor and self hatred of his past actions to be too bland for her tastes.","Yet this unfathomable being before her...she didn't even know what to expect as towards her words, he smiled as if he had found something amusing to play with as his voice echoed out.","\"There is nothing subtle in what we're about to do. During it though, try to keep your focus as best as you can on the Boundary of Fortune and the Absolute Seed of Extremity.\"","HOONG!","Stellar golden and verdant mist surged and covered everything in the surroundings as Aurelia snorted at this moment.","He may be unfathomable, but she could instinctively feel that she was stronger than him at this moment.","Would he really be the only one pushing her around, or could she teach him a lesson before one of his bodies underwent","Apexification?","---","Apexification!","To prepare for such a thing with his Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity that was Alexander King, Noah had spared no efforts in the past day and a half!","The eyes of Alexander turned towards the direction where one of his Clones was about to begin a different type of battle with Aurelia, this battle being something that Noah would truly benefit from with the appearance of Alexander as an Apex Aeonic Lifeform.","This was because his Boundaries would be able to continue climbing upwards as an Apex Aeonic Lifeform- the practice of Dual Cultivation being something that would be most useful in elevating his Boundaries if he were doing it with someone like Aurelia who had reached the 15th Boundary Layer, or an existence like Xiaomi who would make Noah's Boundaries relating to Sources of Chaos climb at such a rapid pace that they would leave behind even Quintessence!","But all of these things could only truly be savored when one of his bodies became an Apex Aeonic Lifeform.","When Alexander King took this step!","And he had achieved all his requirements.","Over 81 Boundaries were expanded towards Extremity as Noah added the Boundaries of Life, Esuriance, Impermanence, Archetypes, Chronos, Aether, Destruction, Slaughter, Fealty, and Annihilation.","Some Boundaries that were favored more than others were placed within the 81 Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds while others were removed, with the appearance of Alexander now being ready to proceed forward with his Origin only saturated at the Third Aletheian Haven of Extremity!","For an Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity, Noah had already over prepared by doing all this.","His main body would continue doing its utmost to build an even more exemplary foundation as among many things in progress for the past day and a half, the elevation of his Boundaries from Golden Consummate had begun as Noah put to use the Light of Conquest gathered by the domination of the Lernaean Domains and his own elevated Soul Value in being capable of altering his Recorded History in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","His main body would take the reigns of building the most Quintessential Foundation before Apexification.","For the purposes of the upcoming war and domination of local Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity placing their fingers into the Haven of Dissolution, Alexander King's current foundation would be more than enough!","\"Proceed.\"","WAA!","His main body commanded.","Apart from all the overpreparation, there was also an unmentioned sense of urgency that pushed Noah to seek Apexification as soon as possible for at least his clone- and this dealt with his own calculations and possibilities he had thought of in the illusory trillions of years within Vacuous Hyperversal Authority!"]},{"number":2515,"title":"Chapter 2515: Chapter 2514 Alexander King’s Apexification! II","paragraphs":["Existence Dissociation that gave birth to the Absolute Vitalistic Clones of Extremity was one of the parts of the puzzles that guarded Noah and his Vassals from any real danger while facing Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","But...it wasn't something that was enough for Hyperversal Extremity Authority!","Existences that had reached Extremity had terrifying ways of moving that Noah was only getting glimpses of through his Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation, and the things he was able to understand and see as his access into the Aeonic Annals of Extremity increased!","After the actions of Euryale and the repercussions they had, Noah did not just want to be reactive to what may possibly happen or not happen in the future as the Apexification of Alexander King was another method of protection.","Protection against existences that had even reached Extremity!","He wouldn't be inactive and simply believe that the Adjudicator of Dissolution would move to protect him if a Hyperversal Extremity attacked him whether hiddenly or in the open.","She had already failed to do so once as she could always do it again.","No. As always, one had to depend on themselves!","And one of Noah's solutions at keeping threats from even Hyperversal Extremities at bay...involved forging an Absolute Seed of Extremity geared towards areas that such beings were most adept at.","Ways of attacking that others couldn't even see coming!","Through Destiny, Fate, Providence, or any other similar concepts.","Through the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","It was a task for Alexander King to design yet another Absolute Seed of Extremity apart from the one filled with devilish destruction and horrors that he had been experimenting with!","And the concepts for the aforementioned Seed of Extremity were already set in stone as things only had to be implemented.","And so...Alexander King moved forward.","\"Come.\"","His voice was deep and resolute as it made a calling.","A calling to the dazzling 81 Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds that were only waiting for such a call!","And...","BOOM!","An explosive shockwave emanated out as immense and utterly wild seas of authority began to rage around Alexander King like a torrential storm of majesty.","His body already held the seeds as the moment after he called them, they enlarged with a blinding light to become radiant stanchions of light that bloomed across his Aspects of Existence!","[The Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds in your body are advancing to become Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians!]","The Process of Apexification fully began as 81 pillars of light began to appear and illuminate Noah's body.","Other beings would start with 1 or 9 and continue building up more, but Noah straight away achieved 81 Extremity Meridians in one sitting as this was what his Foundation boasted!","81 radiant Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians formed as his Aspects of Existence began to be drawn and devoured into them, even more prompts rising along the way.","[The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation is burning with the light of Apexification.] [The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation asks you to define yourself.]","The definition of Noah Osmont's will within the rising Alexander King.","It could be nothing else other than...","\"Quintessential.\"","THUMP!","Like a beating heart, one of the Extremity Meridians pulsed and turned into an utterly bright pillar of light.","And it wasn't over.","Because the True Emperor of Quintessence...had only just begun to define himself with more concepts!","\"Providence, Manadynamics, Loot, Blood, Body, Origin, Soul, Apocalypse, Impermanence...\"","One word after another, multiple defining concepts were uttered out as an Extremity Meridian shone after every single utterance.","And as this process began, the part of Noah's soul contained within Alexander King began to go utterly wild as its Soul Values started to exponentially surge upwards!","And the moment this process began...","[The Process of Apexification is spurring Quintessential changes to your soul.]","[The Process of Apexification has spurred the remaining sliver of Convergence of your Dynamis of Extremity forward.]","...!","The Convergence of his two Dynamis of Extremity!","They had reached 99.99% after being used so much these past few days as they didn't budge thereafter, with Noah waiting exactly for this time as he didn't even utilize any Loot to finish the last remaining percentage- not a single Bud of Convergence!","Such Loot was reserved for the quick Convergence of Dynamis that were about to form.","But at this glorious juncture...","[The Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity has reached 100%","Convergence.]","[The Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity has reached 100%","Convergence.]","A heavy presence erupted from his main body as the changes of concepts like Dynamis were simultaneously expressed in Noah's Soul.","One runic seed that read [ALETHEIAN] and another that read [VITALISTIC] shone with splendor as they began to bloom a moment later!","[An Aletheian Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity is blooming within your Soul!]","[A Vitslistic Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity is blooming within your Soul!]","A black gold Yggdrasil and another of emerald grandeur sprouted within his soul and caused its Soul Values to be elevated to an even more ridiculous level, profound changes continuing to take place!","Each of the blooming trees had trunks as radiant as cylindrical Havens while their branches glimmered like black gold or emerald rivers of stellar Realities that stretched out across Noah's body.","[Due to the enhancements of your Foundation, every half a day, the Aletheian and Vitalistic Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity will bud Aletheian and Vitalistic Fruits of Extremity equivalent to the number of concepts in their makeup.]","Across Noah's Aspects of Existence, the first established Indefatigable Perennial Yggdrasil dominantly stood as one could see 27 dazzling stellar cherry colored Singularity already formed at the tips of some of its branches.","27 Indefatigable Fruits of Extremity were already born during the past day and a half as now, Aletheian and Vitalistic would join the fray to add their own grandeur!","[All features under the banner of the Aletheian and Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity are further enhanced.]","[The Aletheian and Vitalistic Absolute Planar Domains can now be cast.]","On a corner of his eyes, lines of golden prompts passed as they delved into the fantastical enhancements of the features of the elevated Dynamis of Extremity as well as even new ones, but Noah set these aside to look at later as he gazed at two final prompts before turning his gaze towards the process of Apexification!","[The Authority of the Aletheian and Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity will flow across your Aspects of Existence to strengthen your Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation passively when utilizing your Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi, granting an increase in all your Hyperversal Values unceasingly.]","[The combination of your Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi, Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation, and the authority of the Indefatigable, Aletheian, and Vitalistic Absolute Dynamis of Extremity coursing through you has caused the strengthening and strengthening of your Aspects of Existence to reach an even more abnormal level, granting you an increase of +2.5 Hyperversal Soul Values, +2.5 Hyperversal Damage Values, +7.5 Hyperversal Defense Values, and +7.5 Hyperversal Vitality Values daily.]","\"...\"","Pristine beauty displayed itself as other beings would truly cry just at seeing it be a reality.","And yet it was there as the authority of three fully converged Absolute Dynamis of Extremity granted him massive enhancements to his power in addition to not yet quantified changes brought about due to the full Convergence of all Boundaries- his Aspects of Existence currently all being strengthened!","But...Noah had to bring his attention onto the visage of Alexander.","He had to because the 81 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians budding within his body had blazed with a shocking message the moment that he finished defining himself with all 81 concepts.","[The Boundary Layers of all Concepts of Extremity placed within the 81 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians will be determined by the highest Boundary Layer you have achieved in any single Concept of Extremity up to the 17th Boundary Layer.] ...!","BOOM!"]},{"number":2516,"title":"Chapter 2516: Chapter 2515 Alexander King’s Apexification! III","paragraphs":["[The Boundary Layers of all Concepts of Extremity placed within the 81 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians will be determined by the highest Boundary Layer you have achieved in any single Concept of Extremity up to the 17th Boundary Layer.] ...!","Oh!","An utterly broken prompt unfolded before Noah's will whole the 81 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity swallowed everything about his old body.","They remained floating serenely in the verdant space as they pulsed with utmost dominance, his people inadvertently coming out of their traces to watch the grandeur.","The grandeur that commenced with two Dynamis of Extremity reaching full Convergence and continued with a single prompt that truly proved what the Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential","Hyperversal Extremity Foundation was about!","When the Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity that was Alexander was forged, it had access to Noah's Concepts of Extremity and the authority of Dynamis that were branded on their collective soul.","The utilization and authority of these Authorities was one of the few things that could be shared and employed by both main body and Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity through the shared souland it was why the process of Apexification spurred the Dynamis of Extremity Alexander had access to as Noah's Main Body was able to gain this benefit simultaneously!","It meant that when new Dynamis of Extremity were formed by one portion of Noah's soul within Alexander...his main body would be able to get strengthened by an obscene amount as it pulled upon the authorities of these newly forged Dynamis- forcefully expanding his soul within the main body and building an ever grander foundation before it underwent Apexification.","The only limitation was that whatever high Soul Values the portion of soul contained in Alexander came out to be in the near future, Noah couldn't simply take or display this same power unless he chose to assimilate with the Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremitythen he would attain everything.","Even in this broken reality he was enacting, there was still some semblance of balance.","But then, there was the prompt that utterly gave a middle finger to all other existences working hard to expand even a few boundaries towards the Extremity Layer.","It proposed that all of his Boundaries...would have their Layers reflect whatever his highest Layer was in any of the other Boundaries within the 81 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians!","This meant that if Quintessence reached the 13th Boundary Layer, all the 80 other Boundaries would also reach the 13th Boundary Layer.","If Quintessence was brought up to the 17th Layer, all the 80 other Boundaries would also reach the 17th Boundary Layer!","It was a dreadful feature that slightly dimmed the authority that Noah's Main Body had been attaining when his Vassals underwent Apexification and achieved their own 10th Boundary Layers.","But when it truly came to just how such a ridiculous feature could be abused...it had to be with what single Boundary Noah could raise the fastest.","At this point in time, it actually wasn't Quintessence!","It was any one of the Sources of Chaos boosted by the range of 10,000% to 100,000% increased rate of progression that could be gained through Xiaomi!","He just had to proceed rapidly in one while he focused his Indefatigable, Vitalistic, Aletheian, and any other Fruits of Extremity that he would receive from the multiple Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity into a single Boundary and ascend at a speed even Hyperversal Extremities could fathom.","And there were many sources of such Loot as within the Vein of Dissolution, Noah's Reified Sources along with other Scions had pierced into the more dangerous lands over the past day and a half as their hands were beginning to be filled with all sorts of treasures.","Treasures that could aid in the Convergence of Dynamis of Extremity, and those that aided in the advancement of Boundaries towards Extremity!","And profoundly connected to all of this...was something else deeply entrenched in Noah's Soul.","No matter the division between him and Alexander King.","He and those he granted access to could only enter it through his Soul!","It was none other than Infinite Forge of Extremity where at its very core...lay a Relic that had one of its main purposes being the multiplication of Loot.","BOOOM!","The 81 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians released a multicolored pulse as from it, a new form of life began to bloom.","[The Culmination of all the accomplishments of the Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity are being utilized to forge an Apex Aeonic Lifeform.]","A body commenced to be built with the 81 Quintessential","Hyperversal Extremity Meridians as the skeletal support.","Since its Soul Values already exceeded what a newly advanced Apex Aeonic Lifeform would have even before undergoing","Apexification...just how inflated would they be when this process was complete?!","HOONG!","New Aspects of Existence took shape.","And with them, a portion of Noah's soul experienced the most ridiculous explosion of strength yet.","Alongside it...","[The 81 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians illuminate the Concepts contained within them.]","[The 10th Boundary Layer of Quintessence has been achieved.] [The 10th Boundary Layer of Loot has been achieved.]","[The 10th Boundary Layer of Manadynamics has been achieved...] 81 blazing golden prompts.","One after another, they came as with each one, the newly forming visage of Alexander became ever more magisterial!","Since the Meridian Seeds became Extremity Meridians, the 10th Boundary Layer could be supported by the soul taking the identity of Alexander, but Noah's Main Body wouldn't be able to express the authorities of these layers until he formed Extremity Meridians of his own.","But Alexander King could display all of it as with every Boundary attaining a new layer, brilliance overflowed along with abundant information for each new layer!","Until...","[The transforming soul of the Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity is resonating with the construct of the Infinite System accessible within its very depths.]","...!","[A Quintessential amount of authority has begun flowing into the Infinite System and its constructs.]","Fantastical and all around change bloomed as many things were altered!","a??"]},{"number":2517,"title":"Chapter 2517: Chapter 2516 Alexander King’s Apexification! IV","paragraphs":["A Relic floated in the midst of radiant white gold brilliance as it was in a humanoid form.","It shone with crimson and gold light while bathing in waves of profound Loot Light, the air it gave off putting most Apex Aeonic Relics to shame as it had been refined and elevated by endless Loot Light within the Infinite Forge over the past days!","Amidst the liquefied essences flowing around it and the stellar infinity symbols covering dense rotating Loot that seemed like stellar bodies around her, one could barely see a raised smile on the lips of this Relic as its will thought finally...it could be of use to its Master once more.","But then...","HOOONG!","The forge trembled an instant later as the infinity symbols spinning and releasing waves of loot light trembled, a dominant authority being infused into them as they instantly doubled in size while their brilliance became even more potent!","And it didn't stop there as they still seemed to be expanding, torrential waves of Loot Light beginning to flow down from them as the sentient relic at the very center was alarmed to find seas of Loot Light even more potent than what it had been bathing in this whole tike behind to swarm towards her on all sides!","...!","It was Ruination experiencing an even more profound baptism and elevation due to the Apexification of a portion of Noah's soul!","---","Ancient groves of trees floated in space, their roots sinking and melding into stellar space as they seemed connected with the very reality of this region.","They shone in pronounced colors of stellar obsidian light as they were composed of layers of cosmos, clusters of such groves of trees stretched throughout this region that didn't seem to have a sky or earth.","In one area, a destroyed grove could be seen along with a massive body of a Prion Armadillo split open, the visage of the ever so radiant Reified Source of Quintessence being seen next to this dead Leviathan of Dissolution as from the grove of trees, he plucked out a Crimson gold hyphae herb that shone with brilliance!","[Blazing Hyphae of Extremity]:: An Aeonic Treasure of Extremity that is conducive in aiding the progression of Boundaries geared towards heat and flames. The potent light of Extremity within it seems capable of aiding one up to the 13th Boundary Layer...","Such treasures were the ones Noah and many others were finding as they roamed the Extremity Vein of Dissolution, with Noah's Quintessential Emperor of Extremity form remaining in this area briefly after attaining the artifact as a subtle brilliance could be seen on his stellar skin.","The reason for this was none other than the fact that Quintessence had reached the 10th Boundary Layer with a portion of Noah's soul!","For the reified source, it felt as if it had attained an even grander stage, and at the same time not as the portion of Noah's soul it stemmed from could not express the authority of the 10th","Boundary Layer.","It was delving into this incongruency when an instant later...","\"Oh? Osmont!\"","The booming voice of Erikson was heard as this wild being appeared from the side.","His tan visage seemed to glow with strength as he had grasped his own Extremity Foundation, his beach shirt radiating stellar radiance as he held his slippers in his hands instead of his feet.","Further behind him, Scions who had also achieved their own Extremity Foundation followed him, each one adorned in sleek suits as it seemed Erikson had rejoined with his forces.","He came beside Noah's Reified Source of Quintessence freely while whistling out at the sheer aura he radiated, his voice echoing out.","\"My people tell me some inconsequential Lineage sought an Apex War with you and your people as a few dredges of Inheritances are standing beside them. Do you want me to send out an Obsidian Sima Legion or two to stand beside your Lineage? I have enough power to mobilize them.\"","...!","Obsidian Sima Legions!","One of the core forces of the Sima Clan as they stood just below the Crimson Sima Legions and above the Golden Sima Legions.","Within a single Obsidian Sima Legion...24 Apex Aeonic Lifeforms were at the lead! For Erikson to have the power of mobilizing multiple of such forces, his identity was not a simple one!","Towards his words, Noah stretched his neck while replying.","\"No. I want all my enemies to myself. And any Inheritances supporting my enemies...are only setting themselves to be ruined groups that will no longer be able to call themselves Inheritances in the very near future.\"","WAA!","His will could be felt radiantly in his words as in the distance, the eyes of Eirkson's underlings shook with brilliance!","Erikson smiled as if he expected this answer, his eyes wildly gazing into the distance as his words continued.","\"You are a hard one to understand. But let me know of anything that I can do in order to bring you over to the Sima Clan. We do more than quarrel about power and standing as we know the real threat out there. Fostering and supporting unique existences like you is only our duty.\"","...!","A heavy sense of responsibility raged with his words, giving a stark contrast to the carefree way he dressed and moved!","He didn't stay long as after watching the river of stellar black blood leaking from the Prion Armadillo before Noah, he shouted out into the distance while leaving one last resonant message.","\"I received word from a Hyperversal Extremity of Foreordination of the Sima Clan that the Initiation Step of Extremity Sanctification we're in will be abnormally short, even possibly ending over the next few days as the Culmination Step will be ushered in with a surge of even more chaos.\"","A communication standing by itself as it was only directed towards Noah while Erikson disappeared, his retinue following behind him as Noah only smiled at such a message.","Of course the Initiation Step of Extremity Sanctification was ending in an abnormally short period of time.","After all, his Reified Sources of Extremity were sweeping away enormous numbers of treasures like the [Blazing Hyphae of Extremity] across the endless area of the Vein of Dissolution!","And in the Culmination Step to come where Apex Aeonic Lifeforms joined the fray...he would be even more ready for such a stage as a part of him was finishing up the process of Apexification!"]},{"number":2518,"title":"Chapter 2518: Chapter 2517 Obscene Values! I","paragraphs":["An extended banquet table filled with trays pulsing with the aura of EPOCH Relics could be seen, vibrant and mouth watering meats from ancient Beasts cooked under the flames of Boundaries seen filling these radiant trays.","The laughter of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms could be heard as on seats that looked like thrones, the figures of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from the Singularity Overseers, Genesis Institute of Extremity, and Noblesse could be seen mingling and enjoying a grand feast.","Noblesse Reverend Emperors with pristine beauty, men and women alike, could be seen moving around the stellar banquet table and constantly refilling drinks and foods that shimmered with the aura of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity.","Everyone here were Allies in the upcoming war as they cordially got together to discuss everything to do with this war and the ongoing Extremity Sanctification of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution!","At this moment, a burst of boisterous laughter rang out from one side of the table that showed a scowling Singularity Elder beside Zeitgeist speaking.","\"Haha, so it really seems this genius has condemned his whole Bloodline to death. So what if he attained an Absolute Seed of Extremity? The weight of all that blood on his shoulders would be more than enough to prevent him from even reaching the 17th Boundary Layer!\"","A light of jealousy and distaste could be felt within his words and eyes as those around him laughed ruefully.","Each of them dearly wished for an Absolute Seed of Extremity, but most felt that it would be forever outside their grasp as they couldn't help but lament!","When knowing that a Mutated Entity who could attain such a thing even before Apexification existed, they couldn't help but envy!","\"Didn't I hear rumors that the Singularity Overseers welcomed another Hyperversal Extremity not too long ago with an Absolute Seed of Extremity? Comparing that to a being who...\"","Discussions continued with harmony as these Lifeforms talked about their Inheritances and any pertinent issues.","Towards the center of the table, Commander Vladic sat beside Grand Genesis Elder Meiying as his expression was visibly darkand he wasn't participating in any of the festivities!","How could he when much of it involved disparaging the one being he could not kill in this Apex War?","Even now, his mind buzzed with possibilities as he sought for a way in what seemed like an impossible situation!","Meiying saw this as she sighed while speaking to him mentally.","\"Sometimes, the powers that be make it impossible for things you consider fair to occur. You will simply need to let it go and allow the Annihilation of his Lineage to serve as a recompense, otherwise-\"","BOOM!","Before Grand Genesis Elder Meiying could finish her words, their surroundings buzzed as the illusory dome above them cracked to reveal stellar bodies littered in the distance, the forms of 5 Apex Aeonic Lifeforms floating above the cracks of the domain!","The number was very low compared to all the Apex Aeonic","Lifeforms here, but their auras were simply maddening to feelespecially the red robed being at the lead of this force.","His body rhythmically with a heavy force of haki that made even Grand Singularity Elder Zeitgeist and Grand Genesis Elder Meiying change their gazes and become entirely somber.","His aura alone let them know he was many times more powerful than them!","His eyes were sharp as within them, Destruction danced freely.","As he saw the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms below him rise and their Dynamis surge out protectively, Ahpuch smiled and spoke calmly.","\"Why hello there, friends. I don't suppose you would deny any extra help for this Apex War of Annihilation? Since the quality of Lifeforms here seems really lackluster!\"","WAA!","The gazes of most of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms here changed at his provocative words.","Most.","Commander Vladic's heart pulsed with joy as when he felt the oppressive aura of this being that seemed many times more suffocating than Meiying, he rose up to welcome him happily as it felt like his prayers were getting answered!","---","[The Tenth Boundary Layer of Quintessence]:: An important threshold has been crossed as with it comes the stage of a new life.","The closer you get towards Extremity, the more that Quintessence has to live up to its distinction. The 10th Boundary Layer is one such distinction as any Concept of Extremity you personally begin expanding will instantly be elevated to the 9th Boundary Layer.","Upto 81 Boundaries can now be deemed Quintessential, with the limitation of the Quintessential Apocryphal Layers being applied only to the highest Boundary Layer that Quintessence itself has reached being abolished. Now, any Concepts of Extremity deemed Quintessential will also be afforded the authority to expand from the 10th and into the 11th Boundary Layer at no cost to the user...] [...Your standing as a Quintessential Aeonic Curator is further strengthened as you can now alter your Recorded History of Extremity, including but not limited to the editing of the usage of Boundary Layers of any concept apart from Quintessence. You can now peer into the Aeonic Annals of Extremity of other existences with lesser soul values, and you can edit their own Recorded History at the cost of your Soul Values. At this new stage, Quintessence also ponders to you a question. After Golden, Obsidian, and Consummate Boundaries, is the next stage truly only limited to Extremity Boundaries?]","Before Noah's eyes, there was a group of too much information.","Information about the body being forged from the 81 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians.","Information about the 10th Boundary Layers of 81 Boundaries!","There was an excess of such information as Noah sorted through all of it while pulling up the Boundary Layer of Quintessence first!","This was now a Crimson Consummate Boundary as its abilities became even more obscene, with something as ridiculous as the fact that due to Quintessence...any concept that Noah expanded from now on would instantly be raised to the 9th Boundary Layer.","\"...\"","No need for any Aeonic Treasures of Extremity.","No need for Sources of Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity.","No need to ponder or spend years like others!","He could choose a concept and expand it towards Extremity with a beckoning of his soul as moments after, it would attain the highest that Boundary Expansion Realm experts could attain before Apexification.","This was Quintessence.","This was a distinguished 10th Boundary Layer!"]},{"number":2519,"title":"Chapter 2519: Chapter 2518 Obscene Values! II","paragraphs":["2518 Obscene Values! II","The effects of the 10th Boundary Layer of Quintessence were astounding, but Noah knew they were only this obscene for him as the same Layer expanded by his Vassals...would in no way grant the same boons.","Apart from automatically taking any concept Noah expanded as a Boundary to the 9th Layer, Quintessence alone made it so that 81 concepts could be deemed Quintessential as they would even be taken to the 11th Boundary Layer through this!","Noah simply had to express this authority for Quintessence itself and any other Boundary deemed Quintessential as when the 11th Boundary Layer was attained for one...the effects of the 81 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians would kick in and take the rest of the boundaries to this Layer as well.","It was simply an obscene reality for any other beings to watch.","The description of the 10th Boundary Layer of Quintessence even ended with a question as it seemed to indicate that after Crimson Consummate Boundaries and before a Boundary reached","Extremity...there should still be something grand that Noah could attain as the answer may just lie with Quintessence!","Only time would tell.","But for now...Noah continued perusing the dazzling swathes of information regarding Boundaries while the Apexification of a part of him continued!","---","The overbearing pressure of Dissolution and Penumbra mixed in to clutter everything in the surroundings.","It would even make breathing difficult if one didn't have a Dynamis of Extremity or a form of even greater authority backing them up!","A figure of another one of Noah's body was in such a region that consisted of cracks between Havens, where he had traversed far enough that currently, the authority of Dissolution and Penumbra were the two most pressing ones here.","But he and Grand Primeval Elder Silas did not move too much further in the past day as they were being located by someone much more powerful than them, and at this moment...","SHIING!","A runestone pulsed within the body of Grand Primeval Elder Silas as his eyes quickly opened with respect, gazing above them as the overbearing authority which seemed like it could crush Reverends parted ways like nothing, a bright shadow filled with stellar light coming in as it materialized into a figure pulsing with thick authority of a Hyperversal Extremity!","\"Esteemed Shadow Extremity...\"","Even before the figure was unveiled, Silas rose and bowed down with utmost reverence while a peal of clear laughter rang out along with a serene feminine voice.","[At ease, Silas. We're here for a happy occasion after all.] ...!","The voice caused him to become shocked as Silas bowed down even further, his eyes burning with a light of intense respect and even a hint of fanaticism as he called out.","\"Extremity Gabriella...I thought Master was the one making his way here.\"","Hyperversal Extremity of Shadows, Gabriella!","For Grand Primeval Elder Silas to be acting like this, it was only because this was the being who had singularly changed the fate of the Cult of Endless Shadows by locating and obtaining one of the 81 Armaments of Extremity hidden across history by the Hyperversal Extremity of Steel- the Shadow Sword!","For her to come here just to fetch them...he didn't think they were worthy of such an honor.","[I told your master to rest his old bones so I could come see the hotshot causing a buzz and putting himself in the center of the storm of an extremely chaotic Extremity Sanctification. Noah Osmont, was it?]","Her figure fully unveiled itself as Noah gazed at her descending from above.","A glowing black gold silk armament wrapped around her visage as thick Hyperversal Extremity Authority spilled out from it constantly in the form of Shadows, her face being the first Hyperversal Extremity Noah to see revealed as...","'Ridiculous...'","It seemed to break all bounds of realistic standards- as if all the authority of this being reaching Extremity had gone towards making her exceedingly beautiful and of majestic standing!","Bountiful dark hair cascaded way past her shoulders as it seemed to turn into stellar shadows below her, with her fair skin radiating power as on her forehead, a dark three pointed star was etched gloriously.","Her eyes held confidence and grandeur as her pupils infinitely swirled with darkness, with an existence like Silas not even daring to meet her eyes lest he be lost in them for the years to come!","But Noah...","His body pulsed with the grandeur of a being with an Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation as he gazed at her eyes calmly while nodding.","\"Yes. I didn't expect the reception of the Cult of Endless Shadows to be so welcoming.\"","[Mmm...for you to speak so freely towards me- it seems you're really special. Alright, let's go.]","BZZZT!","Their surroundings seethed as all authority here was instantly replaced with a sparkling darkness of shadows.","Silas showed reverence at this pristine authority while Noah...his eyes became sharper as he felt how his current self wasn't able to do too much against such an authority!","It wrapped around them fully as the dreadful pressure of","Dissolution and Penumbra around them seemed to all but","disappear, the very space around them shifting and being displaced as before even a second passed...","Everything calmed again.","\"...\"","Noah gazed at their surroundings as the glowing darkness receded, and he saw that they were no longer in the cracks between Havens.","Behind them, massive churning tendrils of darkness rose up infinitely to form a wall they couldn't see the ends of, the space around them filled with dredges of broken stellar bodies and even split Planes of Existence that were unrecognizable.","With a single move, Extremity Gabriella had taken them within the cracks of Havens and into a brand new land.","[Thie should be your first time here, so let me welcome you...to the Aeonic Haven of Penumbra.]","...!","Roiling dark clouds appeared below their feet as they were wrapped in Hyperversal Extremity Authority, their figures being pulled forward at a rapid speed as when Noah's will spread out, he found a stunning scene!","Extremely far in the distance...he could see that the skies and earth were filled with billowing darkness as across them...a crystalline Vein seemed to have risen from the earth below as it weaved across the skies endlessly, insanity-inducing power stemming from it as it was the Extremity Vein of Penumbra!","It had risen from whatever Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands it stemmed from as this was a Haven...that had long since been in the Extremity Step of Extremity Sanctification.","Noah's first arrival here was hastened by the arrival of a Hyperversal Extremity- an existence that had her will examining him ever since she appeared as she spoke with a smile while they barreled deeper into this Haven.","[In this Haven, there are countless shadows and darkness that reveal one's true heart. Osmont...what darkness hides behind your heart? Why did you wrap Silas here in an Oath as you now stand on the precipice of an Apex War?]","The words of a Hyperversal Extremity flowed freely as even though she was smiling, Noah could feel a feral sense of danger that caused his soul to burn fiercely with tyranny and Quintessence.","He didn't reply to her question as his soul sent messages to spur the portion undergoing Apexification at this very moment.","He sent a message to spur Alexander King to begin making the Absolute Dynamis of Extremity that would even mask and protect him from Hyperversal Extremities as a meeting with another one whose intentions could not be easily discerned made him move even faster!","1"]},{"number":2520,"title":"Chapter 2520: Chapter 2519 Obscene Values! III","paragraphs":["Her eyes fluttered open.","And how could they not when she felt his will become focused on her?","Her surroundings were filled with bright golden seas of Loot Light as far, far above her, she could see 81 infinity symbols shining with a myriad of different colors of light.","Each of them acted like a conduit as they released rivers of liquified golden Loot light- light that had the vast majority of it concentrated on her all this time as even now, it continued to flow into her and made her ever more pristine!","Her eyes had fluttered open amidst all of this as she felt the Will of the one being she wanted to always be of use to- her Crimson gold pupils coming to see his manifested form before her floating with a light smile.","\"Are you ready?\"","His gaze was far reaching as his words seemed to be asking her about many things.","Was she ready to step back into the limelight? Was she ready to bear the weight of all things to come? Was she ready to act at this very moment?!","She knew with surety what the answer was.","\"Yes, Master.\"","Ruination replied with confidence as one of the first things Noah was doing simultaneously at this moment included Ruination playing a big part!","After the grand authority of Apexification coursed through Noah's Infinite Forge of Extremity, she was worthy of playing many big parts.","Noah knew this very well as he stared at the Entity before him.","[Name]:: Ruination(Ruined Blade of Quintessential Extremity) [Lineage]:: Hyperversal Apex I Relic","[Titles]:: Ruination, Multiplicator, Emperor's Armament...","[Ruined Hyperversal Apex Mana Value]:: 1,000","[Ruined Hyperversal Apex Durability Value]:: Infinite","[Ruined Hyperversal Apex Soul Value]:: 1,000","[Ruined Hyperversal Apex Defense Value]:: 1,000","[Ruined Hyperversal Apex Damage Value]:: 1,000","[Features]:: Hyperversal Proliferation, Hyperversal Armament Replication, Hyperversal Outburst...","[Miscellaneous]:: A unique relic that supercedes normal Apex Relics by a large margin. As a Hyperversal Apex Relic, it is already setting its sights to become an Armament of Extremity...","His weapon alone that benefitted from the Apexification of half of his soul...it held the capabilities to unleash 1,000 Ruined Hyperversal Apex Damage Values with every swing!","And not just that. It held Infinite Durability.","It was a weapon that could not be broken!","It held a great deal of profound wonders to peruse through, but Noah's soul urged for him to complete his task as he focused on a single one of her features.","Hyperversal Proliferation.","Without a word, his hands waved out as before him, 9 vibrant buds that shone like singularities bloomed.","He currently held 9 Buds of Convergence that aided in the Convergence of Dynamis of Extremity.","For an Absolute Seed of Extremity, a single Bud of Convergence only granted 1% towards the rate of Convergence.","This was not enough for Noah to instantly achieve 100%","Convergence on a Dynamis he hadn't repeatedly used the","characteristics of like Indefatigable, Aletheian, and Vitalistic!","And one of the answers to this was Ruination.","The moment she saw the 9 Buds of Convergence, she smiled and waved her hands towards them as they came to swirl around her majestically.","Her body was suffused by a vibrant glow as her authority erupted out and wrapped around the Buds of Convergence, Noah watching with his own eyes as while the 9 Singularities whirled around her in one moment...9 more appeared soon after.","18 of such dazzling Loot had appeared and continued to swim around her as another instant later, the 18 pulsed and became 36!","HOONG!","An astonishing light gathered around her as her expression became stern, her Crimson gold figure radiating pure grandeur as she brought her hands together and clasped her palms before her blessed chest.","\"YAA!\"","A valiant cry echoed out from her as another 36 blinding Buds of Convergence appeared!","And the intensity of authority around her only became more concentrated as her figure blazed with halcyon crimson light, yet another 36 Buds of Convergence blooming as a total of 108 now whirled around her.","\"Haa...\" She breathed out a sigh of triumph as she gazed towards Noah with an innocent smile- a smile of a being looking to get praised for what she had done as Noah appeared in front of her and patted her head.","The terrifying Loot of Buds of Convergence were multiplied 12 times as it showed off the capability of [Hyperversal Proliferation] that Ruination could now do!","Something distinctive with this feature was that the factor by which a targeted Loot was multiplied by wasn't always the same- with this number varying depending on the type of Loot and its tier as the factor could be much greater...or much lower.","But the formed Buds were more than enough for Noah's purposes right now as they disappeared from the Infinite Forge.","Outside of the Forge hidden within the depths of Noah's soul, the visage of Alexander King could be seen with his musculature being formed by the 81 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians.","Even before all parts of him fully formed to finish Apexification, his right hand rose and pressed towards his chest where a","multicolored organ was forming.","And as it did so...a pulse erupted out as it thumped, oceans of essence rushing as the chest expanded because he had taken a Quintessential Breath!","He took a breath as many essences coursed through the body of a forming Apex Aeonic Lifeform as if it was coursing through paved roads.","Faster.","Stronger.","And much more inclined towards Extremity!","\"Providence and Destiny...\"","Alexander began to call out specific Boundaries as their authorities were brought close together, a halcyon light beginning to radiate from him as close by, Henry's figure observed intently!","After Providence and Destiny, the authorities of Pathfinder, Moirai, Fate, Karma, Fortune, Kismet, Wisdom, and Quintessence followed as they became like glowing lines that coursed through the forming body of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform- intent on forming an Absolute Seed of Extremity even before the process of Apexification fully finished!"]},{"number":2521,"title":"Chapter 2521: Chapter 2520 Obscene Values! IV","paragraphs":["Around the same time Noah enacted a new Dynamis of Extremity with a portion of his soul.","Within the Quasarian Lands, the figure of Grand Singularity Elder Zeitgeist returned from a banquet that just had powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms join.","Others returned to their abodes to prepare while he moved into what used to be the hidden domain where a young woman used to be.","In this hidden domain, the sea of abundant treasures filled with lifeforce still remained as currently, there was a maddeningly powerful aura floating at its very center!","It was the aura of a Hyperversal Extremity- and it was none other than Hyperversal Extremity Kabul who was dispatched here by the Hyperversal Extremity of Devouring yo ensure success in achieving the being with the Innate Pellucid Extremity Foundation!","\"Brother Kabul.\"","Zeitgeist called out with reservation as he had already sent back the intelligence of all that occured in the banquet between the Inheritances.","The Hyperversal Extremity before him only nodded without even turning back as he spoke out serenely while gazing at the sea below him brimming with lifeforce.","[Zeitgeist, do you know the first thing that happens when a being attains Extremity?]","WAA!","He began with a question as Zeitgeist nearly rolled his eyes, knowing the tendency of this older brother of his to ask questions that he didn't really want answers to as he continued himself soon after..","[Their very existence- the records of their achievements and their very being become their own for them to manipulate. Their records become things that are erased from the Aeonic Annals of Extremity where other beings can freely access. But those who haven't...traces of their Existence will be found everywhere. And such traces can be utilized to do many things...]","As he spoke, Kabul's Hyperversal Extremity Authority seethed and spilled out from him, Zeitgeist becoming shocked as he asked to clarify.","\"Brother Kabul, are you...are you moving to act against this being personally? I thought Master agreed with thr method of the Apex War and-\"","[Zeitgeist.]","HUUM!","A single word stopped him in his tracks.","[The Methodology of this Apex War is muddy. Too many","ambiguities can occur as it is best to make a move before all of it unfolds.]","\"...\"","Zeitgeist had many thoughts crossing his mind as he pondered just what this Older Brother of his was thinking.","\"Wouldn't something like this affect you adversely? The Adjudicator of Dissolution would be able to find out that it was the work of a Hyperversal Extremity as this could even ignite a conflict between her and Master. This is...\"","He shouldn't have spoken. He didn't want to speak against it.","But...there seemed to be too many things at stake as Hyperversal Extremity Kabul smiled at the worry he showed, statung shocking words thereafter.","[These are actually the commands of Master. It seems the oh so great Adjudicator of Dissolution had long since sowed","dissatisfaction amongst others. For someone of lesser blood to hold such a distinction and her actions in the past...it seems others are planning on using this opportunity as a chance to shake the pillars that support her.]","...!","WAA!","Shocking words left his mouth as his authority continued to spill over!","[But...you don't need to know too much about this right now. Just watch and learn what can be done with Hyperversal Extremity Authority as right now...I shall find histories of this Osmont and be able to track him down- a single shockwave of my soul being enough to cause the extinction of him and all records surrounding him. But of course...we shall talk first.]","Kabul.","He was decorated in a black Armament that was littered with three flat rotating planes of Existence. His dark hair was nicely trimmed with a fade as his eyes danced with wildness and age, his will diving into the Aeonic Annals of Extremity at this moment while focused on a single being!","While focused on Noah Osmont!","Before his eyes, countless lights bloomed as if a database holding the histories of all living beings was blooming before his eyes.","But his authority focused on a single being as the vastness of the Records was reduced, his will seeing trillions of Quintillions of bubbles of lights unfolding before him.","Each one represented someone's records.","Most shone with a white light as they seemed like clustered stars in a far away space, their size small and insignificant to show their worth and achievements in their Recorded History.","Some were darkening and disappearing even as Hyperversal Extremity Kabul watched at thus very moment!","And all this...was just focused on the Recorded Histories pertinent to the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution!","Kabul had seen scenes like this too many times as his authority burned ever brighter, his will using it to hone in on the identity that was Noah Osmont.","His vision fluttered across many white points of history as he was pulled ever deeper into the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","'Hmm?'","This surprised him as it meant the accomplishments of this being were a bit more than above average, where the deeper in Kabul went...the sizes of the bubbles of light increased gradually until some that even shone with a radiant blue could be seen!","HOONG!","His Hyperversal Extremity Authority pulsed at this moment as it told him to gaze a certain direction, his target being right there as the nearby bubbles of light disappeared from his sight while he delved into a certain direction.","When the scene changed, the light around this region of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity had changed as Hyperversal Extremity Kabul felt a glow of crimson and gold light in thr surroundings.","This should mean he was deep in the Annals as...","'Where...'","His brows frowned as he didn't see a dense clusters of bubbles before him.","It seemed that only the aurora of crimson and gold light could be seen ahead as when Kabul expanded his will and looked up...","....!","His mind buzzed.","He realized why he couldn't see any other bubbles of recorded history!","He hadn't arrived in the deepest parts of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity that radiated crimson and gold light as when he gazed up, he saw the far away edge of a massive bubble that shone with a glorious crimson gold light!","It's size was utterly massive.","Incomparable to any of the Recorded Histories he had seen in his lifetime.","As Kabul's will expanded outwards, he was able to capture it more with its entirety as he saw the scene of an immeasurably huge halcyon crimson bubble, dense blue and gold bubbles swimming around it as it occupied a region where trillions of other Recorded Histories could be!","And as Hyperversal Extremity Kabul stared and focused on it, his Will roared out in surprise as he felt the massive bubble of Recorded History before him fluctuate.","As if it had sensed something.","As Kabul stared towards this incandescent history...he felt as if he was staring into an endless abyss.","And the abyss...was staring back at him!"]},{"number":2522,"title":"Chapter 2522: Chapter 2521 Obscene Values! V","paragraphs":["2521 Obscene Values! V","A massive crimson gold bubble of light taking the space of trillions of other Recorded Histories!","It represented an obscene amount of achievements worthy of being recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","It represented a being taking an obscene amount of space that showed his possible influence not just on himself, but the region his history was entrenched in.","With a size like this, Hyperversal Extremity Kabul would have assumed he was looking at a Hyperversal Extremity who had built up legends over countless years!","What he didn't know was that the existence who history was recorded here...even though he didn't have Hyperversal Extremity Authority, he already held an Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation.","He had already opened the pathway to multiple seeds of Extremity.","He had even created Extremity Foundations on many beings and paved open their pathways towards Extremity!","These were just a few of his achievements as they contributed to the obscene might that Kabul saw!","---","[Another Absolute Seed of Extremity has begun to be forged!]","For others, it was immensely hard unless they were extremely close to Extremity, or they had attained Extremity themselves.","Only at such a juncture would existences be able of forming Absolute Seeds of Extremity with their shocking Foundations and souls that had achieved or were close to attaining Hyperversal Extremity Authority!","But multiple factors came together as just when the strings of multiple authorities were about to converge into a single factor, the origin of Alexander King blazed as an Aletheian Haven of Extremity within cried out for inclusion.","The Will of the True Emperor of Quintessence gazed at it only briefly before he made his decision as Elysium burned with a halcyon light and joined the fray.","It didn't cause any disharmony as it complemented everything there and even made this forming Seed of Extremity ever closer to Noah!","And an instant after, the golden light of Elysium completed a forging Singularity as it turned into a bright Seed that waited for definition.","[A Fourth Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity has been born!]","[The unique conditions and resonance of the concepts within the Fourth Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity have placed its rate of Convergence at 30%]","...!","A resonance of concepts that granted the greatest initial rate of Convergence so far.","But Noah was not able to enjoy it.","Because the moment this Dynamis formed, whether by Fate, Destiny, Karma, Fortune....or whatever else it may be, Noah felt a burning sense of disharmony as part of a vision of his soul changed.","This change was actually wrapped by the liquid halcyon light of the newly formed Fourth Unknown Dynamis of Extremity as Noah felt like he crossed countless light years, boundless information coursing through him with every passing glimmer of light as he realized he had deeply peered across the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!","And a foggy vision cleared up until a radiant scene displayed itself to him, a scene of what represented who he was and all the records he had made...being gazed at by a horrifically more powerful gaze.","A gaze of a Hyperversal Extremity!","The will of this being seemed surprised at this moment as Noah's will was extremely calm in such a situation.","This was why he had urged himself to form a new Dynamis of Extremity that would even be capable of protecting himself against existences exceeding Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","This was why he couldn't depend on others like the Adjudicator of Dissolution to simply be there to protect him!","This was why at this moment, there was the advent of...","'Oraculum.'","BZZZT!","[The Oraculum Dynamis of Extremity burns brightly in your Aspects of Existence.]","His soul buzzed as he named the Dynamis that had even given him the ability to see the current scene before him.","The Oraculum Dynamis of Extremity!","Oraculum was a word that could closely be translated into a destined declaration or a prophetic decree.","Noah called it so as he wished for this Boundary to be something that could utilize Destiny, Fate...and all the other concepts included in it to decree and guarantee a destiny most befitting to him!","And oh did it serve him well right at its conception.","[The features of Adumbrative Viewpoint and Oracular Annals Curator have been born!]","A prompt that he perused through now, even though one of its abilities had passively initiated to bring him where he currently was.","Within the depths of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, it was [Oracular Annals Curator] that had allowed him to feel the seeking gaze of a Hyperversal Extremity and be capable of gazing back at him!","But...this wasn't enough.","So before the surprise from the Hyperversal Extremity before him faded, Noah had already taken his next move as 70 Buds of Convergence were instantly devoured by his soul- everything about them surging towards the just recently budding Oraculum Seed of Extremity as it shone with an utterly halcyon light!","[An astonishing Quintessential Achievement worthy of being documented in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!]","The first prompt came as Noah felt it closely reflected his size in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity- his vast edge seemingly increasing ever so slightly as he instantly took a Dynamis that had formed in less than a few seconds and took it towards full Convergence.","[The Oraculum Dynamis of Extremity has reached 100% Convergence!]","[An Absolute Seed of Extremity has bloomed within your Soul!]","[The Oraculum Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity is blossoming within your Soul!]","...!","[The Oraculum Absolute Planar Domain can now be cast.]","[The feature of Oraculum Emperor's Touch has been born!]","[The features of Adumbrative Viewpoint and Oracular Annals Curator have been Quintessentially enhanced.]","A fourth Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity bloomed as now...","Now Noah felt like he was ready- activating Oracular Annals Curator right away!","His soul buzzed with power as what he had cast was born not too long ago as it allowed him to perceive a Hyperversal Extremity gazing at him, and now...it was boosted even further by the completion of the Convergence of the Dynamis of Extremity as he could now do more than just watch!"]},{"number":2523,"title":"Chapter 2523: Chapter 2522 Obscene Values! VI","paragraphs":["2522 Obscene Values! VI","[Oracular Annals Curator]:: The authority of the Oraculum Dynamis of Extremity has entirely changed your relationship with the Aeonic Annals of Extremity and your own standing to it as you are now aware of the breadth of your Recorded History, and its utilization to benefit you. You are now able to traverse across the Recorded Histories of other beings without their knowledge so long as their souls are lesser to yours in Value. Upon further enhancement, the feature can also entirely mask your Recorded History and the Recorded History of those connected to you within the Aeonic Annals of Extremity for the cost of 10% of your Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Values every minute- allowing you to attain a right normally reserved for those who have achieved Hyperversal Extremity Authority...","A feature that was simple in its description and grand in its workings.","A feature that Noah activated the moment it was selected as before the Hyperversal Extremity before him could come out of his stupor, his Recorded History and everything that represented him and his people began to disappear!","BZZZT!","And at such a juncture, the will of the Hyperversal Extremity was roused as the visage of Hyperversal Extremity Kabul sharpened his eyes and instantly moved.","He suspended his disbelief and acted first as the massive crimson gold bubble he saw rapidly retreated, becoming a small point of light an instant later as the rest of the bubbles around it disappeared entirely!","Abilities of Absolute Dynamis of Extremity were things that Hyperversal Extremities commonly delved into as their workings were mysterious for each being.","Even at this moment, the Hyperversal Extremity Authority Kabul was utilizing stemmed from the very first Absolute Dynamis of Extremity he had managed to forge after attaining Extremity in Devouring with the efforts of his Master!","The abilities had their distinction in the name.","They were Absolute.","So why was a single dwindling point of crimson gold light still there after Noah had used [Ocular Annals Curator]?","Why was there a part of him not being able to be hidden away to the extent that the will of the Hyperversal Extremity Authority Kabul reached into it?!","The answer was a dazzling one.","---","[Every day, the Oraculum Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity will bud Oraculum Fruits of Extremity equivalent to the number of concepts in its makeup. The Oraculum Fruits of Extremity can be devoured as they are extremely conducive to raising the Boundary Layers of all...]","After the complete Convergence of the Oraculum Dynamis of Extremity, its prompts continued to descend even though Noah's were currently filled with a blinding cold light of tyranny!","There was supposedly an Investiture of Extremity that all beings were bound by that made it so Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and Hyperversal Extremities could not freely massacre or interfere negatively against lower lifeforms.","And yet everything that had occurred so far showed loopholes and unfairness as simply...it seemed like a load of bull!","One could not depend on any set constructs, laws, or people as they had to depend on themselves.","Noah would depend on himself...but he would also use the set laws for his gains.","[The Authority of the Oraculum Dynamis of Extremity will course across your Aspects of Existence to fortify your Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation passively when utilizing your Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi, granting an increase in all your Hyperversal Values unceasingly.]","[The combination of your Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi, Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation, and the authorities of the Indefatigable, Aletheian, Vitalistic, and Oraculum Absolute Dynamis of Extremity coursing through you has caused the strengthening and strengthening of your Aspects of Existence to reach an even more abnormal level, granting you an increase of +25 Hyperversal Soul Values, +25 Hyperversal Damage Values, +75 Hyperversal Defense Values, and +75 Hyperversal Vitality Values daily.]","\"...\"","Set in weaving grand plans, even Noah had to come to a stop on this particular prompt.","One of the True usages of the Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity unveiled itself.","Noah's Main Body was not able to support another Dynamis of Extremity before Apexification as even with all of his terrifying methods, he wouldn't have been able to greatly increase his daily increase of Hyperversal Soul Values from +.5.","Yet after the completion of Vitalistic and Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity brought it to 2.5....the addition of Oraculum brought the daily increase of his power to an even more abnormal level as Noah's Main Body could now gain an equivalent of 25 Values of a newly advanced weak Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","The Defense and Vitality Values were even more obscene.","The elevation of the clone of Alexander King would open up unimaginable pathways for Noah's Main Body as his Foundation would likely grow to be something that utterly exceeded any possible limitations of a being's strength before Apexification.","This was the level of overpowered grandeur Noah was going for as there were others like the Hyperversal Extremity who just targeted him wishing to put an end to his glorious journey!","And it was why he was scheming against such beings.","As he marveled at the wonders a nearly completed Apexification would bring, the scheme he had put into motion unfolded at this juncture.","He had left behind a sliver of his Recorded History in front of the unknown Hyperversal Extremity gazing at him, making it seem like he was unbelievably in the process of masking or hiding it as it was just taking time before it fully disappeared.","But the moment Noah cast Oracular Annals Curator, he could have masked his Recorded History from the Aeonic Annals of Extremity instantly!","A shred of it was left as this portion of Recorded History...Noah pulled it ever so closer towards a certain clone of his.","A clone situated near an existence surrounded by mystery...the veiled Adjudicator of Dissolution!","He even went as far as having this Clone rise and look above with a grim expression, the pulled Recorded History becoming manifested closely to this part of his soul as the Will of the Adjudicator of Dissolution was roused to lock onto him.","And an instant later...she perceived a foreign Hyperversal Extremity Authority actually reach out its grasps towards a part of this being before her as...","BOOOM!","[You!]","A single word filled with bone cold apathy and a shred of disbelief.","It was followed by a torrential explosion of Hyperversal Extremity Authority as from calmness in one moment, it felt like the end of Reality was coming in the next!","...!","A shocking eruption of Hyperversal Extremity Authority erupted deep in the Aeonic Annals of Dissolution.","Far outside of it, in a hidden Infinite Hyperversal Haven the size of a grain of sand...","The one to scheme and bring this event to fruition stared as the last pieces of fair stellar skin appeared on his clone that was Alexander King, his body simmering with brilliance as at this scene....his will burst out to see where it had arrived.","What stage had the Apex Aeonic Lifeform version of himself reached with the Foundation he held and everything else?","The answer was a disgustingly obscene one.","[Name]:: Alexander King(Noah Osmont)","[Realm]:: Fourth Aletheian Haven of Extremity","[Lineage]:: Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor","[Titles]:: True Emperor of Quintessence, Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor, One Who Gazes Upon Hyperversal Authority, Aletheian, Indefatigable, Tyrannical Emperor...","[Quintessential Hyperversal Mana Value]:: Infinite","[Quintessential Hyperversal Vitality Value]:: 5,999","[Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Value]:: 4,999","[Quintessential Hyperversal Defense Value]:: 5,999","[Quintessential Hyperversal Damage Value]:: 4,999","[Hyperversal Dignity]:: 2","[Hyperversal Mastery]:: 2","[Absolute Hyperversal Authority Resistance]:: 15%","[Dynamis of Extremity]:: Indefatigable(Absolute), Aletheian(Absolute), Vitalistic(Absolute), Oraculum(Absolute)","[Boundaries of Extremity]:: Quintessence, Blood, Manadynamics, Loot, Reality, Dimensions, Anima, Body, Origin, Soul, Genesis, Apocalypse, Prana, Dreams, Avalon...","...!"]},{"number":2524,"title":"Chapter 2524: Chapter 2523 Rage Against the Dying Light! I","paragraphs":["2523 Rage Against the Dying Light! I","A stat panel that showed utterly magisterial values presented itself as the visage of Alexander King glowed with quintessence.","It couldn't be described by anything else other than quintessence as his eyes carried the emerald glow of the Absolute Vitalistic Clones of Extremity while pulsing with golden light from the intensity of the Oraculum Dynamis of Extremity!","Soul Values and Damage Values of 4,999!","Vitality and Defense Values of 5,999!","Mind you...a non-unique Apex Aeonic Lifeform had an average Value of 1!","The reason for such abnormal numbers on the Apexification of Noah's were all due to his Foundation, unique Origin and Soul, and the many Concepts he held which all reached the 10th Boundary Layer right at Apexification.","Most other beings had a single Boundary achieve the 10th Boundary Layer, but most other beings didn't define themselves by 81 Concepts like Noah did.","Due to the large number of Boundaries achieving the 10th Boundary Layer, there were some that were particularly generous in their boons!","[The 10th Boundary Layer of Prana]:: An astonishing force of life rages within you as Prana permeates and pulses with vitality across your very cells constantly, granting you an additional +100 Quintessential Hyperversal Vitality Values.","Prana's 10th Boundary Layer was short and simple, yet it showed just how pristine and shocking a Crimson Consummate Boundary was as its 10th Layer alone was equivalent to nearly all the Vitality Values that Euryale held before she perished under Noah's hands.","His single Boundary was worth that much!","Multiple other boundaries in Noah's roster granted similar boons as they were the reason for the ridiculously high initial Quintessential Hyperversal Values.","[The 10th Boundary Layer of the Soul]:: A Quintessential Hyperversal Soul stands gloriously above others as it strives to reinforce that which it defines. Its mere presence at the 10th Boundary Layer grants you an additional +150 Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Values. The breadth of your soul is expanded ever more as your Hyperversal Dignity and Mastery experience a boom to bring you ever closer to Extremity...","Many of his Boundaries were intent on bolstering either aspects of him as they contributed to his ridiculous values.","And all this was before he utilized the authority of the 10th Boundary of Quintessence to take any of his 81 Boundaries towards the 11th Layer.","After that...his Values should experience another boost from all the advanced Boundary Layers!","HOONG!","Wild waves of power emanated from the countenance of Alexander as all of his Vassals surrounding him felt their hearts palpate at his grandeur.","They had reached a new height as Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, and yet his aura surpassed them in such a manner that they felt like children before him!","Even the figure of his Main Body that had yet to undergo Apexification felt like a mountain they could never truly scale.","They were many times stronger than common Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, but most of them held the same issue of not being able to bring together different authorities to make an Absolute Seed of Extremity possible even though their Foundations had already paved the way towards it.","They gazed towards Noah with longing as they wondered.","Why was this? What were they missing?","WAP!","Space snapped as if it was squeezed while the astounding visage of Alexander King disappeared, leaving behind the magisterial main body of Noah as his people gazed towards him for answers.","As for where Alexander King had disappeared to...","—","In a verdant domain filled with golden misty light.","Nothing could be seen on what was occurring within as the most powerful Ancestor of the Lernaean Lineage was currently undergoing Dual Cultivation for the first time.","Amidst the dense golden mist, Aurelia bit her lips as she tried her best to allow her soul to concentrate on the connection and breaths of her body.","She felt like she had joined together with an endless conduit that held essence and authority that even exceeded her, and when she took the Quintessential Breath of Extremity at the same time as him during this connection- she was able to feel the lines of multiple authorities coming together much easier!","But still...it wasn't enough for her to grasp something as pristine as an Absolute Seed of Extremity in such a short period of time.","BZZT!","At such a moment, she felt the domain buzz as an overwhelmingly powerful aura appeared, her will almost rising to attack when she noticed the familiar aura of dominance with the same being she was connected to.","Yet the power had far exceeded even hers by what- six times? Eight? It was unbelievable as she barely managed to get her words out.","\"You...you underwent Apexification?\"","\"No, just a part of my soul contained in a Clone. I brought this part of me here because I will be forging my fifth Absolute Seed of Extremity through this body. Use this coming chance and connection to make sure you condense your Absolute Seed of Extremity as well.\"","...!","Forging a Fifth Absolute Seed of Extremity.","He spoke of it so freely as even with her golden hair strewn chaotically on her head, Aurelia still gazed towards the arriving figure of Alexander King as she spoke with disbelief!","\"Your fifth?! What the hell-...yaa!\"","Her words weren't able to finish as the countenance of Alexander King exploded with power.","\"Focus.\"","His single word pulsed with irrefutable power as the Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity of Indefatigable, Aletheian, Vitalistic, and Oraculum flashed over his body.","He breathed in as thereafter, the authorities of Necromancy, Summoning, Apocalypse, Death, the Seven Deadly Sins....a great deal of concepts began to revolve around him as he was once more about to make something immensely difficult for others to do look extremely easy!","There were many things happening concurrently that his soul effectively handled, but he didn't pause on the things he planned to do as the moment many Boundaries began to revolve around his body, he also gave another command.","\"Let Quintessence disintegrate any obstacles and attain the 11th Boundary Layer.\"","...!"]},{"number":2525,"title":"Chapter 2525: Chapter 2524 Rage Against the Dying Light! II","paragraphs":["2524 Rage Against the Dying Light! II","The Boundary that was Quintessential in its name.","The effects of its 10th Boundary were applied to itself first as an invisible dam seemingly broke, the aura around Noah's body of Alexander King becoming even more maddening because along with Quintessence going towards the 11th Boundary Layer...","HOONG!","His 81 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians carried out their utterly reality breaking feature as the rest of the 80 Boundaries within them also began surging towards the 11th Boundary Layer.","He kept going.","He didn't stop for even a second nor change his plans when he just came across a Hyperversal Extremity seeking to act against him!","A Hyperversal Extremity that at this moment through Noah's actions...faced the Wrath of the Adjudicator of Dissolution.","—","[You!]","The anger was understandable.","The disbelief in her single word was attributed to the fact that she couldn't believe a Hyperversal Extremity- an existence that had truly achieved Extremity...to actually act out against an existence that hadn't even undergone Apexification!","They had to first ignore their Dignity in order to do so.","They had to ignore the Investiture of Extremity and what it stood for.","They then had to utterly ignore her position as the Adjudicator who imposed the rulings of the Investiture of Extremity.","They had to think through all of this...and still choose to do what they were doing now!","[...]","The veiled eyes of Svetlana turned exceedingly cold as she didn't lift a finger.","Yet a maddening Hyperversal Extremity Authority erupted from all around her and ascended towards the foreign Hyperversal Extremity reaching out towards Noah, this whole region of reality instantly shattering as the will of Hyperversal Extremity Kabul on the other end was instantly alerted, becoming roused and trying to sink backwards into the Aeonic Annals of Extremity to return to his body!","His eyes were somber as his actions shouldn't have been found out until after he completed what he wanted to.","This was how he knew the authority of an Adjudicator to work!","If it wasn't actively in her vision when it occurred, she would find out about it within moments due to her authority as an Adjudicator.","She would know when the Investiture of Extremity was violated.","Buy knowing this after it happened...was utterly fucking useless for the weaker lifeform attacked while the more powerful one would be slapped on the wrist and set as an example for the future- telling others not to repeat such a thing again!","This was why even though it was something rarely done, Hyperversal Extremities or Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who weren't actively under the gaze of the Adjudicator would be able to achieve their aims and only be punished after.","But for Hyperversal Extremity Kabul to not even succeed and be found out...","His somber volition turned below him as he saw the visage of the body of the being he was looking for.","And on him, he saw...a smile.","...!","He instantly understood what had occurred.","He...was baited? He? A Hyperversal Extremity?!","HOONG!","He was retreating ever faster across the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as rage began to build within him, but this rage turned into shock a moment later as he felt his Hyperversal Extremity Will suddenly stop its movement back towards his body.","Thereafter, he actually felt it accelerate forward outside of his own control towards where he was escaping from!","This wasn't all as the thin strand of connection there was across the Aeonic Annals of Extremity was pulled upon...his body in the Quasarian Lands felt a tug as something unimaginable happened thereafter.","In the domain that used to be Xiaomi's home, Zeitgeist was watching Hyperversal Extremity Kabul's situated body with a hint of worry as a moment after...","CRACK!","The plane around them splintered as a crack appeared tight above Hyperversal Extremity Kabul!","[HOO!]","A bellow was heard from his roused body as he tried to erupt with maddening Hyperversal Extremity Authority, and yet it was as if an undeniable invisible hand ahead appeared, the Hyperversal Extremity Authority he was releasing instantly snuffed out as he was plucked away from this region!","He was plucked away as shockingly, he moved across the Recorded Histories of the very Aeonic Annals of Extremity towards where a part of his Hyperversal Extremity Will was currently contained!","\"....!\"","It was a shocking action as nearby, Zeitgeist felt his Aspects of Existence receive an enormous shock, blood leaking from his orifices as he staggered back.","Far away from this location, in a crack of darkness pulsing with Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, the head of the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction popped out quizzically as he felt the massive ripples of Hyperversal Extremity Authority spreading out distinctly across different regions of the Haven of Dissolution!","And back in the domain where the Adjudicator of Dissolution's veiled visage was, her eyes coldly watched while a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity was plucked across the very Aeonic Annals of Extremity to appear before them- his body surrounded by terrifying waves of Hyperversal Extremity Authority that was crushing around him on all sides!","His face was ashen as he constantly enlarged and reduced in size, wisps of Absolute Dynamis of Extremity trying to rise and be snuffed out as even without lifting a finger, the massive and much more refined tier of Authority the Adjudicator of Dissolution controlled seemed capable of crushing Kabul entirely.","...!","And at such a juncture...","[Master!]","He bellowed out with a guttural roar as he didn't feel any sense of communication coming from the Adjudicator of Dissolution.","It seemed that she only wanted to crush his Hyperversal Authority on all sides!","There was no reprimand or even a inquiring as to why he did what he did to buy time for his Master to come.","Things were not flowing how they wanted nor planned for.","The Adjudicator of Dissolution moved too swiftly without even inquiring as if she knew exactly what was happening, with her veiled figure not even batting an eye when she heard Kabul roar out the word Master!","Her gaze only became colder as from afar.","From outside the very Havens of Dissolution.","BOOM!","Reality seethed as an interminable force barreled through.","It seemed to be swallowing up reality, time, and space itself as it had both arrived...and not arrived at this moment.","An dominance of heavy insanity and power.","The Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Devouring!"]},{"number":2526,"title":"Chapter 2526: Chapter 2525 Rage Against the Dying Light! III","paragraphs":["2525 Rage Against the Dying Light! III","Everything was seemingly being swallowed up by an indomitable force as a terrifying aura unveiled itself, this authority being so potent that it even devoured time itself!","This could best be seen by what occurred next as even though this terrifying aura should have been arriving from a vast distance, the maddening aura from afar disappeared as if it was never there- and it instead blared up right beside the visage of Hyperversal Extremity Kabul who was getting ground down by the authority of the Adjudicator of Dissolution.","The maddening aura appeared here as if it had been at this location this whole time!","Tendrils of black and crimson darkness pulsed out powerfully as they acted like an endless shawl wrapping over this being.","A devouring darkness was constantly rising from the tip of his feet all the way to the top of his head as it seemed to be trying to swallow him alive, and one could only see his endlessly stellar pupils amidst this darkness!","His concept that he had taken to Extremity was Devouring as he had defined himself with it.","When a concept proceeded so extremely far in the bounds of Extremity, it would even be capable of doing what other concepts stood for- and sometimes even better!","He held the Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Devouring, and yet he could swallow up and alter the orientation of time itself. He could traverse across great distances faster and more proficiently than any spatial concept.","And at this moment...","BZZZT!","The darkness around him rose as his hand reached out towards the struggling figure of Kabul, and this time...he devoured the nearby Hyperversal Extremity Authority itself as Kabul's sorry figure gradually became able to breathe easier!","\"...\"","The environment reality still buzzed and vibrated at the heart auras in this region as seeing the appearance of a second Hyperversal Extremity Authority, the Adjudicator of Dissolution seemed unphased as she didn't question what he was doing here nor what his purpose could be.","She knew his purpose very well.","She just didn't think such purpose would pull in the visage of an existence who had forged an Absolute Seed of Extremity without even undergoing Apexification!","[Can you all no longer sit still?]","...!","Her gaze was far reaching.","She did not just see Kabul and the Hyperversal Extremity of Devouring as she seemed to see other forces standing beside them as well!","And the Extremity covered with tendrils of Devouring stabilized Kabul as he spoke out with a voice that seemed to be eating away at one's Soul.","[Whatever could the Adjudicator of Dissolution be talking about? I'm here answering the call of my disciple who was having his very Hyperversal Authority ground down by the one who should be one of the Seven Protectors.]","WAA!","His words boomed out in this region as sheltered behind the grandeur of the Adjudicator of Dissolution, even Noah in the far distance had his eyes become sharp at the pressure this being emanated.","Kabul was a Hyperversal Extremity as Noah had felt firsthand how overwhelming his pressure was.","But this existence currently protecting Kabul...he made even this Hyperversal Extremity seem like a child!","It caused Noah to question just how wide the gaps of power were amongst Hyperversal Extremities.","As for the Adjudicator of Dissolution...she faced this pressure easily head on as she locked her gaze with the Hyperversal Extremity of Devouring.","She locked onto his eyes which were one of the few things revealed by this being.","His eyes.","She had seen such eyes too many times in her life.","Eyes filled with apathy and disregard for her very existence as they triggered a past memory to appear and disappear within a span of an instant.","An instant of a memory to her, but it was akin to her reliving many years in that instant!","—","[Dmitri...what are you?]","\"Nothing.\"","[Sergei...what are you?]","\"Nothing.\"","A massive existence was floating in a darkened space as he gazed down at an obsidian stellar disk of earth that held a dozen souls.","Each time, he floated to a different one and asked questions as his voice leaked with powerful Hyperversal Extremity Authority!","All around this region, only an overwhelming darkness could be felt and seen as those here seemed like everything across existence.","The visage of the dark existence pulsing with Hyperversal Extremity Authority moved on to a different figure among the dozen.","[Svetlana...what determination you amount to?]","The question was posed to a young woman who seemed to have barely entered adulthood with a head overflowing with dark hair, her eyes filled with immense darkness and a lack of life as she replied without any emotions.","\"Nothing.\"","...!","She answered just like all others, but...","[Look at me when you reply, girl.]","SPLUCH!","As his words ended, the left arm of the young woman became utterly shredded and destroyed- everything being turned to mush right up to the shoulder as black gold blood exploded out like a river!","Yet no emotion showed itself on the young woman as she turned her head up and gazed into eyes filled with utmost apathy and disregard for her and everything else in life.","Those eyes.","She gazed at them and replied emotionlessly once again.","\"Nothing.\"","She was the last of the 12 as after she finished, the immensely powerful Hyperversal Extremity moved away and gazed at all of them.","[That is right. You are all nothing. You were born with nothing. And you determination die with nothing. Your only purpose is the mission. Continue this mission until the last moments of your life.]","WAA!","And a reply came out in unison soon after...","\"Yes, Master!\"","...!","Darkness and coldness were all they could see.","And in such an environment...","[Good.]","The voice of the Hyperversal Extremity thundered out as his authority leaked out and surged towards all 12 beings below- filling their bodies until they ballooned up to the extent that their souls were about to break!","[Not many of you determination survive. For those whose wills can overcome...I will ask you to rage.]","HUUM!","[Rage against the dying light. When your spirit feels like it's about to be extinguished...fight. Fight and fight some more!]","The obsidian tendrils of Hyperversal Extremity Authority around him raged as his covered figure seemed to pulse with immense madness and at the same time, clarity.","[Rage, children. Because if you do not...you may never have the chance to even gaze upon the dying light.]","...!"]},{"number":2527,"title":"Chapter 2527: Chapter 2526 Rage Against the Dying Light! IV","paragraphs":["2526 Rage Against the Dying Light! IV","A distant memory.","It came and left just as quickly as not even an instant passed, the Adjudicator of Dissolution gazing at the eyes that pulled this memory forward as she spoke coldly.","[Kabul has violated the Investiture of Extremity by attacking an existence yet to even undergo Apexification. For such a blatant action by someone of his stature...his Hyperversal Extremity Authority shall be stripped by half!]","...!","For his blatant violation of the Investiture of Extremity, Kabul would be stripped of half of his Hyperversal Extremity Authority!","It was a shocking punishment that was meant to serve more as a message than anything else as with it, beings would be told that they shouldn't just expect Obsidian or Crimson Haven Albatrosses to bear the weight of if they violate the Investiture of Extremity.","But...the tendrils of Devouring around a certain being vibrated as he shook his head.","[No. Taking half the authority of a Hyperversal Extremity for merely gazing upon the Recorded History of a lower life form is an unreasonable price.]","...!","He spoke with the same dominance and surety as the Adjudicator of Dissolution as if they were equals!","And yet the veiled figure of Dissolution turned her head as her fair hand rose up.","[You seem to be under the misconception that I was asking for permission.]","WAA!","[No...my punishment is already done.]","Her words were utterly cold as her fair hand that had risen came down!","And with it...","[Ah...!]","Behind the figure of the Hyperversal Extremity of Devouring, Kabul cried out as even under the protection of his Master, he found that a great chunk of his authority and power was fading away!","This was an unfathomable situation as the profound and powerful Hyperversal Authority of Devouring was all around him, and the authority of the Adjudicator of Dissolution shouldn't have been able to reach him.","And yet...","[Erasing the Recorded History of a weak-willed Hyperversal Extremity who would go as far as to blatantly attack lower lifeforms is an easy thing to do. Let this serve as a warning to any others alongside him. Erasing their records in the event of any violations...will be just as easy.]","...!","Her voice felt chilling as Kabul's soul shuddered.","She had...erased so much of his Recorded History to the extent that half of his Hyperversal Extremity Authority was taken away?!","His soul felt the changes that were so profound that it shouldn't be possible for any common Hyperversal Extremity to even dream of it. And yet...he found to his horror that he couldn't find any knowledge or records of two of his Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.","Not just that, he had lost any knowledge of a few dozen of his Boundaries, with the second boundary he should have attained Extremity in after Devouring...also being nowhere in sight!","[No...] His soul felt blank as if it had forgotten utterly crucial things that should have never left him.","He couldn't help but feel a sense of profound fear when he gazed towards the veiled Adjudicator of Dissolution as her power...it was actually so terrifying that it could go as far as erase the Recorded History that even included a Boundary that had reached Extremity? His Recorded History that shouldn't even be accessible by any in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity?!","Just...who was she?","In his fear, he floated ever closer behind the Hyperversal Extremity of Devouring as he felt his Master gaze towards the Adjudicator of Dissolution coldly.","[Letting it serve as a warning...what a curious thing for you to say, Adjudicator.]","His voice was deep as he gazed towards the surroundings, seemingly seeing through all veils and gazing at all of Dissolution as his eyes even came to lock onto Noah's visage.","[Do you know what is even more curious though? Most Adjudicators quietly observe their jobs and duties. Yet in the span of days, you've had multiple interventions publicly spread all around. Apex Aeonic Lifeforms killing lower lifeforms, hundreds of Scions perishing under your watch, an Apex War blooming, and now...even a clash against Hyperversal Extremities. It really brings to question your judgment and position.]","HOONG!","The shocking words caused even Noah's eyes to turn sharp as he felt the dense Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Devouring blaze, the very reality itself being devoured as the figure of the injured Extremity disappeared first.","At the shocking words, the veiled visage of the Adjudicator of Dissolution actually laughed sonorously as one could feel immense coldness in it, her voice booming out on all sides!","[How kind of you to worry about my position. When you are able to stand before my presence for longer than a few seconds before scurrying away, maybe then I'll take your worries with care.]","...!","Words that utterly decimated the grandeur of the Hyperversal Extremity of Devouring echoed out.","In the far distance, a hidden figure of Ahpuch's Master, the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction- his visage drew a sharp breath as he was once more reminded how unfathomable the Adjudicator of Dissolution was!","Without trading any more words, the brilliant aura of Devouring fully disappeared along with the being that came with it- a massive void being left in space that the Adjudicator of Dissolution waved her hands to erase.","The surroundings then became veiled and distorted as she stared towards a far pocket of space where the aura of Destruction silently disappeared, her gaze then coming to land on Noah as she asked coldly.","[Why are dredges of Devouring looking at you?]","...!","Even though she knew that part of this was due to her position, there also seemed to be more in play as when she focused on Noah, he only shook his head while gazing towards the twisting landscape around them.","\"They seem to want one of my people who has an Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Foundation.\"","WAA!","He spoke freely as the veiled eyes of the Hyperversal Extremity pulsed!","He held an being with such a foundation?! Even though it wasn't as pristine as a being like him who had forged an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, it still meant that it was an existence that was reasonably guaranteed to achieve Extremity in time as she would be sought after by any Inheritance or even the Seven Clans!","[You...]","This being before her also seemed to become more and more unfathomable, but she had no idea that among Noah's people, there were multiple who were at the cusp of attaining an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity as there were dozens of Extremity Foundations just waiting for a missing spark to do the same!","When all of it was revealed in the upcoming Apex War along with an massive number of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that would make one think they stemmed from a powerful Inheritance of Extremity...the reasoning and understanding of reality would be warped for many!"]},{"number":2528,"title":"Chapter 2528: Chapter 2527 Adumbrative Viewpoint!","paragraphs":["2527 Adumbrative Viewpoint!","[Adumbrative Viewpoint]:: Innumerable paths litter the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as Unrecorded Histories become Recorded Histories constantly. Truly powerful beings are capable of peering into the Aeonic Annals of Extremity and gazing at not just that which has been Recorded, but that which still remains Unrecorded. This capability allows you to view Unrecorded and Recorded Histories pertinent to your path, with your gazing of such history allowing you to more seamlessly select which path you will follow. When it comes to events deemed crucial by you in advance, this ability will activate passively to show you an Unrecorded History for the cost of 25% of your Soul Values. Active utilization of the ability will cost the same as you can view a random number of Recorded and Unrecorded Histories pertaining to you or those inferior than you, with the cost of Soul Values varying when it comes to other targets...","The details of another characteristic of the Dynamis of Extremity that had allowed Noah to hide his Recorded History in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity revealed before him as his Soul oversaw many things.","He was also digesting the events where he witnessed multiple Hyperversal Extremities clashing in the Haven of Dissolution as he was reminded of how many layers of mysteries the Adjudicator he was connected to had!","He needed more information.","He needed to be cognizant of what was occurring around him...and even what would occur in the future if he was to be able to dominantly continue his path.","The Oraculum Dynamis of Extremity provided for this need with its features, with the feature of Adumbrative Viewpoint being at the very forefront!","\"Ah...\"","Inside the golden misty domain where the gazes of many were obscured, the valiant cries of Aurelia could be heard as while Noah performed Dual Cultivation with her and advanced 81 Boundaries to the 11th Layer, in addition to forming yet another Absolute Seed of Extremity...he silently cast [Adumbrative Viewpoint].","BZZT!","Golden light overflowed from him.","His eyes showed astounding brilliance as if trillions of golden Singularities were being born.","Then...part of his soul became bathed entirely with the authority of the Oraculum Dynamis of Extremity as it sank into a vast and endless locale that could truly only be reached and employed by the powerful.","And even by the truly powerful, they could only gaze upon what was already written and recorded.","Very few could observe what had yet to be recorded!","Noah's vision saw the budding of countless bubbles of light before him as he passed through every single one, all of them becoming mere points of light as for the first round, he thought of anything relevant to himself.","The countless glimmers of light pulsed and transformed before his eyes as soon after, all that his vision saw was a dazzling golden book.","Its covers were rough and ancient as if it had seen the vicissitudes of time, and yet its pages were clear gold as they were ready to accept eons of history.","The golden pages unfurled until they arrived at a specific blank page, words shimmering with the authority of the Oraculum Dynamis of Extremity beginning to be written as alongside this, a fantastical scene bloomed before Noah's eyes.","[[...The surroundings were murky and filled with an overabundance of Sources of Chaos.","Rivers of blood flowed as deathly authorities ran rampant, a thick taste of death and destruction overwhelming any weak being as Commander Vladic looked at all of this with a blank expression.","He stood above the bodies of his lifeless brethren that formed into mountains below his feet, and yet a verdant obsidian authority curled in endlessly like a smoke as he saw the bodies of his people rise- their musculature spasming as from them, deathly skeletal atrocities that seemed to have at the very minimum 1 Apex Aeonic Soul Values rose.","At the very minimum!","It mattered not whether they were bodies of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms or Reverend Emperors, when they rose from death- they pulsed with a horror of at least 1 Apex Aeonic Soul Value!","KA! KA! KA!","They were only one of the reasons for him being where he was right now as in the distance, the cackling of a Lich reveling in death could be heard.","Dense clouds of verdant obsidian light covered everything else in the surroundings as he couldn't discern how everyone else was faring.","But did he really need to wonder? Was it not all just pure death?","Was what this...fiend before him brought really anything but death?","His blank eyes rose to find the visage of an existence billowing with verdant obsidian authority across his body, and yet his eyes shone with golden radiance as the pressure he emanated felt like it was crushing Vladic's soul even from afar!","The enemy commander that Osmont brought forth as his backing.","His name had been ringing out as chants from the countless Legions of atrocities rising in his wake!","As Vladic gazed towards his coming figure, he found his lips moving outside the control of his will as he spoke in a raspy voice.","\"You think they will let you do all this without repercussions? To desecrate my Lineage and the very life forms of Inheritances? You...\"","SQUELCH!","With a beckoning of his hand, a deathly verdant black bone spear stabbed out and impaled the figure of Vladic, thousands of Damage Values erupting out in a contained fashion so as to not destroy him right away while the voice of the fiend before him rang out.","\"Relish this death.\"","WAA!","\"Because from it, you will rise to become even stronger. This...shall be your atonement and gift for making today's reality occur.\"","...!","His voice caused Vladic's soul to feel so extremely cold as he felt poisonous tendrils sinking into his Aspects of Existence- into his very Records and begin altering them!","Horrid fear rose in his heart at this as he thought of Euryale.","As he thought of how he got here!","He stared at the fiend...no.","\"You...you are no fiend.\"","BZZT!","The last vestiges of his life left him as even in his fear, he managed to cry out in his raspy voice.","\"Demon. You...are a demon!\"","...!]]"]},{"number":2529,"title":"Chapter 2529: Chapter 2528 The Curtains Draw Close! I","paragraphs":["2528 The Curtains Draw Close! I","[[...\"You are a Demon that Elder Ahpuch will destroy with surety. A demon that no Inheritance will leave alive! You-GOH!\"","Vladic's Will and Soul were utterly torn as even his raspy voice couldn't be heard, and from his visage impaled by bones...a verdant black smoke bloomed and covered everything about him as a blazing authority of death began to rise from it!]]","The first page closed as the dazzling scenes Noah saw faded, the massive golden book before him beginning to flip towards another page.","His manifested Will smiled while gazing at the ancient book before him as he felt like a privileged reader who was gazing upon a history that had yet to even occur!","\"A Demon, huh?\"","He thought of the words Commander Vladic was saying before he was undoubtedly liberated by his doing as Alexander King.","He thought of the shocking descriptions of lifeless bodies rising again to have at the very minimum 1 Apex Aeonic Value!","It seemed the Absolute Seed of Extremity he was forming currently...was not something to be scoffed at as its capabilities were something to utterly dread.","He wasn't able to tell of the whole situation of the Apex War of Annihilation from the one Unrecorded History, but he could affirm that the Commander of the Noblesse Lineage would die even before the war was over as there was one name for him to pay attention to!","Ahpuch!","Even with the dreadful power Alexander King showed, Vladic still spoke with his fear that such a being could stop him?","Before Noah could ponder even more, the book before him had opened to another golden page as radiant halcyon runic words began to be etched.","The ability of Adumbrative Viewpoint would show a random number of Histories with every cast as Noah would attain an unknown amount of information each time.","And at the second Unrecorded History seemed to be especially radiant as another scene bloomed before him.","[[...Venous and vessel like structures could be seen snaking out for light years, the figures of a group of Scions passing across the top of such structures as their voices could be heard in the distance.","\"Word is that fewer and fewer Golden and Obsidian Extremity Panaceas can be found. It's astounding when most of us were able to attain at least a Golden Extremity Panaceas, the number far exceeding what was recorded in previous Initiation Steps of Extremity Sanctification.\"","Their robes held a dazzling pink plum petal to signify their Inheritance as they moved further away, their voices still resonant.","\"It also means the last Extremity Panacea should soon be appearing. Another Crimson Extremity Panacea...!\"","Their voices held fervor as they moved away, not noticing that below them, amidst the intersecting venous structures extending in the distance...there was a calm aura that floated above a pool of obsidian liquid that held a thin dried out stalk at its very center.","No signs of life or even the powerful Leviathans of Dissolution were present as this being held a shining horn on her forehead, her hair filled with streaks of crimson and now, even more golden streaks of light as the temperature around her constantly fluctuated.","It was Ayame of Infinite Extremity!","While others guessed and moved haphazardly, she came to this location after much deliberation.","Her exceedingly beautiful face carried traces of hesitation as she waved her hands to show a few twirling Golden and Obsidian Extremity Panaceas, but her gaze remained on the area ahead as she waited.","She was unlike the others. She could peer into the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as while others wondered when the Last Extremity Panacea would come, she had arrived at where it should bloom!","She...had glimpsed at something that had yet to even be recorded.","It cost her a lot to do this before undergoing Apexification as the only way she even had a chance of doing so was due to nothing other than her Origins.","Infinite Extremity.","There were many Inheritances and the Seven Clans out there- each had their own grandiose names.","Infinite Extremity...they were not simply a grandiose name. They lived up to it!]]","\"Oh?\"","The second scene Noah was shown held fantastical implications for Ayame that Noah had first come across during the scuffle with the Scions of the Genesis Institute of Extremity.","Infinite Extremity.","He was given a glimpse that some factions held deep history and power that he needed to carefully observe and understand!","And just as the Unrecorded History involving Ayame disappeared, the pages fluttered as another began.","It was all still under a single cast as all of it only showed the beginnings of Noah deeply understanding how reality would unfold in the coming future- where he would be able to understand his enemies in a way even they didn't understand themselves!","And just like this, time flowed.","—","Within the Aeonic Haven of Penumbra.","Unlike Dissolution, Penumbra shared a trait with other Havens that had already undergone Extremity Sanctification as it was exceedingly vast, with its explored lands under the dominance of many different factions.","The Cult of Endless Shadows had their hegemony centralized in a small segment within the southern region of Penumbra, and yet even this small segment had a wondrous array of Planes of Existence stretched out artificially in its own preset Planar System!","Noah had only now begun to near it while following Hyperversal Extremity Gabriella and Grand Primeval Elder Silas in tow as the blinding shadowy lights in the distance began to reveal more of this world of tantalizing darkness and shadows.","At such a time, the vibrant visage of the Hyperversal Extremity in front of them turned around while speaking calmly.","\"Your soul was tense this whole time until just moments ago. Whatever could have happened to cause your reservations against a Hyperversal Extremity to lessen even further?\"","Hyperversal Extremity Gabriella asked with a smile as she found Noah's demeanor completely unique.","Silas retained a respectful expression prior to this being while having already sent Noah multiple messages to show the utmost respect towards her- her standing being something not many in the whole of the Cult of Endless Shadows could match!","Yet Noah freely gazed back at her while his will took in the grandness prior to him, his words ringing out resonantly.","\"What happened? A body of mine just watched a Hyperversal Extremity have half of their Recorded History erased from existence. It made me comprehend even the Esteemed Hyperversal Extremities aren't all that in the face of true power.\"","...!","News hadn't yet fully spread as with the threat from the Hyperversal Extremity of Devouring, they were bound to.","The upper echelons of the Cult of Endless Shadows would be among the first to hear of the stunning event that had just occurred in the Haven of Dissolution, Elder Silas turning ashen at Noah's words and about to turn towards Hyperversal Extremity Gabriella to apologize when this existence actually laughed while her deep eyes locked onto Noah with even more scrutiny!","[You're truly living up to your name when you act like this...and you're making my anticipations all that much higher for you. Very well, enter our Cult of Endless Shadows and let us see more of you- we shall also deliberate when you can obtain the Shadow Sword, or if you are even qualified to begin with!]","...!","A long expanse of shadows were cast behind her.","With her words, it seemed like the gates into the Cult of Endless Shadows truly opened at this juncture!"]},{"number":2530,"title":"Chapter 2530: Chapter 2529 The Curtains Draw Close! II","paragraphs":["2529 The Curtains Draw Close! II","His authority gave the illusion as if he was as vast as an endless sea.","But he knew it was just that.","An illusion.","Within this illusion, he could see the scenes where stood on dark skies with the Hyperversal Extremity Gabriella and Elder Silas.","He could see his Reified Sources of Extremity moving across the vibrant and unique space within the Extremity Vein of Dissolution as they grabbed anything even shimmering with the essence of an Aeonic Treasure of Extremity.","He could see his figure standing before the Adjudicator of Dissolution, and his many bodies standing before many different existences.","He could see it all within this vastness that was himself as after a while...","THUMP!","The beat of his heart reverberated out and took him out of this illusion.","And instead...he stepped into the very real reality as he felt this vast authority in the form of multiple Boundary Essences coursing across his body.","This authority wasn't endless...but there was one thing that was.","THUMP!","Manadynamics joined the fray as Quintessential Hyperversal Mana proliferated all around.","It brought together the vibrant concepts of Necromancy, Summoning, Cthulhu, Apocalypse, Death, Pride, Gluttony, Sloth, Envy, Greed, Lust, and Wrath that were coursing through Noah's body with every breath!","The deeply cerulean Mana was telling him that it was time!","His portion of the soul that was taking on the identity of Alexander tuned out everything else momentarily but the task at hand as after activating [Adumbrative Viewpoint] and seeing the grandness of the next Absolute Seed of Extremity that he would make, Noah sought to even go above this as he expanded the base Boundaries he was mixing!","Manadynamics joined the fray to give this new Boundary the quality of endlessness.","With this quality in place, he then pulled in Niflheim and Entropy!","BZZZT!","His Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi buzzed as it supported it all efficiently for now, the number of Boundaries Noah was trying to fuse in this new Dynamis of Extremity already exceeding what the previous Dynamis held during their formation!","He wanted to add even more, but of course, they had to have a semblance of compatibility. Otherwise, even with his Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi- it would all fall apart.","He felt the many strands of authorities cycling in line through him as he carefully added...Aether and Conquest.","THUMP!","His heart beat resonantly again as his whole soul now felt a strain.","Yet his will was still bright as in the midst of concepts like Necromancy and Death...","\"Add in the Concept of Life, Prana, and the Soul\"","...!","A verdant life flourished as both the Boundaries of Life and Prana joined the fray only to be followed by the concept of the Soul!","Since he had foreseen the very Recorded History of being like Commander Vladic be changed upon their death by the effects of this new Dynamis, the inclusion of the Soul among others would only magnify the brilliance.","But...the cycling authorities turned unstable as they seemed to say it was one too many and even possibly not aligned in their definition!","But the tyrannical will of the soul doing all this couldn't allow such a thing as to complete everything...","The radiant multicolored light of Quintessence shone.","It cascaded down and dominantly suppressed all others under its light, telling every single one to behave!","And...","[An unfathomable resonance is occurring with an extremely large number of concepts.]","[An Absolute Seed of Extremity unlike any other has begun to be forged!]","Manadynamics, Necromancy, Summoning, Cthulhu, Apocalypse, Death, Pride, Gluttony, Sloth, Envy, Greed, Lust, Wrath, Niflheim, Entropy, Aether, Prana, Life, Conquest, Soul, Quintessence","21 Concepts.","21!","Noah was only attempting such a drastic thing due to the expanded breadth that his soul of Alexander King now held as an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","THUMP!","The beat of his heart was resonant as another full cycle was completed.","There was no disharmony.","Quintessence forcefully corrected any discrepancies there were between the many Concepts and brought together a product of utmost majesty.","And the result was a glorious one.","[A tier of a Dynamis of Extremity belonging only to you has come to fruition.]","[A Quintessential Absolute Seed of Extremity has been born!]","SHIING!","His body of Alexander King shone with brilliance.","The visage of Aurelia that was connected to him in this misty domain...","\"No way...\"","Aurelia said out with hazy eyes as she felt the Convergence of an abstruse Absolute Seed of Extremity she had been feeling this whole time in her soul...","she felt it all meld together under the grandiose light of the seed being born within Alexander King!","As if it was ashamed that it couldn't be merged this whole time when something even grander than it was just converged in the body of the being who held the Sources of the very concepts Aurelia was trying to converge!","So ridiculously, two Absolute Seeds of Extremity formed simultaneously within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven at this juncture.","One within Caterina Aurelia Dismukes.","And the other was within an elevated portion of Noah's soul as what he forged was a distinctive type of an Absolute Seed of Extremity!","A Quintessential Absolute Seed of Extremity!","His soul burned gloriously with four Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity already.","And yet a mere forming Quintessential Absolute Seed of Extremity caused their countless branches to shake and flourish with even more brilliance.","[The Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity has named itself!]","[The Thanatos Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity has formed under unimaginably distinctive conditions- the resonance of concepts within it and its standing placing its rate of Convergence at 50%]","...!","It didn't even wait to be named.","It named itself in a grand show of power as it named itself Thanatos!","A word that was steeped in death.","A word that was actually reminiscent to a river in the old Niflheim Dimension where grand battles were fought before!","Such a word forged into a blinding runic seed in Noah's Soul as even while it was 50% of the way converged, the grandeur it released seemed to be competing with the auras of the Perennial Yggdrasils of Extremity within his soul!"]},{"number":2531,"title":"Chapter 2531: Chapter 2530 The Curtains Draw Close! III","paragraphs":["2530 The Curtains Draw Close! III","Along with a ridiculous 50% Convergence right at its founding, the Thanatos Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity domineeringly took up space within Noah's soul as a verdant obsidian deathly light spread out!","[The features of Quintessential Undead Rise, Quintessential Thanatos Embodiment, and Chthonian Sinners of Thanatos have been born!]","Three dazzling features bloomed as Noah's visions of what he saw in Adumbrative Viewpoint were coming closer to fruition and even being exceeded.","However potent this feature used to be, it was now something else entirely after the changes Noah made for the forging of the Quintessential Absolute Thanatos Dynamis of Extremity.","And this showed itself clearly with just the first feature.","[Quintessential Undead Rise]:: Death is not the end. The authority of Thanatos burns strong as it allows you to gaze upon the masses, and from among those who have perished- you can cause the rise of something even grander in their stead. This ability is both an active and a passive one that requires 5% of your Maximum Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Values to express the passive and active effects every minute. Quintessential Undead Rise utilizes the authority of the Thanatos Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity to re-write the Recorded Histories of all affected perished existences, transforming them into Quintessential Undead Thanatos Vassals who live only for the glory of the authority of Thanatos. Each Quintessential Undead Thanatos Vassal will undergo such a drastic change in their Recorded History as while the new form they will take is random, each one will have at a minimum 10 Apex Thanatos Soul Values- no matter which type of Lifeform they originally spawned from...]","[...When Quintessential Undead Rise is triggered against perished existences who have more than 10 Apex Thanatos Soul Values, it will transform their Recorded Histories to grant them their original Parameter Values and then further enhance them by 100%. All of the Thanatos Vassals will become bound to your soul and follow your will as they will continue to endlessly spawn from perished existences until a certain threshold is reached- this threshold is based on the level of power that the Boundaries supporting Thanatos have currently reached. Legions of Quintessential Undead Thanatos Vassals will form across the land as when the authority of death and chaos is potent enough, even more potent Vassals will rise until the grandeur of Thanatos is spread across the vicissitudes of reality...]","...!","A dreadful offensive ability of horrendous proportions came!","An ability that granted Noah Legions of Quintessential Undead Thanatos Vassals as the maximum number was still not known- and it could only be determined by the power of the 21 Boundaries that Thanatos was forged from.","The most ridiculous thing was that no matter what corpse Noah triggered Quintessential Undead Rise from...a terror with a minimum of 10 Apex Thanatos Soul Values would be born.","An Apex Aeonic Lifeform...born on any corpse Noah gazed upon and extended this dreadful authority!","It was so balance breaking that the only semblance of any balance stemmed from the fact that this ability required corpses.","It required perished existences to re-write the Recorded Histories of as if Noah could simply summon them freely...the scales would be even more destroyed!","When he utilized it on dead Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who exceeded 10 Apex Aeonic Soul Values, they would rise into random Quintessential Undead Thanatos Vassals that retained their original power...and then received a 100% boost all around for it as Noah truly didn't have any words for this terrible feature.","And it would cost him nothing to retain all of these Thanatos Vassals as when they continued to be forged in the upcoming battles...Legions of such terrors would be following behind the Shadow of Alexander King!","At this moment, the words of Commander Vladic in the vision showed from the [Adumbrative Viewpoint] crossed Noah's mind as he smiled.","He could now understand why this Noblesse had called him a Demon.","But...no matter what distinction he was given, after the changes he had made- things were bound to get even more ecstatic!","—","\"Unbelievable...\"","Aurelia uttered out in a daze as she felt the budding Seed in her soul.","Was it truly...an Absolute Seed of Extremity?","Something like that had actually bloomed in her soul?!","It was so surreal that she felt golden tears inadvertently form on the rims of her eyes- tears that were then outshone by the golden words that appeared before her eyes.","[An Unnamed Absolute Dynamis of Extremity has been born.]","The words affirmed her current reality as she felt the brilliant seed in her soul- a seed that seemed to be asking her to name it!","Fortune and grandeur overflowed in her Aspects of Existence as she calmed down.","She then called out lightly.","\"Thesauros.\"","WAA!","[The Thesauros Absolute Dynamis of Extremity has formed under unprecedented circumstances- the resonance of concepts within it placing its rate of Convergence at 20%]","Thesauros.","A word that was closely related to a treasury or location where profound riches and treasures were collected and laid out.","This was the first Absolute Dynamis of Extremity that the True Emperor of Fortune forged under the guidance of the True Emperor of Quintessence!","It was also the second existence within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven to achieve such a feat!","It showed the rapid pace of progression of a power that was relatively unknown at this point in time in the Aeonic Havens of Extremity.","It showed that the grandeur the True Emperor of Quintessence held was something that could also be expressed by those around him!","When the Infinite Hyperversal Haven fully unveiled itself and all of its wonders in the future to come...just how would the myriad of Inheritances and Clans compare?!","—","[Character Stat Panel]","[Name]:: Dr. Hall","[Realm]:: Aeonic Vital Haven","[Lineage]:: Human","[Titles]:: The Doctor, Master of Medicine, Big Pharma...","[Vital Apex Mana Value]:: 20","[Vital Apex Vitality Value]:: 200","[Vital Apex Soul Value]:: 20","[Vital Apex Defense Value]:: 200","[Vital Apex Damage Value]:: 20","[Dynamis of Extremity]:: None","[Boundaries of Extremity]:: Medicine, Prana, Life, Antediluvian, Genesis, Manadynamics, Biochemistry, Epidemiology, Essensology, Pharmacology..."]},{"number":2532,"title":"Chapter 2532: Chapter 2531 The Curtains Draw Close! IV","paragraphs":["2531 The Curtains Draw Close! IV","In a blinding stellar region filled with churning liquified essence of Dissolution distorting space constantly.","This essence felt vile and majestic at the same time as any being with weak Aspects of Existence nearing it could be corroded in a short period of time, and rivers of this essence seemed to be extending from all directions like endless branches and joining together into a vast sea- a sea that formed an interminable wall before the eyes of all beings who had managed to make it this far as it had no end in sight.","The wall seemed liquid and solid at the same time as it was akin to countless branches intersecting together...as if it was the junction between an outer layer of the Vein of Dissolution and an inner layer!","Within the veins of Existences, they were composed of the tunica adventitia which was the outer layer, the tunica media which was the middle layer, and the tunica intima which was the innermost layer lined up by smooth endothelial cells.","This region...seemed akin to the junction from the outer and into the middle layer!","In between the surging conjoining rivers and branches of Dissolution, Obsidian Extremity Panaceas could be seen floating serenely as they dared any beings brave enough to attain them- with massive Leviathans of Dissolution nearing 1 Apex Aeonic Soul Values roaring out in this region as powerful Scions like Erikson, Atlas of the Plum Sword of Extremity, and Lodovico among others could be seen.","Their bodies released blinding radiance and power as they had forged their Extremity Foundations, beings like Atlas having even attained a Dynamis of Extremity as the power they released was enough to rival Leviathans of Dissolution who were almost nearing a singular Apex Aeonic Value!","They still fought as apart from Obsidian Extremity Panaceas, there were also blinding singularities of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity that were either precious loot that allowed one to traverse towards the 10th Boundary Layer with ease, aid in forging a Dynamis of Extremity, or Panaceas that were useful in reinforcing one's foundation.","They fought tooth and nail as all of them felt the urgency that others had begun to openly mention the last few hours.","That the Initiation Step of Extremity Sanctification was close to an end!","That the Extremity Panaceas were becoming rarer to find unless one came in this region where a massive wall of a sea of dissolution stopped the advancement of any beings forward!","The reason for this could all be attributed to a single being.","BOOOM!","While others were struggling or grouping up against the Leviathans of Dissolution nearing the power of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, any single one that he came across was bullied into oblivion as the visage of the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity had just ripped apart five Leviathans of Dissolution who were guarding a group of Loot filled singularities right before the endless wall of Dissolution.","The one to bring everything to an early end was none other than the True Emperor of Quintessence as he had his Reified Sources of Extremity sweep away all obstacles easily while obtaining an overabundance of Loot himself!","It was to the extent that apart from the Loot stemming from the two Apex Aeonic Lifeforms he had killed, Aeonic Treasures of Extremity that were conducive to elevating Boundaries, forming Dynamis of Extremity, and the accelerated Convergence of Dynamis of Extremity were within his hands in abundance.","Each of them held a myriad of names like the Blazing Hyphae of Extremity, Glacial Perennial Hartwig, Radiant Moon Grass, Singularity Torn Bud...and many more.","When categorizing them, Noah was able to quantify 233 Aeonic Treasures of Extremity geared towards helping the progression of Boundaries up to the 13th Boundary Layer, many others sharing this quality like the Blazing Hyphae of Extremity!","There were 198 Aeonic Treasures of Extremity geared towards increasing the chances of the successful Convergence of Boundaries into a Dynamis of Extremity- these beings things utterly useless to Noah as he would actually have to try really hard to be capable of failing in forming a Dynamis of Extremity.","But they would be invaluable for his people, so even they held their importance.","Lastly, he had scoured and attained 174 Aeonic Treasures of Extremity geared towards increasing the rate of Convergence of already formed Dynamis of Extremity!","It was a heavy haul for a single being, and this wasn't counting the Extremity Panaceas he collected for the Shadowlings of the Cult of Endless Shadows and others he kept for his own collection.","All in all, he had dominated the Scions that had risen up in this stage of the Initiation Step of Extremity Sanctification, and he now stood before a huge demarcation of a barrier that seemed to be something only Apex Aeonic Lifeforms could cross!","His eyes were full of calm as he had utilized the feature of [Adumbrative Viewpoint] greatly these past moments with the might of Alexander, finding out many more things in the unfolding future as he understood that this wall...would only begin to buzz and initiate a profound new process when the last set of Crimson Extremity Panaceas were plucked.","Yes.","A set!","He had seen this with his own will as his body in this intersection of a space filled with Dissolution turned away and gazed towards an entirely different direction.","The hidden space far away from here when the set of Crimson Extremity Panaceas would bloom...and where the visage of Ayame of Infinite Extremity was hidden.","—","The horn on her forehead shone with a Crimson gold glint at this moment as she seemed like a priestess of flames and honor, her figure hidden from others as the region she was in had been enacted with veils that masked the very Records of this area!","If others were to look- even Scions like Lodovico may be fooled into seeing an Altered Record than was currently happening.","Because as fewer and fewer Extremity Panaceas remained with tens of thousands of Scions struggling for even a smidgen of an edge in order to stand out on the stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms about to unfold, a heavy aura and a blinding crimson light had begun to blare from this region!","It was a light that would normally tell others and cause them to rush here to fight for one of the ultimate opportunities, but Ayame's fearsome means contained it all as she gazed towards a blooming Singularity with great expectations.","That is until...","WAP!","Her eyes flashed as her gaze changed, turning towards her left side as she saw the Altered Recorded she had set up be twisted as an existence calmly stepped in!","An air of majesty emanated from him as he was none other than the Reified Source of Dreams.","The Dreamer of Extremity carrying Noah's devilishly handsome visage and adorned in sandy gold robes appeared at this position that nobody else should have been able to discern!"]},{"number":2533,"title":"Chapter 2533: Chapter 2532 The Curtains Draw Close! V","paragraphs":["2532 The Curtains Draw Close! V","\"You came.\"","Ayame turned to focus on the visage of Noah's Dreamer of Extremity as she spoke calmly, but one could still see a sense of veiled surprise deep in her eyes!","Noah gazed at the center of the blooming Singularity whose blooming would mean the end of one stage and the start of another as he asked with a smile.","\"Were you actually expecting me?\"","\"I was expecting that if there was anyone who might exceed all my expectations and appear at such a critical juncture, it had to be you.\" Her eyes shone with profound brilliance as her will delved into the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","She looked at Noah, and then turned to look at the crimson light that was blooming with even more intensity than the first Panacea as she seemingly came to a decision, her voice ringing out in waves.","\"There are many theories I have of you, but being the first to observe you when you dealt with the Scions of the Genesis Institute of Extremity and then watching you move against all others in the past days...it has made me realize that you and I may be on the same path.\"","WAA!","\"Oh?\" Noah held a smile on his face as with his hands behind his back, he floated towards the area where the crimson blooming light was concentrated with immensity!","Ayame didn't stop him as she nodded and continued.","\"Yes. You...are also seeking to complete an Aspect of Infinity, are you not?\"","...!","An Aspect of Infinity!","If it were the past Noah, he would have been surprised and given Ayame even more interest as he heard more of her shocking words out!","But the current Noah was a vastly different being compared to even an hour ago.","\"You think that I am trying to forge the Infinity of Essence while you yourself chase the Infinity of Heat. You wish to promise me information and secrets of your Inheritance of Infinite Extremity to help me achieve what I seek.\"","...!","His words were akin to a clap of thunder as genuine shock bloomed in Ayame's eyes!","It was because she couldn't believe the words that had come out of Noah's mouth since their implications were too grand.","For him to speak about the things she was planning on saying...","\"You...you couldn't have possibly been able to discern all this through future Records. That is only something that Hyperversal Extremities are capable of!\"","A heavy thought to have!","A capability that a being like him should not have as it was the only way for him to state what he stated!","Noah smiled as he didn't confirm or deny any of her words.","Something only Hyperversal Extremities could do.","Of course, they could only do such a thing with their means of forming powerful Absolute Dynamis of Extremity!","And Noah...was already doing that in abundance now.","But the subject matter was Infinity.","The Inheritance that was Infinite Extremity was a grand one as those within it sought different Aspects of Infinity- such beings always showing terrifying power!","For the Initiation Step of Extremity Sanctification, they had only sent forward Ayame as without Noah's participation, she would be one of those who attained the strongest boon here without the help of any others.","This was the behemoth that was the Infinite Extremity- their Hyperversal Extremities being forces that even those from the Seven Clans were wary of.","\"Do you know how many beings have successfully expanded the concept of Infinity itself into Extremity?\"","Noah retained his smile as he asked a question that Ayame would have asked him if this conversion was going according to her plans.","And she knew this answer as she became even more certain of her thoughts while replying.","\"None.\"","WAA!","\"None Recorded in History, anyways.\"","None!","Nobody had been capable of expanding and taking the concept of Infinity towards Extremity as it was simply too grand.","Too unachievable.","But...would this be the same case for Noah?","HUUM!","His body began to blare with a cerulean brilliance as from the soul of Alexander King in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, the concept of Infinity was roused and began its venture towards Extremity.","Once expanded, Quintessence would do its job and seamlessly take it towards the 9th Boundary Layer as in no time, his main body and Reified Sources of Extremity were able to express it!","A concept others could not take to Extremity.","Noah embarked on its tumultuous path today as his visage began to burn brightly with it while speaking towards Ayame.","\"No need for you to appeal to my better nature or promise to aid in my search for infinity. You can have one of the Crimson Extremity Panaceas that is about to bloom...in exchange for you taking me to the Heart of your Infinite Extremity. From there, I would like to attain any single opportunity of my choosing.\"","...!","One of the Panaceas about to bloom.","Ayame heard this and connected the dots as she didn't need to take long to nod her head.","\"Of course, and while we are in the depths of Infinite Extremity, you may even find yourself unwilling to leave.\"","Entry into a grand Inheritance and taking an opportunity for himself from it.","Noah was already doing this with the Cult of Endless Shadows as he was now adding an even more powerful Inheritance on top of it, all for the cost of an Extremity Panacea he no longer had any use for!","HOONG!","Behind him, the crimson radiance overflowed as the blossoming Singularity gushed out a small surging sea of essence, all of this contained by Ayame's Altered Record of the surroundings.","Noah's focus came upon the blooming light as the grandeur of incandescent crystalline Crimson Extremity Panaceas could be seen.","A set.","Two dazzling Panaceas shone with radiance as unlike other steps on Extremity Sanctification, deviations in how things normally went could slowly be seen within the Extremity Sanctification of Dissolution!","The plucking of these Extremity Panaceas here would effectively start the process of bringing to a close the Initiation Step of Extremity Sanctification where many powerful Reverend Scions reigned- tens of thousands of them having fought tooth and nail as less than half of them were able to achieve Golden, Obsidian, or Crimson Extremity Panaceas.","Others only gained Aeonic Treasures of Extremity geared towards helping their Boundaries or Dynamis of Extremity.","But those with Extremity Foundation set in place due to the Initiation Step...","they would be exploding with power and joining the expanded majesty of the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification as all of this was going towards aiding them in a more rapid progression of Extremity than normal!","They didn't need to cultivate for thousands or millions of years as from the treasures they obtained here, they could make the same advancement as others who had spent a great deal of time traversing towards Extremity.","This was why it was called Extremity Sanctification.","And this was the reason why the Culmination Step that held profound boons for Apex Aeonic Lifeforms...was going to be the main concentrate for all Inheritances wishing to rapidly elevate the power of their forces!","Noah knew all of this would begin to play out as soon as he made a move towards the dazzling Panaceas before him.","And he...did not hesitate.","SAA!","His hands steeped in sandy gold light grabbed the anchored Crimson Extremity Panaceas before him, feeling their pulses in his hands as the moment he did so...","BZZZT!","The surrounding space began to shake.","Not just this region, but the whole vastness within the Extremity Vein of Dissolution was beginning to shake and vibrate with authority!","Having ushered forth this step freely, Noah threw one of the dazzling Crimson Extremity Panaceas towards Ayame while another disappeared towards his Expansive Space, the sonorous voice of Ayame ringing out as she accepted the Panacea and blazed with a fiery light, beginning to absorb its essence right away to establish her Extremity Foundation.","\"You have paved the way forward and hastened the arrival and Proliferation of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from a myriad of factions across the Seven Havens. Will you be able to keep your dominance against monsters stuck on the 16th and 17th Boundary Layers as the only thing in their minds is Extremity?\"","...!","Was he ready for Apex Aeonic Lifeforms?","The current Scions like Ayame would use their Extremity Foundations to breakthrough and then assimilate the treasures they attained to quickly stabilize their power as Apex Aeonic Lifeforms- with those who had backings of the majestic Clans or potent Inheritances being fed even more resources to propel their strength upwards as they would become renowned Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as the Culmination Step was underway.","When it came to Noah who didn't have the backing of any Inheritance...","\"Will I keep my dominance from here on out? Haha!\"","His Tyrannical will vibrated with radiance as this was a question that didn't even need answering!"]},{"number":2534,"title":"Chapter 2534: Chapter 2533 The Extremity Vein Rises! I","paragraphs":["2533 The Extremity Vein Rises! I","The Culmination Step which held unknown wonders and boons was one that received the most attention in any Extremity Sanctification.","Even the Extremity Step where only Hyperversal Extremities could truly reign did not receive as much attention- and this had its own profound reasons that many would come to find out in the future to unfold.","The Culmination Step was so favored because of many points, but one of the more common ones was the fact that Aeonic Treasures of Extremity that could aid with Boundaries past the 13th Boundary Layer appeared. During this time of the Initiation Step, Noah had only ever gathered loot similar to the Blazing Hyphae of Extremity that aided one up to the 13th Boundary Layer.","The Culmination Stage was one that forged a generation of powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and future Hyperversal Extremities as Dynamis would be more easily converged here, and the hope of forming an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity...was actually a Recorded History that had come to be in the previous Extremity Sanctifications!","It was a crucial stage.","And Noah had ushered it forth as when the space around them began to tremble, deeply black light began to cluster above Noah's visage as a pure source of Dissolution seemed to be drawn from all around and converging here- this dense authority snaking towards Noah's Dreamer of Extremity and sinking into his body as it tried to sear itself into his soul.","Ayame watched quietly as she knew what was happening.","For the being to have attained any astonishing Recorded feats in the Initiation Step of Extremity Sanctification, they would be branded with a profound authority that would aid them in the future Steps of Extremity Sanctification.","For the being to obtain the First Extremity Panacea.","For the being to kill the most Leviathans of Dissolution.","For the being to attain the most Aeonic Treasures of Extremity.","For the being that obtained the Last Extremity Panacea!","Normally, all of these feats would be spread out across multiple different beings. But as Ayame gazed towards Noah...she knew that he may just pull in all of these achievements for himself and attain an even grander threshold for the future to come.","The authority of an Aeonic Haven of Extremity.","It was something that any prominently powerful being with grand aspirations would seek to take for themselves, or at the very least- expand what such a Haven stood for as a concept.","But many would come to realize over the years that passed that either their expanded concepts would veer ever further away from what the Haven stood for, and that nobody could ever truly reach Extremity in what the concept of the Haven signified.","Many in the Aeonic Haven of Genesis expanded the concept of Genesis- with unique existences like Orion and Noah also expanding their version of Genesis as none of them truly had a link to what the Aeonic Haven of Genesis stood for.","One would know they weren't on the proper path of Genesis or any other concepts of an Aeonic Haven they expanded when in their Boundary Layers...","nothing relating to this Haven itself would be found.","Noah and Orion's concepts of Genesis had no link to the Aeonic Haven of Genesis as they did not correlate with the authority of this Haven.","But if a being was accomplished enough and was able to enact one Recorded History after another within a Haven...they may just accumulate enough understanding and access to the extent that they would be able to truly step on an endless path of the authority of a genuine Aeonic Haven of Extremity!","On this day, Noah Osmont was receiving pure streams of Dissolution as they were forming a brand into his soul- a brand that read with brilliant obsidian grandeur...[DIS]!","The beginnings of Dissolution.","One of the Seven Aeonic Vaults of Extremity. The Havens of Extremity!","There were the Vaults of Genesis, Helios, and Penumbra.","There were also Vaults of Andromeda, Elera, Oceanus, and Dissolution.","Noah was currently gaining a more distinct connection with the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution as anyone gaining such a distinction would only have an easier time while following the path of Extremity Sanctification!","Ayame watched the scene of such grandeur as above her head, minute traces of such authority formed as they paled in comparison to what Noah had surging into his soul, but they were there nonetheless to show her accomplishments.","With this, she knew that what her Grandfather had predicted would now come to fruition.","Extremity Sanctification would truly begin!","—","HOOONG!","The skies and land in the Endless Abyssal Thalassic Caverns of Nullity trembled and shattered for countless light years as if a cataclysm had arrived.","The endless Abyss hidden within it roared out with fervor as the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands that were deeply entrenched in the underside of Dissolution...they began to rise!","BOOOM!","Space warped and twisted with this area as the epicenter, Sources of Chaos running rampant all around as fantastically, thick tendrils of Dissolution began to rise from the depths of the Abyss that were light years in length and diameter- these tendrils smashing onto the skies and terrain as the moment they did...the areas they touched seemingly became malleable and began to expand.","The very earthen glacial floor expanded as if countless tectonic plates were shifting below it, all of this change prompted by the tendrils of Dissolution writhing out and expanding from this region and continuing throughout!","Alongside this...the glacial floor split apart with utter glory as from the depths below, one could see the rough yet glorious sheen of a Vein begin to rise.","The pulsing Extremity Vein of Dissolution was rising from its depths ever so slowly as the very Haven of Dissolution split apart and expanded due to it- the expansiveness of this whole Haven about to be increased by an unknown amount!","As this occurred, the thick tentacles of Dissolution caused sparks of anomalies to bloom- singularities that sometimes formed into Planar Seeds ready to bud into Planes of Existence, while other singularities pulsed with a light of Aeonic Treasures of Extremity as they became concealed in the folding and expanding space- some becoming veiled deeply while others floated out grandly in the open!"]},{"number":2535,"title":"Chapter 2535: Chapter 2534 The Extremity Vein Rises! II","paragraphs":["2534 The Extremity Vein Rises! II","Countless tremors spread across the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","The domains that used to be explored and conquered by the Lernaeans, Noblesse, Quasarians, and Planeswalkers were about to become minuscule and small points on the map, the process taking place being so fantastical that the vast majority of this Haven would continue to be unexplored regions!","As these tremors spread within this Haven...word also spread as invisible tremors reached into the six other Havens, the power lying in wait finally being roused as they began to move.","—","In the Aeonic Haven of Genesis.","A golden temple stood at the very peak of one of 100 verdant gold mountains, powerful auras prevalent within it as they shot to the skies at this moment.","At the entrance of the golden temple, a Hyperversal Extremity floated out and gazed towards the expanse of grandeur and Planes of Existence littered out across the lands as behind him, dozens of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms rose.","And the mighty voice of the Hyperversal Extremity rang out.","[The time has come for you all to see whether Extremity is within your grasp. If you cannot grasp it in this unfolding Extremity Sanctification...you may never have the chance to even try again.]","...!","Words of caution and mystery rang out as there seemed to be a hidden meaning within them, but the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms nodded without hesitation as the Hyperversal Extremity began to move.","\"Let's go.\"","WAA!","From this mountain, dazzling auras rose and went towards a far away crack between the vast Havens to arrive towards nowhere else other than Dissolution.","On another mountain, another party with slightly less Apex Aeonic Lifeforms rose as one of them asked the Hyperversal Extremity leading them.","\"Master, since many of our forces will be arriving there before the Apex War of Annihilation we are supporting starts, will we be adding any more of our Apex Aeonic Lifeforms into it?\"","...!","[We will observe and see before this small battle unfolds. If need be, we will...","but this should be of little focus to you all.]","The reply was swift as the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms nodded while they followed!","Within the Genesis Institute of Extremity.","Within the Singularity Overseers.","Within the Cult of Endless Shadows.","Within the Sima Clan.","Within the Avernus Clan.","Within the Plum Sword of Extremity...","Inheritances across the Aeonic Havens of Andromeda, Elera, Oceanus...an Innumerable cluster of forces waiting for the start of the expansion and Culmination of The Last Haven began to move at this moment as their Seers or simply potent Hyperversal Extremities had long since sensed the rapid progression of this particular Sanctification.","They swarmed towards an expanding Haven of Dissolution as the Initiation Step came to an end, their arrival just happening to be a day before an Apex War of Annihilation took place as it seemed there would be a much larger audience than what many anticipated.","While waiting for the doors of the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification to open, how likely was it for these clusters of powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms to come and view an unfolding Apex War?","The chance...was extremely high!","—","In the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","Noah's Main Body felt the glorious concepts and Dynamis that the other part of his soul expanded, with him being able to express the Boundaries up to the 9th Layer while the Dynamis of Extremity forged by Alexander...would only be accessible to him when this part of his soul grew potent enough to accept their Absolute Seed or Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity!","So he felt the terrible power of the Thanatos Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity with his main body...but he couldn't express its authority as it seemed abstruse and far away.","But the Boundary of Infinity that was just expanded...","He felt his endless Mana churn ever faster since its conception.","He felt the other Resources within him flare and jump excitedly.","He felt many minute changes from the expansion of this single concept towards Extremity as he carefully gazed at its details while his figure moved.","He floated across the space busting with the verdant essence of Prana and appeared before his son who rose up in respect.","His main body remained unblemished like all others as he even placed his Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity on pause, almost as if he knew what was about to happen in advance.","Noah smiled as he waved his hands and caused a dazzling Crimson Extremity Panacea to appear, his voice masking its brilliance as he spoke.","\"When I took this to solidify my Foundation, I forged the Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Supreme Being Foundation. Forge your own path with it and let's see how far you can go.\"","...!","From the last 2 Crimson Extremity Panaceas, one had gone to Ayame as the other went to Henry!","The Son of Destiny grasped the Crimson Extremity Panacea with a heavy heart of responsibility as beside him, Adelonly smiled as she stared at father and son.","After this, Noah's gaze turned to the Vassals around him who had their Absolute Vitalistic Clones of Extremity standing beside their main bodies while releasing potent waves of power, his voice ringing out to address all of them while his visage swirled with the power of Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.","\"You all have the Foundation, Circulation Modus Operandi, and all other tools that allow you to forge an Absolute Seed of Extremity...and yet you cannot.\"","WAA!","\"The reason for this is that even though you were able to define yourselves with the Concepts due to your Foundations, you do not and have truly expressed these concepts with your Aspects of Existence!\"","Yes!","Those closest to him were granted everything from him as many of them had yet to even use the power of their new boundaries to form skills, attack, or even cast their Planar Domains!","\"You all grasped the Boundary of Quintessence, but what Quintessential feat have you enacted? You hold the Boundary of Loot, but have you taken down a myriad of enemies to see their very existence turned into caches of Loot? If you truly wish to grasp an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, you must first utilize your newly granted authorities and build a sufficient amount of records with them, and paired with your Extremity Foundations...enacting an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity then would only be a reality.\"","They heard his words as their Aspects of Existence pulsed.","And as if to hit the nail in the coffin...","\"It just so happens that within a day, there will be an Apex War with Ultimate Existences from Lineages and Inheritances who have yet to see the grandeur you all can express. In that battle, you all can create your records and enact your own legends for the eons to come.\"","BOOOM!","Waves of golden Oraculum Dynamis of Extremity scattered out as the Aspects of Existence of Noah's people roared.","From them...","\"RAA!\"","Roars and shouts of valor began to echo out as they got ready to delve into a grand war!"]},{"number":2536,"title":"Chapter 2536: Chapter 2535 The Extremity Vein Rises! III","paragraphs":["2535 The Extremity Vein Rises! III","\"Hmm...\"","Erikson's eyes were like lanterns of singularities as he gazed at the massive and endless wall that didn't seem to want to decide on being solidified or liquified in form, his beach attire standing out amidst this scene as his slippers were back on feet- shining with a glint of an Apex Aeonic Relic.","The wall before him radiated grandiose waves of Dissolution as ever since the fundamental change began hours ago which represented the last Crimson Extremity Panacea being attained, this wall had remained just as it was now.","\"Any word on who obtained the last Crimson Extremity Panacea?\"","He asked with sharp eyes as behind him, Reverend Emperors with Extremity Foundations built by Obisidian Reality Panaceas floated protectively while a woman with round-rimmed glasses gazed towards a certain direction.","\"There is a high probability that it was the self-titled True Emperor of Quintessence. A lot of his bodies haven't always been accounted for, and if there is anyone who can silently take it away...\"","The last Extremity Panacea had been whisked away without any grand battles, with even its eruption being silent and unseen as many Scions suspiciously gazed towards a single being!","\"If not for him, Master Erikson would have surely grasped one of the Crimson Extremity Panaceas...\" A Scion of the Sima Clan spoke with reservation within the group as Erikson laughed while waving his hands.","\"Haha, no need for it. I already altered the probability of the Obsidian Extremity Panacea I devoured to grant me similar effects to a Crimson Extremity Panacea. My current Extremity Foundation...should only be a step behind his!\"","He spoke with confidence as he knew he couldn't rival it. After all, he was not able to distort the probability enough at his current stage to birth something as pristine as an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity. But this should change greatly when he became an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","As he thought of this, he turned his gaze behind him and saw hundreds of pillars of multicolored lights blooming like suns all across this region.","Each of these pillars showed Extremity Meridians being formed, the vast majority ranging from 6 or 18 as it was all beings who had acquired an Extremity Panacea and had a guaranteed chance of becoming Apex Aeonic Lifeforms. It was the process of Scions undergoing Apexification en masse as they wanted to be entirely ready to participate in the Culmination Step that was about to unfold!","\"Are you all ready to start too?\" He spoke towards the Sima Clan Scions behind him as they nodded.","\"Alright boys and girls...\" He cracked his neck and stretched his body as the light blue beach attire on him pulsed with glorious waves of haki.","\"...the next stage to come will have an easy and rapid path of progression across the stage of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform as in Recorded History, those who benefit the most from the Initiation Step and the Culmination Step...will in no doubt achieve Hyperversal Extremity at the Extremity Step of Extremity Sanctification.\"","...!","\"No arduous hard work for millions of years...just be outstanding enough to grab the opportunities of Extremity Sanctification as with enough fortune, you may even be standing alongside the Elders of the Sima Clan in the months and years to come.\"","His words caused the eyes of the Sima Clan Scions to burn as their bodies pulsed with rhythms of power and battle!","Erikson's face turned serious while he spoke as immense bravery and honor leaked from his tan skin, his voice radiating out to even be heard in the surroundings as Noah's visage in the far distance that was observing the vast Wall of Dissolution turned around to gaze at this scene.","\"We of the Sima Clan are the Protectors of the Seven Havens....we make the Malignancies that wish to harm us run in fear as our power is Absolute!\"","HO!","The rhythm of the Sima Clan Scions behind him formed into a booming sound that emanated out with his words.","\"So live up to the name and standing of the Sima Clan. Obtain the strength required to continue our holy mission for the years to come...undergo Apexification!\"","HO!","Radiance shone on the Scions behind him.","Hundreds of Extremity Meridians flourished in a grand show of power as apart from this region...all other locations had the emerging light of Extremity Meridians blooming as thousands of Scions took the step forward to get ready for wonders to come.","In one corner, the visage of Shadowlings could be seen near the wall of Dissolution as they stayed close to Noah's Reified Sources of Extremity.","Many of them also shone with the light of Extremity Meridians as some had even successfully finished their Apexification and wondrously felt the power of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","What was frightening though, was that some thought the being who had led them here this whole time would feel less like a mystery and an unwavering existence as those who had become Apex Aeonic Lifeforms gazed towards Noah's Reified Sources of Extremity.","With their new power, they expected to be able to at least see through him and not feel the sense of suppression, but...","\"Ah...\"","Their gazes trembled in shock as their more attuned senses as Apex Aeonic Lifeforms warned them of danger when they gazed at Noah's bodies- the sense of oppression he gave off before becoming maddening!","Even after advancing as Apex Aeonic Lifeforms...they could actually not even touch a fraction of this being's power!","What the hell was this?!","There was no answer to come as not just them, many Scions becoming Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and wishing to break the feeling of inadequacy they held whenever they gazed at Noah's visage before would try to send their wills over.","But they would only receive another unfathomable shock that few would be able to forget in their lives!","Meanwhile, Noah's bodies were in front of the huge wall of Dissolution- the hands of his Quintessential Emperor of Extremity placed on it as he rippled with its massive waves of authority- thinking of even more audacious things like passing through this impassable wall without even having undergone Apexification!"]},{"number":2537,"title":"Chapter 2537: Chapter 2536 A Glorious Apex Battlefield! I","paragraphs":["2536 A Glorious Apex Battlefield! I","Within the vast Haven of Dissolution itself, a shocking scene could be seen at this moment as one could appreciate the outer layer of an utterly majestic vein extending infinitely across, tendrils of dissolution arcing across it and constantly changing the space around them.","It seemed like less than half of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution had risen from the abyss as it showed the progression of Extremity Sanctification, its appearance filled with grandeur and mystery for any who gazed at it!","\"Astonishing to view every time, isn't it?\"","In a region with concentrated tendrils of Ruin and Nullity, near the Apex Battlefield where the Apex War of Annihilation between two factions would soon be taking place- a voice of wonder rang out as a humanoid woman adorned in a white robe with bright gold wings erupting behind her back could be seen.","Around her, similar humanoids with golden wings could be seen as they were of the Celestial Thunderbirds of the Celestial Thunder Inheritance!","\"It still places to the Records of the Extremity Sanctification of Andromeda or Oceanus we've been shown, Priestess Persephone. Their Extremity Veins were something of wonder...\"","Another voice chimed in as Priestess Persephone shook her head with a smile.","\"You all have yet to see this Extremity Sanctification fully unfold, It had been Recorded that the Last Sanctification will be something surpassing any others! And this difference should be felt more in the Culmination Step as the knowledge that many Inheritances have collected before will not be useful. But...ah.\"","Towards the end of her words, she sighed with a sense of sadness as her will and the will of many Apex Aeonic Lifeforms veiled by a golden light gazed in the far distance where they could see the Apex Battlefield.","\"For such an event to occur at the same time as a war of bloodbath...why would the Adjudicator allow something like this? Why must they fight to spill blood when we have much more terrifying enemies barely being held at bay?\"","Her eyes held a light of love for all living things as she felt saddened by the bloodbath that would soon follow.","\"I understand the feelings of Priestess but...where are the rest of the forces for this Apex War?\"","Another voice from among the Celestial Thunderbirds rang out curiously as they gazed at the Apex Battlefield.","There, one could see that on the side with a brilliant obsidian runic ecriture reading NOBLESSE, Legions of forces could be seen enacted as they floated on the silver crimson skies with valor- many Legions being seen as each one was led by a few Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","The vast majority of them were composed of Noblesse, but on the forefront, one could see the commanders identifiable as Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from the Genesis Institute of Extremity and Singularity Overseers.","They had increased in number- especially so for the Singularity Overseers as the slightly pale figure of Zeitgeist could be seen with a somber expression as he looked ahead!","Apart from them, there were the relaxed Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from an unidentifiable faction- and yet these beings were the ones who emanated the most power.","It felt stifling for even some of the Wills arriving and watching from a distance as the main cause of it was from a single being who silently throbbed with the aura of Destruction.","Ahpuch!","This was the grandness on one side of the Apex Battlefield.","But on the other...a few Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from the Cult of Endless Shadows could be seen as their gazes weren't the happiest, one of them turning towards the far back and sending out a message towards none other than Roan!","The deposed Lernaean Emperor who wished to take the reins and forge relations with the Cult of Endless Shadows first.","He was backed by 4 Ancestral Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as he didn't run away when word of the Apex War spread, his gaze cold as many hidden criticisms were unsaid!","\"Why aren't the forces of Lernaeans here yet?!\"","This was the message Roan received from the Primeval Shadow Elders upfront as he scoffed.","Didn't they all side with the so called True Emperor of Quintessence?","Now, they would also face the same consequences of his actions!","As sad as it was to see, they might just be witnessing the end of the Lernaean Lineage in this coming day.","But still, Roan was here.","Even if the self acclaimed True Emperor of Quintessence turned tail and ran, Roan would be here to defend the honor of the Lernaeans!","Two sides of an Apex Battlefield.","One was filled while the other felt barren.","Every now and then, new Wills would sweep over it as a few forces from those arriving here across different Havens heard of or knew about a small Apex War sparking out as they came to watch.","It was like a car crash or a collapse of Planes of Existence.","Some beings just couldn't pull their eyes away from the horror!","—","In the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","Serene waves of authorities and Dynamis of Extremity pulsed like a silent storm within the depths of the Prana Aletheian Haven.","Even though his Vassals could not yet create an Absolute Seed of Extremity, forming a Dynamis with 2-3 Boundaries forcefully was still possible due to their Extremity Foundations.","And to go even further, each of his Vassals Main Bodies had assimilated Obsidian or Golden Extremity Panaceas from the many that Noah had collected- elevating their Foundations even further!","They all prepared thoroughly for the Apex War of Annihilation that would occur within less than a day, with Noah continuing to work the most.","At this moment, multiple clones were within another area of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven that was surrounded by the golden light of Loot and the crimson light of flames.","Glorious forges burning with intense heat could be seen organized in a curved linear formation as if they were a stellar system, each one pulsing with the light of Relics as armored Breastplates, Briefs, Helmets, Boots, Gloves...a numerous of Relics radiating a light even more intense than Apex Aeonic Relics could be seen!","The Hyperversal Blacksmith's Forge was pulsing with a grand light of Quintessence as Set Items were being forged to be equipped by an already horrifying army!"]},{"number":2538,"title":"Chapter 2538: Chapter 2537 A Glorious Apex Battlefield! II","paragraphs":["2537 A Glorious Apex Battlefield! II","The light of heat and loot permeated all around as the isolated domain holding a myriad of forges pulsed with life.","The authorities of natural laws and decreta surged wondrously in the surroundings as they flowed into every Forge, their might flowing into every Relic being forged!","The materials going into these forges were formed across the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as it continued to expand and proliferate with Spiritual Herbs as well, the Relics coming out exceeding any Apex Aeonic Relics Noah had seen on the bodies of Scions.","Every few seconds, one of the massive Forges would shine brightly and spit out a dazzling relic that radiated pure wonder of Loot.","Along with Noah, there was one other being in the Hyperversal Blacksmith's Forge who had called for a recess from Dual Cultivation as her heart couldn't take it anymore, and she had sensed the pulse of Loot light occurring in this location as she was drawn here!","A light of the Thesauros Absolute Dynamis of Extremity covered her body as she gazed at the mass production of fantastical Loot and spoke out with mesmerized eyes.","\"Now this...is fucking gorgeous.\"","It was!","Each one radiated pure wonder and Loot light as before Noah's will, there was an array of prompts that continued to repeat over and over again until he put them on the sidelines, waiting only for a single one that showed the immense progress being made.","[The Quintessential Greataxe of the Loot Harvester has been forged.]","[The Quintessential Looter's Breastplate has been forged.]","[The Quintessential Briefs of Greed have been forged.]","[The Quintessential Seagold Boots have been forged.]","[The Quintessential Wraps of Midas have been forged.]","[The Quintessential Helm of Atonement has been forged.]","[The Complete Set of Quintessential Loot Seeker's Regalia has been forged.]","...!","The Relics being forged were being mass produced as each one shone with a milky white gold luster, the breastplates having been branded with a cerulean infinity symbol while the helms held burning blue flames that seemed to be pulsing with authority!","The color of milky white and gold was dominant on the rest of the Set Pieces that made the Quintessential Loot Seeker's Regalia Set, with a cerulean shading appearing here and there.","Noah was about to view their astounding details when...","\"Hold on!\"","As if Aurelia could read his thoughts, she stopped him while her body began to radiate the authority of the Thesauros Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.","[The Blessing of Loot]!","BZZT!","Pure halcyon grandeur pulsed from her and exploded out like a sea, going on to cover the hundreds of Relics making up the Quintessential Loot Seeker's Attire Set as well as the myriad of forges floating throughout.","\"Ha...now let's see!\" Aurelia sighed with happiness and excitement as her fair hands reached out to grab one of the [Quintessential Greataxes of the Loot Harvester]","[Quintessential Greataxe of the Loot Harvester]:: A Hyperversal Apex I Relic forged under the fires of the Hyperversal Blacksmith's Forge that faced the constant infusion and refinements of Natural Laws and Decreta. It has been further elevated under the light of the Blessing of Loot by the holder of Thesauros Absolute Dynamis of Extremity as its capabilities and potential have only scaled upwards. When equipped, it currently grants the boost of +100 Quintessential Hyperversal Damage Values, +5% Lifesteal of Enemy's Maximum Vitality Values Per Hit, Halcyon Flammability Effect On Hit, +50% Chance to Trigger Chaos Loot Nova On Hit(A Chaos Loot Nova deals 500% of the base Damage Value of the Relic as an Area of Effect Damage Value), +50% Increased Rarity of Loot, and a +50% Increased Quantity of Loot. This Item is only one of the 6 that makes up the [Quintessential Loot Seeker's Attire Set]- the more set items collected, the grander the effects...","\"Ah! Do you see it? It was already a high quality Loot, but by Blessing of Loot raised its boosts by 25% or 50% at the very least! When I fully converge through Thesauros Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, I should be able to enhance a Relic by over 100%...\"","Aurelia twirled the Greataxe of the Loot Harvester in her hands with utmost excitement as one could see the fanaticism of Loot in her eyes!","She hugged this milky gold Greataxe that looked like it could split a Plane of Existence as it was buried in her blessed chest, her eyes shifting around excitedly as she beckoned and caused one of the dazzling white gold Breastplates with a blue infinity symbol on their center float towards them.","[Quintessential Looter's Breastplate]:: A Hyperversal Peak I Relic forged under the fires of the Hyperversal Blacksmith's Forge that faced the constant imbuing and refinements of Natural Laws and Decreta. It has been further elevated under the light of the Blessing of Loot...When equipped, it currently grants the boost of +150 Quintessential Hyperversal Defense Values, +150 Quintessential Hyperversal Vitality Values, 25% Absolute Damage Nullification, Boundary Essences Below the 10th Layer Cannot Bypass Through, 5% Passive Heal of Maximum Vitality Values every ten seconds, +25% Increased Rarity of Loot, and a +25% Increased Quantity of Loot. This Item is only one of the 6 that makes up the [Quintessential Loot Seeker's Attire Set...","\"Ah...!\" Aurelia also hugged the vibrant Breastplate excitedly as she breathed with excitement while gazing at the hundreds of similar Loot around her.","It filled her with such profound happiness that she didn't even know what to do","She felt content.","She felt at peace!","BZZZT!","Her Origin pulsed as her eye closed, the rate of Convergence of the Thesauros Absolute Dynamis of Extremity being urged forth ever faster as after gazing and blessing all the Loot here, she seemed to have entered a state of epiphany.","Noah shook his head at this Loot Fanatic who even exceeded his own enthusiasm as he called 6 of the Hyperversal Peak I Relics that made a complete set before him.","Ruination was also considered a Hyperversal Peak I Relic, and yet her capabilities were more than 10 times with pure stats alone as her characteristics and abilities were even more monstrous.","But when these Relics were worn together to grant the Set Effect...their benefits were also astonishing!"]},{"number":2539,"title":"Chapter 2539: Chapter 2538 A Glorious Apex Battlefield! III","paragraphs":["2538 A Glorious Apex Battlefield! III","[Quintessential Loot Seeker's Regalia Set]:: An upheaval of a reality altering effect brought to fruition by the Infinite Hyperversal Haven. When 2 Set Items of the Quintessential Loot Seeker's Regalia are equipped, a Loot Barrier forms around the body as it can absorb 750 Apex Aeonic Damage Values, and it regenerates fully within 1 second of being destroyed. When 4 Set Items are equipped, there is a 25% Chance Upon Killing an Enemy to cause an Explosion of Loot that grants 1,000% more Loot. When 6 Set Items are equipped, any enemy killed grants +1,000 Quintessential Loot Experience Points that can be utilized towards the progression of Boundaries up to the 13th Boundary Layer. A Quintessential Banner of Loot will also form above you as it adds +750 Quintessential Hyperversal Loot Damage Values to all attacks and abilities you release. A third effect for wearing all 6 Set Items is currently still budding from the Blessing of Loot...","Equipping all 6 items of the set granted fantastical boons that exceeded anything that Apex Aeonic Relics could grant.","A single set item and its effects exceeded what multiple weak Apex Aeonic Lifeforms could do as even their Values wouldn't reach the mere boons they granted as a set!","This was something Noah had forged in Relics in the past, and it appeared here again as when he adorned his Vassals that were already holding Extremity Foundations and exceeding normal Apex Aeonic Lifeforms with such ridiculous Hyperversal Apex I Relics, especially with their set effects...","It was a really bad future to imagine for their enemies!","And this was only the first version of Hyperversal Relics that he would forge.","As the Infinite Hyperversal Haven grew and its features became more robust...","even deadlier Relics that were making their way to becoming Armaments of Extremity would begin to appear!","Noah monitored all of this carefully as his voice emanated out.","\"Is the other side ready?\"","He asked serenely as from his surroundings...","[Yes, Master. Here are the results so far.]","The voice of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven urged out.","A part of his Will shone as it was given a vision of a veiled region within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven- a region within the depths of its Source!","There, the visage of Hyperion could be seen floating calmly as waves of pristine power at the Apex Aeonic Lifeform level reverberated out.","Alongside him, massive Hyperversal Enders of Extremity could be seen as Noah and the Infinite Hyperversal Haven had been busy!","Other beings worked hard for their lineage and domains, but did anyone work as hard as Noah?","Yes, his Mana was Infinite as his resource usage was absolutely minimal.","But the things he did in a matter of days were things that some Hyperversal Extremities could not complete in years!","And in addition to everything else he worked on these past days...the Enders of Nature was another glorious project!","Their Realms and Origins were reconfigured and reconstructed.","Granted Extremity Foundation!","And then they were advanced to Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as the defenders of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven were truly stepping up to their role.","Besides Hyperion, the forms of regal Dragons, Phoenixes, Qilins, Cosmic Serpents, Singularity Tortoises, and many more stretched out left, right, and behind him as their eyes shone with power that waited to be expressed.","They simply waited to exert their strength!","With this and many more things, Noah felt pristinely prepared for the war to come.","The goal wasn't to have a hard fight with tension on who would be the winner. The goal was to dominate the other side so devastatingly that others would have to think twice about ever moving against them!","But of course, things never went according to plans.","And this was why his strength had to not only be overpowered, but utterly intense and obscene to account for any possibilities that may happen in the future to come!","In addition to the Quintessential Loot Seeker's Regalia Sets and the Hyperversal Enders of Extremity, Noah was also working to expand his Boundaries to the highest possible level he could, the Loot he obtained from the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands already brought towards Ruination to be multiplied and utilized by him.","There were even the grand Fruits of Extremity from the Perennial Yggdrasils of Extremity in his soul for the expansion of his Boundaries!","Thereafter, there was one additional thing he had to do.","One additional Dynamis of Extremity he had to forge!","Thereafter, the rest would be history!","—","In the Haven of Penumbra.","In a tiny speck of this endlessly vast Vault of Extremity, past rotating clusters of multiple Major Planes of Existence, within a Unique Plane of Extremity modified by the dense Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Shadows.","Massive obsidian castles the size of Cosmos floated like bright moons in the starry space, their edges making it seem like they were on floating stellar bodies that dripped off a pure obsidian essence like endless waterfalls.","The particles of this pure black light gathered below into immaculately flowing rivers that flowed to form the runic ecriture of [SHADOWS]!","The castles rotated around one central fortress shining with crystalline grandeur, its size exceeding that of average Realities as it seemed to hold pockets of dazzling cosmos within its walls, along with other smaller castles that held an Innumerable number of beings moving about!","Massive ships and vessels could be seen stationed or moving around the floating castles and the fortress that was known as the Shadow Fortress.","The Shadow Fortress within the Tenebrous Plane Immutable Extremity where a core portion of the economy and power of the Cult of Endless Shadows flowed!","Materials, Relics, Aeonic Treasures of Extremity, and much more were constantly being imported or sent out as the Cult of Endless Shadows took hold of anything under the banner with the quality of shadows and darkness.","The auras of Boundary Expansion Realm experts were in abundance, with the shining might of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms being felt in every floating castle as within the fortress, the heavy aura of Hyperversal Extremities blazed!","Noah's gaze took in all of these scenes while Hyperversal Extremity Gabriella took him toward a portion of the massive Shadow Fortress, her voice ringing out to Primeval Elder Silas who had accompanied Noah this whole time.","[Silas, you join the group leaving with your Master to participate in the Culmination Step. I'll handle things from here. When you get back, see if more Shadow Elders need to reinforce the side of our friend here.]","Her words were irrefutable as Silas nodded respectfully, giving Noah a side glance while sending him a mental message as he disappeared.","'Whatever you do...please act with etiquette when interacting with Hyperversal Extremities. Especially Extremity Gabriella!'","His mental message fell on deaf ears as Noah acted as if he hadn't heard them, nodding towards Extremity Gabriella as he continued forward!","\"There won't be a need for any more forces of the Cult of Endless Shadows to be sent over for this Apex War, even the current ones there won't be needed really.\"","[Oh?] A smile appeared on Extremity Gabriella's face as she spoke with serenity.","[Are you sure about that? I hear the Apex Battlefield still doesn't have even a shred of your forces. While the other side...]","Information was constantly sent over on what was happening with the Apex Battlefield in the Haven of Dissolution!","Many were inquisitive about the being who had forged an Absolute Seed of Extremity.","What would he reveal on the Apex Battlefield, and why was his side vacant when the battle was nearly upon them?!"]},{"number":2540,"title":"Chapter 2540: Chapter 2539 A Glorious Apex Battlefield! IV","paragraphs":["2539 A Glorious Apex Battlefield! IV","One side of the Apex Battlefield was filled with Legions led by powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, and yet the other side only had a few Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as it looked extremely barren!","[You would know more than others, but most beings are under the assumption that you will lose in this battle, but that it doesn't matter to you since the Adjudicator of Dissolution has either already put safeguards or will simply make a move when the time comes.]","The voice of Hyperversal Extremity Gabriella rang out after she brought up the topic of the Apex Battlefield.","\"Then most beings would be wrong.\"","Noah replied with ease as he took her words lightly, their figures landing on a massive black white platform that had the character of [S] inscribed on the very floor, rows of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms pulsing with ferocious eyes spaced out in this region as they only bowed respectfully towards Gabriella.","The platform they were on led deeper into the Shadow Fortress, and yet Gabriella remained standing on the [S] character as she motioned with her hands to release a blinding light of authority, the [S] releasing a bright spatial light as her figure and Noah's figure disappeared!","The Shadow Fortress was too vast.","Each of its myriad parts were divided into the abodes of different Hyperversal Extremities who led Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","Here lay the focused forces of the Cult of Endless Shadows as far away from this location, their other domains had their own Hyperversal Extremities stationed and maintaining their dominion.","The [S] teleportation rune Noah and Hyperversal Extremity Gabriella had activated brought them into a domain within the depths of the Shadow Fortress the size of a small world, Noah gazing around to see the floor was formed by thick Hyperversal Extremity Authority that looked like endless swirling black rose petals.","The ends of the domain held a darkness he couldn't see across, but the potency of Hyperversal Extremity Authority in this domain could not be looked down upon!","[Welcome to one of my domains, Osmont. Here, we can discuss exactly what future you see for yourself, and what outcome you're seeking with this Apex War.]","Extremity Gabriella's voice was radiant as it rang out, Noah's brows rising as he asked lightly.","\"Just that?\"","It was very clear what he was asking for with his words as the reply was equally quick!","[Oh, do you mean the Armament of Extremity, the Shadow Sword? I know full well of your oath and what it means.]","WAA!","As she spoke, she waved her hands as an illusory scene appeared above them, showing an utterly magnificent outline of a sword that was devouring all sources of light!","One could feel profound palpation just from gazing at it as it seemed like a smooth ticket towards Extremity!","[Unfortunately, one of our prized Primeval Shadow Elders a lineage above Silas is breaking through from the cusp of the 17th Boundary Layer as he can already sense Hyperversal Extremity Authority. You gazing upon the Shadow Sword may just have to be after this Apex War..\"","...!","She smiled sweetly as she spoke, nobody being the aware on what she truly thought or why she did what she was doing!","The cherished Shadow Sword would be gazed at and grasped at the end of the Apex War of Annihilation as this was within the bounds of the Oath he made with Silas.","So he remained calm at Extremity Gabriella's words as she continued.","[I instead want to get past the bullshit and understand which group you will stand on if you continue to rise with your current brilliance.]","Extremity Gabriella seemed much more straightforward as she was looking at things from the perspective of the gains of the Cult of Endless Shadows!","Would Noah stand to join them or another faction in the future to come when he had even received an invitation from a Scion of the Sima Clan?","At her question, Noah smiled and replied sharply.","\"I'm afraid that such a question will only truly be answered after this Apex War.\"","...!","The same words she had uttered when it related to the Shadow Sword!","But Noah wasn't just speaking here as at the end of this War, all those watching would understand just which group the True Emperor of Quintessence belonged to!","And at this moment, the Cult of Endless Shadows wondered.","Away from this Haven, the Genesis Institute of Extremity wondered.","And even further away, a Scion of the Sima Clan and a Sion of the Infinite Extremity wondered.","Many beings could only guess the results about to unfold as in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution...the hours trickled by as the time of the Apex War of Annihilation neared!","In the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, under the covers of the golden light of the Oraculum Dynamis of Extremity, the True Emperor of Quintessence continued his preparations.","With every passing hour, he was ever closer to his goals as he hit all the milestones he wished to.","In the last hours before the set time of the Apex War of Annihilation...too many changes occurred with him and his body of Alexander King, along with his Son completing a profound Apexification!","They were stupendous changes that would be felt first hand by the enemies they were about to face.","—","The skies were bathed with a crimson silver radiance as tendrils of Nullity and Ruin dominated, their excellence becoming more focused as if they could feel what was to come.","Their light showed the expansive Apex Battlefield below as on the side under the banner of Noblesse, Legions could be seen stretched out as far as the eyes could see.","The time for the Apex War neared, and yet the situation didn't seem to change much for the other side as less than 10 sparse auras of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms could be felt!","\"Can this even be considered an Apex War? It just seems like a one sided stomping is about to occur, with all the reputation this Osmont has garnered for forging an Absolute Seed of Extremity about to come crashing down.\"","Far from the bounds of the Apex Battlefield crimson clouds of Ruin were artificially formed as atop them, luxurious thrones were enacted as Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from Inheritances sat atop them!","Some were on floating Ships or Vessels serenely parked in space, while others formed their own domains and watched the unfolding events from afar as their opinions had already begun to flow out!"]},{"number":2541,"title":"Chapter 2541: Chapter 2540 A Glorious Apex Battlefield! V","paragraphs":["\"Still nothing from him?\"","In the northern region past the Apex Battlefield, the figure of Erikson's Aped Aeonic Soul Clone could be seen on a throne atop a golden stellar vessel in the form of a leaf as the changes from him over the last hours were utterly drastic.","\"No, Master Erikson. His other bodies are still floating before the Wall of Dissolution in the depths of the Extremity Vein.\"","Behind him, a reply came from a Sima Clan Scion as another resonant voice came beside Erikson soon after.","\"There's still time before the Apex War. He'll likely arrive with a bang. He just seems like that sort of being.\"","The voice stemmed from Atlas of the Plum Sword of Extremity as besides Erikson's throne, the figures of many prominent Scions who had participated in the Initiation Step could be seen on their own thrones!","Erikson had invited their Apex Aeonic Soul Clones over as apart from Atlas, even the visage of Lodovico and Ayame could be seen among others!","Only their Apex Aeonic Soul Clones were here as their Main Bodies had already met up with their core forces that entered the Haven of Dissolution- each of them receiving the resources of their Inheritances on top of what they gained in the Initiation Step of Extremity Sanctification to rapidly stabilize their power as Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and elevate their Boundaries past the 10th Layer.","Those from truly powerful Inheritances or those part of the Seven Clans were gaining even more boons as they basked in the aura of their Hyperversal Extremities, being given unique resources to aid them in forging their Dynamis of Extremity.","The Wall of Dissolution did not crumble down as the Extremity Vein rose ever so slowly even now, the Culmination Step not yet unfolding as a decent number of the myriad factions came to the periphery of the Apex Battlefield to watch.","Some Inheritances considered it beneath them as their forces already entered the Extremity Vein of Dissolution and stood before the massive wall that stopped all others!","But the mere presence of renowned names from factions like the Sima Clan, Infinite Extremity, and Plum Sword of Extremity being here observing caused a few more eyes to be drawn over.","On the golden leaf shaped vessel Erikson and others sat on, the visage of Ayame that had been quiet this whole time had her eyes flash with brilliance as she voiced out.","\"It seems the suspense and questions are about to come to an end.\"","...!","The moment her words finished, on the side shining under the banner of {LERNAEAN}, space fluctuated as a majestic aura blazed forth!","The Wills of many watching eyes were roused as they focused on the Apex Battlefield.","There, with all of his glory, the single figure of Noah's Main Body appeared as fantastically, those watching truly affirmed he had yet to advance as an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","His exceedingly handsome face was apparent to all as he was adorned in a light blue Emperor's Robe, seeming like he was going on a simple stroll as he gazed into the Battlefield ahead of him that instantly blazed with a terrifying intent for battle the moment he had appeared.","At the center of this Battlefield, the figure of Commander Vladic rose from the Legions below as after seeing Noah, his figure became surrounded by a brilliant light as he bellowed out!","\"Osmont!\"","WAA!","The being who had crushed Euryale's soul right before him.","He actually showed up as Vladic almost wanted to tear the veil stopping the two sides from beginning battle right away!","Yet the being he considered his life and death enemy barely spared him a glance before shaking his head.","What Commander Vladic didn't know was that Noah had already read of his death from {Adumbrative Viewpoint} as he was already considered a dead man walking!","His figure instead floated ever closer to the thin transparent wall that distinguished between the two sides, the figures of the Shadow Elders and Roan who had already been on this Battlefield coming up towards him as Roan's voice was the first to emanate out.","Before Silas's words finished, Noah's regal voice thundered out as he stopped while his facial muscles twisted in anger!","\"This is the precipice you have brought our Lernaean Lineage to after taking the seat of Emperor? Complete Annihilation by-\"","\"Shut up.\"","WAA!","Before Silas's words finished, Noah's regal voice thundered out as he stopped while his facial muscles twisted in anger!","Among the Primeval Shadow Elders coming by, the figure of Silas could be seen as he had returned from the Haven of Penumbra to take the lead for the forces of the Cult of Endless Shadows aiding Noah.","Depending on how events unfolded in the next few moments, he would be given a command by the Hyperversal Extremities of the Cult of Endless Shadows watching in a hidden space on whether to increase the forces of the Cult of Endless Shadows and bring Legions of them into the Battlefield!","So he didn't stay anything at this moment as he watched Noah's figure ignore everyone else on this side and float right at the transparent veil separating the two forces.","He gazed at the sea of Legions before him that would have frightened any common Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, and yet his eyes held no fear as he turned his head to the Legions led by Elders of the Singularity Overseers and Genesis Institute of Extremity!","He even gazed in the far distance where the figure of a being surrounded by a palpating crimson aura of Destruction could be seen surrounded by extremely powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","He looked at all of them as under the banner of many eyes, his resonant voice rang out!","\"Before this Apex War begins, I will give an opportunity for all those who do not have life and death conflict with me to leave.\"","...!","His words were a surprise to many as Noah's gaze was directed to the forces of Genesis Institute of Extremity and Singularity Overseers who were supporting the side of the Noblesse!","Before any insignificant reactions began, he continued.","\"Because for those who do remain in this Apex War of Annihilation...they shall be branded as enemies that cannot exist under the same Haven!\"","WAA!","\"This doesn't just include those who are present here...but the forces of Inheritances they represent. Any single Existence associated with an Inheritance on this Battlefield- your presence here means that your entire Inheritance is declaring War on me and my livelihood!\"","BOOM!","Shocking words that caused many auras to burst with grandiosity boomed out, the eyes of many Apex Aeonic Lifeforms constricting as an immense silence descended only to be broken down by the True Emperor of Quintessence once more, his cerulean Emperor's Robes making him seem like a celestial Emperor advising the masses.","\"The armies of the Genesis Institute of Extremity, the Singularity Overseers, and even the veiled Scions of the Avernus Clan thinking they can hide themselves.\"","...!","His eyes landed on every force he was talking about until they ultimately locked upon Ahpuch and his people as their eyes blazed with brilliance at being called out like this!","Noah had long since found out their affiliation from the Mutated Entities he killed in the Extremity Vein as well as his probing with {Adumbrative Viewpoint}.","But his words caused waves as some beings gazed shockingly towards the visage of Ahpuch and others.","\"The Avernus Clan is involved in this?\"","\"Is this appropriate...\"","Many minds began to buzz as the face of Noah didn't pay attention to them.","He gazed at the Legions before him and continued as behind him...a spatial light began to shine as it seemed like his armies were being called forth!","\"If a single one of your forces remains on this Battlefield when the Apex War starts, then I will take it as a proclamation of war on my and my whole Lineage. It means that the Genesis Institute of Extremity, the Singularity Overseers, and the Avernus Clan are declaring war on me and becoming deadly enemies. It means that after this war...I will not cease until these two Inheritances and Clan are deconstructed to the last being remaining!\"","...!","\"....!\"","BOOM!"]},{"number":2542,"title":"Chapter 2542: Chapter 2541 Violating Common Sense! I","paragraphs":["If they were to participate in this war, they would be branded his mortal enemies as he would not rest until the Genesis Institute of Extremity, Singularity Overseers, and the Avernus Clan were wiped out from existence!","This being actually dared to say such words boldly under the eyes of many prominent inheritances here.","His cerulean robe glimmered with majesty as he continued.","\"This is an Apex War of Annihilation. Any Lineage and factions on this Battlefield...I hold the right of Annihilation!\"","WAA!","\"Any Hyperversal Extremities from the Genesis Institute of Extremity, Singularity Overseers, and Avernus Clan...my words are for you to make a decision now. You have lived long enough to come across Entities and phenomena that even you do not understand. I assure you that this junction is one of them. When the War starts...everything thereafter is irreversible. You have until it starts to decide.\"","...!","As soon as he finished, the blinding spatial light that had begun to bloom and covered the region behind him became clear as astonishing auras unveiled themselves.","One...two...ten...twenty!","One blazing aura of Apex Aeonic Lifeform after another blared forth as they weren't weak ones!","At the very forefront, a young man adorned in a milky white Armament could be seen, his Breastplate swinging radiantly with a blue infinity symbol as in his hands, a burning Quintessential Helm of Atonement was held.","His hair shone with blue, black, and gold radiance as his eyes carried a deep emerald hue of an Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity.","The pure power he released was suffocating as it far exceeded any common Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, those watching from afar and about to erupt up in clamor and shock at Noah's dazzling words finding their mouths tied and unable to speak as their eyes constricted in different levels of surprise and shock!","From the appearance of Henry Osmont alone, his blaring pressure alone seemed to be at upper levels of power that would only be present on Grand Primeval Elders of Inheritances who led squadrons of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","But this wasn't the main point of surprise about this being.","It was the fact that the Armament his body glimmered with...","exceeded any Apex Aeonic Relics as many eyes blinked wondering whether these beings were fitted with Quasi-Extremity Relics, the only thing they didn't feel from these terrifying Armaments being traces of Hyperversal Extremity Authority marking them as such!","What was astonishing was that the dozens of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms to appear behind the appearance of Henry...all wore similar Armaments blaring with a shining aura of brilliance.","Above their heads, the Quintessential Banner of Loot could be seen as a single illusory gold character signifying {LOOT} blazed with ecstatic power and brilliance!","It was the Quintessential Loot Seeker's Regalia Set that all of them were adorned in, the gazing upon gazes counting 200 of these oppressively powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as each of them held a Quintessential Greataxe of the Loot Harvester in their hands!","\"....\"","It was a breathless scene.","It was a beautiful scene that felt as if time had stopped.","Besides Henry, the visage of the Emperor Penguin could be seen covered entirely by the Quintessential Loot Seeker's Regalia Set as near them, Barbatos was present.","Above Henry's head, a bouncing Blue Slime could be seen as its eyes shimmered with a sly smile that seemed to gaze at everything around it with scrutiny.","Eowyn, Ophelia, the humanoid form of the Kraken, Kazuhiko, the Oathkeeper, the Sword Emperor...a myriad of beings who had been with Noah this whole time got the grand opportunity to be here as their appearance made the grand Apex Aeonic Lifeforms leading Legions opposite to them...feel just a little lacking in brilliance.","But this wasn't all.","Just when the spatial light died down, another one even more dazzling appeared as near the radiant Legion of 200 Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, the appearance of a golden-haired Caterina Aurelia Dismukes appeared.","\"Huu...\"","She sighed out calmly as she gazed around cooly, her surroundings also flashing with light as the appearance of the True Emperor of Genesis appeared beside her.","They were followed by the appearance of Lucia, the Mad Apex Emperor Caesar, and the other Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that had bent the knee to have their Realms Reconstructed!","When they appeared...they were also decorated in the Quintessential Loot Seeker's Regalia Sets as the auras of Aurelia and Orion felt even more obscene than the Legion of 200 that had appeared first!","It was to the extent that...","\"Aurelia? Orion?\"","Roan's voice came out in utter shock as he actually felt his soul be pummeled by a profound sense of oppression when he looked at Orion and Aurelia.","As if their power was so much higher that they could extinguish him with a single tap of their finger!","Not too far from Roan, Grand Primeval Elder Silas gazed on in shock as he found these beings he had met before...he questioned whether he could withstand a few of their strikes and come out unscathed!","It had only been a few days.","What the hell happened?!","Who were all of these Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, and where did they come from?","Most of all, why were they all under the banner of a single being who hadn't even undergone Apexification?!","The advancing Commander Vladic who had risen from the center of the Legions came to a stop before he reached the transparent barrier as his eyes opened wide with incredulity.","The number of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms on the other side...held no Legions of Reverend Emperors or those in the Boundary Expansion Realm who only held Boundaries up to the 9th Layer.","But the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms alone...were nearly 10 times the number that were contained in the whole Noblesse Lineage!","This was a maddening thought and reality to see as suddenly, him going forward as the Commander to fearlessly stand opposite to Noah near the transparent barrier did not seem so enticing!","The silence in the surroundings was deafening as after Noah's words and the arrival of just some of his forces...those observing were utterly gobsmacked.","And at this moment, the roiling skies filled with Ruin and Nullity began to seethe and buzz."]},{"number":2543,"title":"Chapter 2543: Chapter 2542 Violating Common Sense! II","paragraphs":["2542 Violating Common Sense! II","[This was your trump card?]","In the isolated space that seemed to be far above the skies of Dissolution, the veiled figure of the Adjudicator of Dissolution rang out towards Noah's Clone.","[It is astonishing even by my standards, with a preliminary gaze at these Apex Aeonic Lifeforms letting me know they hold astounding potential. But still...why mark two Inheritances and one of the Seven Clans your enemies?]","...!","A sense of surprise was evident even in the voice of the Adjudicator as Noah's figure gazed down at the scenes below them while he replied.","\"You told me before that if anyone seeks trouble with me or my livelihood after I am known, I have the right to retaliate and that you wouldn't interfere.\"","His words were calm as they caused Svetlana's gaze to more tightly wrap around him.","\"I'm also a reasonable being and I took into account the larger situation of these unknown Hyperversal Malignancies around us as before they make themselves my mortal enemies...I am giving these two Inheritances and the Avernus Clan a chance. This is me showing appreciation to you for your actions so far, and also an opportunity for established Inheritances and one of the Seven Clans to not face utter destruction and humiliation in my hands.\"","WAA!","Noah's words were filled with utmost confidence.","As if what he was saying was that of utmost surety!","Hearing such words...Svetlana actually did not reply as she gazed back below!","She seemed to be pondering.","Her profoundly perceptive eyes seemed to be questioning as her gaze landed on the visage of Aurelia among the many Apex Aeonic Lifeforms Noah had called out.","And...","Her veiled robes fluttered as she voiced out in surprise.","[What...?!]","She seemed to have sensed something rather alarming with her piercing eyes that others had yet to observe, this being just one of the surprises of what was to come!","The skies above the Apex Battlefield seethed.","The battalion of over 200 supremely high quality Apex Aeonic Lifeforms made many beings pause as after a deafening silence, immense clamor was about to erupt!","But this clamor never came.","Because the seething skies pulsed with the aura of Hyperversal Extremity Authority- and multiple ones at that!","—","In a hidden pocket of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","Dense nothingness and emptiness of time and reality itself permeated as the figure of the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction could be seen within it, his gaze currently as if he had stepped on stellar shit as he gazed at the scenes of the Apex Battlefield.","Beside him, a woman with fiery purple hair and two burning purple horns could be seen as her aura was blazing with an even grander sharpness than his, her voice ringing out at this moment as she locked onto the visage of Noah and the forces he had called out with a wave of his hands!","[You and the Avernus Clan are one, but you promised us you would move with our disciples covertly and not put them in any major spotlight that would reflect on our Clan too much.]","Her words were filled with terrifying authority as she was definitely a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity, and a particularly powerful one at that!","[...]","At her words, The Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction remained silent as this being continued.","[Now, the name of the Avernus Clan is being besmirched before the eyes of numerous Inheritances and even the representatives of multiple Clans, with a being actually placing themselves on a high enough pedestal to say that he would eradicate the Avernus Clan itself lest we choose to be his enemies! At this juncture, how do you think we should move, Destruction?! Do you think we even have a choice other than to remind others of the power of the Avernus Clan?!]","She was freely enraged as the visage of Destruction had his eyes turn into blazing slits of flames as he glared at her dangerously.","And yet...","[Glare all you fucking want, but you brought this all here. This Ahpuch you're raising better be worth it, because now...we have to truly have the Avernus Clan participate in this Apex War.]","...!","[What? But the Avernus Extremity Senate would never authorize...]","[I already sought permission, unlike you who acts wantonly.] The Hyperversal Extremity burning with purple flames spoke out curtly as she snapped her fingers.","[If any of this goes wrong any further...both your seat and mine in the Avernus Extremity Senate may be jeopardized. So you better tell me anything else I am missing about this Osmont.]","The Power of Hyperversal Extremity Authority erupted as while she carried a conversation with destruction...","The seething skies filled with Ruin and Nullity above the Apex Battlefield carried her voice as it thundered down with impunity.","[I have lived long, but not long enough to witness the name of the Avernus Clan be disrespected like this. For your indiscretion...we shall very well take your so-called stand of being mortal enemies! No matter what Absolute Seed of Extremity a junior sprouts, the whole Havens need to be reminded that this alone isn't enough to besmirch the magnificence of the Seven Clans!]","WAA!","As her voice thundered out, the gazes of numerous changed and looked above.","There, the skies split as from them, dazzling purple Hyperversal Extremity Authority proliferated as grand auras of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms began to appear, and as if to mock and tell the True Emperor of Quintessence of how far out of depth he was... exactly 200 Apex Aeonic Lifeforms were appearing.","And they weren't weak.","Each one held wild contained power and might as they each held a power equivalent to a Grand Elder of an Inheritance or Clan!","The sight astonished many as they didn't know, but this was a fourth of the most potent battalion of Avernus Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who were meant to participate in the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification that were redirected here with the power of this Hyperversal Extremity!","The scene was an utterly shocking one as instead of pulling out, the Avernus Clans representative made a grand move that caused the current situation to become even more chaotic!","Many entities watched this scene and this stunning reaction to the words of the True Emperor of Quintessence.","But he didn't just name the Avernus Clan.","In the Apex Battlefield, there were also forces of the Genesis Institute of Extremity as at this moment, the Hyperversal Extremities who had arrived in Dissolution to bring the battalions of their Apex Aeonic Lifeforms for the Culmination Step also heard his words!","In an isolated domain that no Apex Aeonic Lifeform would ever be able to locate in the faraway skies above the Noblesse Domains.","A marbled golden floor could be seen as feathery thrones rose from them, golden pillars and archways having been fabricated to stand straight on this marbled floor as at this moment, a Hyperversal Extremity rose with pulsing power in his eyes, his voice directed toward a white-haired Extremity still sitting down beside him.","[Extremity Marcellus, we talked about recruiting this being even if forcefully, but his words now are spitting in the very magnificence of the Genesis Institute of Extremity! For this-...!]","Before the Hyperversal Extremity could finish, the aged old man known as Extremity Marcellus raised his hand and all words stopped.","Multiple gazes landed on him as his stellar eyes took them all in calmly, his stare on the illusory screen showing the figure of none other than Noah.","Nobody could know what he was currently thinking, but his next words were explosive!","[What irreconcilable enmity do we actually have with this being before us?]","...!"]},{"number":2544,"title":"Chapter 2544: Chapter 2543 Violating Common Sense! III","paragraphs":["2543 Violating Common Sense! III","Extremity Marcellus.","He held many disciples in the Genesis Institute of Extremity as Titus was among them.","When he had perished, he noticed and talked to a being that was devouring Titus' memories, even understanding that the whole squadron Titus led was about to die!","The being he had talked to then and the one he was looking at now...were one and the same.","He remembered that he had told this being the last time they met that if their paths crossed in the future, he may even discuss destiny with him.","And now, this being gave a warning to make the whole Genesis Institute of Extremity his enemies should they participate in this Apex War.","So he spoke towards the three other bodies of Hyperversal Extremities that came with him to the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","[What irreconcilable enmity do we actually have with this being before us?]","What great enmity did they have?","[He massacred some of the squadrons of Scions we sent during the Initiation Step-]","[He also killed Scions of many other Inheritances, but I do not see them here in this Apex War. I'm asking what this being did against our Inheritance that we have a smidgen of our forces, however small it is, supporting a War where from his perspective, he is fighting for his very livelihood and the lives of his whole Lineage.]","[...]","The other Hyperversal Extremities didn't reply as they could see where Extremity Marcellus was going with this.","On the third feathery throne, a woman squinted her brows as she spoke cautiously.","[Extremity Marcellus, you couldn't possibly be thinking...]","[Why not? What do we lose from it? Do you think our Inheritance would look weak from such an action?]","WAA!","His white hair danced with authority.","The other Hyperversal Extremities were quiet for a while as the female one sighed again.","[You've lived longer than all of us and are known as the Wise Extremity of Genesis. If you believe this is the best course of action, I have no qualms with it. But this Osmont's mouth...]","[Live and let live...] Extremity Marcellus waved his hands as he came to a shocking conclusion.","[For this Apex War of Annihilation, the forces of the Genesis Institute of Extremity will not be involved.]","...!","—","The seething skies palpated with the aura of Hyperversal Extremity Authority even now as a moment after the voice of the Hyperversal Extremity of the Avernus Clan ended, another one came down with an equally shocking message.","A message that was simple in nature, resonantly sinking into the ears of all here.","[The forces of the Genesis Institute of Extremity will not be involved in this conflict.]","...!","Words that caused the minds of many to buzz.","The mind of Vladic and the other Noblesse Commanders buzzed even more so than others as this faction...was their own backing!","They were about to lose the very backing they had allied with before the Apex War could even begin?","The Genesis Elders were just as shocked as them as the figures of Grand Genesis Elder Meiying and others began to disappear with a glimmer of light from the battlefield as if they were never there.","\"This...!\"","Commander Vladic who had just experienced euphoria when 200 terrifying Apex Aeonic Lifeforms began descending from the crack in the skies felt his smile fading as his eyes burned with shock and rage, but he gritted his teeth when he looked at the terrifying figures from the Avernus Clan while steeling his resolve.","Thereafter, his gaze went towards the beings stemming from the Singularity Overseers.","What would they do?","Before the choice came down, the figure of Noah floating before the transparent wall gazed above at the distinct Hyperversal Extremity Authority from the Genesis Institute of Extremity that had yet to fade, his hand waving upwards and sending out a portion of his volition in a vibrant ball of light.","A light merged into space and disappeared along with the Hyperversal Will that had spoken on behalf of the Genesis Institute of Extremity!","Noah's eyes were vibrant as this single action was him being intrigued by whoever was bold enough to actually reverse the course of the Genesis Institute of Extremity, and he established a line of communication with this single move as thereafter, he continued gazing above while voicing out.","\"What shall be the path that the Singularity Overseers take?\"","WAA!","He ushered forth a reply from the last remaining faction supporting the Noblesse as in the crimson silver skies, there was only silence so far.","—","[Devouring, you made a move on your own when this was a small scuffle, what shall you do now?]","In an isolated domain close to the lands of the Planeswalkers, a voice entered the mind of the Hyperversal Extremity of Devouring as he healed the visage of Extremity Kabul who was in a sorry state!","His eyes flashed with a vicious brilliance as he gazed before him where illusory screens showed the Apex Battlefield, his voice decisive as it thundered out.","[I shall redirect a portion of the Singularity Elders here for the Culmination Step for this War. I do not fear a creature who has merely forged an Absolute Seed of Extremity, nor will the Singularity Overseers fear such a being. This is still a minor and insignificant skirmish as we shall treat it as such...and cause as much chaos to tarnish the reputation of Svetlana!]","His eyes throbbed with both viciousness and age.","Truly, in the viewpoint of beings who had lived billions of years and held the profound power of Extremity...would they fear the words of a single existence in the face of the power they wielded, the power their Inheritance wielded, and the very Aeonic Havens themselves that they had founded themselves in?","[...]","The Hyperversal Will that had reached out to Devouring was silent with recognition as it instantly acted.","And above the recently calm skies of the Apex Battlefield...","BZZZT!","Space was torn apart once more as if it were paper, and the answer of the Singularity Overseers came with actions instead of words.","Blazing auras of exactly 300 Apex Aeonic Lifeforms descended with stern expressions, all of them riding on variations of massive stellar beasts whose bodies seemed to be formed of constructs of Cosmos, Realities, or even pulsing Singularities!","ROOAAR!","The Tamed Apex Astral Leviathans roared out with majesty as the 300 Lifeforms riding them...at least half held pulsing majesty akin to a Grand Elder of an Inheritance!"]},{"number":2545,"title":"Chapter 2545: Chapter 2544 Violating Common Sense! IV","paragraphs":["2544 Violating Common Sense! IV","The Apex Battlefield became rowdy.","200 pristinely powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from the Avernus Clan and 300 from the Singularity Overseers were added as the force supporting the Noblesse became utterly massive!","Commander Vladic's dark expression became many times lighter when he saw this ever changing scene as his fists tightened.","So what if they lost the support of the Genesis Institute of Extremity?","Their number of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms on their side alone had increased by more than 5 times since just minutes ago!","Meanwhile, the opposing side, however surprising it was, held a bit over 200 exceptional Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","Would they be able to stand against the enraged forces of the Avernus Clan and the Singularity Overseers?","This was a question that some believed they had the answers to as at this moment, the silent clamor in the surroundings rose as those watching realized just how much bigger this War had become.","But while their discussions began amongst themselves, the visage of the True Emperor of Quintessence remained unfettered while staring at the myriad of beings before him.","His voice was even calmer than before, a smile forming on it as very few would be able to understand why he was smiling!","\"At times, the smallest of decisions can forever change the course of one's destiny.\"","WAA!","\"Today, the destiny of the Avernus Clan and the Singularity Overseers has diverged into another path entirely.\"","As he spoke, he waved his hands again.","A simple motion.","But all beings who were watching aptly remembered this motion.","When he did it before, 200 utterly powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms adorned in Relics far exceeding Apex Aeonic Relics had appeared.","What exactly was he calling forth now?","Time felt like it was crawling by extremely slowly.","Besides the True Emperor of Quintessence, space fluctuated as an instant later, an aura of utmost brilliance bloomed as an Entity appeared.","His mere presence caused the surrounding space to buzz and grind on itself heavily as on his very skin, a pristine authority of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity could be felt!","His hair shone black, gold, and green. His pupils shone with an obsidian verdant sheen that seemed to be filled with both life and death as any weak Apex Aeonic Lifeform gazing into them may have their Soul shattered!","His body was adorned not in the Loot Seeker's Regalia Set...but with wondrous armaments that shone with a stellar obsidian and green crystalline light as they seemed to be forged from bones.","In his right hand, a verdant staff was grasped as at its tip, a skull with its sockets inscribed with a deathly green infinity symbol could be seen.","Armaments that were forged just for him.","Relics that came together to forge a Set known as the Raiments of the Quintessential Lich Emperor!","A bony helm of this set stably adorned the visage of none other than Alexander like a crown as it blazed with horrifying green flames.","All of this was stunning, but nothing was more so stunning than his aura and the fact that from him, an aura of a fully converged Absolute Dynamis of Extremity could be felt.","Not an Absolute Seed that had yet to bud, but a genuine Absolute Dynamis of Extremity!","At his appearance, the far-away Ahpuch that the forces of the Avernus Clan had gathered near rose as his body throbbed with grandeur.","His heart beat loudly like a drum as if it was telling him...his destiny had arrived.","Before any surprise and alarm could be expressed, the motioning hand of the True Emperor of Quintessence was not done as behind his stellar force of 200, dazzling lights of titanic stature began to bloom.","The figures of Regal Beasts began to unfold by the dozens as even with their massive size, there were dozens of them who were led by none other than a titanic Draconic Elephantine Ender of Extremity!","All around him, the images of Beasts that seemed like massive celestial creatures only born in ancient times proliferated as their forms varied a great deal, taking on statures of Qilins, Phoenixes, Serpents, Crows, Dragons, or a myriad of combinations of such creatures with even more Beasts!","They didn't bellow out or roar to show their power as their eyes held interminable brilliance, gazing around at everything coldly and with precision as even average Apex Aeonic Lifeforms watching in the distance felt their blood run cold.","Their numbers and sizes filled the scanty battlefield as a count had 300 Enders of Extremity pulsing with Extremity Foundations and a dazzling aura of the Apex Aeonic Lifeform stage.","\"...\"","Wondrous dread and power unveiled itself as the myriad of watching gazes each held their own thoughts, each one observing a different part of the unveiled forces.","Roan could not believe the scene before him.","The figures of Oriona and Aurelia felt utterly unreachable as even though it was hard to believe, he could somewhat go through the phases and bring himself to accept it.","But when he looked at the other Apex Aeonic Lifeforms he knew very well to be weaker than him just days ago, and their auras were many times more powerful than him right now...he couldn't accept it!","This was...until his eyes fully focused from his shock as he blinked when his gaze came to land on a figure he recognized very well.","A being with broken meridians.","A being that had failed Apexification.","Maximilian...was he...was he seeing things or was this past Lineage Emperor an Apex Aeonic Lifeform with an aura just as maddening as all the others?!","\"...\"","Roan's will couldn't formulate any thought as at this moment, his soul felt like it had ground to a halt from utter incredulity!","He and many others found themselves unable to even discuss as they truly never expected the True Emperor of Quintessence to call forth a force that would make an Inheritance jealous!","And before any of the disbelief could be expressed...","BZZZT!","The skies seethed once more with Hyperversal Extremity Authority.","An authority more insane than any that had come before it.","It was the authority of the Adjudicator of Dissolution as above the Apex Battlefield, space cracked open while a hidden visage stepped out!"]},{"number":2546,"title":"Chapter 2546: Chapter 2545 A Cleaving Blade of Destiny! I","paragraphs":["2545 A Cleaving Blade of Destiny! I","The time neared!","This was the only reason why the figure of an astonishing existence now seeped out from the cracks of space and stared at the glorious Apex Battlefield below.","Both sides were filled to the brim with Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, each one more astonishing than the last as it showed an utterly deadly battle was about to unfold.","The form of Svetlana stepping out of the cracks of space was veiled with dense Hyperversal Extremity Authority that her figure could barely be recognized of its curves and blessings, some existences being too frail to stare at her for too long as they gazed away!","She appeared with a veil over her head as those who could barely withstand the power of Extremity surrounding her may have been able to tell that her eyes...held traces of sadness!","The attention of the myriad of watchers became divided from peering at the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms the True Emperor of Quintessence had called out and the visage of the Adjudicator of Dissolution as her will began to emanate out across this region.","[Our Seven Havens are staying in a precarious balance with our strongest forces holding truly terrifying enemies at bay. Every single force we add over the years contributes to this balance as every life is of utmost importance.]","...!","Her words were filled with both regality and a sense of disapproval as she gazed towards Noah's visage, towards Vladic, and towards the vast number of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms on the tense Battlefield below as she continued!","[What I hate the most is precious lives and forces of the Havens of Extremity being reaped for no reason, and even worse if they are reaped for sport. Today, every side here has chosen to ignore the larger picture and involve the lives of powerful future defenders of these Havens in a senseless war or Annihilation. It gives me no joy to govern over such an event...and yet here we are.]","\"...\"","Power and sadness went hand in hand in her words.","It caused the burning sensation of war and conflict to feel stifled just a little.","It caused the surroundings to feel empty.","It felt desolate.","It felt sad.","And her words weren't done as she continued.","[Here we are in a field of battle where even Hyperversal Extremities who know full well of the situation we are in contributed to. And the rest would go so far as to recline on their comfy thrones getting ready to watch this senseless war for amusement. Such a scene...paints a grim future for the Seven Aeonic Havens of Extremity!]","She admonished the war about to occur, those involved, those who contributed to it, and those watching!","And even further...","[What I am most disappointed in is myself for allowing this future to develop the way it has as after this war...even the smallest violation of the Investiture of Extremity will be personally handled by me with scrutiny! So enjoy this War you will watch with amusement and strive for your future when the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification fully unfolds, because from now on, my stare will pervasively glance at every single thing!]","...!","With the end of her words, her fair hidden hand rose and snapped.","And an instant after...","BZZZT!","The transparent barrier separating the two sides began to glare with dazzling light as it actually...began to dissolve.","The appointed time had come.","And yet it was so sudden that many were left flabbergasted as the barrier very quickly began to dissolve, the Legions on the side of the Noblesse beginning to buzz with power.","[At this point, the inclusion of any foreign influences in this War has been closed off.]","The voice of the Adjudicator of Dissolution thundered out amidst the shocking progression.","[The war being fought is against the Lernean Lineage and the Noblesse Lineage. The victor holds the right of Annihilation over the defeated and their supporters!]","BOOOM!","Her last sentence caused many wills to rouse as it felt like it was directed towards certain inheritances and a Clan!","And yet once more, those watching couldn't properly react quickly enough.","Because in the next instant...","\"My people!\"","The voice of the True Emperor of Quintessence thundered out.","His body shone with pristine brilliance as at this moment, a dazzling multicolored throne rose below him that he grandly sat down on.","As if indicating that he...would not even need to lift a finger himself for the fight to come.","The moment he sat on the grand throne, a symphony began to play.","THUMP!","Booming drums and sonorous strokes of sounds emanated out as they seemed to usher forth the call for war, his voice continuing to ring around.","\"Today, we fight to defend ourselves from the threat of annihilation from a faction that doesn't truly understand us. Today...we fight to establish the grandeur and identity of our Infinite Hyperversal Haven!\"","BOOM!","He sat on the throne grandly as tendrils of Absolute Dynamis of Extremity rose on his skin and caused him to give off terrifying majesty.","His eyes seemed like spinning singularities of infinity as those watching and listening to him realized they were holding in their cycling of essence across their Aspects of Existence!","\"We shall establish the grandeur of our Infinite Hyperversal Haven to the extent that no Inheritance nor Haven would dare to turn their swords against us, and those who do...their fate shall be nothing other than destruction.\"","...!","Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","A concept that others hadn't heard before.","But the way that the True Emperor of Quintessence was speaking about it...it was akin to him giving a proclamation of a faction along the same lines of an Inheritance or Clan!","It was a shocking assertion.","It was an impossible goal.","And yet the True Emperor of Quintessence sitting upon his throne paid no heed as he spoke out coldly while watching the fading barrier, the momentum of the conflict entirely on their side as Vladic nor any other commander opposing them was able to say any word.","\"Throw out the first strike that shall carve out the majesty of our Infinite Hyperversal Haven, my Son.\"","...!"]},{"number":2547,"title":"Chapter 2547: Chapter 2546 A Cleaving Blade of Destiny! II","paragraphs":["2546 A Cleaving Blade of Destiny! II","His word beckoned forth an existence to make a move.","His son.","Those who heard this scanned their wills to see who would move as from the masses, the radiant golden visage of none other than Henry Osmont stepped forward.","He was adorned in the Quintessential Loot Seeker's Regalia Set as above him lay an innocently bouncing blue slime.","His power was among the highest of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as he grasped the massive golden Greataxe in his hands and stepped forward!","His son...was an Apex Aeonic Lifeform whose power could rival Grand Elders of Inheritances?","This was the only thought that passed through their heads before a moment later, the visage of Henry Osmont appeared at the forefront of the forces of the Infinite Hyperversal Planes, the moment that the barrier completely disappeared...his hand swung down and carried forth imposing momentum.","It felt heavy.","It felt full of responsibility and a weight that very few beings could bear!","And yet he carried this weight as he called out with his swing.","\"Destiny Cleaving.\"","A greataxe thundered down.","With it came the cleaving of all destiny as wondrously...the might of an Absolute Seed of Extremity came with it!","...!","What!","This single word blazed in the minds of all.","That couldn't be the grandeur of another Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, right?","How many beings on the side of the True Emperor of Quintessence would that make who held such a pristine authority?!","Just...what was this?!","SHIIING!","A golden radiance of destiny overflowed.","And in the skies above, a massive halcyon Axe of destiny eclipsing the whole battlefield formed and thundered down towards the masses!","The very will of the being ushering forth this massive cleaving of destiny seemed to somberly permeate throughout, his eyes clear and filled with clarity as before him, a panel of fantastical details was reflected.","[Name]:: Henry Osmont's Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity","[Realm]:: Third Haven of Destiny","[Lineage]:: Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor(Destined Hyperversal Emperor)","[Titles]:: True Emperor of Destiny, Son of Destiny, Little Henry, One Who Looks to Scale an Impossible Wall...","[Destiny Hyperversal Mana Value]:: 1,299","[Destiny Hyperversal Vitality Value]:: 1,299","[Destiny Hyperversal Soul Value]:: 1,999","[Destiny Hyperversal Defense Value]:: 1,299","[Destiny Hyperversal Damage Value]:: 1,999","[Hyperversal Destiny]:: .3","[Hyperversal Mastery]:: .3","[Absolute Hyperversal Authority Resistance]:: 1%","[Dynamis of Extremity]:: Destined (Absolute), Arcadian(Aeonic)","[Boundaries of Extremity]:: Destiny, Fate, Karma, Fortune, Moirai, Kismet, Quintessence, Wisdom, Blood,","Manadynamics...","He had absorbed the Crimson Extremity Panacea to obtain an even more pristine Extremity Foundation- the Unrecorded Aeonic Destined Hyperversal Extremity Foundation!","With such an outrageous foundation as the foothold, the concepts of Destiny, Fortune, Karma, Moirai, Kismet, Wisdom, Pathfinder, Nexus Emperor, and Quintessence that he had already dabbled in and understood to an extent...","were capable of being taken and forming an Absolute Seed of Extremity.","He didn't impose any grand names as he simply called it what he wished for it to be.","Destined.","And so, he used one of the features of the Destined Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.","Destiny Cleaving.","An ability that could be used in a myriad of ways- whether through the Aeonic Annals of Extremity or directly as he used it now as in this instance, he utilized it in an extremely offensive fashion.","It was the action of severing the destinies of his targets as the Authority of his Dynamis went so far as to sever their potential, their Foundations, and the very Aspects of Existence that contributed to their destiny if they couldn't stop this authority!","He applied it as an area of effect attack.","He had it descend on the Legions before him!","...!","HO!","The bodies of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from the Avernus Clan and Singularity Overseers pulsed with grandeur as the lights of numerous of Dynamis of Extremity rose from every single being.","The figures of the Noblesse Apex Aeonic Lifeforms moved and came close together as their bodies shone with brilliance- dense waves of the VOID erupting out as they overlapped on each other and tried their best to extend to the Legions of Reverend Emperors that were brought into this battle!","Their hearts felt tight at the grandeur of fall of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity!","Henry saw the vast sights occurring before him as he closed his eyes.","And the massive golden Greataxe in the skies thundered down and dispersed its authority upon the masses!","It cleaved Destiny!","The Lifeforms from the Singularity Overseers and Avernus Clan would feel the weight of the Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, but they wouldn't perish from it.","But the Noblesse...","\"Ah...!\"","The cries of two Noblesse Apex Aeonic Lifeforms rang out as they were on the fringes of the Layers protection they all cast with Commander Vladic at the center.","With his eyes closed, Henry felt his authority surge into their bodies as they cut up everything that contributed to their grand destiny.","Their Foundations.","Their Aspects of Existence.","They were all cleaved as like broken kites, they fell from the skies silently!","Their cleaved fate surged out and grandly rushed towards Henry, but this wasn't all.","If among the Apex Aeonic Noblesse, two could not be protected...what of the crowds of Reverend Emperors that the Noblesse called out to form Legions?","The answer was presented in an ecstatic scene.","The myriad of Legions stretched across the aids of the Noblesse were covered by the brief flash of golden light, and then...every single one slumped to the ground.","\"...\"","Destiny pervaded and proliferated all around as Henry felt the souls of all he had cleaved apart the destinies of, what was their streaming out and rushing towards him to become his as he sighed!","They all had their own dreams and fates. They all had their own destinies and hopes to live for millions of years.","And he had reaped away all of this from thousands as this...this was a War!","Along with their Destinies, the effects of the Quintessential Loot Seeker's Regalia Set activated as numerous of deaths among the thousands that died had triggered the [Explosion of Loot] that granted 1,000% more Loot, hundreds of prompts cascading past his closed eyes!"]},{"number":2548,"title":"Chapter 2548: Chapter 2547 The Dead Are Not Done With You! I","paragraphs":["2547 The Dead Are Not Done With You! I","When he opened his eyes again, the Apex Battlefield had greatly changed.","Only Apex Aeonic Lifeforms remained.","The gazes of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from the Avernus Clan and Singularity Overseers were bright as they withstood the weight of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity together, their commanders already making plans!","Ahpuch's visage didn't even cast any defensive skill as he stood tall in the crimson silver skies with a smile.","As for Commander Vladic...the void faded to reveal his figure as his face was ashen when he looked around him!","Had he not utilized the combined strength of the Noblesse Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, he would have just become the first Commander in history to fall in the first strike.","But when he looked at the utterly devastating state of the Legions of his people lying lifeless...his heart burned with immense pain and hate!","His gaze was that of utter malice as he gazed at the single being who had made this move, seeing him hold his Greataxe on his chest as if to pay respects for all that he had instantly killed.","Above him, the Blue Slime pulsed with tendrils of light and jumped from his head as it was about to move.","The force of 200 Apex Aeonic Lifeforms behind him also buzzed with tendrils of light as it seemed they were about to move!","And at such a junction...","\"Do not despair for the dead.\"","The voice of the terrifying Entity floating beside the multicolored throne of the True Emperor of Quintessence thundered out after a shocking first move.","Adorned in verdant obsidian bone Armaments, his movements caught the eyes of the most powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms standing opposite to them as he continued!","\"As the First Commander of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, I shall etch many lessons of death onto your souls. I will first teach you not to despair for the dead because the dead...are not done with you yet.\"","HOONG!","As he spoke, the staff in his hands began to shine- Alexander King making his first move at this moment!","But the enemies opposing them were existences that had lived and fought for a great number of years.","The first move was given away...but that was it.","SHIING!","With shocking crimson brilliance, the faraway figure of Ahpuch that had been in the center of the Avernus Clan Elders instantly appeared past the area of the dissolved barrier while he shone with the grandeur of Destruction, his target being none other than Alexander!","The being who had proclaimed himself as the First Commander of Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","Towards the appearance of Ahpuch, Alexander didn't even bat an eye.","His serene gaze remained on the lifeless bodies strewn on the opposing Battlefield as he uttered out.","\"Undead...Rise!\"","...!","A grand symphony began to pick up pace and became more pronounced.","A symphony of death and destruction!","It was carried forth by the Thanatos Absolute Dynamis of Extremity as it washed out like a tide towards the dead in the distance!","As for Ahpuch's figure...","WAP!","The brilliant visage of Caterina Aurelia Dismukes appeared as her body radiated the grandeur of the Thesauros Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.","\"Hey big guy, remember me?\"","Her figure blazed with brilliance as it thundered forward, but she wasn't alone.","A milky white rose bloomed as from it, the countenance of Genesis thundered out- his sockets filled with an astounding concentration of light as they shot out stellar beams of utter wonder!","Thereafter, another figure rose up as his body shimmered of countless quasars.","His eyes held a hint of unresolved anger and majesty as the gravity around him became twisted, the Mad Apex Emperor Caesar also coming forward to make a move against the newly appearing Ahpuch!","And it still felt like it wasn't enough against this being as finally...","BOOM!","Space fissured and cracked as the massive form of a Draconic Elephantine Ender of Extremity appeared in the skies, its golden trunk seeming like a cylindrical haven of apocalypse as it roared down with at the very minimum 2,000 Natural Apex Damage Values!","Aurelia, Orion, Caesar, and Hyperion.","These four beings advanced with harmony to rebuff an immense aura of Destruction as the True Emperor of Quintessence had yet to lift a finger from his throne!","Ahpuch moved, but he didn't move alone.","There were hundreds of terrifying Grand Elder Level Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from the Avernus Clan and the Singularity Overseers as all of them also made a move.","The Apex Battlefield was akin to a brilliant stellar field of blooming light as hundreds of authorities of Dynamis of Extremity were called out, the eyes of the Elders from the Avernus Clan cold and decisive as they moved in groups of ten while calling out.","\"Planar Domain of Destruction.\"","\"Planar Domain of Cataclysm.\"","\"Planar Domain...\"","Planar Domains of Dynamis of Extremity began to unfold en masse as reality itself was being twisted, dozens of Elders appeared before the army of the True Emperor of Quintessence as they fought with power and synchrony!","The Apex Aeonic Lifeforms of the Singularity Overseers weren't far behind them as Zeitgeist clasped his hands, a heavy force of Devouring erupting out as around him, bestial Roars echoed out as the Tamed Apex Astral Leviathans bellowed out while moving like mountains.","It was a horrifying counterattack that pitted the very concepts of Extremity the two sides grasped, the impact no doubt being something that would produce casualties as all sides surged forward with power!","On the side of the True Emperor of Quintessence, the Son of Destiny rose his Greataxe again as along with him...","RAA!","A gallant existence with a golden beak turned into a stream of light that surged forward, its eruption only matched by a form shrouded in darkness drawing out his Katana and calling out coldly.","\"Planar Severing.\"","Kazuhiko's voice carried weight and excitement as he moved, the skies above his head also changing colors at this moment and becoming painted with a cerulean hue as the countenance of a certain Blue Slime expanded massively- a unique aura of Devouring far different from what the Elders of the Singularity Overseers released emanating from it as it was ready to absorb any authorities thrown its way!","The scene was completely chaotic with too many moving pieces.","But some pieces were more influential and crucial than others.","The words of the piece that was Alexander King...they should have been taken with utmost gravity and importance as all attacks of the Avernus Clan Elders and Singularity Overseers should have been focused on him!","But he was given free rein as due to this...","A verdant obsidian light began to shine.","An aura of death began to rise.","And the lifeless bodies in the distance...terrifying waves of deathly authority pulsed from them as their very Recorded Histories were being changed, monstrous anomalies knowing nothing but death about to unfold!"]},{"number":2549,"title":"Chapter 2549: Chapter 2548 The Dead Are Not Done With You! II","paragraphs":["2548 The Dead Are Not Done With You! II","One had to have a truly special pair of eyes to capture and understand the horror about to unfold.","Due to the Convergence of so many powerful factions in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution, there were actually a great number of beings who could pierce through the veils of secrecy and easily gaze upon the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!","There were many...and then there was Ayame.","Ayame of Infinite Extremity!","She stood from her throne as she wasn't the only one, the figures of Erikson and Atlas being the same as their gazes were locked onto the confounding authority of life and death radiating from the existence beside Noah- the one who had termed himself the First Commander of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","Ayame's gaze was locked onto this authority of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity and how it had begun to suffuse and build up in the surroundings, but more so how it flowed into the lifeless bodies of the Legions the Son of the True Emperor of Quintessence had struck down with a single strike.","Her pupils constricted as her gaze saw an entirely different scene.","One must not forget that in the Initiation Step of Extremity Sanctification, only three beings had attained genuine Crimson Extremity Panaceas.","One of those beings was Ayame!","The other two beings attained shocking Hyperversal Extremity Foundations, so one could only assume how grand of a change she had undergone.","But among her many changes, her perceptiveness, freedom, and control of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity became utterly obscene.","Her eyes could see the locked and ended Records of the dead Reverend Emperors and the 2 Apex Aeonic Noblesse that had fallen.","Locked Records.","Records of beings whose lives had come to an end!","She saw the authority of the First Commander of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven flow into these Locked Records as an instant after...it began re-writing them in a taboo fashion as it utterly altered these Records and Unlocked them once more!","\"Do not despair for the dead...\" She stared at this blankly as she found herself repeating the words he had said.","How could she not when she stared at the impossible task of the Records of thousands of existences being altered right before her eyes- something that would need pristine concentration and heavy Soul Values to alter in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, and yet it occurred simultaneously for thousands as thereafter...","THUMP!","Their lifeless bodies began to pulse with deathly essence as their Altered Records burned even more fiercely than when they were alive.","And from them...she saw a process of ascension as their new archives were utterly horrific to gaze at.","Their bodies pulsed with verdant obsidian tendrils of light as their skin and musculature receded, a bony crystalline exterior being seen as each one of these rising Entities had their own peculiarities- but they were skeletal in nature!","And from their birth, Ayame was able to peer at the archives that they were giving off.","From the bodies of the Reverend Emperors, a single Record repeated itself.","[The Prince Tier Thanatos Vassal, Death Knight, has been born.]","[The Prince Tier Thanatos Vassal, Death Knight, has been born...]","Their Altered Records were similar even though their forms varied, their backbone remaining skeletal in nature as their sockets began to shine with grand verdant obsidian flames that caused the hue of the skies to match it.","Ayame stared at all of the different variations of the Prince Tier Thanatos Vassals with wonder until her eyes came to lock onto the already altering bodies of the 2 Apex Aeonic Noblesse.","These were even more obscene as the Noblesse humanoid forms expanded rapidly, dense verdant black smoke covering the region they were in as from them, massive figures rose!","One held a serrated bony skeletal body of a creature reminiscent to a dragon form, expansive bone wings spreading out left and right as its record unfolded before Ayame's eyes.","[The King Tier Thanatos Vassal, Void Dracolich, has been born.]","Void Dracolich!","From its crystalline obsidian green bones, liquified death dripped freely as its draconic jaws rose up to the crimson silver skies and opened to release a billowing mist of death that covered the whole region!","A mist of authority that Ayame knew had to be the Absolute Dynamis of Extremity that brought this creature to be.","Its power was unimaginably higher in this altered Record compared to the History of the Noblesse that had died, Ayame fully understanding the words that the First Commander of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven had uttered as she heard Erikson speak the last words that reverberated out with a grim expression!","\"The dead are not done with you...\"","WAA!","An existence who could alter the archives of perished beings and utilize them appeared before their eyes as even though it wasn't something revolutionary or new, the way he did it was utterly obscene and full of impossibilities!","Ayame's piercing eyes were one of the few confirming this as she saw the record of the last Apex Noblesse that fell flash brightly.","[The King Tier Thanatos Vassal, Chaos Nightwalker, has been born.]","...!","A second King Tier Thanatos Vassal rose as this one held a titanic humanoid bony form, his visage releasing a deathly glacial chill around him as he looked like a mummified Emperor shining with white and green light.","The region around him very quickly had its reality frozen as glacial tendrils of light began to proliferate, its deathly cold sockets lighting up with verdant obsidian flames that Ayame was briefly lost in!","And at such a moment, the flames burned brightly as they turned towards her direction.","...!","It was a change that instantly caused her guard to rise as the verdant obsidian flames felt like they were staring straight at her, and it wasn't the Thanatos Vassal that was gazing at her...but their Master!","Their Master who radiated dense Absolute Dynamis of Extremity besides the True Emperor of Quintessence!","And through the Records of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, Ayame heard a single word from the Will within the verdant obsidian flames as thereafter, her entry and stare were restricted from any more information.","'Nosy.'","...!"]},{"number":2550,"title":"Chapter 2550: Chapter 2549 The Dead Are Not Done With You! III","paragraphs":["2549 The Dead Are Not Done With You! III","Nosy!","Ayame fell back on her seat in surprise as she was flabbergasted when this single word thundered in her mind.","Who was she? What Inheritance did she belong to? What pristine Extremity Foundation did she now hold? What terrifying access did she have into the Aeonic Annals of Extremity?","For her to be seen by another soul while peering through the Records of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, and then subsequently blocked by them...this should only be something a Hyperversal Extremity was capable of- or an existence with an extremely domineering Absolute Dynamis of Extremity that couldn't easily be grasped by an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","And yet...","ROAAR!","Her thoughts were brought to a stop as the deathly energies in the Apex Battlefield reached the peak, the Void Dracolich roaring out and instantly rising in the air with a power that terrified normal Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, while the Chaos Nightwalker began to rise with chilling waves of essence with a slightly more terrifying aura!","They were followed by droves of Prince Tier Thanatos Vassals that took on the forms of a myriad of Undead- all of them moving in sequence and like a billowing wave of death as they swarmed the forces of Singularity Overseers and Avernus Clan from behind!","—","[Name]:: Thanatos Vassal Death Knight (Prince Tier)","[Realm]:: Second Haven of Thanatos","[Lineage]:: Quintessential Undead Thanatos Vassal","[Titles]:: Slave of Thanatos, Death Seeker...","[Apex Thanatos Mana Value]:: 100","[Apex Thanatos Vitality Value]:: 100","[Apex Thanatos Soul Value]:: 100","[Apex Thanatos Defense Value]:: 100","[Apex Thanatos Damage Value]:: 100","[Dynamis of Extremity]:: Thanatos(Absolute)- Limited Access","[Boundaries of Extremity]:: Death, Necromancy, Quintessence...","The stats of the thousands of what used to be Reverend Emperors showed themselves before Noah as they showed a terrifying potential and possibility.","When the Thanatos Absolute Dynamis of Extremity was converged past 50%, the stats of rising Quintessential Undead Thanatos Vassals was at a minimum of 10 Apex Thanatos Soul Values!","Now that Noah had taken Thanatos to full converge and held yet another dazzling Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity in his soul, this power was shown to be even more obscene!","And this...was the transformation of existences that weren't Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","The Altered Records of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms produced an even more terrifying result!","[Name]:: Thanatos Vassal Void Dracolich (King Tier)","[Realm]:: Third Haven of Thanatos","[Lineage]:: Quintessential Undead Thanatos Vassal","[Titles]:: Draco, Slave of Thanatos, Death Seeker...","[Apex Thanatos Mana Value]:: 999","[Apex Thanatos Vitality Value]:: 999","[Apex Thanatos Soul Value]:: 999","[Apex Thanatos Defense Value]:: 999","[Apex Thanatos Damage Value]:: 999","[Dynamis of Extremity]:: Thanatos(Absolute)- Limited Access","[Boundaries of Extremity]:: Death, Necromancy, Quintessence...","\"...\"","A violation of common sense and nature.","The stats of the dead Apex Noblesse were utterly transformed and made into a terrifying Entity that nearly gave off the intense aura of a Grand Elder of an Inheritance.","With their limited access to the Thanatos Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, they very well represented this terror and power as they instantly moved and brought down tendrils of death from behind enemy lines!","...!","It caused chaos to instantly spread, Noah- nay, Alexander King wasn't done.","Quintessential Undead Rise was the first taste.","What was truly terrifying had yet to come as at this moment, he saw the billowing waves of strength that the existence who was stopped by Aurelia, Orion, Caesar, and Hyperion expressed as his terrifying waves of Destruction were pushing all 4 back!","For such a being, Alexander's staff shone as he called out calmly.","\"Quintessential Thanatos Embodiment.\"","...!","BZZZT!","The crimson silver skies darkened.","Verdant black clouds and tendrils of grandeur began to seethe and gather as above Alexander's terrifying visage, a stellar doorway made of bones instantly bloomed and radiated terror!","And the instant it formed, a skeletal hand pulsing with terrifying power erupted out and formed into a fist- a force bursting out to instantly shatter the door of bones as deathly mist covered everything!","And from this deathly mist...","[Ka Ka Ka!]","A deathly cackling could be heard.","It was a cackling of a lich that reveled in death and destruction.","The deathly mist dispersed to reveal a figure shrouded in a billowing black robe that covered a crystalline skeletal humanoid form with withered flesh tightly wound on stellar bones.","On the back of this skeletal figure, an expansive aurora of verdant black wings expanded out gloriously as above his skeletal head, an Obsidian flaming crown rotated with mad power while releasing tendrils of grandeur in the surroundings!","Its sockets were pure verdant flames of life as they contrasted beautifully with the aura of death he released, the cackling coming as he moved his jaws up and down as they seemed to show happiness at having finally returned.","Returned.","It meant he had been here before as this was none other than a manifestation of an Arch Lich that the True Emperor of Quintessence had utilized before!","Under a different name now. And yet holding even more grandeur.","Its flaming sockets gazed at the battlefield as its jaws formed into a cruel smile, the power that it released being something that shone among the brightest on this Battlefield!","[Name]:: Quintessential Thanatos Embodiment(Thanatos Haven Lich Ra'Zan)","[Realm]:: Fourth Haven of Thanatos","[Lineage]:: Quintessential Thanatos Embodiment","[Titles]:: The Arch Lich, Haven Lich, Ka Ka Ka!...","[Apex Thanatos Mana Value]:: 9,999","[Apex Thanatos Vitality Value]:: 9,999","[Apex Thanatos Soul Value]:: 9,999","[Apex Thanatos Defense Value]:: 9,999","[Apex Thanatos Damage Value]:: 9,999","[Dynamis of Extremity]:: Thanatos(Absolute)","[Boundaries of Extremity]:: Death, Necromancy, Quintessence...","Thanatos Haven Lich Ra'Zan.","He came to be once more as his burning sockets transformed into a cruel smile that caused the swarming Elders of the Singularity Overseers and Avernus Clan to feel a chill and a sense of danger!","A billowing aura of death surged around him as he raised his skeletal hands up- a crystalline bone staff forming within them while he called out.","[Rise, my children!]","...!","A call was made as behind it, gates of hell seemingly began to open as Legions of Undead were waiting behind them....","—","The Avernus Clan was a terrifying behemoth that had lived for too many eons.","Those that were a part of this force...were the brightest and most astute entities as if they weren't, they were forcefully forged to be this way!","This was why amidst the unfolding chaotic battle, there were portions of the Wills of the Avernus Clan Elders engaging in this battle resonating and communicating with each other.","They all joined together in a unique domain accessible only by their wills as it manifested as a forum of a roundtable surrounded by thrones, with the manifested figures of the prominent Avernus Clan Elders sitting on these thrones as they debated the battle at hand and made decisions rapidly- barely a fraction of a nanosecond passing between their discussions!","\"Ahpuch, can you handle the monstrosity that this First Commander of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven has called out and its minions? It exudes the authority of the Absolute Dynamis of Extremity even more than the Death Minions risen behind us.\"","A voice from one of the thrones rose towards the visage of Ahpuch who had an expression of utmost happiness at this moment.","He nodded as he looked at the over a dozen Commanding Avernus Elders in this manifested space around him.","The strongest of the Battalion of 200 released on this Apex Battlefield!","Each of them held approximate Apex Aeonic Soul Values ranging from 8,000-18,000 as he...exceeded them all in this aspect! The rest of the 200 apart from these Commanding Avernus Elders had an approximate average of 2,000-4,000 Apex Aeonic Soul Values as there was a vast discrepancy between power that was determined by many factors!","\"I'll take care of both this Lich and the Master that called him forth. Will you all be able to handle everything else? This is a War that the Avernus Clan cannot lose, or our souls will not be let off even in death!\"","...!","The Wills of the Elders knew this very well as they nodded, a woman with burning black flames on her head taking on a leading role and nodding while they all scrutinized the battle and made judgments quickly.","\"Very well, if you see anyone being overpowered, lend aid right away and work together to grind down the enemies, and...oh for fucks sake!\"","...!","Her words had to change mid-way as they saw the authority of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity gather around the First Commander of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven again.","\"He's calling out more of his Undead Minions...since we don't know what their might will be, try to stop him if you can!\"","They quickly conveyed and moved as their bodies on the Apex Battlefield heard ecstatic words.","[Chthonian Sinners of Thanatos].","...!","Four words.","They called forth the advent of even more death and destruction!"]},{"number":2551,"title":"Chapter 2551: Chapter 2550 Madness! I","paragraphs":["2550 Madness! I","The Thanatos Haven Lich Ra'Zan.","He was the Quintessential Thanatos Embodiment of the Absolute Dynamis of Extremity that held 21 Boundaries within it!","He could exist from the moment the Dynamis was Recorded as now that he was out, even death could never truly reclaim him unless the Thanatos Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity was destroyed.","'Death.'","BZZT!","The bright verdant flames in his sockets blazed as this idea that was at his very core buzzed with wonder!","With it ringing in his deathly will, he gazed at the battlefield before him as what he saw was very different from what others saw.","His vision showed the myriad of entities represented as brilliant illusory hearts of differing sizes and intensity!","These hearts were filled with life, concepts, and everything that defined these beings.","The Avernus Clan Elders had their vast majority of forces showing illusory hearts half the size of the Haven Lich himself.","About a dozen of them almost neared the same size as his heart by about 80%!","This proportion remained the same for the 300 forces of the Singularity Overseers, where only about 10 out of the 300 Apex Singularity Overseer Elders commanded strength similar to him!","The massive Apex Astral Leviathans they stood on were barely above the Prince Tier Thanatos Vassal level that could be conjured by his Master from the lowest Dead Record.","Ra'Zan read the field of battle and scanned all of this in an instant as behind him, he also saw the forces called out by his Master.","The 300 radiant Enders of Extremity were great accomplishments as their illusory hearts under his gaze seemed the same as the Apex Elder on the enemy side, their power singularly being 4,000 Apex Aeonic Soul Values as some Enders like the Draconic Elephantine Ender trying to hold off the strongest enemy here held a bit more Values than the other Enders!","As for the 200 Vassals that followed his Master, their Values could be set at a minimum of 1,000 due to their own Foundations and the effects of the Quintessential Loot Seeker's Regalia they adorned as beings like the Son of Destiny, Aurelia, Orion, and Caesar went towards or slightly exceeded the 2,000 Apex Aeonic Soul Value benchmark.","The Haven Lich Ra'Zan could see all of this with a glance as the Vassals of his Master would have to move in groups of two or three in order to survive against their enemies, with the Enders of Nature capable of moving by themselves to withstand the enemy Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","His Master existed to balance out this discrepancy as death would soon begin to proliferate and the number of their forces would rise.","Then there was him.","The Haven Lich!","His purpose here...","THUMP!","He felt his illusory dead heart beat with astonishing life as he came to gaze upon the strongest enemy combatant here.","He knew the Record of this being from his Master.","Ahpuch.","His illusory beating heart...was the largest on this Battlefield!","Larger than even the beating heart of his Master as this being held a much greater edge in the concepts that made his Heart.","But this didn't alarm the Haven Lich.","Because to him, it didn't matter if the enemy had greater Values.","So long as they fell prey to the sweet release of death...their values would mean nothing!","His Master had just cast [Chthonian Sinners of Thanatos]- another boon of the Thanatos Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity that Ra'Zan stemmed from as another deterrent against this enemy, the dense aura of death becoming ever concentrated as at the same time- the illusory heart of Ahpuch blazed as this being also made a grand move!","Ra'Zan knew the children that would come from [Chthonian Sinners of Thanatos] as surely, they would be a sufficient deterrent against this enemy.","But Ra'Zan thought about himself as the unimaginable flow of deathly essence coursing through him and the endless essence flowing from his Master.","He could draw everything from his Master as assets were not an issue for him.","His Master.","The True Emperor of Quintessence!","His Master concentrated on many things apart from death that he didn't really need to.","Ra'Zan knew this innately as he had appeared when his Master beckoned throughout his reign, but he didn't stay out for long.","He wanted to let his Master know that he didn't need to focus on anything else.","He wanted to let his Master know that if he just concentrated on Death...all of his problems would be solved!","'Ka Ka Ka! Why am I thinking so much? I only need to let death flow through me!'","...!","BZZT!","He grasped the crystalline bone staff in his hands.","Tendrils of verdant and black light overflowed as his raging verdant flames dimmed!","The bone crown spinning atop his skull flashed with brilliance as within the body of the Haven Lich Ra'Zan, an illusory Thanatos Perennial Yggdrasils of Extremity becoming ever real!","He was embodying it as at this moment, he let the death he was used to so much flow freely into the concepts that made this Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity.","He saw how they were intricately connected as his authority surged at their very stable center as the deathly authority at his core guided all of these 21 concepts to converge at the very center of the illusory Yggdrasil of Extremity as in the next moment...he breathed only death with the Methodology belonging to his master. And thereafter...","CRACK!","Something bloomed at the very center.","It was akin to a Singularity being born as for Ra'Zan, it was another Heart.","It was akin to a Singularity being born as for Ra'Zan, it was another Heart.","A Vessel of Life and Death!","With it, Ra'Zan took reign and resonated all 21 Concepts that made Thanatos to a terrifying degree- more so than his Master currently did as the Thanatos Perennial Yggdrasils of Extremity solidified in his body!","He wanted to let his Master know. And so he let his actions speak for themselves.","'Ka Ka Ka! Yes...this is it. This is death!'","Ra'Zan bellowed out in his mind as he felt his Values break past 10,000 and begin to climb upwards.","He grasped Recorded Histories of Deaths in the very Aeonic Annals of Extremity and drew them to himself as his visage began to grow larger and more dominating, his flaming sockets coming to focus on Ahpuch and the many enemies before it as his skeletal staff waved forward.","'Here is a peek of death and madness...a reflection of my mind as I lay inactive all this time!'","...!"]},{"number":2552,"title":"Chapter 2552: Chapter 2551 Madness! II","paragraphs":["2551 Madness! II","[The Quintessential Thanatos Embodiment- Thanatos Haven Lich Ra'Zan, has spurred a Mutation in the center of the Quintessential Absolute Thanatos Dynamis of Extremity!]","[Thanatos Haven Lich Ra'Zan is circulating the core concept of his existence across the Quintessential AbsoluteThanatos Dynamis of Extremity, giving birth to the Thanatos Vessel of Life and Death that culminates all of his achievements.]","[The feature of Quintessential Thanatos Embodiment has independently undergone Quintessential advancement!]","[Many more possibilities and tools are now accessible in the hands of the Thanatos Haven Lich Ra'Zan.]","The prompts cascaded one after another before Noah's eyes as he smiled.","And he could only smile as this was something he had caught glimpses of!","Now, he wanted to see just how stupendous it could grow to be.","—","Ahpuch.","This was the name he proclaimed for himself when he was born.","A name that meant death, disaster, and destruction.","And in the region he was currently in, there was a dense amount of death and destruction!","Within this atmosphere and the enemy Lifeforms rising beside the True Emperor of Quintessence, Ahpuch could feel the chains of the unreachable 17th Boundary Layer of Destruction loosening!","It told him that so long as he destroyed everything here...there was a chance.","And this was a chance he wouldn't miss.","He gazed at the massive form of a Draconic Elephantine Ender, and three Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that were bright in their own right, one of them being among those he had half-heartedly chased earlier as he saw they would lead him to a grander path.","A meeting of the moment this Apex War unfolded and the visage of the True Emperor of Quintessence!","Now, they stood before him against him as they made grand moves.","Now he...would make his own grand move and show them how far out of their depths they were.","That the one to face him had yet to step up!","That when he merely moved toward them, they would be forced to move back!","He took a step forward.","And...","HOONG!","Amidst the destruction, a terrifying authority of nothingness shot forth from him like an expanding bubble.","It was none other than Vacuous Hyperversal Authority!","The moment it erupted from him, the four beings standing before his path had their gazes change as their bodies glimmered with defensive brilliance and forcefully moved back.","And how could they not? Their very Souls screamed danger from being enveloped by the authority outside of space, time, and reality itself!","\"Fight.\"","His voice rose out across the battlefield for the first time as it thundered with brilliance.","Fight.","Was he telling the battalions of the Apex Aeonic Elders behind him this?","He took another step, and the area of effect of the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority became ever grander and vaster as the four beings standing before him were pushed further back!","The visage of Aurelia had an enraged and distasteful expression while Hyperion and the others were somber.","\"Fight!\"","Ahpuch called out again, this time with even more ferocity as he took a large stride forward!","The enemies before him were pushed back past a certain dazzling multicolored throne and the figures of the self-proclaimed First Commander of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, as well as the Undead Entity he had called out.","They were the only ones that didn't move a single step backwards as Ahpuch's eyes shone with brilliance.","His current armaments burned into crimson flames as the authority of Destruction transformed into a heavy armor that covered all parts of his body apart from his head.","His hair now burned crimson and black as his eyes shone like burning suns.","The immense aura of Destruction burned brightly around him as with the periphery of the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority about to spill into the Armies of the True Emperor of Quintessence, he called out for the third time.","\"Fight!\"","...!","Before his word even ended, the visage of Alexander King raised his skull staff and pointed out.","And from it, a similar eruption of nothingness erupted in a grand show of glory!","It was another being who could use Vacuous Hyperversal Authority- or at least had access to it as Ahpuch could tell its form was a bit different!","A circular domain of nothingness tinged with destruction barreled down as another domain of nothingness tinged with brilliance erupted out to stop it, a shocking clash erupting out as reality began to break down!","BZZZT!","The domains didn't even touch.","Just nearing each other caused the erasure of reality between them as this junction of space seemed like a massive fissure erupted- the crimson silver skies above being parted and seething out while the earth below that had begun to be covered by the verdant obsidian mist of death did the same.","It felt like the battlefield was divided into two halves at such a moment as the masses of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms stood up with their mouths snapping open.","They couldn't sit still for this.","They couldn't not focus and observe this grandeur!","\"Vacuous Hyperversal Authority...\"","The Priestess Persephone uttered out in a far corner away from the battlefield as she wasn't the only one.","Many eyes watched the clash of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority unleashed by two beings as how frequently seen was such an authority?","How important were the personages that held it?","A clash of this authority alone divided the battlefield in half as two central forces that shone like burning suns gazed at each other, the terrifying First Commander of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven adorned in his bone Armaments spoke out with majesty.","\"Fight, you say...but this will not be a fight. This will only be a trampling.\"","WAA!","The voice was filled with confidence as why was this? The enemy was powerful. The Apex Elders were veterans of the battlefield with a myriad of Dynamis of Extremity under their banner!","So what gave the forces of the True Emperor of Quintessence so much confidence?","SHIING!","On the side of the True Emperor of Quintessence calmly sitting on his throne, 7 points in space had long since ruptured into massive obsidian portals as at this point, blazing auras in titanic forms began to step out.","And before anyone else could make a move, a raspy voice that had its own portals formed cackled as its voice sought to dominate the battlefield!","[Death.]","WAA!","[There shall only be death.]","The voice was raspy as the Haven Lich Ra'Zan moved.","A lich controlled a myriad of things to do with death, but did this only mean summoning legions of undead?","The answer was a resounding no.","Death came in many forms.","And the Thanatos Haven Lich Ra'Zan sought to show these uncultured beings just how many forms death could take as his staff began to wave amidst the clash of the Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities, his voice ringing out multiple times over!","[Haven Curse of Corruption.]","...!","[Unrecorded Plague of the End.]","[Aura of Fear.]","[Sea of Agony.]","One after another!","Utterly debilitating abilities bloomed as a billowing smoke of death began to surge out like waves as at this moment, the two buzzing domains of the Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities were canceled out as the waves of death thundered down upon the masses like an endless sea!"]},{"number":2553,"title":"Chapter 2553: Chapter 2552 Madness! III","paragraphs":["2552 Madness! III","The shocking scenes of the Apex Battlefield flowed like films on an illusory screen as multiple areas were focused on and seen with utmost clarity- the clashing of Dynamis of Extremity and Boundaries felt as if the watchers were right there in the midst of the battle.","The illusory screen showing the scene of the clash between the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority of Ahpuch and Alexander had taken center point, while the Haven Lich Ra'Zan who had begun to release waves of deathly authority over the whole Battlefield took another major focus on his own screen!","As for those watching...","[The battle has begun for a little while now. Can you see what the outcome would be?]","The voice of an aged Hyperversal Extremity thundered out.","He was adorned in a light red and white robe that held the burning symbol of infinity behind it, a horn rising on his forehead that looked quite similar to the one of the woman sitting before him.","Around the illusory screens they were viewing, a blazing flames seethed as molten mountains and burning suns were spread out all around, all of them pulsing with tremendous Authority of heat that was directed and focused on the single figure of Ayame's Main Body!","She was adorned in a light white gown as her expression was hardened, tremendous heat flowing over her skin as multiple Boundaries were forcefully being cycled through her body to try and achieve nothing else other than the Convergence of enough Boundaries to form an Absolute Seed of Extremity.","Her Grandfather stood behind her as with the aid of a being like him who held too many Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, it was only an inevitability!","What she was doing now was the same as many other powerful Scions- sending their Aeonic Soul Clones to observe the changes of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution to watch the Apex War unfolding while their main bodies accepted the support of their Clan or Inheritance to undergo a thorough advancement in power.","At this moment, Ayame's Grandfather had asked her the very hard question of whether she could already see the outcome of this battle!","Sensing a bit of hesitation from her, the Hyperversal Extremity with a brooding aura that burned vigorously among any Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities laughed and spoke lightly.","[Little Ayame, do not let the veiled records of a single being break your confidence. You can see the strands of all reality and read them through the Aeonic Annals of Extremity. So now...I want you to provide me with a thorough analysis of the battle. Of all the pieces involved.]","WAA!","The words roused Ayame out of her stupor as she nodded.","She could read and see many things about reality as after gazing at the many moving pieces, she began.","\"In any battle with Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, victory is truly decided by the strongest commander leading a side. So long as their Boundary Layers are higher, their closer ties to Extremity will ensure that they oppress the enemy commander as their authority will also spill over to their soldiers. In this case, this Apex War's winner should be Ahpuch as he holds multiple Boundaries at the 16th Layer, holds Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, and very likely had his own Absolute Seed Extremity forged!\"","...!","Ayame spoke calmly as she felt her Grandfather smile behind her, and she continued.","\"But...this Apex War is different. The enemy Ahpuch and the forces backing him are facing...my eyes tell me that he shouldn't have exceeded the 13th Boundary Layer. And yet, the Commander wields an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as well, and multiple people on his side also wield Absolute Dynamis of Extremity. This acts to balance the scales somewhat, but then...there comes the effectiveness and uniqueness of one Absolute Dynamis of Extremity that was shown on the side of the True Emperor of Quintessence.\"","Her words came out rapidly as her Grandfather's deep voice rang out behind her.","[Nice catch. Yes...from the Records he did not hide, he termed it the Thanatos Absolute Dynamis of Extremity. This is likely not a normal Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, but one that has the Convergence of at least 20 concepts. Something that only pristinely talented Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who have achieved the 17th Layer and are on the cusp of Extremity can ever fathom to achieve...something that you can more easily do as a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity.]","As the two of them spoke, their eyes came to focus on the visage of Alexander King and the Haven Lich Ra'Zan, as well as the 7 cracks in the skies that showed off another eruption of this Thanatos Absolute Dynamis of Extremity \"Now, the outcome of the battle has become centered on the pieces connected to this unique Absolute Dynamis of Extremity. I could barely grasp the Recorded History of the First Commander to be Alexander King as the Entity he called out should be known as a Haven Lich. Their abilities will cause the favor of this War to tip towards them if Ahpuch and the truly powerful Elder Apex Aeonic Lifeforms do not stop their abilities from spreading...\"","As she spoke, they observed the dense authority of death cast by the Haven Lich to descend on a wide area.","It washed over the visage of Ahpuch and then spread onto the 200 Avernus Clan Elders, going even further to also land on the 300 Singularity Overseer Elders as their bodies lit up with their own defensive authorities to resist it!","When reading the deathly authority with the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, Ayame's eyes felt troubled as she continued.","\"The authority is concentrated as plagues and curses that lower and restrict the authority of their targets. This Haven Lich should have spent a lot of its Soul Values to cast such wide ranging debuff abilities, and yet...\"","KA KA KA!","They heard the cackling laugh through the screen as this Lich continued to wave its staff badly, illusory totems cackling just like it erupting out by the hundreds as they went to settle above the heads of anyone who couldn't resist the authority of the Absolute Dynamis of Extremity it held!","The Wills and souls of the affected Avernus and Singularity Overseer Elders then faced constant mental attack abilities imposing feelings of inferiority and madness, their eyes becoming somber as they released their own authority to be rid of this negative effect!","Their essence flowed slower as they faced horrific deathly plaques and curses, and the activation of their abilities could at times fizzle and not unfold.","\"The authorities the Haven Lich is releasing are working to lower the capabilities of their enemy forces, while there are also the Prince Tier and King Tier Thanatos Vassals I saw before making their moves...\"","As she spoke, Ayame centered on another screen that showed the Void Dracolich releasing a Poison Breath towards the Apex Astral Leviathans carrying Elder Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, the Chaos Nightwalker motioning with his hands as massive glacial sword formed in the skies and also rained down death!","Meanwhile, the Legions of Prince Tier Thanatos Vassal moved like Undead waves of a sea as they tried to drown much more powerful Elder Lifeforms by simply overpowering them with numbers!","[Yes.] Her Grandfather nodded behind her as he accepted her analysis so far.","[The ability to control the battlefield is extremely crucial, and so far, the side of the True Emperor of Quintessence has taken the reins of control, even if the other side has more powerful Lifeforms. And since they didn't stop another capability of this distinctive Thanatos Dynamis of Extremity being expressed...]","As he spoke, he focused on the 7 points of light that came to be after Alexander King called out [Chthonian Sinners of Thanatos].","From the cracks in space, heavy auras of Entities slightly exceeding the power of common Grand Elders erupted out as a mere glance of their bodies showed grotesque-looking Lifeforms of massive size rush out with mad intent for battle!","It caused everything to seem utterly chaotic as their appearance made the whole battlefield descend into even more chaos and madness.","This wasn't to mention that behind the Haven Lich Ra'Zan, portals multiplied and bloomed as Legions of Prince Tier Thanatos Vassals began to surge out like endless tides!","[The Authority of Death and Destruction...is a distinctive one as something at this magnitude has only been exhibited by the Hyperversal Extremity of Necromancy in the Haven of Penumbra. To have a Rising Junior express its authority like this already...]","...!"]},{"number":2554,"title":"Chapter 2554: Chapter 2553 Madness! IV","paragraphs":["A Rising Junior expressing the authority of Death so proficiently!","The eyes of Ayame's Grandfather shone brightly as Hyperversal Extremity Authority continued to flow from him and into Ayame.","{Continue.}","He beckoned for Ayame to continue her analysis as she focused whole gazing at the constantly changing battlefield.","\"The different forces have fractured into their own battles, and now...it seems more casualties are about to appear- this result brought about by the wide ranging debuff abilities of the Haven Lich and the soldiers of the True Emperor of Quintessence not letting opportunity go to waste...\"","As she spoke, her eyes came to focus on a screen that showed Commander Vladic and his Noblesse Apex Aeonic Lifeforms surrounded by cackling illusory skulls as they rotated their Dynamis of Extremity to hold back its effects, their figures trying to stay close to the Legions of Singularity Overseers with their Apex Astral Leviathans as at this time, an Apex Aeonic Noblesse erupted with power to prevent the deathly authorities of the Haven Lich from reaching him!","He breathed heavily as the moment he thought he could catch his breath...","CRUNCH!","A cerulean blue light flashed.","Over a thousand Apex Aeonic Damage Values flashed as a viscous blue slimy light instantly chomped onto half of his whole body, his Aspects of Existence buzzing and experiencing a disconnect as in shock, his soul was destroyed right after!","Half of his body was missing as on the side, a blue slime chewed with a giddy light! The lifeless body began to fall from the skies at this time when a moment later, the verdant black mist of death that had spread across the battlefield wrapped around it.","The authority that Alexander King had released!","It seemed to be ever present on the battlefield as from the dead body of the Noblesse, deathly energies erupted out as a roar followed next, the skeletal form of another Void Dracolich rising from it as a third King Tier Thanatos Vassal was born!","On the side, Commander Vladic and others were ashen as before they could even react...","RAA!","A cry boomed out beside them as a lustrous golden penguin used its flippers to swing a golden Greataxe down!","\"Death, and more death.\"","Ayame spoke as she looked at the scenes before her.","\"The more time passes and the more deaths that occur, the more favorable this War becomes for Osmont. Even if they are more powerful, they will get drowned by the Legions of Undead that hold no fear of death, and these massive creatures I could only find records of as Enders who seem to not fear death either. Currently, the ball is in Ahpuch's court if he wishes to reverse the dominance of his enemy before it is too late. The answer to this lies in him using his edge as someone who had achieved the 16th Boundary Layer, if he doesn't- oh?\"","Ayame's words came to a halt.","They focused on the screen showing Ahpuch as he gazed at the unfolding battle with a smile.","And he then spoke.","\"The more death and destruction there is, the more powerful I am too, you know?\"","He spoke while bringing his right hand before his chest as if he wanted to grasp his beating heart, his eyes closing as he uttered out.","{Domain Expansion- Interminable Destruction}","...!","THUMP!","A beat of a heart was heard.","And the whole battlefield changed!","In a matter of an instant, the vast Apex Battlefield and even close to the edges of it where the Wills of watching existences were hidden- an astonishing domain was laid down!","It covered everything in an instant.","\"Domain Expansion,\" Ayame uttered with a somber expression as Ahpuch had finally made a genuine move.","\"Something achievable commonly at the 17th Boundary Layer, but some Concepts can attain it earlier if they are unique enough. It allows one to add the might of a Dynamis of Extremity onto an existing Boundary Concept and expand it to an alarming degree, granting a domain of Absolute Control where one can instantly display their power across it. Even the surrounding reality will bend and conform to the truth of the imposed Dynamis and Concept...\"","As she spoke, the scene before them greatly changed as massive crimson pillars of flames manifested across the Apex Battlefield a moment after the Interminable Destruction domain was expanded!","Interminable! This was the Absolute Dynamis of Extremity that Ahpuch grasped. And Destruction was his core concept as his Domain Expansion was Interminable Destruction!","Endless Destruction.","So long as one was within it...","BOOM!","The dense appearing crimson pillars of flames pulsed as they released hellish torrential storms of destruction that washed over the Prince Tier Thanatos Vassals- their skeletal structure facing over a thousand Apex Damage Values as their bones cracked and melted under the banner of Destruction!","ROAR!","The two Void Dracolich bellowed out as a dozen crimson pillars of Destruction appeared around each of them, the torrential waves of power they released ripping apart their wings as it seemed soon enough, they would face Destruction.","And the 300 Enders as well as the 200 Battalion of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms adorned in golden Armament that truly seemed like Quasi-Extremity Relics faced their first setbacks as their bodies were forced to go on the defensive for the first time.","Golden grandeur pulsed from them as a vast majority were knocked back, their barriers destroyed as their Vitality Values took a hit!","And this was only the first wave of torrential flames of Destruction from the {Domain Expansion- Interminable Destruction}.","When the next one came...","\"Ahpuch has finally made a correct move and placed his enemies in a predicament, if Alexander King or his summoned Haven Lich do not pull out something to-...!\"","Her eyes opened wide.","Amidst the burning pillars of Destruction and wide range torrential flames of a not yet fully established domain, the cackling of the Haven Lich could be heard.","{Did I not say there would only be death?}","BZZT!","His aura soared.","The flaming bone crown atop him spun fervently as he commandeered his Master's {Quintessential Undead Rise}","From the ashes of bones of the dead Prince Tier Thanatos Vassals and King Tier Thanatos Vassals, the lush black light expanded in concentration as what was destroyed reformed again.","And this time, the deathly energies were doubled as instead of a single Thanatos Vassal rising...two could be seen from a single spot!","Two reforming Void Dracolich became 4.","Over ten thousand more Prince Tier Thanatos Vassals last appeared as the Battlefield became even more chaotic!","At the same time, 7 massive points of light emerged and made their presence known.","One was a particularly frightening one as while shaped like a circular plane of Existence- an Entity whose body was made up of pulsing crimson black meat vibrating with tendrils of the Absolute Thanatos Dynamis of Extremity moved.","Its circular meaty visage held no eyes, with one seeing a single structure forming from one end to another as it was...a mouth. On its backside, a burning symbol reading {GLUTTONY} could be seen as it radiated terror!","The mouth on the front side suddenly opened in a devilish grin to reveal horribly sharp teeth and an endless abyss, this single summoned creature out of Seven new ones beginning to inhale as shockingly...the crimson flaming pillars nearby began to be sucked towards its abyssal jaws endlessly.","...!","The battle was constantly changing.","Ayame and many others watched it and analyzed every move made as just when it seemed the dominance of the battle would shift from one side to another, magnificent changes bloomed!","But there were still the injured forces of the True Emperor of Quintessence that may very well start seeing some deaths due to the Interminable Destruction Domain laid out by Ahpuch in the next moment when it released another one of its torrential waves of Destruction.","At such a moment, a being stood up from the backside of a Draconian Phoenix as a white coat billowed gloriously in the wind.","His voice was barely discerned amidst the chaotic war, but it buzzed out nonetheless!","{All Aspect Hyperversal Heal}.","...!","A lush blue light of life and grandeur emerged amidst all the death.","And the troops of the True Emperor of Quintessence...were enveloped by such a thick aura of life that some weaker Apex Aeonic Lifeforms were blinded!"]},{"number":2555,"title":"Chapter 2555: Chapter 2554 Demon! I","paragraphs":["2554 Demon! I","What was his purpose?","When the blue planet was undergoing an Apocalypse, Dr. Hall thought it was to rescue lives.","When he came in contact with the True Emperor of Quintessence, he once more sought his purpose.","He didn't know if he truly found it yet, but something would always remain true.","He was a doctor.","And he saved lives.","THUMP!","He felt his beating heart churning essence like an engine as Boundaries and a Dynamis of Extremity coursed through him!","[All Aspect Hyperversal Heal].","His voice was light, yet its grandeur and what it called forth was instantly applied to all beings deemed as Allies- wondrous prompts rising up before him.","[All Allies have restored 100% in all Aspects.]","Not just Vitality Values, but even soul values were recovered along with any deficient Aspects. But it went further than that.","[300% of the Maximum Vitality Values of the target will also be generated as Reserve Vitality Values for the next hour.]","...!","Brilliance unfolded before his eyes, but this wasn't it. This wasn't enough for what his very soul knew was the genuine nature of all things.","So he continued.","[Hyperversal Grace of Inarius.]","His Soul Values depleted greatly!","Brilliant verdant light now unfolded and bathed over the masses as the Domain Expansion of Ahpuch became ever-solidified.","And...","[Under the Grace of Inarius, the attachment of Death Reversal has been applied to all Allies once for the next hour.]","[When Death Reversal is triggered, the emptied Vitality Values will be returned to the highest as 500% of the Maximum Vitality Values will also be added as Reserve Vitality Values, with All Aspects of the target experiencing a 200% rise for 10 seconds after Death Reversal.]","...!","Yes.","This was the route he sought, even though it was nowhere near complete. His research in Essensology, Biochemistry, Pharmacology, and many more concepts had brought him here, but he knew he could go further!","His piercing eyes watched as the Hyperversal Grace of Inarius settled above the heads of himself and all Allies as illusory flaming green wings of light, the aura of overabundance of lifeforce waving out as it seemed to trigger the existence who had laid out a terrifying Domain.","He gazed at the visage of Alexander King pulsing with grandeur as well as the Haven Lich cackling beside him as he bellowed out.","\"Just as you can the Legions behind me...I can also target those you hold dear.\"","WAA!","His eyes pulsed with destruction as waves of power unfurled.","[Dance of Destruction].","BZZT!","The hundreds of crimson pillars of destruction across the expanded domain blazed and expanded. They then began to move across space like stanchions of destruction, a few dozen being devoured by the Chthonian Sinner of Thanatos labeled as [GLUTTONY], but the rest of them danced wildly as they released torrential waves of power with thousands of Apex Damage Values!","They ignored the Avernus and Singularity Overseer Elders along with the Noblesse as the lyrics would surely reap the lives of the people of the True Emperor of Quintessence- finally having some beings die on his side as the dominance of the battle would tilt yet again.","Or so it should have been.","The torrential waves of Destruction swept through the forces of the True Emperor of Quintessence as the might of an existence who had reached the 16th Boundary Layer was shown.","He delivered an excess of 8,000 Apex Damage Values not to a single target...","but to hundreds of targets simultaneously!","Such a move was enough to wipe out hundreds of common Grand Elders of an Inheritance as the result...","\"Huh?\"","Was not the mass demise and destruction they expected.","The illusory verdant flaming wings above the heads of the Endeds and beings adorned in golden Armaments flashed.","A cry of Phoenix erupted out as pillars of verdant flames rose from their bodies, their life forces just as exuberant as ever!","The Interminable Destruction Domain settled back with its crimson pillars becoming stationary again, but all were shocked to see absolutely no damage or deaths done to the other side!","And instead, they seemed more organized than ever as at this moment, a light of destiny erupted out.","As if it was saying that it was time.","\"Gather!\"","The cry of the Son of Destiny erupted out.","Henry Osmont called out as a myriad of Vassals adorned in Quintessential Loot Seeker's Regalia Set came behind him, their bodies still surrounded by flaming verdant pillars of light as the boosts of the Hyperversal Grace of Inarius settled in since [Death Reversal] was triggered!","They were currently at their most powerful as their stats had gained a 200% boost for the next few seconds due to the Grace of Inarius, and the Son of Destiny called for them to gather and use this moment to the fullest.","Others lined up behind Aurelia, Orion, Caesar, and many Lernaeans came to group behind Maximilian!","Each of them were connected to thin strings of destiny that placed them where they needed to be as while their bodies shone with auras of intense life and grandeur, Henry's voice rang out again.","\"Be ready to initiate the last set effects when prompted.\"","...!","The last set effect.","The Quintessential Loot Seeker's Regalia Set had many boons, with the boon for adorning all 6 equipment still being born on the last day after Aurelia augmented all of them.","They could now use it freely as it was just as restrictive as it was mighty!","[When 6 Set Items are equipped, any enemy killed grants +1,000 Quintessential Loot Experience Points that can be utilized towards the progression of Boundaries up to the 13th Boundary Layer. A Quintessential Banner of Loot will also form above you as it adds +750 Quintessential Hyperversal Loot Damage Values to all attacks and abilities you release. Once every minute, you can release the Rage of Loot Seeker's Smite that thunders out as an area of effect ability capable of dealing 2,000 Quintessential Hyperversal Loot Damage Values, with any targeted enemies perishing from it having a 50% Chance to Trigger the Explosion of Loot effect...]","...!"]},{"number":2556,"title":"Chapter 2556: Chapter 2555 Demon! II","paragraphs":["2555 Demon! II","The eyes of the Son of Destiny flashed.","He saw the terrifying Avernus and Singularity Overseer Elders, as well as the few Apex Aeonic Noblesse struggling to survive amidst this battle.","And his body glimmered with brilliance as he sent commands with destiny.","His Greataxe thundered down as behind him, Kazuhiko, Athena, Eowyn, Ophelia, and many others swung their Greataxes down at the same time!","They triggered the Rage of the Loot Seeker's Smite as above them, the sound of thunder echoed as tendrils of golden lightning formed like a churning sea.","They threw it out simultaneously.","A single Smite should have held a few thousand Quintessential Hyperversal Loot Damage Values, and yet tens of them formed together all once as it seemed like a golden storm formed from above that pulsed with tens of thousands of Damage Values, and it rained down on the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms on the other side of the battlefield like a butcher's knife!","\"OOOH!\"","The Apex Aeonic Lifeforms felt a level of unprecedented danger as before any could react, the golden thundering Smite struck down in one region and carved a path as shockingly, Blood and gore erupted out.","The Rage of Loot Seeker's Smite carved out a path of mass death as for the first time, the massive Apex Astral Leviathans and the Singularity Overseer Elders standing atop them faced casualties, over 15 perishing at this moment!","On the side of the Avernus Clan Elders, 4 were in the proximity of this region as they were drowned in the tens of thousands of Damage Values raining down simultaneously.","But this wasn't all.","Just as quickly as the first one had formed and thundered out...","ROAAR!","The thundering cry of another cluster of Smites appeared as after the group led by Henry utilized their, the group led by Aurelia swung down their axes in sequence as well.","Before the battlefield could even absorb what had happened!","\"Ah...!\"","\"Gather!\"","Domains of Boundaries were shredded under the tendrils of Quintessential Hyperversal Loot Damage Values, the group led by Orion following Aurelia as one after another, clusters of heavy Damage Values cleaved across the battlefield in a shocking turn of events.","Barely a few lives were reaped after the Legions of Reverend Emperors fell to the cleaving of destiny early on with very few Apex Aeonic Lifeforms perishing, and yet now...dozens began to perish as death and destruction ran rampant!","And amidst all of this death...","KA KA KA!","The cackling of a Haven Lich could be heard as the dismembered bodies of Apex Astral Leviathans, Singularity Overseer Elders, and the few perishing Avernus Clan Elders floated in space while the verdant obsidian smoke of Thanatos filled them.","At the same time, the visage of Alexander King began to move as he stared at the figure of Ahpuch whose eyes currently burned with a destructive light of surprise at the clusters of heavy Damage Values being released by the forces of his enemy.","\"Domain Expansion?\"","His voice was cold and filled with dominance as he moved to enact what he had read in the Unrecorded Histories not too long ago.","\"What is a mere Domain Expansion under the light of Loot?\"","...!","A light of clear gold light erupted from him as it was vastly different from the verdant obsidian light of death he had been releasing this whole time.","It was...","\"Another Absolute Dynamis of Extremity!?\"","Clamor seethed in the faraway regions of those watching as in disbelief, they saw this First Commander of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven erupt out with yet another Absolute Dynamis of Extremity!","Was it so easy to forge these pristine authorities now?","Could anyone just sit and do it as they wished?!","Their cries weren't answered as instead, the heavy voice of Alexander King thundered out.","[Hyperversal Plundering].","...!","A clear gold light erupted out as it carried the character of another Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.","Noah knew this Dynamis very well as its light was no less powerful than the Thanatos Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity!","Being one of the last few things he forged before the Apex War began, it was the Lotra Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity!","Lotra.","A single word, and yet it represented plundering, loot, or the most precious spoils!","One of its features was Hyperversal Plundering.","An ability that allowed Noah to plunder anything the authority of Lotra covered, whether that be a Person, Reality, or Concept. He could even Loot the Recorded Histories of defeated enemies whose lives were under his hands!","And what he plundered...could be turned into Hyperversal Lotra Caches filled with the most pristine Loot, or it could be made his.","What he plundered could be made his!","At this moment, he designated the Domain Expansion- Interminable Destruction as the target of Hyperversal Plundering.","The light of gold bathed everything as the skies that rained down golden tendrils of Smites from his Vassals became tainted entirely gold.","And from above...an illusory golden hand whose skin seemed to be made of bejeweled crystalline light manifested.","A golden hand whose fingers that were outstretched began to close and come together at this moment as if it was plucking something from the earth!","And the crimson light released by Ahpuch's Domain Expansion began to be twisted.","The myriad of crimson pillars of light instantly lost their magnificence as if they had been plucked from the space they were anchored in, the authority of the Interminable Absolute Dynamis of Extremity wrapping around this domain not being able to stop the authority of the Lotra Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity as the results of [Hyperversal Plundering] were fully carried out!","[The Manifested Domain Expansion- Interminable Destruction, has been plundered.]","[The Concepts and Pathway to form the Interminable Absolute Seed of Extremity have been Recorded.]","[The Authority of Domain Expansion has been Recorded.]","...!","An astonishing result was obtained.","Boundless surges of information coursed within Noah's mind in an instant as on the Apex Battlefield, the appearance of Ahpuch with eyes changing from astonishment to shock could be seen.","The displayed Domain Expansion he had called out entirely disappeared under the actions of a single being as Ahpuch's head was raised towards the skies, watching as a golden hand disappeared into oblivion just as quickly as it had come!","And then, he and many others heard two words that caused their minds to buzz in disbelief.","The words came from the appearance of Alexander King whose left hand came to land on his chest as he felt the beat of his Heart.","The Heart.","It turned out to be the instigator of this wondrous capability as at this moment, words that shouldn't come out of his mouth echoed and resounded out across the battlefield.","\"Domain Expansion.\"","...!"]},{"number":2557,"title":"Chapter 2557: Chapter 2556 Demon! III","paragraphs":["2556 Demon! III","[Domain Expansion]:: When sufficient strides have been taken towards Extremity, the resonance of one's Soul with advanced Boundary Layers gives way to the expansion of the Domains of Boundaries and Dynamis to an unfathomable level. For the cost of 80% of your current Soul Values coursing through and putting a strain on your Heart as the Domain Engine, the domain of a Dynamis can be further expanded by adding the definition of a concept to it- or vice versa. It is a closer interplay between concepts and Dynamis as one gets closer to Extremity, with the resulting domain allowing your Will to be expressed anywhere within it instantly for 1 minute. The expanded Domain allows you to use all skills and abilities of the chosen Dynamis and Concept of Extremity at no cost of Soul Values or any other resources, with your Will remaining anchored onto the expanded Domain to the extent that so long as it is not destroyed, your soul cannot entirely perish to any attacks. The true power and extent of the cast Domain Expansion truly depend on the Dynamis and Concept of Extremity put together as something with great resonance can give birth to a domain that will cause one's enemies to only despair...","80% of one's Soul Values to cast. It was a heavy cost, and the truly powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms paid this cost in order to win difficult battles.","And in exchange, one didn't have to worry about the cost of any resources relating to the Dynamis and Concept of Extremity they utilized to make this domain!","They could dish out waves of their Damage Values as Ahpuch had begun to do just this.","He released torrential storms of destruction that should have reaped the lives of Noah's Vassals were it not for the existence adorned in a white coat giving off an aura of abundant life.","But this wasn't an issue for Ahpuch as he could easily call forth the storms of destruction again since for the next minute...it didn't have a cost.","But before this could be done, an illusory bejeweled golden hand descended from the skies and...canceled his domain.","When Ahpuch tried to connect and call upon it again, he felt that he couldn't even enact it again at this time as it was truly canceled out.","Canceled!","An expanded domain could be canceled?!","This question buzzed in the minds of many as many Apex Aeonic Lifeforms learned of this possibility today.","But what was even more obscene was that after a certain being had canceled his expanded domain, he spoke out words he should in no way be capable of.","\"Domain Expansion.\"","...!","\"Infinity...Thanatos.\"","BOOOM!","[Domain Expansion- Infinity Thanatos]!","The Quintessential Absolute Thanatos Dynamis of Extremity, and it went further on to be defined with a ridiculous concept of Extremity.","Infinity.","What exactly would the result of such a thing be?","—","[Mmm...]","Extremity Marcellus' eyes flashed sharply the moment the words of [Domain Expansion] were uttered by Alexander King.","[Did you all see what he did?]","He asked in a calm fashion as the Wills of Genesis Hyperversal Extremities around the feathery thrones on the marbled floor of this domain gazed forward with a light of marvel.","[He forcefully took the Record of Domain Expansion as an instant later, he expressed it with his own soul. Authority like this...should be feasible with Unique Absolute Dynamis of Extremity that Hyperversal Extremities can forge. What he is doing now is just...]","The words of the Genesis Hyperversal Extremity were left unsaid as Marcellus nodded.","His aged face seemed to have lost a few wrinkles as he spoke out words that caused immense silence to descend in the surroundings.","[Now, had our Apex Aeonic Elders been on this Battlefield...what would be their fates?]","[...]","[...]","A question that couldn't be answered.","A question that the Genesis Institute of Extremity could at least say they escaped the consequences of, but other beings could not do the same!","Across the folds of space.","In the lands of the Planeswalkers, within an isolated domain.","Devouring and Kabul watched the screens showing the events of the Apex Battlefield with cold eyes as to their right, the manifested Will of another Hyperversal Extremity of the Singularity Overseers could be seen.","[Are we still treating this as a minor and insignificant scuffle? We officially used the name of our Inheritance and a portion of our forces meant for the Culmination Step here. Some have begun to die as the dominance that should be seen on the battlefield...none of it is with them.]","WAA!","The voice was sharp and ferocious as it was inquiring and already placing a lot of the blame on Devouring!","[Devouring...I hope you realize that you will be the one to fully answer for everything if 300 Elders and Apex Astral Leviathans begin to be butchered.]","...!","Elders. Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","They weren't just dredges as they made a notable portion of the potency of their Inheritance- and they couldn't just watch them be butchered!","At this juncture, Devouring snorted with a thrum of potency as he replied.","[Keep watch. If they do not reverse the flow of battle and take the lead, we shall make a move.]","[We?] The eyes of the Hyperversal Will besides Devouring and Kabul scoffed at the inclusion as it continued.","[Interference means defying an Adjudicator. What makes you think I would do such a thing to cover up for your mistakes?]","Yes!","Any outside interventions after an Apex War had begun were not allowed as for them to do this, it would mean they were directly going against the presiding judge of this War!","Someone who had already made her stance and standing clear before the War even began.","At the words of the Hyperversal Extremity beside him, Devouring smiled as his eyes continued to scour the battlefield for someone specific.","[My mistakes? I think you mean our mistakes. And whether it be triumph or defeat...did the Singularity Overseer Overlord not express his dislike towards the oh so great Adjudicator of Dissolution? This error can simply be turned into an opportunity to finally start the steps of correcting the mistake of her promotion as an Adjudicator.]","...!"]},{"number":2558,"title":"Chapter 2558: Chapter 2557 Demon! IV","paragraphs":["2557 Demon! IV","Dangerous words emanated from Devouring as the Hyperversal Extremity beside him was silent, but he could feel her deadly glare!","[You do not have to do anything, I will let the Singularity Overseer Overlord know myself if the Apex War turns any more unfavorable.]","[...]","Devouring had made a choice as he stuck to it.","But all this time, his gaze continued to search for the being who contained one of the reasons why he was here.","The being with the Innate Pellucid Extremity Foundation from the Quasarian Lineage!","She was the solution to him attaining Extremity in another Source of Chaos quickly as once he held Ruin in his grasp as well...he would be extremely distinguished among Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities!","But he had only seen the face of the father of this target.","His eyes flashed as they honed in on Caesar who was coincidentally among those releasing golden tendrils of light that tore apart Apex Astral Leviathans and the Singularity Overseer Elders standing atop them.","'If reality dissolves to an unsalvageable state...you shall be first.'","...!","His priorities remained in order.","And he watched the marvel that was the Domain Expansion unfold from an unknown being who seemed to brim with power!","—","Infinity Thanatos.","The moment three words ended, the earth in this region was painted black as the skies turned a deadly shade of green.","The obsidian earth felt extremely real as if an endlessly dark abyss had appeared- this abyss roaring out as if it were a raging sea as from it...a dense number of Thanatos Vassals began to rise.","From the verdant skies, a cry erupted out as the beak of a massive skeletal creature pointed out, the rest of its body following close at hand as the mythical Undead form of an austere beast showed itself off!","[Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassal- Infinite Nine-Flame Phoenix]","After Prince and King Tier Thanatos Vassal, an Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassal appeared at this moment as even though it was a first, it wouldn't be the last!","Its expansive skeletal wings spread out and cast a shadow over dozens of the Apex Astral Leviathans that felt their Origins tremble, the liquefied green skies it came from pulsing as more monstrosities began to descend.","[Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassal- Orc Fiend Devourer]","[Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassal- Abyss Vampyre Defiler]...","One after another, some descended from the green skies while others endlessly rose from the Obsidian earth!","The most potent ones were Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassal as dozens of King Tier Thanatos Vassals rose from the abyssal obsidian earth of the Infinity Thanatos Domain, their rise being followed by massive bony mountains rising up as each one releasing billowing waves of death!","And the Thanatos Vassals that were already on the Battlefield before the Domain Expansion was cast...","ROAAR!","They bellowed out grandly as the bodies of the Void Dracolich could be seen cracking- multiple new heads beginning to sprout from their bodies as their aura became even more ferocious.","They experienced an elevation in ranking as from King Tier Thanatos Vassal...","[Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassal- Dracolich of the End]","Droves of Thanatos Vassals flooded from above and below along with massive mountains of bones while any Thanatos Vassals already present experienced a thorough elevation.","The cackling of a Haven Lich could be heard in the distance as even more oppressive might was felt from it, the Seven Chthonian Sinners of Thanatos that had yet to fully show their grandeur also becoming surrounded by even more deathly auras as their presence alone utterly dominated the battlefield!","This...was just the first few nanoseconds of the activation of the Domain Expansion- Infinity Thanatos.","From the earth and skies, Undead continued to surge out endlessly as it seemed in no time, they would drown the entire battlefield with their presence!","\"...!\"","The scene was astonishing.","This was especially so due to the power that the Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassal expressed and their sheer number- since there were already dozens of them making an appearance so far!","[Name]:: Infinite Nine-Flame Phoenix (Emperor Tier)","[Realm]:: Fourth Haven of Thanatos","[Lineage]:: Quintessential Undead Thanatos Vassal","[Titles]:: Undead Nirvana, Slave of Thanatos, Death Seeker...","[Apex Thanatos Mana Value]:: 6,999","[Apex Thanatos Vitality Value]:: 6,999","[Apex Thanatos Soul Value]:: 6,999","[Apex Thanatos Defense Value]:: 6,999","[Apex Thanatos Damage Value]:: 6,999...","Their numerical stats alone exceeded the hundreds of Apex Aeonic Elders here, and were only slightly less if not matching the most potent Elder Commanders here.","They brought with them endless death and destruction as at thus moment, the mountains of bones that had risen from the skies and the earth pulsed before their tops shockingly erupted with viscous beams of poisonous verdant black liquified authority- authority that connected from one bone mountain to another as any enemies on its path...","-6,999!","-6,999!","The eyes of the True Emperor of Quintessence seated on the throne could see the ridiculously deadly Damage Values Per second for any poor Apex Aeonic Lifeform that was caught on the path of the rising Thanatos Mountains!","From the over a dozen bone mountains to materialized from the earth and skies, more than 50 Apex Aeonic Elders did not get out of the way in time even with their souls warning them of danger as they perished before they could escape the periphery of the cylindrical pillars of erupting liqufied authority!","The Apex Aeonic Noblesse who had barely been surviving this whole time...","their numbers were shaved down by 90% as only the sorry figure of Commander Vladic could be seen hurriedly and with fear tumbling from a mountain of bones, the Noblesse who survived with him being caught in the eruption as their bones rained down with his sorry figure that gazed around in utter horror.","The Unrecorded History had shown a version of events occurring, and even with the interference and changes brought about by the True Emperor of Quintessence, the future seemed intent on playing out as it should be.","Vladic stood on a mountain of bones as he didn't know which came from his Lineage, or which were simply a part of the terrifying domain of death.","He gazed around him to see mountains of bones and death as the Scions- nay the Elders of an Inheritance and a Clan were grouping together to withstand swathes of Undead as in a short period of time, they perished!","They died as an instant later, their bodies underwent a transformation as they become part of the very armies that killed them.","\"This...\"","Vladic was nearly numb to this astonishing scene as his soul trembled- feeling the aura of a certain horror near him at this moment.","His head rose to gaze up to see one of the main main attractions of this War coming his way.","Before this being...Commander Vladic felt utterly insignificant!"]},{"number":2559,"title":"Chapter 2559: Chapter 2558 Demon! V","paragraphs":["2558 Demon! V","His blank eyes rose to gaze at the immensity before him.","His bone Armament and the green obsidian light of one Absolute Dynamis of Extremity covered his body, and yet his eyes released a profound golden radiance of another Absolute Dynamis of Extremity!","His presence alone felt as if it didn't need to be here as the Thanatos Vassals swarming over would be more than enough.","And yet here he was.","The enemy commander that Osmont brought forth as his backing.","From the rising Thanatos Vassals, his name and difference had slowly begun ringing out as chants from the countless Legions of atrocities rising in his wake!","King.","King!","King!","It was overwhelming.","It was utterly soul-crushing for the enemies to hear as it felt the tolling of death growing ever closer!","As Vladic gazed towards the coming figure calling forth all of this disaster, he found his lips moving outside the control of his will as he spoke in a raspy voice.","\"Do you think they will let you do all this without repercussions? To violate my Lineage and the very Lifeforms of Inheritances? You...\"","SQUELCH!","With a beckoning of his hand, a deathly verdant black bone spear stabbed out and impaled the figure of Vladic, thousands of Damage Values erupting out in a contained fashion so as to not destroy him right away.","And from then on, an Unrecorded History becoming Recorded was accomplished as the being carrying it out strayed from its occurrence even if just a little.","His words were not the same.","\"I had already seen your death even before this War started, with my appearance here now only as an acknowledgment. You were one of the pieces to initiate this war and cause things to be where they are now, and for that- I thank you.\"","...!","His golden eyes dripping with the Lotra Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity felt as if they could see through everything, Commander Vladic feeling a sense of dread he had never felt before.","\"Relish this death.\"","WAA!","\"Because from it, you will rise to become even stronger. This...shall be your recompense and gift for making today's reality occur.\"","...!","His voice caused Vladic's soul to feel so extremely cold as he felt the essence of death coursing inside of him.","Was he...about to meet Euryale? Join her in death at the hands of the Commander of the being who had killed her?","\"You will not be meeting your beloved Euryale.\"","His heart felt immense dread as the voice of the First Commander of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven buzzed in his mind and Records for him alone to hear!","His eyes could barely focus to see a devilish smile as this being's words buzzed in his mind again.","\"And it is no Commander killing you...you are dying in the hands of the very same being who crushed Euryale in his hands.\"","...!","Vladic's eyes expanded wide in stupor.","One and the same being?","He thought of the being seated on the multicolored throne without making a move.","And then this terrifying Apex Aeonic Lifeform before him!","And the dread only became more intense as stared at this fiend...no.","\"You...you are no fiend.\"","BZZT!","As the last vestiges of his life left him, he managed to cry out in his raspy voice.","\"Demon. You...are a demon! A Demon that Elder Ahpuch will destroy with surety. A demon that no Inheritance will leave alive! You-GOH!\"","Vladic's Will and Soul were utterly torn as even his raspy voice couldn't be heard, and from his visage impaled by bones...a green black smoke bloomed and covered everything about him as a fiery authority of death began to rise from it!","He would not meet Euryale.","He would join the ranks of the endless Legions that would rise under the banner of Alexander King.","Under the banner of the Haven Lich Ra'Zan!","In a single move, the Commander who was the one to initiate this war had fallen.","The one to do all of this gazed up to see the ever-increasing mountains of bones and droves of Undead Thanatos Vassals as he gazed towards a point where more than ten Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassals surrounded the being Commander Vladic had called for in the Unrecorded History he read before and even now.","\"Ahpuch.\"","Noah called out the name of this being as he smiled.","He had perused across many records with the Adumbrative Viewpoint of the Oraculum Dynamis of Extremity.","Ahpuch would merely be a blip in the events about to be recorded!","BLINK!","The visage of Alexander King instantly disappeared and moved to float above the raging storm of Destruction that was Ahpuch, bones splintering all around him as Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassals surrounded him!","—","\"Demon...\" The word rang out from the mouth of the Priestess Persephone as her white robes and eyes radiated rays of justice.","She and many others had seen the scene of the opponent Commander between the two Lineages naturally involved in this Apex War being killed by the First Commander of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven who had called forth a dreadful Domain Expansion that filled the Apex Battlefield with death!","Powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms were currently dying left and right as if they survived the sudden eruptions of the pulsing bone mountains, there were the Undead Vassals to survive from thereafter as they swarmed over all opponent living beings.","Priestess Persephone saw this all as she repeated herself for all those around her to hear.","\"What is that being but a Demon? To be reaping the lives of powerful future defenders of the Seven Havens like this!\"","Her cries echoed out as she purposefully made herself loud.","As if she wanted to spread outcry and hatred towards the other side!","And just as she was about to continue...","\"What the hell are you going on about, Crazy Priestess?\"","The booming voice of Erikson buzzed out in the distance as he gazed over in distaste.","His left foot rose as his right hand grabbed the slipper from it, lifting this slipper up and pointing it towards the far away Priestess Persephone as he spoke out with grandiosity.","\"In a scheduled and decided upon War, a Commander defending himself and utilizing all of his power to take down his enemies suddenly turns into a Demon? You keep running that dumb mouth of yours and I'll be the next one that turns into a demon by teaching you what those nasty lips can say or not say.\"","...!","A shocking development unfolded even amongst the far away beings watching as tension began to rise, the far away Apex Battlefield filled with constant shocking changes becoming even more heart-shaking to watch!"]},{"number":2560,"title":"Chapter 2560: Chapter 2559 A Path of No Return! I","paragraphs":["The Aeonic Soul Clone of a renowned Scion of the Sima Clan pointed a slipper threateningly towards a renowned Scion of the Havenly Church!","\"This is a War.\"","His eyes were sharp as if he could make a move at any moment without fear of the repercussions as he continued.","\"If it was the side of Avernus and Singularity Overseer Elders winning the War and killing their enemies, would you call them demons as well? Get that hypocritical shit out of here.\"","WAA!","His demeanor was so dominating even while adorned in his beach attire as Priestess Persephone could say nothing else but harrumph and bring her gaze back towards the battlefield.","This whole interaction was also only gazed at with a periphery of the Wills of the watchers around this area, with the majority of concentration of their Wills remaining on the shocking events of the battlefield that seemed to be getting filled with a tremendous aura of death.","—","Above the Apex Battlefield tinged black and green.","In what seemed like a Haven of celestial beings gazing upon the lower earth below, the visage of the Adjudicator of Dissolution watched the unfolding events with a gaze of utmost scrutiny as not too far from her, the clone of the leader of this ongoing conflict continued to absorb the aura of her Hyperversal Extremity Authority.","{Multiple beings with Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, and one who even holds two Unique Absolute Dynamis of Extremity. This is a force that should be coming from a renowned Inheritance or Part of the forces of a Clan, and yet you wield it.}","Her words were clear, and yet they were filled with an inquisitive light as her veiled figure came to land on Noah.","His figure held a hint of mystery and wonder as he gazed down at the events below him.","He shrugged his shoulders as his grand voice emanated out.","\"Is it so wrong and out of place for me to possess such a force? Even if it is not renowned, I have just stated before everyone when this battle began about my Infinite Hyperversal Haven. People undervalue me because my name isn't attached to some major Inheritance or Clan. They do not take my words at face value as this is what led to the reality we are currently in.\"","WAA!","\"I warned all Inheritances and the Avernus Clan involving themselves in the War, and yet only the Genesis Institute of Extremity put their biases aside and took a step back. Now...ah, it pains me that I will have to destroy one of the Seven Clans and the Singularity Overseers due to them not being able to take a step back!\"","...!","His broad shoulders were filled with power as his last ones seemed to almost be filled with lamentations!","A knowing smile full of power and certainty rose on his lips as his gaze went from the Battlefield below and locked onto the veiled eyes of the Adjudicator of Dissolution.","\"They made themselves my clear enemies. The rules of the Apex War of Annihilation dictate that the victor holds the right of Annihilation for those involved in this war. When I finish this portion of the war...I hold the right to wage it on the rest of those who sought my Annihilation.\"","He spoke in advance as if he already expected certain words from the Adjudicator of Dissolution.","And Svetlana looked at him silently before she spoke up with a level of coldness.","{Must you continue this grudge? Do you know how difficult and deadly for your own forces it will be if you continue to pit yourself against the Avernus Clan and the Singularity Overseers? What you're facing now are the Elders they're raising up. Their true power lies in Hyperversal Extremities and Extremity Armaments that contribute to the defenses of the Seven Havens. They will not wait for you to grow and wage conflict as you grind them down. If you truly point your blade at them, they have the right to fight back and eradicate you and everything you hold dear. So I ask again...","must you continue this grudge?}","\"...\"","Words of reasoning.","The Adjudicator of Dissolution saw the immense and still hidden potential of the power this being before her wielded as she truly wished for it to be directed towards a positive direction!","Yet her veiled eyes flashed the moment she saw this being's smile become even wider.","She realized nothing that she had uttered had reached him.","\"Adjudicator of Dissolution, I assure you that even if I take a step back, my enemies will not.\"","...!","His figure pointed to the war zone below as he continued.","\"Even now as this War has reached a precipice, I have an sense it will not end with a simple victory or defeat. I wouldn't be surprised of interventions...I wouldn't be surprised of a Hyperversal Extremity or two making a move and breaking even the rules of this Apex War for the reason of saving their Elders. You see, I am a lover of peace. But when things like that happen...I will not be able to help but retaliate!\"","BOOM!","His words were explosive as the Adjudicator of Dissolution blazed with an astonishing authority thereafter.","She didn't reply.","She couldn't reply as the words he had said...could not be refuted! The thought had instantly risen the moment the flow of the battle tipped towards the side of Osmont.","If the Apex War was tipping towards the defeat of the forces of the Avernus Clan and the Singularity Overseers...would the Hyperversal Extremities that had authorized things here truly stay still? Could they answer to their factions as to why they lost a portion of their forces entirely even before the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification began?","The Adjudicator of Dissolution knew the answer very well!","{For this, I have made a warning. For this...I am prepared for.}","At her words, Noah smiled.","His eyes glimmered with a stellar light as he had truly spent too much time with the Adumbrative Viewpoint of the Oraculum Dynamis of Extremity.","He seemed to see many things others couldn't as he wondered...did the Adjudicator of Dissolution truly have things in her grasp as she believed?!"]},{"number":2561,"title":"Chapter 2561: Chapter 2560 A Path of No Return! II","paragraphs":["Truthfully, Noah himself did not know much about the Unrecorded Histories of Hyperversal Extremities as rarely did he coke across their Histories when utilizing Adumbrative Viewpoint.","And when he did, the information was very little as the level of secrecy Hyperversal Extremities held was too profound for what his current Soul Values and access into the Aeonic Annals of Extremity could allow him to view!","But the fact that his Quintessential Hyperversal Mana Value was substituted for nearly all of Soul Values usage meant he could utilize the authority of the Oraculum Dynamis of Extremity with unimaginable frequency.","Hyperversal Extremities with Dynamis like this that could speculate or foresee possible Records existed in large numbers, but they didn't spend their whole days doing so as it wasn't possible!","But with his Infinite Mana, Noah had no trouble doing so.","And since the Unrecorded Histories of Hyperversal Extremities were not easily gazed at, he focused on the powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from their factions.","The Scions watching in the distance.","The Scions hidden in the dark.","The beings who planned and plotted!","Ever so slowly, Noah was able to expand what he knew about them as this Apex War of Annihilation...would only be a stepping-off point for what was to come!","—","Immense silence was the only thing in the region of nothingness that the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction was in.","He watched the scenes of a solemn Ahpuch who ripped apart Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassals with obscene strength and apocalyptic destruction, and yet even more of such Undead Vassals continued to appear as his authority was ever so slowly being sapped!","It wasn't dredges of weak existences that he was facing.","Each one was equivalent to a Grand Elder of an Inheritance as apart from them...","GUOOH!","The roars of some of the Seven grotesque looking Lifeforms emanated out towards him as the one with a pulsing {GLUTTONY} on his back was the first to surge towards Ahpuch.","More and more followed as even with the frightening power and Destruction he wielded at the 16th Boundary Layer...it may not be enough!","That is unless...he can use this terrifying pressure to break through.","All this time, the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction was not worried about Ahpuch's life as no genius who had accessed Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as an Apex Aeonic Lifeform would be allowed to die- especially one of the Avernus Clan!","Even if Svetlana dared to, he or other Avernus Hyperversal Extremities would not sit still.","But there was the current problem that it wasn't just Ahpuch. There were 200 Avernus Clan Elders on the field as dozens had perished!","At this reality, Destruction let out a sigh as he felt the Will of the Hyperversal Extremity with fiery purple hair and two burning purple horns begin to blaze with light.","{What does the Senate say?}","His Hyperversal Extremity Clone was currently not within the Avernus Domains for a reason as his Records were not supposed to be associated with them. So he had to rely on this baleful Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity beside him to communicate with the other powerhouses of the Avernus Clan!","{There are some disagreements, but it has been authorized for us to use this chance to probe...them.}","WAA!","Them!","Destruction heard this word as he instantly understood what it meant and who it referred to!","{Really? We do not know many things yet-}","{It matters not.} Blazing Hyperversal purple flames rose as the woman beside him waved her hands.","{We can make a move as once we do, we shall be able to judge just which Inheritances or Clans have been influenced. It is as good a chance as any to find out who our adversaries are and who our Allies are. And since we are using this opportunity...we have to be sure the sprouting weeds are rooted out early as this Osmont and his forces have tremendous potential, but their open hostility and disrespect towards the Avernus Clan means they cannot exist. You were granted the task to eliminate the Record of this Osmont and his strongest Commanders by the Senate- if even this fails...you know the consequences.}","...!","Shocking words emanated out as Destruction's eyes turned cold.","He thought carefully and connected to the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as he recalled the scene of Extremity Kabul and Devouring not too long, as well as the power Svetlana wielded!","He was mute for a while before he replied.","{Okay. But if you have contacted the others...let them know not to underestimate the Adjudicator of Dissolution. She may have attained the Zenith of Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity with the power I've observed so far.}","BZZT!","Zenith of Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity!","A set of terms that may not mean much to Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, but they were extremely crucial for Hyperversal Extremities!","The purple flames beside Destruction blazed as the voice emanating out was sharp.","{Are you sure?}","{60% sure, when I faced her before, the Unrecorded Paths I could take were extremely limited.} Destruction's reply was quick as after a brief silence, the other voice came out with a chilling light.","{Then I shall ask for Emperor Shao to make a move.}","...!","Emperor Shao!","Other beings liked to be adorned with grand titles when spoken about as most held 'Extremity' in their title to distinguish just how far they had come.","But there were some beings who did not need to remind others they had achieved Extremity by placing the distinction in their name.","Some beings simply went by a single name, while others were known widely by one moniker.","Then...there was Emperor Shao!","When the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction heard this name, he couldn't help but think of another being entirely as he wondered about the future. He thought of the Hyperversal Extremity of Chaos who still hadn't returned to the Seven Havens.","'You should have been here for this...' His gaze was filled with Innumerable light of Destruction as he planned for the future.","His mission was a simple one.","Amidst the chaos to come, his main objective was singular.","The True Emperor of Quintessence.","Noah Osmont!","...!","At a certain point in time, once one had stepped on a certain path, they had to stay on it and follow it to the end.","At this moment, the Avernus Clan remained on the path they had chosen as they were following a fantastical direction!"]},{"number":2562,"title":"Chapter 2562: Chapter 2561 A Path of No Return! III","paragraphs":["2561 A Path of No Return! III","The Apex Battlefield showed a hellish scene that left many wide-eyed and surprised at the sheer capabilities of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, but there were beings within the Apex Battlefield who didn't even feel like they were a part of it!","Like they didn't even need to be there, with some of them almost being in a sorry state had the abilities of Dr. Hall not befallen them as well.","These beings were the figures of Grand Primeval Elder Silas and the other Shadow Elders, as well as Roan and the few Apex Aeonic Lernaeans who followed him!","They were in the periphery of the battlefield as they watched blankly, a sense of silent fear ever present that the terrifying titanic figures of Emperor and King Tier Thanatos Vassal would at any time turn their burning verdant sockets towards them!","And through the eyes of Primeval Elder Silas and the few Hyperversal Extremity Shadows who had set off and brought the core Apex Aeonic Lifeforms of their Cult of Endless Shadows in the Haven of Dissolution....everything that was occurring was also being shared towards those who remained in the Haven of Penumbra.","Frankly, many of the watching eyes were recording what was currently happening and transmitting it to other locations as for the time before the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification began...there was nothing more exciting and worthy of their time than observing this shocking battle that held Absolute Dynamis of Extremity flying around!","—","In the Aeonic Haven of Penumbra.","Within the domain surrounded by darkness and shadows, the figure of Extremity Gabriella no longer held a playful smile as she stared at the images of scenes being transmitted from multiple sources that fed into the ranks of the Cult of Endless Shadows.","It showed the unbelievable prowess that had Apex Elders of the Avernus Clan and the Singularity Overseers on the defensive as one by one- they slowly fell!","All by the hands of the forces of a single being.","\"You kept me waiting because you were waiting to see the results of the Apex War. What hidden backing I had. Whether the Adjudicator of Dissolution would truly step in to save me as my Lineage was being decimated. You sent less than a dozen Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from your Cult of Endless Shadows to assist as how many thousands do you have? From all of these actions, do you think the Cult of Endless Shadows has shown me any sincerity?\"","...!","The voice of the being she was containing in a Shadow Domain within the Shadow Fortress rang out as vibrant Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Shadows pulsed from Gabriella.","She stopped looking at the illusory screens before her and turned towards Noah as her eyes pulsed with countless unknown thoughts, but the most obvious ones were those of scrutiny and caution!","Cautioning this being before him that no matter how magnificent he was, the one standing before him was still a Hyperversal Extremity!","Extremity Gabriella portrayed this emotion clearly as Noah shook his head with a sigh.","\"I know I'm supposed to feel some sort of reverence and watch myself under the allure of a Hyperversal Extremity, but the vast majority of the ones I've met so far have just been so...disappointing. I do not see the greatness and majesty you all should portray as in fact, the vast majority of you just seem...","so little.\"","WAA!","Arcs of interminable shadows instantly erupted as the surroundings seethed, Noah's face seeming like a lonely boat in a tumultuous sea as he didn't even bat an eye!","He instead rose up and placed his hands behind his back as his body became suffused with the glorious multicolored light of Quintessence.","He glimmered of stellar and celestial luster as he gazed at a Hyperversal Extremity calmly amidst Hyperversal Authority pulsing around him.","\"I came here because of an Oath. I have fulfilled my end of the bargain as any more delays in this oath, and will call forth the Adjudicator that acted as the witness. I take your actions as representative of the Cult of Endless Shadows as even with your recent malfeasance, I shall be the bigger being and leave the door open for cooperation.\"","...!","As he spoke, he took steps towards Extremity Gabriella without fear as he continued!","\"I warned the Avernus Clan and the Singularity Overseers but they did not listen. You can now see me butchering their Elders in high resolution as...","what is the Cult of Endless Shadows compared to something like the Avernus Clan? If I dare to make myself an enemy of one of the Seven Clans, do you truly think I would fear a Hyperversal Extremity of an Inheritance like this? You need to look past your pride and magnificent achievements and not gaze at me like some junior who is playing tricks or making outlandish claims. When I receive a gaze like that, I tend to return it right back. \"","WAA!","\"Now, what shall it be?\"","Silence reigned as the grandeur of Quintessence bathed Noah's Clone.","He stared at a Hyperversal Extremity head-on as the Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Shadows began to die down and fade around him!","Extremity Gabriella stared forward wordlessly towards this entity as this whole time, this pristine existence did not say a word...","—","Who was he?","What magnificent Lineage did he come from? What grand Inheritance was he a part of?","He was Ahpuch- a genius of the Avernus Clan who moved directly under a Hyperversal Extremity!","Very few beings would ever be taken as Direct Disciples of a Hyperversal Extremity- their path already outlined as they only had to follow it.","Ahpuch had followed it.","He achieved Vacuous Hyperversal Authority just like his Master.","He crossed the Boundaries of Destruction just like his Master.","And just like his Master...he would attain Hyperversal Extremity Authority as the enemies he faced now would only be fuel towards his path!","This was but a given.","BOOOOM!","Luminous crimson locusts of destruction rotated around him as they ground down the bones of Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassal every moment, cylindrical flames of Destruction erupting from them ever so often as his surroundings were only filled with chaos.","He had been destroying these Undead Entities with Soul Values a bit more than a fourth of what he held as this whole time, he preserved his power.","He used the reality of the destruction around him to regenerate the lost Soul Values as it felt like after forever...","His soul cried out as the capability of [Domain Expansion] he couldn't call out this whole time had finally returned and could be employed again.","This capability took a great toll to call out as it drained over half of one's Soul Value, with Ahpuch paying a heavy price to regenerate enough to finally be able to call out to it again!","And this time, he wouldn't allow it to be taken away as his enemy with much lesser soul values...would in no way be able to do something as magnificent as that again!","And so for the second time, just as he saw the face of the First Commander appear behind a bellowing Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassal, Ahpuch called out grandly.","\"Domain Expansion...Interminable Destruction!\""]},{"number":2563,"title":"Chapter 2563: Chapter 2562 A Path of No Return! IV","paragraphs":["2562 A Path of No Return! IV","Ahpuch called out this terrifying ability again as with it, he could senselessly call out waves of Destruction without a strain on his soul!","His enemy should in no way be able to afford the toll of erasing this domain like he did before, with Ahpuch's Absolute Dynamis of Extremity tightly wrapping around the erupting Domain Expansion as he wanted this to be the end of this War.","He would erase the countless Undead Entities running rampant and focus most of his Wrath on the caster!","The visage of the First Commander and the cackling Haven Lich was in his sights as Ahpuch felt the crimson flames of Destruction begin to proliferate out, dazzling Crimson pillars beginning to manifest and even battle for superiority with the mountains of bones as it seemed two Expanded Domains were about to be overlapped.","The stronger of the two would come out on top as Ahpuch was ready to lay his cards on the line!","He utilized the 9 Cycles of Destruction Modus Operandi as he felt all his 16 Boundaries of Destruction.","And he got ready to unleash it as...","'Huh?'","His perceptive eyes caught the visage of the First Commander who was looking towards his direction while shaking his head as if he was looking at a fool.","At the same time, the First Commander of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven raised his crystalline skull staff and nudged upwards as if he was telling Ahpuch to look up!","A foreboding sensation pulsed and raced within Ahpuch as his eyes and will turned up.","'Surely not...'","...!","In the dazzling verdant skies that were about to be overlapped with the crimson Interminable Destruction Domain Expansion, a gem-encrusted illusory golden hand formed again.","\"...\"","A hand similar to before and with just as much brilliance!","When he saw it again, Ahpuch's mind buzzed.","The most powerful Avernus Clan Elders who were giving orders and trying to mitigate as much damage as possible with the swarming Undead, Enders, and those adorned in the Quintessential Loot Seeker's Regalia Sets had their faces turn extremely sour as they had thought they would have some leeway to recover and go on the offensive if Ahpuch's domain could cover the battlefield again!","And yet reality seemed to hold an entirely different path in mind.","As he gazed at it, Ahpuch's thoughts were grave ones as he thought coldly.","'Fucking how?'","There were rules and common sense, and this applied even to existences reaching the 16th,17th, and ultimately the 18th Boundary Layer!","Domain Expansion was an ultimate move that drained one's reserves of Resources.","Forcefully nullifying a Domain Expansion...should cost even more to accomplish!","If the enemy Ahpuch faced was stronger than him and had reached a greater Boundary Layer, maybe it would be understandable.","But it was someone that Ahpuch felt at most had achieved the 13th Boundary Layer!","Someone weaker than him!","So how...","How was what he was currently seeing possible?!","BZZZ","The golden hand plucked.","And the Interminable Destruction Domain that was just laid out trembled before ridiculously...it began to disappear before it could even fully set!","Ahpuch was silent as he watched the jeweled hand begin to disappear just as quickly as it came, the Infinity Thanatos Domain in the surroundings only becoming more potent as even more droves of Thanatos Vassals rose.","As much as he hated to admit it, Ahpuch knew he was defeated in multiple areas against this being before him. And even though he didn't like this situation...he didn't turn fearful or ever begin to worry about his life as it was never in question.","After all, he was an Apex Aeonic Lifeform with an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity and had also attained Vacuous Hyperversal Authority!","He knew sooner or later, there would be an intervention.","And since the battlefield was getting increasingly chaotic, he knew exactly where to be before the interference by his Master or others came.","BZZZT!","His body pulsed and released tendrils of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, the area around him beginning to melt away as a massive crack of nothingness appeared- a crack that seemingly held an endless pocket of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority!","Ahpuch slowly disappeared into it as he gazed with might and challenge towards the visage of the First Commander of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","As if to tell him...come if you dare!","—","[The Manifested Domain Expansion- Interminable Destruction, has been plundered for the second time.]","[The Recorded History of Domain Expansion has been entirely erased from the Plundered Target.]","[The Authority of Domain Expansion has been elevated.]","His soul experienced a wondrous euphoria.","As Legions of Different Tiers of Thanatos Vassals ran rampant, his enemy actually laid out his Domain Expansion once more under a very wrong assumption!","An assumption of logic and reasoning that he then applied to him.","The moment Ahpuch applied logic and reason to Noah, he lost!","No matter his greater power. No matter the more advanced Boundary Layers.","Lotra's wonder showed itself once more as befitting a Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, the second time that Ahpuch's Domain Expansion was plundered, it was actually forever erased from his Recorded History as Noah's own Domain Expansion was made even grander!","In the surroundings, the massive bone mountains radiated a deathly crystalline sheen as the vertical cylindrical pillars erupting from their peaks began to change.","They became mobile as fantastically, they turned into multiple rivers of poisonous deathly light that now sought enemies from the earth and skies!","The Thanatos Vassals already on the field had their bones becoming larger and even stronger as they burned with furious flames.","All of this was just a part of the benefits as at this moment, the last set of prompts relating to the effects of [Hyperversal Plundering] cast for the second time unfolded.","The reason for his soul feeling euphoria.","[14 Boundary Layers of Destruction have begun to be deduced.]","[The Plundering of the Soul of the current target will allow for the deduction of more advanced Boundary Layers.]","...!","Traversing across the Boundary Layers towards Extremity was immensely hard.","With Lotra...Noah wanted to make it easy!","His eyes eagerly stared at the crack of nothingness and the pocket of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority that Ahpuch had carved out.","He thought he had entered a domain where he was the strongest in.","A domain for him to continue testing out Destruction against Noah as the only paths he saw were either him breaking to the 17th Boundary Layer, or the interference of Hyperversal Extremities to stop this War as no Apex Aeonic Lifeform with a hold of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority would ever be allowed to perish!","'Let me show you another pathway...'","Noah's eyes released a blinding radiance as his visage of Alexander King stepped towards the crack of nothingness.","Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassals followed him as on the Apex Battlefield, the Haven Lich Ra'Zan would be the one to finish off the struggles of the rest of the enemies!"]},{"number":2564,"title":"Chapter 2564: Chapter 2563 Emperor Shao!","paragraphs":["2563 Emperor Shao!","In the Aeonic Haven of Oceanus.","There was no earth or sky.","All around...there was only an endless stellar blue sea that filled everything.","Cerulean beauty and wonder was stretched throughout as in a small corner of this vast Haven known as Oceanus, there was a Plane of Existence that shone with a milky white hue.","The entire Plane was utterly empty and void of life except for a single being within it, and yet outside of it in the endless cerulean sea, millions of multicolored sea Beasts swam peacefully!","The single existence within this milky white plane was currently in a seated position as around him, streams of potent Hyperversal Extremity swirled with wonder, the auras of over 20 Absolute Dynamis of Extremity at the very minimum swimming around him as one never knew how many more were hidden within.","He was adorned in a simple white robe, his facial features handsome, but not exceedingly so as his extremely light caramel skin radiated purity and wonder.","His dark hair brilliantly stood with a light fade on the sides as he seemed like a distinguished man barely in his prime!","His pupils were constantly spinning with multicolored light as if a whole stellar system moved within, and a small sword lay on his lap that he was stroking calmly.","He was a man of many names, but the vast majority knew him as Emperor Shao.","At this moment, he stopped stroking the sword on his lap as his head turned to gaze towards a certain direction.","Thereafter, the over 20 auras of Absolute Dynamis of Extremity faded while his vibrant force of life became many times less than what was originally being given off!","Not too long after, the blaring aura of another Hyperversal Extremity bloomed as from the skies, purple flames that transformed into the figure of an exquisite woman formed.","Everything about her blazed purple with heat and regality as her fair figure descended onto the milky white plane of Existence gracefully, her gaze slightly somber as she approached the seated figure of Emperor Shao with a hint of caution.","Emperor Shao gazed towards this being calmly before he went back to stroking the sword on his lap, his voice ringing out first.","[Ariana of the Avernus Clan. Are you here representing yourself or your Clan?]","...!","Each of his words were filled with a profound sense of power and dominance as Extremity Ariana floated far away from him while she replied.","[I come representing the Avernus Clan. We are redeeming one of the two remaining favors.]","WAA!","Her words were straightforward and to the point as she pulled out a radiant Extremity Relic with the word [AVERNUS] etched on it, Emperor Shao nodding at her words as he spoke while putting the sword on his lap away.","[You know the drill.]","Extremity Ariana nodded at his words as from her, multiple bubbles of light flew out- each one occupied with memories accumulated from many beings as well as intelligence reports gathered from all of these memories!","As she handed them off, she began to speak.","[The request this time deals with an Apex War in the Haven of Dissolution. We have to move soon to end the war without allowing our Elders to suffer too many casualties, and since we're doing so- we have agreed to use this opportunity to see which of the Inheritances and Clans have fallen under the influence of 'Them'. There is the possibility that the Adjudicator of Dissolution has reached the Zenith of Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity as due to her and the difficulty of this venture, we seek your services to ensure utmost success.]","...!","The way she spoke towards him was uniquely indicative of the power that Emperor Shao held, with Extremity Ariana not even being able to put on any airs as she spoke!","Emperor Shao absorbed the droves of recollections placed before him as this was his first condition before agreeing to any request.","He had to gain all the background knowledge on it, who was involved, and what their goals were!","If he didn't have all of this information and more, he wouldn't make a move.","In the bundle of information he received, there was the history of what ushered forth this Apex War, who the Commanders on each side were, what their levels of power and Recorded Histories were, and who they were connected to!","As he scanned through everything, Emperor Shao's stare sharpened as he asked lightly.","[Is there any more information on this Noah Osmont? His Origins, any history that doesn't date back to just a few days?]","[...]","Extremity Ariana blinked at the questions as she shook her head while continuing her pulsing purple flames!","[The recollections of his movements within Dissolution and the Initiation Step are all included. This is all that was able to be gathered on him. But Emperor Shao, he is a minor part that will be taken care of by Destruction. We just need Svetlana to be reigned in while we save our forces and 'they' reveal themselves, and our Hyperversal Extremities will do the rest.]","Her words were sound, and yet when Emperor Shao heard them, he shook his head while gazing at Extremity Ariana with evident disappointment!","A stare that Extremity Ariana saw clearly as she continued to reign herself while Emperor Shao spoke.","[Your biggest obstacle this whole time has been this Osmont. One of your goals in this is to save the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from your Clan and Singularity Overseers...you will fail in this as they should all be dead soon if they aren't already.]","WAA!","[You aren't worried too much about this Direct Disciple Ahpuch as saving him would be the easiest? This is also a wrong thought; it is likely he is also about to die. You all should have begun your movements the moment you saw the Apex War going south and dedicated to the Probe you want to conduct for 'them'.]","...!","Milky white light of purity and power burst out grandly as shocking words were carried with them!"]},{"number":2565,"title":"Chapter 2565: Chapter 2564 Corpse Explosion!","paragraphs":["2564 Corpse Explosion!","[What are you...-] The words of Emperor Shao caused Extremity Ariana to turn somber as she had just begun when she was cut off, Emperor Shao raising his hand for her to stop as he continued!","[This is all for your redeemed favor- my services have already begun. If you want to ensure success as per your request, you need to follow every single thing I say. Pass this along to the others as well. Otherwise do not blame me if things do not go accordingly.]","His white-robed figure rose as he radiated immense grandeur that even other Hyperversal Extremities would pale in comparison to!","[You all have made many mistakes in this whole venture, but the biggest one is treating this unknown being who seems to only have Records of a few days in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, and yet he has embroiled a Clan and a major Inheritance in a war as he has placed himself center of the Extremity Sanctification. Your goal to kill him by sending out Destruction...will also likely fail.]","BOOM!","Like a thunderclap of reality, his words came down.","Extremity Ariana looked at him incredulously as the spinning pupils of Emperor Shao flashed, a majestic light blooming with them as an moment later, a second figure that looked just like him appeared...and subsequently disappeared an instant later as it shot out towards the horizon!","[My clone will make its way towards Dissolution as the moment it arrives, you all can begin. If you want to save whatever remains of your forces in this War, especially this Ahpuch you all put a level of importance in- then make a move before I even get there. The number of Hyperversal Extremities you and your Allies were putting forth in this...you will need to double it at the very least. And have those coming later wait to move under my command]","...!","One command after another flew as if one looked at the two Hyperversal Extremities, they would think that one extremely powerful Lifeform was giving commands to another as it didn't seem like the two of them were on the same playing field at all.","Extremity Ariana was perplexed as she wanted to say this was excessive and over the top. That it would require too many of their hidden forces to move as the exposure would be too much.","But...she held it all back as she knew Emperor Shao's identity.","The Undefeated Extremity.","The Extremity of War.","The Extremity of Conquest.","These were just some of his titles.","He had never led them wrong in their last two requests as if he believed this was how they should move, she would pass this word along!","Her will had already passed along all commands as tendrils of authority leaked from her and surged towards Emperor Shao- establishing a connection to a communication channel filled with the Wills of specifically chosen beings as all of them could communicate seamlessly- no matter where they were in the Seven Havens!","The visage of Emperor Shao held a thoughtful look as he gazed up.","Past the milky white Plane he was in, he gazed into the endless cerulean sea.","As if he could see the very Records of everything there, he shook his head with a complex expression that seemed to hold a sense of appreciation and curiosity at the same time!","[Your objective of eliminating this Osmont who is pitting himself against your Avernus Clan is unlikely to succeed at this moment it seems. Very few traces of Records of him can be found in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as he has likely structured an authority capable of masking himself. Killing him carries the same level of difficulty as killing a Hyperversal Extremity as one will have to get a hold of his body directly and see whether his Recorded History will be obtained through his body. Without scorching everything about him in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, he will never truly die.]","...!","A pristine assessment was given by a truly peculiar existence towards a being he had yet to meet!","—","On the True Throne of Quintessence in the center of the Apex Battlefield.","Noah's figure was surrounded by tendrils of light as even though he didn't make any moves personally, he constantly monitored everything as the Oraculum Absolute Dynamis of Extremity pulsed around him powerfully!","Everything was flowing in a somewhat expected path as he had arrived at the edge of his victory.","At the peak where a few moves were all that were required for a magnificent conclusion!","And yet an moment later, he felt droves of his Quintessential Hyperversal Mana Value burn along with a portion of his Soul Values as [Adumbrative Viewpoint] was passively activated.","The ability stemming from the Oraculum Absolute Dynamis of Extremity that could be triggered passively when any unfavorable or important Unrecorded History pertaining to Noah or his people unfolded!","Within the depths of his soul, Innumerable Records flowed.","A golden book rose as its pages fluttered!","A heavy record then began to unfold as Noah's eyes flashed, his soul buzzing with brilliance as a moment later, his Will buzzed in the minds of all his forces.","In the mind of his Son and the Squadron he led.","In the minds of Aurelia, Orion, and even the Enders led by a roaring Draconic Elephantine beast!","In the mind of the Chthonian Sinners of Thanatos who didn't really get a chance to shine and the Haven Lich Ra'Zan.","\"Wrap it up.\"","BZZT!","Three words.","But they sufficiently conveyed the will of the True Emperor of Quintessence!","The bodies of Henry and all others began to suffuse with astonishing brilliance as all their Soul Values were drained to unleash everything they held, while the Haven Lich Ra'Zan...","Its skeletal figure was enshrouded in a deathly light as an aurora of verdant black wings expanded behind its back, the flames within its sockets dancing as it released the bone staff in its right hand.","The bony skeletal hands beside it then came together as their digits intertwined in front of its bony chest, a surge of authority erupting at this moment as two words emanated from the Haven Lich!","Words directed towards the corpses within the battlefield.","Words directed to the Prince, King, and Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassals!","Words granting the Ultimate Form of death for even the Thanatos Vassals as their authority even caused the myriad of bony mountains to crack and splinter as if they were ready for their last eruption.","The Haven Lich Ra'Zan called out...","[Corpse Explosion].","...!","The voice rang out at the same time as in the skies, out of nowhere and with utmost brilliance- multiple Hyperversal Extremity Authorities blazed with glorious horror!"]},{"number":2566,"title":"Chapter 2566: Chapter 2565 A Flicker of Brilliance! I","paragraphs":["2565 A Flicker of Brilliance! I","Moments before an utterly irrevocable History played out.","In an isolated Domain, a marbled golden floor could be seen forming the earth as the skies were tinged stellar white.","Within this domain, the aura of two beings could be felt as one was a Hyperversal Extremity, and the other...radiated Quintessence!","\"I was looking forward to seeing how the Hyperversal Extremities of the Genesis Institute of Extremity came to an entirely different potion...but why isolate us from all the others?\"","Noah's voice rang out as when he had sent this Will forward, it had initially been brought into a space with the auras of multiple Hyperversal Extremities.","Yet now, they were in a separate domain by themselves as the Hyperversal Extremity before Noah smiled while replying.","[Some things need fewer audiences. Especially what I have to say.]","\"Oh?\"","Noah's brows rose at the words of Extremity Marcellus as this being's eyes seemed to hold endless light.","His aged visage seemed like an ancient being full of Vitality and contained power as he spoke in a somewhat pondering tone.","[Your curiosity as to why the forces of the Genesis Institute of Extremity pulled out at the last moment can be satiated very simply. It was partly because I had learned about you much more than others...it was because you were Scouted as a possible Candidate.]","...!","Cryptic words rang out as they came with many questions, Noah's Will about to delve into what exactly this being meant by him being apparently scouted as a candidate- none of this information appearing from the myriad of pages he read in the past day!","He was about to.","But this was when his eyes became sharp as his Main Body relieved a flow of heavy information from Adumbrative Viewpoint.","This was when...","BZZZT!","The cries of multiple Hyperversal Extremity Authorities cried out gloriously and with wild abandon as before him, the figure of Extremity Marcellus sighed while his body began to suffice with white gold light!","[They truly chose this path in the end...]","...!","The white gold light radiating from him caused a grandiose change as on his face, a mask that was half white and half gold appeared as on the right side, the numerals [III] could be seen gloriously.","And just as this mask and change appeared, the aura that Extremity Marcellus portrayed completely faded as it felt like he wasn't even there.","His voice came out again, but this time it seemed to be a mixture of voices of young and old as one wouldn't be able to make out his identity at all!","[I shall be back. Be careful for the next few moments.]","WAA!","Even his body proportions had changed to become a slender and tall male visage as the moment he finished speaking, his figure disappeared!","—","[Corpse Explosion]!","The words were enough to cause an immense force of terror to rise within the minds of the already dwindling enemies, with the remaining Avernus Clan Elders and Singularity Overseers grouping together and pulsing with defensive reality altering skills to survive what was coming.","Ever so briefly, their souls flashed with happiness as they felt the auras of Hyperversal Extremities blare above them.","The thought that finally, they wouldn't be stuck in this horrid domain of death and Undead as their masters and Protectors of their Clan and Inheritance wouldn't allow them to continue being killed in this insignificant war!","And this moment was when the effects of [Corpse Explosion] activated.","The effect of this ability from the Haven Lich Ra'Zan was quite simple.","For the sacrifice of the chosen Quintessential Undead Thanatos Vassals to forever return to the embrace of death, their bodies would release one last final radiance of Damage Values that were equivalent to 3x their Vitality Values!","Simple.","And yet extremely deadly!","The distance covered was vast per Thanatos Vassals as there were already thousands of Prince Tier Thanatos Vassals and a few hundred King and Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassals.","Their bones pulsed and radiated instability as an instant later, they were akin to collapsed singularities that pulled into themselves...before exploding out with a horrific force of nature.","BOOM! BOOM! BOOOOM!","The sounds of explosions danced wildly as it soon became a maddening symphony, turning into a wave of green obsidian light that expanded to eradicate all enemies on the battlefield!","The leading Avernus and Singularity Overseer Commanders turned ashen as their souls released their most protective abilities and wondrous planar domains..","And yet when the waves of explosive light passed over them..","-20,997!","-20,997!","-20,997!","The statistical values that only the True Emperor of Quintessence could see flashed as their Planar Domains were shredded along with their bodies!","All of this unfolded just as the terrifying auras of Hyperversal Extremities unfolded above.","[You!]","An angry voice erupted out at the surprising actions taken as many observant eyes were made to watch in real time as dozens of Apex Aeonic Elders were forever swallowed by death!","As if the one who had taken these actions knew they were coming!","The voice that rang out carried with it authority that pressed towards the Apex Battlefield at shockingly fast speeds.","At the same moment in time, in the center of the battlefield that held the crack of nothingness leading to an isolated pocket of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","\"Chaos must have started out there.\"","Outside the scope of time and space, Ahpuch's voice rang out calmly as he observed the approaching figure of Alexander King.","He had felt traces of Hyperversal Extremity Authority from the traces of his will he left behind as he knew everything was about to be over!","He saw the figure of Alexander King being entirely unphased by the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority around him as it seemed there were two geniuses who grasped the same authority among his enemies.","\"I'm inquisitive about the secret behind you and the Emperor you serve attaining the capability to use Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, and how you forged multiple Absolute Dynamis of Extremity. If you are forthcoming enough...I will ask my Master to save you to live another da-\"","BZZT!","As he was speaking, he amazingly felt dozens of Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassal becoming painted with a cherry colored light of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity that had yet to be shown!","And their bodies were already shaking with instability as the voice of Alexander came out to cut off Ahpuch.","\"Even outside the scope of space and time...I still do not have time to waste on the likes of you!\"","WAA!"]},{"number":2567,"title":"Chapter 2567: Chapter 2566 A Flicker of Brilliance! II","paragraphs":["2566 A Flicker of Brilliance! II","Even outside the scope of time, he wouldn't waste any time on Ahpuch!","These words caused this Direct Disciple to burn with rage and power as he didn't expect this being to not even bat an eye at the appearance of Hyperversal Extremities.","Did he already expect death, and this was why he was rushing without care?!","The answer didn't matter as Ahpuch radiated the power of multiple 16 Boundary Layers and the Interminable Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, his figure also pulling out the lifesaving measure his Master had granted him for use only in the most dire situations!","Something an Elder Scion like him with so many achievements would always carry.","SHIING!","A one time use Quasi-Extremity Relic of utmost Rarity.","It looked like an illusory white wing that released an influx of light- it was a Relic known as The Embrace of the Widowed Fairy Queen!","It could absorb up to ten times the Vitality Values of the user in terms of Damage Values as with his power, Ahpuch expected to be able to contain over 200,000 Apex Aeonic Damage Values!","The Embrace of the Widowed Fairy Queen flashed as a brilliant wing of protection appeared above his head, a pure white light of fortification covering him.","This should be enough as within the next moments, his Master would arrive as the anomaly before them would have to be studied later!","Waves of Destruction formed into roaring serpentine flaming snakes as they got ready to intertwine and break down the nearing Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassals, but this was when their ballooning instability became worse as a moment later...","BOOM! BOOM!","Their bodies exploded with massive force all around him!","A force that simultaneously threw out over 20,000 Thanatos Damage Values as to his shock, Ahpuch felt the Embrace of the Widowed Fairy Queen waver when over 10 of such explosions shook his surroundings!","At the same time...","[Hyperversal Plundering].","WAA!","His soul vibrated as he saw the visage of Alexander appear above him, an illusory bejeweled hand that had caused him the most problems appearing for the third time as the target this time...seemed to be directly him!","The fact that the Wills of Hyperversal Extremities were descending was entirely ignored by this being as he seemed intent on Devouring a single thing before him, and that was Ahpuch!","—","[You!]","The word came with a blazing authority that brought everything to a halt.","The expanding explosive waves of the Corpse Explosion.","The cycling of Boundary Essence and authority in everyone's bodies.","It felt like everything was brought to a halt as just before this Hyperversal Extremity Authority fully descended...","HOONG!","A dazzling black light erupted and nearly blinded the wills of those watching.","A black light.","It carried utmost majesty and authority with it as the moment it appeared, the multiple descending Hyperversal Wills had their advancement stopped!","This black light bloomed as the visage of the Adjudicator of Dissolution appeared in three skies, her body radiating this brilliant light even as the skies were darkening and turning murky!","She was akin to a flicker of a blinding brilliance that no others could match as her will pervasively overpowered all the defending wills.","Her veiled figure expressed immense disappointment and anger as in the skies, she gazed at 5 Hyperversal Extremities veiling themselves tightly with authority appearing.","They appeared to interfere with the Apex War of Annihilation as she stood against them all fearlessly, with her might seeming indomitable as if she could take them all on.","She was the Adjudicator of Dissolution!","SHIING!","Her body began to cry out with unfolding authority as it seemed she was about to establish her might and show all those here that the rules could not be so easily broken, but an instant later...a crack in space bloomed as from it, a massive milky white gold finger descended.","A single finger!","And yet it carried with it obscene Hyperversal Extremity Authority as the veiled figure of Svetlana revealed a trace of shock, all of her authority being released forced to focus on this descending finger as if she didn't fully deal with it, it would utterly eviscerate everything below.","This single move forcefully grabbed all of her attention as the 5 Hyperversal Extremities moved in sequence the moment it appeared- seemingly knowing it would come as their authorities bypassed the Adjudicator of Dissolution.","Two moved with veiled crimson radiance as they surged towards the isolated pocket of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority where Ahpuch and the First Commander of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven were.","The three other Hyperversal Extremities continued to extend their authority towards the Apex Battlefield as they reached out to the remaining Avernus Clan Elders and Singularity Overseers!","This sudden progression of events was utterly shocking as it caused all beings to rise in shock and cry out, the scene of the Adjudicator of Dissolution being occupied by an immensely potent authority of an Unknown Hyperversal Extremity while 5 other Hyperversal Extremities appeared to interfere with the battle being imprinted in all minds.","Noah watched all of this occur as he remained seated on his throne.","Reality was never fair.","He didn't expect to have a fair fight by any account, and so he prepared!","His Vassals all had clones representing them here as they couldn't be traced even in death. And he himself was unkillable as he could leave at any time!","He just did all this because he wanted to expose these grand Clans and Inheritances for what they ultimately were.","Beings that moved with their own goals and ideals- ideals they would achieve no matter what rules lay before them.","He depended on his own power to get past even the interference of these beings as the two Hyperversal Extremities- one of them undoubtedly being Destruction, would at most arrive to find Ahpuch halfway through being Plundered!","And the vast majority of Avernus and Singularity Overseer Elders were nearly torn to pieces under the grandeur of his forces.","So let them interfere.","Because in all this, it seemed he would get to see a reality play out that revealed much more of the Seven Havens!","Events were playing out extremely quickly as just as it seemed the interference of the veiled Avernus and Singularity Overseer Extremities would succeed...","SHAA!","The auras of multiple more Hyperversal Extremity Authorities bloomed.","One bloomed right before the crack of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as it was a humanoid visage adorned in a white robe, their face covered by a half-","white and half-gold conceal that carried the inscription [III]!","This Entity stood against the coming figures of Extremities veiled in a Crimson light as tendrils of a Unique Absolute Dynamis of Extremity erupted from him.","Before the grandeur of the three other Hyperversal Extremities who were going towards the Battlefield, 3 more beings adorned in half-white and half-","gold masks appeared to stop their advancement!","Their masks were inscribed with the numerals [II]!","...!","Their appearance was an unbelievable sight as nobody truly understood what was going on at this moment!","—","Above the Apex Battlefield.","Emperor Shao released his authority in the form of a single illusory finger that forced the Adjudicator of Dissolution's attention on only this.","This was how potent he was.","Powerful enough to alone rival an Adjudicator of Dissolution!","As he saw the scene unfolding below, he sighed while his voice rang out only for him to hear.","[The ones who barely leave traces across History, the beings exceeding the bounds of Lineages and Factions and act independently to maintain the order of the Seven Havens...]","...!","[You wasted one of the last few favors collected from me for this? To probe and see which Inheritances have fallen under their influence? How useless.]","His words were callous as they thought of a memory in the past.","Memories of beings in the same half gold half white masks that entirely erased their identities and existence appearing before him as they offered inclusion into their secretive organization that spanned across the most powerful factions within the Seven Havens.","He had denied them then, and he would even refuse them now if they were to appear before him once again!","This was not his path.","And now, he could be considered to be moving against them even though he was only keeping up his end of the bargain after the Avernus Clan paid heavy costs to gather favors from him!","Fate could be so fickle.","Emperor Shao shook his head as seeing the advancements of the battlefield, it correlated with the reality that the Avernus and Singularity Overseer Hyperversal Extremities would lose if they only sent forth this number of pieces.","It was why he had told them to double it at the very least as after these 5 were deployed, his Will stretched out to 10 other Hyperversal Wills that Extremity Ariana had connected him to.","They tried to conceal their identities within the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, but Emperor Shao could easily tell who they were the instant he connected to their Hyperversal Wills!","Extremities from the Havenly Church, the Caecilii Clan, and surprisingly- even some Extremities from the Plum Sword of Extremity were among the reserves waiting for the commands of Emperor Shao.","It showed off the machinations and alliances formed behind the scenes as Emperor Shao paid attention to all of them before his Will commandingly spread out!"]},{"number":2568,"title":"Chapter 2568: Chapter 2567 The Incursion of Dissolution! I","paragraphs":["2567 The Incursion of Dissolution! I","Shock!","This was the emotion that many of the watchers felt as for some, rousing anger exploded forth!","In the far distance, the figure of Erikson rose up with tendrils of grandeur pulsing around him as he stared at the veiled Hyperversal Extremities invading the Apex Battlefield- as well as the unknown Extremities adorned in half gold half white masks whose identities could not be made out.","They were all powerhouses of the Seven Havens as their actions represented the Wills of major factions and powers whenever they moved!","For them to move like this now...","Erikson's soul buzzed as either a somber gaze, he sent out a message.","\"Uncle, we cannot remain idle as this situation unfolds...\"","His words traversed into the mind of one of the Sima Clan Extremities in this Haven as the scene he saw was something that breached everything they stood for!","Those with more power very clearly committing wrongs regardless simply because it served their best interests.","Even though it wouldn't make any difference, Erikson had already grabbed his slippers and held them tightly into his hands as if he would jump into the battle himself, but what could a recently advanced Apex Aeonic Lifeform who was merely distorting probability to converge his first Dynamis of Extremity do against the grandeur of Hyperversal Extremities?","As his eyes buzzed with brilliance, he received a reply.","[Be at ease, Young Master. I have already made a move.]","...!","The words were unexpected ones as Erikson's eyes flashed with brilliance.","His Uncle had already made a move.","It meant that he was one of the Hyperversal Extremities on the battlefield as Eirkson's heart didn't waver on which side he would have been standing on, his intuition ringing as he came to focus on the figures of the three Extremities wearing masks that had the inscriptions of [II]!","Beside him, the form of Ayame had the same look as her main body in the domain with her Grandfather had already turned to him, only for her to see his body divide in two as another one adorned in a white robe and carrying a white gold mask with an inscription of [III] on it!","[I've told you before that you will be officiated and begin missions after you become an Apex Aeonic Lifeform. You haven't been officiated yet, but you can observe how we move and why we move now. Because reality is not black and white, because the Seven Havens are not perfect Vaults of peace and prosperity as they may seem on the surface.]","WAA!","Her grandfather's face was filled with an age and interminable power at the same time as he adorned the white gold mask on his face, everything about him changing and becoming different as he turned into a man of short stature with a bulky build- where if she hadn't seen this body of his change before her, she wouldn't have known it was him!","Her expression was grim as her grandfather continued.","[It is not yet time for me to move yet, because if the words of Guardian Recorder are true, they have yet to fully reveal themselves.]","...!","Words of mystery and wonder erupted out as some of the prominent Scions saw what was happening and didn't sit still, reaching out to those above them to make a difference.","But it didn't always play out the same way for all.","Besides Erikson and Ayame's Soul Clones, the Soul Clone of Atlas of the Plum Sword of Extremity also reached out to those above him when he saw the shocking scene unfolding and remembering the favor he owed Osmont from the Initiation Step.","He waited for a reply as when he got one...","BZZT!","His body buzzed and stumbled back on the throne he was just sitting on as shock flashed across his face.","Shock that was replaced by outrage as when he turned back on the ever changing battlefield, it turned out that those above him...were on the side of the veiled Extremities attacking!","It was a devastating reality for him to affirm as the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms gazing in the surroundings tried their best to follow what was happening before them.","—","HOONG!","When Hyperversal Extremities fought, the Havens cried and were torn to pieces.","On this day, the skies of Dissolution fractured as the widespread Hyperversal Extremity Authority bearing down felt as if these very skies were weeping!","The Son of Destiny looked at this scene coldly as even in the face of this might, he was unphased.","\"What is written will only come to pass...no matter who tries to interfere with it.\"","...!","He had already seen a glimpse of destiny through his Destined Absolute Dynamis of Extremity as he gazed at the clashing Hyperversal Extremities around him, his calm demeanor and Noah's unphased form of the True Throne of Quintessence filling those around them with confidence as they weren't broken down in their wills!","[Wilful ignorance of decorum!]","BOOOM!","At this time, the crying skies shuddered as the booming voice of none other than the Adjudicator of Dissolution rang out, her hands pointing up as an instant later...","CRACK!","The skies quite literally shattered.","As if they had been cleaved, a horizontal fracture spread out as the authority of the white gold finger descending was obliterated, with the form of the Adjudicator of Dissolution pointing out again as the other half of the shattered Haven was forcefully pulled down- its immense weight pressing on selected targets here with utmost scrutiny!","[Intentful violation of the Investiture of Extremity!]","Her voice buzzed out again as thereafter, she brought her hands close to her bountiful chest.","Her veiled chest that she pressed on to feel her beating heart as she coldly voiced out.","[Hyperversal Extremity Expansion.]","....!","An utterly dreadful voice seeping of tyranny and grandeur.","An action that caused even some of the veiled Hyperversal Extremities to be shocked as they didn't expect her to call out such a thing here- with so many lives in the distance having the chance of being affected!","But she finished her words with immensity.","[Adjudication!]","WAA!","Hyperversal Extremity Expansion- Adjudication!","For words were uttered, and yet in the next moment, everything turned dark.","As of whatever was lighting up the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution was turned off.","As if reality itself closed its eyes the moment that the Hyperversal Extremity Expansion- Adjudication was called out!"]},{"number":2569,"title":"Chapter 2569: Chapter 2568 The Incursion of Dissolution! II","paragraphs":["2568 The Incursion of Dissolution! II","Immense darkness descended as if reality itself was closing its eyes!","And in this darkness, a white light shone as dazzling round scales rose.","Scales.","Scales that seemed to be there to weigh and judge the weight of the actions of all beings here!","In addition to this, a massive white gavel radiating pure white radiance appeared above this scale- a gavel that was seemingly there to pass down judgment.","It was the Extremity Expansion of Adjudication!","Without so much as a delay, the white gavel swung down with immense authority and pressure as very few could actually wrap their minds on what would happen with the advantage of this Extremity Expansion!","—","In the pocket of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","Over 200,000 Thanatos Damage Values erupted from all around Ahpuch as they shredded apart the one time use Quasi-Extremity Relic- The Embrace of the Widowed Fairy Queen!","The wing disappeared from Ahpuch's visage as he bellowed out with torrential flames of Destruction that absorbed the remaining tens of thousands of Damage Values, but in the midst of these flames...","SAA!","The formed bejeweled hand had come ever closer and appeared right above his head as it actually minimized itself, Ahpuch raging out even more flames as he saw the figure of Alexander appear before him to superimpose itself- his hand reaching out as it overlapped with the bejeweled golden hand that was appearing for the third time!","The Corpse Explosion of Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassals made the way.","The torrential flames around Ahpuch continued to be annihilated by the deathly force of nature until...","TSS!","The bejeweled illusory golden hand entirely became superimposed on the right hand of Alexander King as a tight-fitting glove that came to land on Ahpuch's face.","His glaring eyes of destruction felt blinding brilliance after that as his body surged with Interminable Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, but the authority descending was above it as Lotra roared out with utter fervor!","Hyperversal Plundering.","It could Plunder anything as at this moment, it sought to plunder Ahpuch himself.","His soul.","His very existence!","[Hyperversal Plundering of the target Aspects of Existence has begun!]","[The 13th Boundary Layer of Destruction has been obtained.]","[The 13th Boundary Layer of the Barbarian has been obtained.]","[The 14th Boundary Layer of Destruction has been obtained.]","...!","When Noah had plundered the Domain Expansion of Ahpuch for the second time, he had begun to deduct the first 14 Boundary Layers of Destruction!","Now as he plundered the very soul of this being, the subsequent Layers were obtained as...","\"HOOO!\"","Ahpuch bellowed out as he felt like core parts of him were being pulled out.","And his defenses, Vitality Values, and everything were at their absolute lowest as he couldn't resist!","[The 15th Boundary Layer of Destruction has been obtained.]","...!","15th!","The further one went, the more obscene and hard it was to climb across the Boundary Layers as all the boons Noah had obtained were only viable to bring him to the 13th Boundary Layer for his 81 Boundaries coursing in his Meridians!","After Devouring the Fruits of Extremity from his Yggdrasil of Extremity, he had began to make some progress towards the 14th Boundary Layer of Quintessence as he didn't manage to reach it.","And yet now...","The Plundering of a single being had granted him both the 14th and 15th Boundary Layers of Destruction as the moment Noah was able to include this Boundary as part of the concepts that defined him in his Hyperversal Extremity Meridians...80 more concepts would reach this level as well!","The only ordeal here was the inclusion of a different concept to define oneself.","The concept or concepts that one defined himself with were set in stone as the ones with the strongest connection in their meridians!","This was why what one defined himself with was likely the concept to be taken to Extremity.","It was an ordeal for others...but was it really the same for Noah? Could he really not do anything with the 81 Boundaries making up his Meridians?!","BZZT!","His eyes pulsed with tendrils of radiance as the Roars of Ahpuch were ignored, great resistance coming from him as he felt like a core part of himself was about to be stripped away.","The accomplishments of the 16th Boundary Layer!","If this was lost, he would have utterly noth-","BOOOM!","At such a crucial juncture, the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority surrounding them seethed.","[My, I hate whenever that guy is right.]","A voice filled with shocking power erupted out along with an enormous Hyperversal Extremity Authority that caused a Singularity to bloom between Ahpuch and Alexander King, Noah's will cold at this development as the moment the Singularity bloomed, a heavy impact erupted that canceled out the dazzling bejeweled golden hand!","[Hyperversal Plundering was forcefully canceled by a type of Hyperversal Extremity Authority.]","[Further Plundering of the target has failed!]","...!","Reality truly was never fair throughout history.","The good lived and died in poverty, while the ruthless and selfish beings enjoyed riches and wealth.","Set rules were violated by those more powerful as they didn't worry about the consequences, with the current reality showing a Hyperversal Extremity actually bypassing the shocking actions of the Adjudicator of Dissolution outside as after she separated Ahpuch and Noah's figure, her Hyperversal Extremity Authority turned into a purple flaming claw that sought to grab Alexander King!","Noah's will gazed at this shocking attack with apathetic eyes his Absolute Dynamis of Extremity raged around him.","And right before the moment of impact...","[Not today.]","Crimson radiance unfolded in front of Noah.","Another Hyperversal Extremity Authority showed itself as in the next instant, a short and stout figure adorned in a white gold mask with the inscription of [III] appeared as his visage seemed filled with limitless brilliance.","Before the figure of Ahpuch, a woman bathed in purple flames appeared as she blazed with scorching brilliance.","Her flames reached out to stabilize a ragged Ahpuch whose eyes bulged with boundless anger and a trace of fear as the two sides looked at each other without a word!","And an instant later...","BOOM!","The figures of the two Hyperversal Extremities moved to confrontation with each other!","It was a sequence of unfathomable chaos as in the midst of all this, Noah counted his gains that were stopped before he attained the grandest prize.","He couldn't plunder the 16th Boundary Layer from his enemy after the interruption of the Hyperversal Extremity, but he still plundered the 15th Boundary Layer of Destruction!","It meant that he could do many more things.","It meant that he could put the Boundary Layers of 10th, 11th, 12th, and 13th Boundaries of Quintessence to use as his power increased another level even amidst this chaos!"]},{"number":2570,"title":"Chapter 2570: Chapter 2569 The Incursion of Dissolution! III","paragraphs":["2569 The Incursion of Dissolution! III","Emperor Shao gazed at the devastating battlefield.","Battles with Hyperversal Extremities were always unique as in their stage, it didn't matter too much in terms of statistical values when accounting for who was stronger.","A lot of the time, it was the concepts that one took to Extremity that were determinants of power- and whether one could win against another!","Of course, unique concepts taken to Extremity also greatly altered one's Soul and granted them a tremendous Hyperversal Extremity Authority that would make other beings feel weak in their knees.","The concept of Adjudication...was something all 7 Adjudicators of the Seven Havens held as one of the tools under their belt- something they were granted when they were elected to the position of Adjudicator!","[Why would one ever seek this thankless job?]","His body was covered by profound layers of authority in the hidden folding of space as he looked at the Extremity Expansion that Svetlana had released.","Truly powerful Extremity Expansions released a domain that rejected any other Extremity Expansion from being expanded in that region, with Adjudication being one of the concepts that was especially deadly as it made Adjudicators at their peak of power at Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity!","Even with this as a boon, Emperor Shao never saw the appeal of becoming an Adjudicator.","[A glorified position that if you take seriously, you only make enemies that make plans to hunt you. If you turn the other way, a stream of Extremity Treasures flow to your side as you forge connections across the Seven Havens.]","...!","It could be seen which path Svetlana had taken by the actions today as there were many hidden pieces here today!","One was the fact that somehow, the Avernus Clan and others had found out or theorized that the Adjudicator of Dissolution was influenced by the faction behind the Extremities adorned in white gold masks, and they already planned to smoke out just how far the reach of these beings extended past an Adjudicator!","This Apex War just became a perfect chance to do so as many audiences from multiple factions were here, and they would achieve their goals of saving their disciples as the ruse behind it if any were caught or questioned.","And the consequences of this incursion into Dissolution today would be the names of multiple factions having been verified or suspected of having their Extremities connected to the veiled organization moving for their own gains...","these suspected factions would face scrutiny and begin to be ostracized ever so slowly!","Isolation, growing conflicts, more enemies than Allies, until ultimately...a faction begins to dissolve as its core powerhouses are picked off one after another.","The Seven Clans had been established for eons, but a few had changed names over the vast Recorded History.","The Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity were numerous, but some giants had risen and fallen in the past!","Because the Seven Havens were never short of conflict and conflicting goals.","And the beings that stood at the peak of power...constantly played games of life and death that granted the winner even more pieces of Extremity!","[But this isn't the way to go.] Emperor Shao shook his head and sighed.","He didn't block the expansion of Svetlana's Extremity Expansion as with its emergence, he moved multiple pieces into the Battlefield for them to achieve their secondary aims.","One was into the pocket of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority where a supposed genius Avernus Scion was under the threat of death, and the other was the remnants of the Avernus and Singularity Overseers on the battlefield being whisked away from the deathly authority spreading across the battlefield!","It was a calculated move that also caused more of the selective existences on white gold masks to come out as they achieved their goal of probing, but this would come at a cost.","The Extremity Expansion of Adjudication was not something to take lightly, especially when cast from a Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity!","Someone was bound to feel some pain as Emperor Shao would only make a move to clash against it when their goals were accomplished, using it as the chance to have them pull out their forces entirely away from Dissolution after that.","[Let's see, who shall be the unlucky piece...]","His eyes spun endlessly with grandeur as even though others couldn't see anything in the Extremity Expansion below them, his eyes covered by layers of Unique Absolute Dynamis of Extremity saw too many things.","And at this moment, they flashed to see one of the attacking Extremities covered by a Crimson light forcefully be shifted across space as they appeared on one of the two massive golden scales meant to judge others!","The veiled Extremity was none other than Destruction as the voice of Svetlana thundered out.","[Did you think this meager disguise would mask you? When I gave you a warning not too long ago?!]","The thundered out as shockingly, the massive golden gavel above the two scales swung down.","As of the decision on the Extremity on the scales was already decided!","...!","Thereafter, shockingly potent Hyperversal Extremity Authority converged on all sides of the Scale Destruction was on as the further down the gavel swung, the deadlier the power would be exerted as escaping this would not be something done lightly!","The figure of The Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction swayed with a gloomy light as shocking brilliance erupted from him to withstand someone he already knew he wasn't a match for!","Uniquely, he would be one of those who paid a heavy cost for this incursion...","—","Zeitgeist had half of his body eradicated as his soul barely hung by a thread, a few dozen Singularity Overseers around him having used their Astral Leviathans as sacrifices to save themselves as the laughing of a Lich could still be heard in this darkness that gave them a sense of fear!","At such a critical junction, he felt the warm aura of his Master actually appear as the Hyperversal Extremity of Devouring passed over this region- his authority descending to wrap around the remaining Singularity Overseers as they disappeared from the battlefield.","Amidst the cover of darkness of Adjudication, he moved and swiped any Avernus Scions he also came across as the battlefield was rapidly being cleared- with those who had made critical moves today beginning to achieve their aims!","Their plans came at the expense of ruining the golden path of the True Emperor of Quintessence as he was also covered by the immense darkness of the Extremity Expansion of Adjudication, his gaze luminous as his will sent out multiple commands!"]},{"number":2571,"title":"Chapter 2571: Chapter 2570 The Incursion of Dissolution! IV","paragraphs":["2570 The Incursion of Dissolution! IV","[The Eleventh Boundary Layer of Quintessence]:: The strength of the True Emperor of Quintessence is not set in stone as it can be interchangeable within his Aspects of Existence. This Layer allows you to alter three statistical Values- being able to move up to 75% of your Vitality and Defense Values to become a part of your Soul Values, or vice versa. Do not be restricted by the bounds of logic of others on what your strength can or cannot do, instead, let them experience a new reality through your own hands!","[The Twelfth Boundary Layer of Quintessence]:: Quintessence disdains being restricted to the Crimson Consummate Tier as it opens a pathway to an ever greater type of ranking that will stand to make a concept truly grasping Extremity. With enough authority, it is now possible to bypass the Crimson Consummate Tier of a Boundary and achieve the Quintessential Zenith Tier. Boundaries of such ranking far exceed others as their difficulty in achieving Extremity is even greater, but when an existence achieves Extremity with Quintessential Zenith Tier Concepts, his standing as a Hyperversal Extremity can't help but stand at the very Zenith!","[The Thirteenth Boundary Layer of Quintessence]:: Just as your values are interchangeable, the concepts that you define yourself with are even more so. At the cost of 50% of your current Soul Values, you can change one of the 81 Concepts that define you within the Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians. The defined concepts taken out of your Meridians retain their Boundary Layers as they cannot be placed back as defining concepts thereafter- a limitation that can easily be resolved when Quintessence becomes ever closer to Extremity. A truly Quintessential being is changeable and adapts to the ever-changing landscape, always seeking more definitions for themselves!","\"...\"","Yes!","Quintessence always showed the path forward as Noah could truly put the means of the 13th Boundary Layer of Quintessence to use at this moment!","There were also the grand achievements of being able to alter his statistical values that he already utilized before this battle began to be skewed as much as possible with his Soul Value- and there was also the wonder that was the ranking past Crimson Consummate Tier.","Quintessential Zenith!","It was an arduous task to overcome, but it was merely an inevitability for Noah.","At this very moment, his Will expressed through Alexander watched as a clash unfolded between two Hyperversal Extremities, the figure of Ahpuch seemingly getting further away from him as if he had more strength, he could have overpowered this being even before any Hyperversal Extremity appeared to save him!","And so, strength he would attain.","His will buzzed as the shocking reality of two Extremities fighting with their Hyperversal Extremity Authority was tuned out.","His commands then thundered out within his mind.","'Replace the Boundaries of the Sword and Essensology with Destruction and Infinity'","...!","Destruction was deduced and reforged under Noah's Quintessential Banner- Ahpuch's understanding being entirely plundered and reforged under Noah up to the 15th Boundary Layer!","With its inclusion as a defined concept in his Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians, it would allow all the other 80 Boundaries to also climb towards this highest 15th Layer.","This would include Quintessence.","This would include Infinity!","This would include the Boundaries that made up his Dynamis of Extremity.","Whenever Boundaries went ever closer to Extremity, their Dynamis would become even more powerful as he could look forward to the fantastical upgrades of their features!","His strength would grow by another level as if was ever in front of an enemy that he could plunder the Boundary Layers and very existence, he would ensure that everything was plundered.","It was uncertain if he would get the chance with Ahpuch again with Hyperversal Extremities appearing- but however this war concluded and its consequences thereafter...there were still an Innumerable number of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from the Seven Havens that were converging on Dissolution.","Some were Direct Disciples of Hyperversal Extremities like Ahpuch.","Others exceeded him in strength as they were already at the 17th Boundary Layer!","These would be his nutrients in addition to the boons that were yet to be uncovered in the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification.","As these thoughts passed and his Foundation buzzed at new changes, the reality around him also changed as the power of Hyperversal Extremities was shown.","[Haha, my purpose isn't here to fight, you old dredge!]","Blinding purple flames in the form of Hyperversal Authority erupted and formed into blooming flowers of singularities, the veiled woman standing before Ahpuch placing her hands on his weakened and rage full figure as this Direct Disciple disappeared!","\"...\"","The Hyperversal Extremity moved quickly as she didn't grant even the possibilities of second chances.","She seemed to know the difference in strength between her and this being before her as she didn't erupt in a life and death battle, her authority forming into an incandescent wall as she quickly began her retreat the moment her aims were achieved!","It was precise, quick, and some might say that it even showed traces of cowardice.","But this being had thought of the larger picture and what they were here to do as she decisively made her moves!","The short and stout figure with the white gold mask was radiating a crimson gold aurora of light that caused the purple flames to fade the moment they neared, his gaze piercing as he didn't chase.","He knew that the moment he did so, this genius behind him would be targeted by another Hyperversal Extremity as his actions would be for naught!","[The one you follow was targeted by the veiled Destruction as he is being taken care of by the Adjudicator. Since our aim is to currently protect, we are restricted somewhat, and I know this may be a disappointing result for what you all envisioned in this War.]","The short and stout Hyperversal Extremity spoke lightly as the purple flames faded, Noah not saying anything at this moment as he watched this being turn around and face him.","Was he just the tiniest bit disappointed? Yes. But he had attained booms that took others millions or billions of years in the span of minutes!","The 14th and 15th Boundary Layers alone were enough to make this war a tremendous success as it didn't just mean getting a single Boundary to the 15th Layer for him.","It meant getting 81 Boundaries to the 15th Layer!","A ridiculous reality that any beings who learned of it would cry out unfairness!","And then, there was the fact that Haven Lich Ra'Zan and his Vassals had eradicated over 80% of all the forces of the Avernus Clan and the Singularity Overseers.","The prompts for all of their Loot...they were enough for him to scroll through for hours!","As he took on the gaze of the Hyperversal Extremity before him, Noah's voice came out calmly as Alexander King.","\"This war is far from over. It is an Apex War of Annihilation as at this very moment...the Infinite Hyperversal Haven has not achieved the complete Annihilation of all of its participants!\"","...!","WAA!","His words carried a terrific Will that caused this Extremity before him who was seeking a type of Infinity to state with Innumerable thoughts.","\"When the Avernus Clan and Singularity Overseers are reduced to nothing but rubble and bones like the Noblesse, then...they have our authorization to consider this War done.\"","...!","Alexander's skeletal Armaments shone with a profound luster as he waved his staff, the few remaining Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassals crying out with bony jaws as outside of this pocket of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, shocking events continued to unfold!","Events that were flowing in a certain direction because of one person's commands as his appearance changed many possible paths today!","One of these paths was a particular Hyperversal Extremity.","Even though his Direct Disciple was saved, Destruction himself had landed in a dangerous dilemma as he was coercively placed on the Scales of Adjudication while the Gavel of Adjudication continued to press down!"]},{"number":2572,"title":"Chapter 2572: Chapter 2571 That Sword!","paragraphs":["2571 That Sword!","In the hidden folds of space near the Apex Battlefield.","The visage of Ahpuch was spat out of purple flames with an ashen gaze as the figure of Extremity Ariana appeared soon after, her gaze ferocious as she spoke.","[Did you manage to track all the Extremities that made a move?]","The question was not for Ahpuch, but towards a communication channel that held the will of another Hyperversal Extremity who had not even appeared on this Battlefield!","And the answer Extremity Ariana received was a special one.","[For the most part. The Genesis Institute seems to be tainted along with an unknown portion of the Sima Clan, Infinite Extremity, Immeasurable Mystery, and two more that I need to verify the signatures to be 100% sure.]","...!","The reason for their actions.","The purpose of their probe!","Extremity Ariana's eyes flashed as she heard these words and she nodded while replying just as quickly.","[Then we can begin pulling out now. Remember, our goal isn't to fight today!]","She allowed this message to flow freely across the multiple Hyperversal Extremities she was working with as when she gazed at the complete darkness before her brought about by the Extremity Expansion of Adjudication, she could see the struggling figure of Destruction as she snorted without feeling too sorry!","Mind you, this was a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity.","His authority was raging around him and barely hanging on as the Gavel of Adjudication swung down, but if it was a Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremity that was placed on the scales...Svetlana would have been able to easily crush them and erase their Recorded History by now!","But...","[Continue to be weak...]","She didn't target any of the Tier 2 Hyperversal Extremities as the moment she did so, it would mean that an Adjudicator had actually made a move to kill a Hyperversal Extremity of the Seven Havens!","How grand would such an occasion be?","How fantastical of an opportunity would it be! They could have utilized such a reality to actually shake her seat of an Adjudicator as thereafter, someone they favored would be supported to step up and be elevated to this grand pedestal!","But Svetlana moved carefully as she chose one of their stronger combatants and pressed down Adjudication unto them, this authority penetrating directly into the Soul of Hyperversal Extremities as its damage was directly on the Concepts one expanded to Extremity!","This was the type of power awarded to Adjudicators- one that made them powerhouses nobody wished to go against in the Seven Havens.","Because of their granted Hyperversal Extremity Authority that didn't touch one's Vitality Values, but they simply attacked one's records and scorched even Concepts that had achieved Extremity to oblivion.","It was utterly dreadful.","Even Extremity Ariana felt a sense of apprehension when she gazed at it as at this moment, she reached out to the person moving behind the scenes.","[Emperor Shao, can you move to provide an opportunity for retreat? Destruction seems to be in a tight spo-]","OOOOH!","Before her words could even finish, the situation seemed to change dramatically on the Scales of the Expanded Extremity as Destruction cried out in immense shock and anger, his voice chilling and seething as it echoed out!","[You...would actually dare?!]","It was a voice of shock as it realized the length that this Adjudicator was willing to go.","It was because at this moment, The Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction felt the Gavel of Adjudication swinging down targeted none of the Concepts he had achieved Extremity in...but a single one.","The concept he defined himself with.","The concept that became his moniker.","The concept that was his name!","BOOOM!","The Gavel of Adjudication actually had its unstoppable authority attack the very concept of Destruction within him!","[You all seem to think I will not act as you move rampantly...so let me show you.]","...!","Svetlana's voice was cold as even while her figure couldn't be seen, the gavel above seemed to press down with even more gravity as Destruction screamed out!","Destruction's body was bathed in crimson splendor as he roared out maddeningly, but he seemed to be anchored onto the scale he was on as he could not leave- being forced to watch as the Authority of Adjudication seeped into his soul and burn his most prized concept.","It was stably entrenched in Extremity as he had elevated this concept to stand far above any others at the same stage.","Yet now, it seemed to be forcefully burnt from his very soul while the defenses he set up continued to be bypassed!","This was the terror of a Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity.","Once one made their mind and faced another existence that was also Tier 3...","their victory would be a certainty!","[OOH!]","Destruction's roars continued to resound as in the next moment...","All sound was canceled.","In the center of the Extremity Expansion of Adjudication, Svetlana raised her head as her eyes turned sharp.","There, in the midst of all this darkness, a point of light appeared.","It very quickly brightened as its appearance was seen by all, taking on the form of a dazzling white sword that seemed to be formed by tendrils of multiple Unique Absolute Dynamis of Extremity that had at their base terrifying concepts that had achieved Extremity!","The moment this sword appeared, all Hyperversal Extremities present felt as if their souls could be cut the moment it swung- with the weaker ones getting a feeling that it could eradicate everything about them and their history with a swing!","It didn't seem like an illusory sword.","It seemed as if an Armament of Extremity had come to life as an instant later, it swung down.","...!","Blinding endless light radiated from it as shockingly, the moment it swung...","the vast and endless domain of Adjudication laid out...was cut.","Cut!","Cleanly, a brilliant slight of light formed in the skies and only expanded from there as from a reality of immense darkness, it seemed like this sword shimmering with endless white light was the only thing that was here!","A single sword of white light...cut through the Extremity Expansion of Adjudication.","The cornerstone of an Adjudicator!","When seeing this scene, the scalps of all Hyperversal Extremities present tingled.","The being behind that sword strike...","It seemed like very few if any of them would be his match as at this moment, complete white brilliance covered everything!"]},{"number":2573,"title":"Chapter 2573: Chapter 2572 Overpowered At Its Best! I","paragraphs":["2572 Overpowered At Its Best! I","In this moment of blinding brilliance, Hyperversal Extremities began to make their retreat as barely any senses could be perceived.","Even sound seemed to be cut off, and yet towards the last moments...a hoarse cry could be heard echoing out across the lands!","[17th Layer...17th Layer!]","A voice cried out amidst the blinding whiteness as it was not a joyful one.","It was one of utter shock and pain as if it was a parent witnessing the death of their child.","As if a poor pauper had suddenly gained all the riches in the cosmos only to lose it all a moment later! As if a sentient pig could see the butcher's blade while they were being led to slaughter!","Very few people understood what this cry meant, but those who did were shocked at its significance.","It was the voice of Destruction as it was in so much pain because incredulously, his main authority that granted him his very distinction and standing...Svetlana had used Adjudication to take it from its standing within the grandeur of Extremity to the extent that it came down to the 17th Boundary Layer!","17th!","And it would have been erased entirely if the blinding white sword didn't come.","The cries were full of pain to hear as with this single action, it was hard to say whether Destruction could keep his standing as a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity.","It was hard to say if he would even keep his distinction!","—","The blinding white brilliance that cut through everything seemed to also reach the pocket of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority that Noah's visage of Alexander and the short and stout white gold masked Extremity were in.","Thus being seemed like he wanted to converse with Alexander a bit more, but the blinding sword strike caused him to make another move as his body began to fade.","As for Noah's will in Alexander...it was entirely focused on within as a Quintessential change was about to take place.","An astonishing feat that utterly rejected nature was the only way that Noah's path could be described.","The closer one went towards Extremity, the more arduous and slower it was!","But it seemed that Noah was becoming even swifter as he had crossed the thresholds of the 10th, 11th, 12th, 13th, 14th, and 15th Boundary Layers far faster than when he scaled the 1st to the 9th Boundary Layer!","But the moment that the 16th Layer was in sight, a Hyperversal Extremity had intervened.","This didn't matter as regardless, Noah had swapped Boundaries and infused Infinity and Destruction into his Meridians.","The effects of this bloomed now as in the body of Alexander, he looked at the gradually disappearing figure white gold masked Hyperversal Extremity before him while his visage turned crystalline and translucent!","[Infinity has been added to the concepts that define you.]","[Destruction has been added to the concepts that define you.]","BZZT!","[The upper Layer of all Boundaries in the Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians has been set to 15!]","...!","Now, the changes of achieving the 15th Boundary Layer of Destruction were being applied as Noah's Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians activated their function, the 80 other Boundaries within breaking past the 13th Boundary Layer with utter ease!","And one must remember, common existences raised a few boundaries across Layers at a time as they slowly grew in power.","Accomplished Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who held ranges of 10,000-20,000 Apex Soul Values would slowly scale towards 30,000 and 40,000 Values over the years as they further refined their souls with the concepts of Extremity through pristine Circulation Modus Operandi, even adding Dynamis into this as they became more powerful!","Noah took a different route.","Instead of a few Boundaries slowly crossing the layers, 80 Boundaries did so all at once as the explosive rise in power...","Was utterly obscene!","So obscene that his Foundation made his body seem like a celestial treasure, turning crystalline and translucent as the 81 Meridians within could be seen clearly only under Noah's Will!","The Concepts of Extremity within the Meridians were akin to rivers of blood flowing through them, each of them taking a different color as they circulated with profound fervor at this moment!","A Boundary Layer for any of the heightened Boundaries could add a few hundred Values if not more as they became elevated.","Other Boundary Layers unlocked unique features that would only make Noah more broken.","And of course, the Layers of the Decreta, Natural Laws, and Fundamental Natural Laws getting closer to Extremity meant grand transformations for the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as well!","[The 15th Boundary Layer of Quintessence has been achieved.]","[The 15th Boundary Layer of Loot has been achieved.]","[The 15th Boundary Layer of Manadynamics has been achieved.]","[The 15th Boundary Layer of Blood has been achieved.]","[The 15th Boundary Layer of Dreams has been achieved.]","[The 15th Boundary Layer of Infinity has been achieved.]","...!","Every time that one of these shockingly pristine Consummate Boundaries arrived at an even higher stage, his body pulsed and exploded with a shocking aura as either entirely shattered abilities were being granted, or heavy increases to Soul Values and other Values were being added!","And in addition to all this...","[All Dynamis of Extremity converged by your concepts are undergoing Quintessential elevation.]","[New Features have been forged in all Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity!]","[Prior Features of all Dynamis of Extremity have experienced a Quintessential advancement!]","His body shone with incandescent splendor as he seemed like a reborn celestial creature from the early eons of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!","His Meridians seemed like pathways for all creatures to follow as 81 dazzling concepts flowed within, a great deal of things coming to fruition as some...","were much more important than others.","There was one thing that could not be missed.","It flowed pristinely along with the countless other prompts, but Noah brought it up to the forefront as it manifested before his eyes at this moment.","[The Fourteenth Boundary Layer of Quintessence]:: Boundaries are the backbone of your strength, and their Convergence into Dynamis elevates them to another level that allows the expression of what they stand for in unfathomable ways. For the expense of 75% of your current Soul Values, this Layer of Quintessence allows you to take already converged Dynamis of Extremity and be capable of modifying their Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity by adding or removing any concepts, the only thing to be cautious of being the resonance and compatibility of the remaining concepts....","\"...\"","...!"]},{"number":2574,"title":"Chapter 2574: Chapter 2573 Overpowered At Its Best! II","paragraphs":["2573 Overpowered At Its Best! II","The 14th Boundary Layer of Quintessence was simply maddening!","Once a Dynamis of Extremity was forged, it was set in stone.","If one wanted to create something similar but with additional concepts or different concepts, they had to converge a brand new dynamis and examine out its compatibility!","But Quintessence looked at such a reality and chose to give it the middle finger.","It told Noah on its 14th Boundary Layer that he could add and eliminate Concepts from Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity as he wished- the only thing being a high cost as to him, the cost didn't matter!","His Quintessential Hyperversal Mana Value took care of nearly all of his asset costs instead of the required Soul Values.","He would be able to freely add and remove multiple concepts even if the cost was stated to be 75% of his total Soul Values Per concept as the main thing here...was that he could enhance his Absolute Dynamis of Extremity into Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity!","All of these surprises...stemmed from a single Boundary of Quintessence.","What others may consider a dead path because it was simply too grand.","A path that could not be taken to Extremity!","It fell along the same lines as the concept of Infinity.","The Boundary Layers of this concept...were part of the core reason that Noah's visage of Alexander was currently shining with translucent and crystalline light as if his very body was a young Armament of Extremity being forged!","—","His fantastical changes had only just begun to unfold.","But outside of this, events continued to spill out around the Apex Battlefield as the blinding sword light that cut open Adjudication continued to blind all beings for a few seconds, and when it finally died down...","The scene revealed was one to stare at in wonder and wonder.","Fantastically, the only figure to be seen in the skies was the Adjudicator of Dissolution who currently had tendrils of profound authority raging around her- the auras of other Hyperversal Extremities nowhere to be seen.","It was as if they were never here to begin with!","As if a shocking battle had not just taken place.","The ones veiled with Hyperversal Extremity Authority who attacked were nowhere to be seen, and the ones wearing white gold masks who had appeared were also nowhere to be seen!","The Apex Battlefield below showed rows of Enders of Nature standing fearlessly, valiant Apex Aeonic Lifeforms adorned with white gold Armaments floating in front of them with valor as around them...deathly wheelies ran rampant as a certain lich collected corpses nonchalantly as if nothing else was happening around it.","A few massive Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassals could be seen in the background along with the sorry figures of Primeval Elder Silas, Roan, and other remnants from the Cult of Endless Shadows as they stared around them breathlessly.","The spectators who were blinded by darkness and then light this whole time could finally see again as they drew sharp breaths when the scene became clear!","On the battlefield, the only thing left behind of the Avernus and Singularity Overseer Elders were corpses that a cackling Haven Lich was collecting with glee, all others being whisked away as approximately 15-20% of the forces of powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms were saved.","But all others faced a devastating loss as the eyes of many beings couldn't help but focus on the man still seated on the multicolored throne in all this.","He hadn't moved a muscle.","He had grandly sat and watched over everything as even now, his eyes seemed to gaze around their audiences with scrutiny as if he was looking for the attackers that had come and gone from among them!","Far in the distance, the figure of Erikson grandly fell back on his seat as...","\"Fucking hell...\" He put his slippers back on his feet while rubbing his brows, this whole reality being an utter headache as too many significant things happened.","Ayame's eyes shone brilliantly as beside her, Atlas had a clouded expression as moments later...","\"You guys will have to excuse me for a while.\"","...!","He rose from the vessel of Erikson and disappeared into a burst of Plum petals as too many things seemed to be on his mind!","CAA!","And at this time, a fearsome cry of authority rang out as the figure of the Adjudicator of Dissolution gazed at the masses.","Her piercing eyes seemed to cross across all veils and land on the souls of all beings here as her fearsome voice reverberated out with a hint of clear anger!","[Today, multiple parties from a Clan and Inheritances violated the Investiture of Extremity as they believed their power and standing would mean there would be no consequences!]","WAA!","[You may disguise yourselves and use the darkness as a cover, but you know who you are! You know...since today, I stripped the very defining Concept of Extremity from one of you. Since you do not seem to hold the decorum of a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity, you can back down to Tier 2!]","...!","Her words were utterly callous as the skies seethed at her taunting!","She knew who the culprits were.","The culprits knew exactly what she was talking about.","In the distance, one could almost hear the howls of a maddened Hyperversal Extremity who seemed to be getting held back from appearing due to the taunts of the Adjudicator!","As for the audiences across the myriad of Inheritance and Clans here...","They drew sharp breaths at the words of the Adjudicator.","She had stripped the authority of a Hyperversal Extremity from Tier 3 to Tier 2.","Very few beings even knew the true distinction between Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremities and those who were Tier 2 and Tier 3!","But it was broadly known that the requirement for one to be elected as an Adjudicator of a Haven was to be at the Tier 3 at the very least!","Such beings were the cornerstones of the Seven Havens.","And for one reason or another...the Seven Havens had deprived a being of Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity!"]},{"number":2575,"title":"Chapter 2575: Chapter 2574 Overpowered At Its Best! III","paragraphs":["2574 Overpowered At Its Best! III","When one truly thought about it in the larger picture, it was a very, very sad day for the Seven Havens.","And yet it also seemed appropriate for the punishment of today's incursion to at least be this as an example had to be made!","If the Adjudicator of Dissolution had granted True Death to any Hyperversal Extremities today due to this, it was hard to say what the outcome would be and what storm would be raised among those truly powerful.","Yet her actions had shown her power and decisiveness cleanly today!","She gazed at all those in the surroundings and then towards the figure of the True Emperor of Quintessence seated on a grand floating throne.","He was akin to an ancient Commander with Recorded Histories of countless victories with the way he coldly gazed at everything, his eyes locking with the Adjudicator as he made his intentions clear!","And an instant later, the voice of the Adjudicator rang out again.","[The Apex War of Annihilation could have been considered over and done with had unruly beings not interfered, but because of their incursion...the War of Annihilation between the Lernaeans Lineage and the Noblesse- along with all those who supported them...has still not ended!]","WAA!","[The feud remains open until a clear victory is obtained from either side- and this time without the interventions of anyone.]","...!","A shocking judgment was made as the Adjudicator made something very clear for those listening.","The Noblesse were nowhere to be seen on the battlefield, and yet she proclaimed the war wasn't over.","The only combatants remaining were the Lernaeans led by the True Emperor of Quintessence and the forces of the Avernus Clan and the Singularity Overseers!","She effectively claimed that there was an ongoing war with this small unknown Lineage that held a grander faction name known as the Infinite Hyperversal Haven and the behemoth that is the Avernus Clan and the Singularity Overseers too!","A fantastical proclamation.","After it was said, the Adjudicator of Dissolution gave a cold look to all those here as if she could see the faces of the Hyperversal Extremities who had pulled away and hidden as if nothing had happened, her gaze then turning up to where the white sword that had cut her Extremity Expansion of Adjudication used to be.","It was as if she could see the being behind it.","It was as if she was committing it to memory and she would never forget!","Thereafter, her figure disappeared into a flash of darkness a moment later as only now...did many beings feel like they could breathe again.","The majesty and anger of a Zenith Tier 3 Ultra-dimensional Extremity was that terrifying.","Yet not long after she left, the multicolored throne of the True Emperor of Quintessence buzzed as the watching wills came to focus on him.","Some observed what they saw with their eyes and transmitted it across the walls of different Havens!","\"It seems very easy for those unidentified and with no apparent backing to be bullied and even given the decree of death from others sitting on their high pedestals.\"","...!","His words began slowly as he gazed at the many peering eyes around him, continuing with grandiosity as behind him, rows of Ultra-dimensional Extremities lined up!","\"Today, we make ourselves known.\"","\"Known as those from the Infinite Hyperversal Haven! For any beings daring to seek trouble with us or plot for our demise...you should be entirely prepared for the annihilation of your Inheritance or Clan. Just as the Avernus Clan and the Singularity Overseers should be prepared for what is to come!\"","WAA!","He spoke without fear. Those behind him seemed ready and even thirsting for battle, especially the seven Chthonian Sinners of Thanatos who wanted to fully unveil their monstrous forms and power!","The Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","Their introduction into the Seven Havens was a grand one as many knew them from this Apex War of Annihilation, with their entrance being paved by the blood of hundreds of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and even the bloody authority of a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity being stripped away!","At the untimely conclusion of the Apex War, they stood as the clear victors. Victors that others dared not to even approach since they had declared themselves along the same lines as an Inheritance or Clan, and they had even made the Avernus Clan and the Singularity Overseers as their clear enemies.","If they were associated with such a group...others simply didn't even dare to be.","Others.","But then there were the fearless and exceptional ones.","SHAA!","Multiple flashes of light went towards the battlefield that had deathly energies being swept away by a cackling Haven Lich who carried away the remnant corpses of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who had reached the 14th or 15th Boundary Layer- these corpses not being turned into Emperor Tier Thanatos Vassals right away as the Lich seemed like it had something else in store for them!","In the midst of such an atmosphere...","\"Let me be the first to congratulate you on your victory!\" The boisterous voice of Erikson thundered out as he arrived gallantly in beach attire, the figure of Ayame not being too far behind as they were among the very few who didn't fear being seen merely associating with the beings who made a Clan and Inheritance their enemy!","On the surface, things seemed to be entirely done as the battlefield quieted down...but they were far from over.","—","Within the Haven of Oceanus.","In the white gold Plane of Existence where the main body of Emperor Shao remained, the Extremity Soul Clone of Extremity Ariana nodded with somber acknowledgment while beginning to leave.","[The favors Emperor Shao has to fulfill are nearly depleted...but we look forward to working with you whenever fate permits us to utilize the last favor.]","...!","She spoke while her figure disappeared into purple flames, Emperor Shao's eyes calmly gazing forward while stroking a white sword on his lap.","After a while, his head rose as he pondered at the vast cerulean wonder all around him, his voice serene and full of wonder as it portrayed his thoughts that were buzzing with how everything came to be!","[Noah Osmont, is it? Since they appeared and the brilliance you have shown so far, it is likely they have already approached you to be groomed into another Guardian. When I come across you again, will it be as an enemy or an ally?]","His eyes were bright as the picture he saw was vastly different from others.","The Records he viewed were those that others had never seen nor would they ever come to life!","The future he sought...was not something the likes of Extremity Ariana, Destruction, or even the Adjudicator of Dissolution could fathom!"]},{"number":2576,"title":"Chapter 2576: Chapter 2575 Overpowered At Its Best! IV","paragraphs":["2575 Overpowered At Its Best! IV","The Apex Battlefield became abuzz with even grander activity after the War ended.","After Erikson, Ayame, and others took the lead forward, the audience became even more active as this region lit up with discussions!","It was to the extent that a moment later...","BZZT!","A Hyperversal Extremity Authority bloomed as it nearly caused the calm wills of beings to buzz wildly again, their gazes coming to observe the appearance of a man surrounded by tendrils of Shadows besides the figure of Primeval Elder Silas!","His demeanor was calm as he seemed aged with authority, his figure beginning to float towards Noah's visage on the throne as Silas and the other Shadow Elders followed along with complex emotions.","This...was the first Hyperversal Extremity to have stepped forward after the battle had ended as there were too many possibilities with what his actions meant!","Had the Cult of Endless Shadows decided on a path? And what exactly was the connection between them and the Infinite Hyperversal Haven?!","Questions arose as the peering gazes talked of what had just occurred and continued to prepare for the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification.","As all of this occured, Noah's will in the body of Alexander continued to observe the wondrous changes caused by the advancement of 81 Boundaries to the 15th Boundary Layer.","There were many astounding changes, especially to the Dynamis of Extremity that were made of these Boundaries!","Many of them required Noah's will to peruse their details and understand just what shocking extent they had grown, but one Boundary in particular...could activate one of its features passively.","It was the Oraculum Dynamis of Extremity that held the Adumbrative Viewpoint!","It had activated by itself to warn Noah right before the incursion of Hyperversal Extremities unfolded, and as the Boundaries making up this Dynamis received such a thorough advancement simultaneously...the abilities of Adumbrative Viewpoint became even more obscene!","HOONG!","In Noah's will contained in Alexander's visage, a blaring glimmer of authority echoed out as a golden book unfolded- taking a portion of his soul into it as Prompts began to cascade down.","[Adumbrative Viewpoint has independently enabled to show the glimmers of Unrecorded Histories waiting for the True Emperor of Quintessence.]","...!","It wasn't due to an alarming cause. It had enabled simply because of his advancement as Noah's soul found itself drawn into the pages of the golden book!","[Due to the thorough advancements of the Boundaries with Oraculum, the feature of Adumbrative Viewpoint can now have you experience your own Unrecorded Histories in an unknown straightforward path of your choosing in a Quintessentially in-depth fashion.]","As the notification faded, Noah's soul that was absorbed into the golden book felt 9 roads form before it.","Roads that seemed like grand stellar rivers as whenever he stepped on one of them...it would take him on a possible Unrecorded History relating to his future!","He gazed at the nine roads of unknown futures and chose the one at the very center as his soul was sucked into it.","And before even a moment could pass, his soul experienced passing through Annals of Extremity as he delved into a wondrous Unrecorded History, his vision clearing up to find himself within the Hyperversal Haven!","He wouldn't just be reading or viewing the Unrecorded History, but it was like he was right there in the flesh- living in it!","At the same time, a booming voice narrated from above.","[As Extremity Gabriella took his clone to observe the Shadow Sword, Noah's will finally sought an even grander path of power as he turned into his Infinite Forge. There, days worth of Loot Light that was withheld from Ruination finally began to climax and build the Fragments of none other than the Second Volume of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi!]","The scenes were wondrous as Noah truly felt like he was living through this History, the sheer usage and possibility of what he was seeing being amazing as it felt like time was sped up on the path he chose.","[A day passed since the Apex War ended, and the wall of Dissolution still did not relent as the Extremity Vein of Dissolution continued to rise to the skies of the Haven. It foretold of a Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification unlike any other as even the forces of Clans and Inheritances that continued to increase in number did not know what to expect.]","Noah's vision flitted through a great deal of memories and potentialities as what he lived through constantly changed, until soon after, he found his eyes staring at the glorious scene of 81 infinity symbols rotating in the Forge within the depths of his soul, waves of stellar loot light cascading down as 100 Fragments of the Second Volume of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operative formed into a grand scroll!","[He gazed at the Second Volume of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi as he could already feel the nonsensical boosts from it. Instead of being capable of cycling 24 different boundary essences across his atoms with every breath, the number was now 48 as this was only one of its boons!]","The scene was one of wondrous achievement that Noah would only obtain on the second day after the Apex War of Annihilation.","The scene was about to pass as Noah's will gazed at the scroll right before him hungrily as...","'Wait...'","BZZT!","The scene paused.","The Unrecorded History did not continue playing out as Noah gazed at the methodology of Extremity Circulation he would only obtain 2 days away after exhausting all of the Loot Light within his Forge!","His mind seemed to be shining with brilliance at this moment as a sense of profound revelation and potentialities surged within him!","He wanted to try something.","Something unbelievable.","Something others wouldn't even be thinking of, much less attempt.","THUMP!","He felt his heartbeat through his soul as once the idea took root within it, he could not let it go!","As his soul stood in observance of an Unrecorded History...his figure that should have only been an observer rose its hand as a unique golden light of a Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity shone from it.","And while looking at the Second Volume of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operan","di...his mouth moved within this Unrecorded History.","[Hyperversal Plundering].","\"...\"","...!"]},{"number":2577,"title":"Chapter 2577: Chapter 2576 Overpowered At Its Best! V","paragraphs":["2576 Overpowered At Its Best! V","BOOM!","The Unrecorded History Noah was gazing at shook dangerously as the fantastical authority of a Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity unfolded.","The authority of Lotra was blinding as it was truly carried over Noah's Soul and into a History that had yet to happen!","Below the dazzling spinning infinity symbols of the forge, a bejeweled golden hand formed as Noah truly tried to plunder a possible fabrication of reality in the form of an Unrecorded History.","And...","[You are attempting to obtain something in an Unrecorded History of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!]","[A grand and impossible goal, and yet the authority of the Lotra Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity seeks to make it a possibility.]","The bejeweled hand pressed towards the completed scroll of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi as the Unrecorded History around Noah shook with cataclysmic frequency!","And a moment later...","CRACK!","The scene of the Unrecorded History around Noah shattered under the weight of the actions he sought to do!","Along with it, dazzling prompts came.","[The Unrecorded History accessible through the Oraculum Absolute Dynamis of Extremity was not stable enough for the conducted action.]","[Oraculum communicates with its Master that its elevation to a Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity may grant enough stabilization to accomplish the sought after impossibility!]","...!","Noah had simply tried an action of utter impossibility through his intuition, and it had actually failed as the final result of it all...was the Oraculum Absolute Dynamis of Extremity telling him that what he tried to do may succeed so long as he adds more Boundaries into it!","Lotra was already set as it could do the Plundering.","Oraculum needed more power to stabilize the Unrecorded Histories as after that...there may actually be possibilities for him to plunder an unknown number and quality of things in the farthest reaches of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!","\"...\"","Just thinking about the possibilities made Noah's mind buzz as he locked onto the Oraculum Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity and the concepts contained within it, his Will moving along with dense Soul Values and Mana Values as the first Dynamis to undergo elevation was decided!","—","\"What was that performance today?\"","Noah's voice echoed out from his clone as it hid the profound brilliance within its eyes that nearly radiated wonder due to what a portion of his soul had just tried to do in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!","His clone was speaking towards none other than The Adjudicator of Dissolution.","[You call it a show...and I guess that isn't too far from the truth. The response you saw today was the crucial part in all this. The entities that stepped forth to prevent the injustice that would have occurred to you and your people.]","They were in the secluded domain above the Haven of Dissolution, stellar billowing clouds below their feet as while she spoke...her environment began to pulse with spatial light that showed forming gateways emanating auras of Hyperversal Extremities!","[They have been known by few across Recorded History as they do not move for fame or pride. They stretch across Inheritances and Clans as only the truly exceptional beings among all others are chosen. Geniuses outstanding in their stage and outclassing all others. Prodigies blessed by Extremity in ways others cannot fathom!]","WAA!","The portals around her flashed as in the next moment, three dazzling auras of Hyperversal Extremities unfolded as existences adorned in white gold masks and variations of white gold garbs appeared beside the Adjudicator of Dissolution!","One of the Extremities reached towards his white gold mask and slowly took it off as the visage of Extremity Marcellus of the Genesis Institute of Extremity revealed itself!","His eyes were serene and filled with age as he was the next one to speak.","[We move in the shadows of Extremity in order to protect it, only acting when all other measures have failed. We hold Hyperversal Extremities accountable even when Adjudicators fail to do so. We are known as the Curagulus of Extremity, the Protectors of the Seven Havens...the Guardians of Extremity!\"","...!","Noah's eyes squinted as he watched these powerful entities unveil themselves before his eyes!","The Curagulus of Extremity.","Existences moving in secret across the Seven Havens as their members were the most powerful individuals across Inheritances and Clans. For them to unveil themselves before Noah at this moment...","He smiled lightly while gazing at them and the figure of Dissolution.","\"For you all to be here, shall I assume I made the cut?\"","He smiled feely even amidst Hyperversal Extremities as Marcellus stroked his white beard with a similar smile while replying.","[You're chosen as a Candidate along with that First Commander...Alexander King, is it? Exceptional Entities like you will carry the torch forward to make sure the Curagulus of Extremity remains a force of great power over the years to come. So long as you complete your first mission successfully and begin rising through our ranks, you will come to find that holding the position of a Curagulus has its own gains.]","\"Oh?\" His brows rose with interest as beside Marcellus, the veiled Adjudicator harrumphed while jumping in.","[You do not need to entice him like this. Just know that when you efficiently move to protect these Havens, you can gain access to Resources and even the Armaments of Extremity within the Vaults of Curagulus! With how you've made yourself an enemy of Avernus and the Singularity Overseers, you will come to find that you need all the support you can get.]","Her words carried the same cold authority as she revealed the grand notion of the Vaults of Curagulus!","Caches of treasure Vaults that even held Armaments of Extremity!","Noah found himself in the midst of such a grand reality as there were many questions that remained unanswered.","How widespread was this Curagulus of Extremity? Just how many members did they have to even hold one of the Seven Adjudicators among them? These questions and more buzzed in his mind freely!","And as if they could see the questions through his eyes, the Adjudicator of Dissolution shook her head as she continued.","[As you gain more authority, you will naturally attain more information. For now, the crucial detail to understand is that the Curagulus of Extremity exists to keep in check existences who believe they are above scrutiny. Existences like those who carried out today's incursion...existences belonging to the center of power of the Seven Havens.]","WAA!","The center of power of the Seven Havens!","[The governing body that elects Adjudicators to their positions and has retained dominance across the Aeonic Annals of Extremity. Held together by pillars of all Seven Clans and Major Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity...The Senatus of Extremity!]","...!"]},{"number":2578,"title":"Chapter 2578: Chapter 2577 Overpowered At Its Best! VI","paragraphs":["2577 Overpowered At Its Best! VI","The Senatus of Extremity!","A global group of powerhouses whose reach went across all Seven Havens for as long as Recorded History existed!","They elected the Adjudicators of the Seven Havens and controlled things to an unfathomable level.","Their reach extended across the majority of the Hyperversal Extremities within the Seven Havens as they set they controlled all the infrastructure and the behemoth of an economy across the Havens.","The Adjudicator of Dissolution spoke about such beings as Noah's eyes shone brightly.","Before him, Hyperversal Extremity Marcellus took out a white gold mask that shone with silent wonder, his wide eyes radiating light as he spoke.","[So long as you take the Oath of Curagulus, the first thing you will be granted is this Extremity Relic that grants you whatever form you wish and entirely masks the Hyperversal Extremity Authority emanating from you...among its myriad of other functions. With it, you can navigate through different records as you will see the different tiers of Missions you can take, as well as what the rewards for it will be once completed. Through it, you can obtain high tier Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi, Records of Concepts of Extremity expanded over the eons, Records of Dynamis of Extremity, Records of the Inheritances and Clans along with much more.]","...!","An Extremity Relic!","It was nothing like an Armament of Extremity, but it was a relic that contained traces of Extremity!","\"Who could have made such a tool and mass produced it?\" Noah's hands reached out to grasp the dazzling white gold mask as he saw a layer of Hyperversal Extremity Authority covering it, and he wasn't able to obtain any information on it until this authority faded away!","His question was answered with a dismissive head shake from the Adjudicator of Dissolution as she replied succinctly.","[A Legend you may or may not know. If your achievements are high enough in the future, you may even be able to meet them and commission a genuine Armament of Extremity.]","WAA!","Fantastical words rang out as up to this point, only the Adjudicator and Hyperversal Extremity Marcellus had revealed themselves and spoken.","The other two masked Guardians that came with Marcellus remained quiet and mysterious this whole time as Noah grasped the vibrant and pulsing mask in his hands while pondering with a thoughtful look.","His piercing gaze passed through all of these beings as he asked lightly.","\"What if after all this, I turn you all down?\"","Yes.","They had unveiled themselves before him when they were this secretive organization, so what if he didn't join them in the end?!","Extremity Marcellus smiled at this moment as he shook his head lightly.","[I do not think this is an opportunity you will deny. One of the requirements for vetting potential candidates is already discerning what their choice will be.]","...!","His eyes were filled with boundless light as he spoke, Noah's sharp eyes turning into crescents as he smiled.","An opportunity he could not deny, was it? For him, it would merely be another tool for his path of glorious power!","\"Let's do it.\"","He gave the acknowledgment.","BZZT!","And Hyperversal Extremity Authority erupted from the Adjudicator of Dissolution as another Oath of Extremity was about to be born!","[Repeat after me. I vow to utilize my authority for the benefit of the Seven Havens of Extremity and the guidelines of the Curagulus of Extremity whenever acting under their name. To not reveal anything of the Curagulus of Extremity to outsiders!]","A fairly basic and nonrestrictive oath.","Noah's eyes glimmered with the golden grandeur of Oraculum as he spoke succinctly.","\"I vow to utilize my authority for the benefit of the Seven Havens of Extremity and the guidelines of the Curagulus of Extremity whenever acting under their name. To not disclose anything of the Curagulus of Extremity to outsiders.\"","WAA!","Hyperversal Extremity Authority buzzed and raged wantonly as an Oath of Extremity was established and witnessed by four Extremities!","It was an Oath from the True Emperor of Quintessence joining the Curagulus of Extremity as at this moment...nobody knew just what drastic of an effect this would have on the History of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!","[Good...with this, another exceptional member of the Curagulus has been born!]","The Adjudicator of Dissolution proclaimed vibrantly as she radiated immense power and wonder!","Her eyes beneath the veil shone with utmost majesty as they had innumerable thoughts and possibilities crossing through them.","At this moment, a memory passed through these veiled eyes.","A memory that seemed like an entire lifetime ago, and yet she could recall it as if it were yesterday.","—","The environment were filled with darkness as a single obsidian crystalline disk of earth floated at the very center.","A shadowy figure encased in utter darkness floated above the stellar obsidian earth that currently held a single life force that was pulsing with a distinctive authority.","Around her, only ashes and dust of what used to be Lifeforms could be seen as the voice of the shadowy figure thundered out.","[Sergei and Dimitri could not survive as they have now become fuel for your growth, Little Svetlana.]","...!","The ashes and dust around her were the 11 others who had been on the same path as her not too long ago as nothing about them remained!","Her small figure now pulsed uniquely with an authority of distinctive quality.","It felt devoid of life and reality itself.","SHAA!","Svetlana opened her eyes as crackles of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority erupted out!","It was the same crackling authority of nothingness that had been surrounding this whole region they were in this whole time!","Within her body, it seemed refined and docile.","Like it was natural. Like her very existence aligned and was meant just for it.","[Your Innate Vacuous Hyperversal Meridians will pave the way forward. Even though you have entered your Second Vacuous Awakening, you are still far from Extremity. You are still nothing.]","...!","The voice of the Hyperversal Extremity shroud","ed in dense Vacuous Hyperversal Authority boomed on all sides as Svetlana nodded with affirmation.","\"Yes, Master!\""]},{"number":2579,"title":"Chapter 2579: Chapter 2578 Overpowered At Its Best! VII","paragraphs":["2578 Overpowered At Its Best! VII","Her eyes were emotionless as she replied, the Hyperversal Extremity floating above her burning with brilliance as he continued.","[You raged against the dying light and became the champion of this batch as anticipations are high for you. Like all other champions, you only have a single mission for your existence! That mission...is to infiltrate the bane of our existence. The Antithesis who spread cancerously and encroach upon our very existence...the Vitalis Malignancies that reject Vacuous Hyperversal Authority in their very nature!]","BOOM!","[They refuse what makes our very existence as their Seven Vitalis Havens continue to spread their authority into our lands. We are greatly weakened when we are even close to their source of authority as you and all the other champions will be one of our weapons against them. You are a weapon that can withstand the Vitalis Hyperversal Authority in their lands as your only purpose is to climb across their ranks and prepare. Prepare for the time when we will reclaim what is rightfully ours!]","...!","A light of zeal crossed the eyes of the veiled figure as towards its words, the reply of Svetlana was an emotionless one.","\"Yes, Master.\"","Not a single emotion could be seen on her face as she replied with affirmation.","This memory, as if it were dust in the wind...quickly faded into nothingness.","In the current time, the veiled eyes of Svetlana blinked as the memory in her mind faded and focused on the scene before her.","The scene of a genius Scion and Ruler of a rising faction who had just joined the Curagulus of Extremity!","Her mind entirely erased and blocked out the rising memories of a distant time as she spoke out.","[Familiarize yourself with the Curagulus Mask and choose your first mission soon. Some may be native in this Haven, others might require you to go to other Havens entirely. But after you are accustomed...bring your First Commander so he can be granted the same opportunity.]","...!","Her words and aura were perfect and free of any discrepancy.","With her usual veiled demeanor, she continued to carry out her duty as her eyes swirled with innumerable complex emotions!","—","The Oraculum Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity trembled as new branches sprouted out like branching stellar rivers of reality.","Currently, the grandeur of Quintessence was being utilized as massive amounts of Quintessential Hyperversal Mana Values and Soul Values bathed it every second- a new concept being added ever so often!","It began with the concepts of Destiny, Providence, Pathfinder, Moirai, Fate, Karma, Fortune, Kismet, Wisdom, Elysium, and Quintessence.","The first thing that Noah added to the mix was Infinity.","The endless blue of infinity caused the golden tree to pulse with an even brighter splendor as after that, the concepts of Manadynamics, Continuity, Causal Nexus, Dictum, Opulent, Kairos, and Uncertainty were added.","Multiple natural laws were added into the mix for their grand conceptual backing as the number arrived at 19!","It seemed to be just one higher than the minimum required number of Boundaries to form a Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.","The condition was 18 Crimson Consummate Boundaries at the very minimum to be converted together for such a Dynamis to arise!","After such a grand addition of concepts...the Oraculum Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity released tendrils of halcyon grandeur all around.","[The requirements have been met to elevate Oraculum to an even greater stage!]","The golden light within Noah's soul was retained in as thereafter, the aura of Alexander was retracted as obtaining any information from him would be immensely hard!","[The Oraculum Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity has been born!]","[The feature of Wyrd has been born!]","[All prior concepts of Oraculum have undergone Quintessential elevation!]","...!","A monumental achievement was forged as Noah tackled it first for a single reason.","[Adumbrative Viewpoint]","WAA!","His soul called out grandly.","There were many things to explore as the newly obtained feature of [Wyrd] was also something making his will buzz, but he focused on the reason for elevating Oraculum first as a portion of his soul was taken into a golden book that seemed even more intricate and refined!","His soul appeared before multiple paths as he chose the same one as before.","And a pathway of an Unrecorded History began to play out as he seemed to be living in the very midst of it!","A myriad of scenes he had observed before passed before him.","They continued to play out until...","[He gazed at the Second Volume of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi as he could already feel the nonsensical boosts from it. Instead of being capable of cycling 24 different boundary essences across his atoms with every breath, the number was now 48 as this was only one of its boons!]","The glimmering scroll radiating pure majesty could be seen right before him as with a voracious light of tyranny, Noah's soul bellowed out!","[Hyperversal Plundering!]","WAA!","Torrential waves of glory suffused outwards.","A bejeweled golden hand appeared within Noah's Forge as it plucked down towards the completed Fragments of the Second Volume of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi!","[You are attempting to obtain something in an Unrecorded History of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!]","[A grand and impossible goal, and yet the authority of the Oraculum Quintessential Dynamis of Extremity and the Lotra Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity seek to make it a possibility.]","[An enormous amount of your Mana and Soul Values are being drained!]","The Unrecorded History remained stable.","It didn't fracture and break down like before!","All that was left now was Noah's own capabilities as his portion of soul drew from the source and erupted with magisterial glory!","[Your soul is being put under a great strain!]","His soul felt like it was drawing everything from his visage of Alexander.","Even after endless seas of Quintessential Hyperversal Mana Values bathed everything, thousands of his Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Values were also drained unceasingly!","The bejeweled hand pressed down with tyranny while supported by such grandeur as it grasped the vibrant scroll within it.","And with vigor and unbeatable might, this hand plucked with force a single time!","...!","Time felt like it came to a stop.","The circulation of essence and the beating of a heart felt like it stopped!","Until...","BOOM!","Golden light erupted from all around as if an endlessly burning sun had just been born.","And with it...","[An impossible course of action!]","[The Second Volume of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi has been plundered!]","Noah's mind buzzed as dense waves of information and authority began to descend.","[An Achievement worthy of being heralded across the Records of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!]","[Through your actions, your Soul has become exposed to an unknown Hyperversal Authority from the depths of Aeonic Annals of Extremity!]","...!"]},{"number":2580,"title":"Chapter 2580: Chapter 2579 Overpowered At Its Best! VIII","paragraphs":["Noah's main body and Alexander King's body were entirely separate, and yet they shared the same soul.","Two pieces of a single being!","While the separation meant some things could only be utilized by one body, there were other things that Noah's main body benefited from.","At this moment, a prompt blazed over the soul within the body of Alexander King about him being exposed to an Unknown Hyperversal Authority from the depths of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","Due to the ridiculous actions of Plundering something that did not yet exist- something from the Unrecorded History of a possible future!","It caused his soul to be exposed to a type of Unknown Hyperversal Authority as a vibrant colorless transparent authority washed over Noah's soul!","It didn't differentiate between which parts of him as the moment it washed over the soul within Alexander, it also washed over the soul within Noah's main body.","{The unknown Hyperversal Authority has tainted your soul as unknown effects are beginning to manifest!}","The colorless transparent essence was filled with a profound force of life as Noah's soul cried out with fervor at its mere presence!","And just as it began to express shocking effects onto Noah's soul...","BZZT!","A massive shock erupted within him.","As if something utterly rejected what this authority stood for!","CRACK!","Fissures instantly erupted and began to spread across Noah's resplendent soul as the gazes of all of his bodies changed!","{The Vacuous Hyperversal Authority within your Soul is utterly rejecting the Unknown Hyperversal Authority!}","A dreadful phenomenon unfolded as within Noah's soul, it felt like two utterly opposite authorities had interlinked with him as at this moment, they utterly denied each other.","As if they could never mix.","As if one was the Antithesis of the other!","BOOM...CRACK!","His soul across all bodies splintered as his expression became increasingly grim.","Tendrils of two authorities raged and fought against each other with him as the vessel, threatening to destroy him completely!","In the midst of all this, his multiple Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity born from different Dynamis of Extremity shook and erupted with their authority to protect their Master.","But the instant the authority of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity that was the doorway which led to Vacuous Hyperversal Authority joined the fray to help its Master...","HOONG!","The transparent Unknown Hyperversal Authority roared out as it was maddened even more, its tendrils ferociously smacking down to destroy everything with its abundant life force!","{The Unknown Hyperversal Authority has been identified to be the Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!}","As his soul was getting utterly torn apart, he was at least able to learn of the identity of the authority ripping him apart.","Vitalis.","It was a concept that was the direct opposite of Vacuous!","Vitalis quite literally translated to life or life-giving.","An authority hidden within the very depths of the Seven Aeonic Havens as very few beings knew of it, and there was no record on whether any being could actually manipulate it even though it was the basis of the makeup of the very Havens!","What was complicated to understand was the fact that this authority that was the very backbone of the Seven Vitalis Havens...why was it that whenever Extremities or even Noah called out Vacuous Hyperversal Authority that rejected reality within the Seven Vitalis Havens- no rejection occurred in their Aspects of Existence?","Why was it that one could unlock and gain access to Vacuous Hyperversal Authority through Dynamis of Extremity or other means while they lived within the Seven Vitalis Havens?!","And now, both of these shocking authorities were in the depths of Noah's soul.","The Vitalis Hyperversal Authority was also the backbone of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as Noah's recent intrusion and action into obtaining something from an Unrecorded History had caused him to be uncovered to this authority, its exposure being something that should have been a grand positive event as it washed over his soul.","And yet...","'Fuck.'","BOOM!","Even as Quintessence rose in addition to all the authorities of Dynamis of Extremity, the raging polar opposite authorities utterly decimated everything as all of Noah's Soul splintered apart!","He didn't even get a chance to question why these authorities acted the way they did in regards to him as darkness descended.","\"...\"","{Your Quintessential Hyperversal Soul has experienced a version of True Death.}","...!","Death.","True Death!","And yet...","THUMP!","Like the beat of a heart, the countless Fragments of Noah's Soul shone with endless brightness as they slowly came back together!","He died...but not really.","Because so long as the Infinite Hyperversal Haven was not destroyed, he wouldn't die!","When his Fragments of souls were about to be entirely erased from existence, his Record remained untouched as in the Planar Palisades of Extremity, the Infinite Hyperversal Haven roared out like an engine as sources of its essence flowed through the connection it held with its Master.","Noah's consciousness and will felt like it faded for one instance and reappeared in the next instant as the moment his fragmented soul began to come together...","ROAR!","The fucking tendrils of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority raged as the battlefield they were on was reconstructed once more, and their fight destroyed the very battlefield they fought on as Noah's soul shattered into pieces once more!","His Concepts of Extremity surged to try and repair the damage as the Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity that were becoming shattered into pieces the same as Noah's soul fought with every ounce of their authority as in a short period of time- in a fraction of an instant....","{Your Quintessential Hyperversal Soul has experienced a version of True Death.}","Noah's soul was entirely shattered to the point of true death as once more as just like before, Quintessence shone.","His soul began to repair itself.","His soul glimmered full of vitality as the Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority raged once more, the same result occurring again as Noah found he could not even separate his soul from either authority!","{Your Quintessential Hyperversal Soul has experienced a version of True Death.}","Death came once more.","But this time...it took a bit more time before his soul was shattered to pieces.","And not too long within the span of an instant...","{Your Quintessential Hyperversal Soul has experienced a version of True Death.}","It began repeating in a cycle!"]},{"number":2581,"title":"Chapter 2581: Chapter 2580 Overpowered At Its Best! IX","paragraphs":["Every time, his soul would heal as his Concepts and Dynamis backed him. And every time, he would be destroyed by Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authorities!","Fantastically, it took his soul longer and longer to be destroyed after every cycle as ever so subtly...traces of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority were being infused on the very soul they were constantly destroying.","The Vitalis Hyperversal Authority was originally only going to baptize Noah's soul and elevate Quintessentially due to his actions in the Unrecorded History.","And yet now, it continued to flow into Noah's soul and fight with the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority that had its source stemming from Noah's own foundation and the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity!","It was a form of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as it differed from the potent authority of Vacuous Malignancies- the Vacuous Daimonikos who lived outside of reality, space, and time.","The Authority Noah was working with was barely at the level of potency that Vacuous Malignancies held before their First Vacuous Awakening.","And there were many others over the eons who had attained different forms of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority!","None of them had been destroyed the moment they did so. Noah himself wasn't rejected or destroyed when he first accessed Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as the major powers of Extremity even considered this authority the greatest tool to fight against Vacuous Malignancies!","None of them talked about Vitalis Hyperversal Authority.","None of them talked of it as very few even knew of it!","Frankly...Vitalis Hyperversal Authority was even greater than Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","Whenever the two authorities met, they would repel or devour each other depending on the concentration as always, Vitalis would come out on top.","Rifts, spaces, or pockets of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority created within the Seven Vitalis Havens would always reduce and be erased naturally as they never expanded.","Vitalis Hyperversal Authority was so potent that Vacuous Malignancies could not survive within the Seven Vitalis Havens- within the Seven Aeonic Havens!","This was how distinguished and astonishing it was!","The reason for Noah in his current state...was him daring to have a foundation infused with Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, for his soul to hold a source of it in the form of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, and then coincidentally undertaking an action within an Unrecorded History that awarded him a baptism of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority.","It all concluded with these two authorities being enclosed within the core of a single Entity.","Within the soul of a single existence!","And these two authorities...would never mix. One would always drown out the other.","Like fire and water. Like light and dark...but to an even greater extent!","If ever in any Recorded or Unrecorded History where any soul tried intentionally or by mistake to put these two Authorities in the core of their existence...death was their only reprise.","Like the deaths that Noah was experiencing over and over again.","Normally, Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority should have clashed as another astounding genius would fall in the pages of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","Yet...","{Your Quintessential Hyperversal Soul has experienced a version of True Death.}","The anomaly that was Noah came to be.","His soul would continue to be fractured and he would die, but this same soul would be reforged an instant later!","For him, death would only come when a massive Infinite Hyperversal Haven perished.","So during this battle where Vitalis continuously attacked and repelled Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, unimaginable changes were forced to occur over and over again!","The Vacuous Hyperversal Authority that Noah held a minuscule potency of...was encouraged as after every death, its source seemingly became stronger as it came ever closer towards true Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","And the Vitalis Hyperversal Authority that should have been cut off from flowing into Noah's soul...continued to flow as it had yet to achieve its purpose!","{Your Quintessential Hyperversal Soul has experienced a version of True Death.}","Death after death.","Cycle after cycle within the span of instants that were carried into nanoseconds.","Every time, the potency of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority increased.","Every time, more of it was infused in Noah's soul as traces of Vitalis Hyperversal Authority were being infused the same!","During all of these cycles, Noah withstood the tremendous pain of his soul being torn apart before it was put together again.","He withstood it all while shouldering the pain because he could see the cycles taking longer and longer!","He could see his soul being slightly different after every cycle as this wasn't the only thing being forcefully altered.","During the cycles of True Deaths of his soul, many things were impacted.","The Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity.","The 81 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds in his Main Body.","The 81 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians in Alexander's body.","His Hyperversal Forge.","And as these changes occurred within his soul...their effects to a lesser extent reached his body and Origin as minute traces of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities made their way over!","The cycles of his soul being torn had been so quick that they had occurred many times within an instant, but gradually, they began to last as long as a nanosecond.","And then as long as 10 nanoseconds. 1,000 Nanoseconds. 1 Millisecond!","On every junction of time past the passage of an instant alone, the number of true deaths exceeded a million.","A million!","And they continued until...","BZZT!","A second passed entirely as the two authorities raged within his soul, but his soul was not destroyed.","It felt like a thick and viscous mass that absorbed the shocks of the two authorities, and every time they damaged him...he healed just as fast as his state no longer deteriorated!","His soul breathed a exhale of tyranny.","He gazed at the authorities still raging within his soul coldly as because of them, too many things had changed.","{An Unfathomable Quintessential Alteration has occurred to your Soul.}","His capabilities came back to life as the profundities around him were quantified, prompts beginning to appear once more.","He gazed at his current Soul as its state was startling to look at.","After millions of cycles of True Death, changes had occurred every time his soul came back together as the multiple Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity in his soul...were nowhere to be seen.","Instead, a single utterly massive and incandescent tree that screamed out ancientness power rose from the depths of his soul!","The tree had multiple extending thick trunks that flourished into other fantastically massive trees- with the Indefatigable, Vitalistic, and other Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity seemingly now coming from trunks of this massive tree!","The 81 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians in Alexander's body underwent a astonishing alteration.","But more than that...the 81 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds in his Main Body Were altered to such an disturbing degree that...","{The Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds within your main body have transformed into the Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Overlord Meridian Seeds!}","...!","{The Authority of the 10th Boundary Layer of Quintessence is now being expressed within the Aspects of your Main Body!}","...!","{The Authority of the 11th Boundary Layer of Quintessence is now being expressed within the Aspects of your Main Body!}","{The Authority of the 12th Boundary Layer of Quintessence is now being expressed within the Aspects of your Main Body!}","He did not undergo Apexification with his main body.","And yet...!","{The Authority of the 13th Boundary Layer of Quintessence is now being expressed within the Aspects of your Main Body!}","With Quintessence in the lead, the authorities of Boundaries that his soul within Alexander had extended were being expressed in his Main Body in an disturbing turn of events!"]},{"number":2582,"title":"Chapter 2582: Chapter 2581 Overpowered At Its Best! X","paragraphs":["The changes were extremely subtle.","They had occurred in the span of an instant that was then carried into seconds.","Noah experienced them fully as he followed exactly what was happening, but others?","In the center of the Apex Battlefield.","Noah's main body had remained seated on his throne even as a Hyperversal Shadow Extremity floated over with Silas, his demeanor and presence showering the level of respect he held towards this being.","Erikson shook his head while chuckling freely, while Ayame's figure was hard to read as she seemed unsure of exactly what to say to Noah.","At such a juncture, the Hyperversal Shadow Extremity smiled with sharp eyes as he opened his mouth to speak.","And in the span of these few seconds, the cycles of True Death occurred!","Others only felt Noah's eyes dim and brighten millions of times a second.","And when they brightened one final time...","BOOOM!","His seated visage of the True Throne of Quintessence exploded with shocking authority that erupted out like a storm!","It shone with multicolored radiance as Erikson and Ayame's figures that had come close found themselves pushed back by a seething sea of authority- authority that they had only begun to be familiar with as it was that of Boundaries that had stepped into the 10th Boundary Layer and above!","Ever so briefly, Erikson and others nearby thought they felt dozens of such pristine authorities flash before them, their grandeur causing the pressure Noah's Main Body released to outclass any Apex Aeonic Lifeforms nearby.","Upon the throne, his erupting authority felt wild and primordial as if he was a celestial beast lying dormant this whole time!","Along with the erupting authority that would dominate Apex Aeonic Lifeforms at the level of Grand Elders, his Will emanated outwards as it represented his raging soul.","And when it passed over Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, their gazes changed as they felt like an immense weight was pressing down on them!","And this...was only his will.","It was retracted as soon as it had erupted as the gazes of nearby Apex Aeonic Lifeforms remained changed. They felt like the being on the throne was sending out a message.","That he had not made a move this whole time even though he was more powerful than his First Commander and dreadful Lich!","None of them knew...that he had yet to even undergo Apexification.","—","Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority continued to clash against each other in his soul.","But the rate at which they destroyed everything was much slower, as if his soul had developed great resistance to these two authorities!","And how could it not? It felt as if it was structured with wisps of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities at its very core, with the power of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority being so vastly different from before to the extent that it seemed entirely different.","Amidst the hundreds of prompts about Boundaries, there were some particularly shocking ones as Noah gazed at his soul.","He gazed at the Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Overlord Meridian Seeds that had caused a tremendous change to his main body as more prompts appeared about it.","{Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Overlord Meridian Seeds are an Unrecorded type of Meridian Seeds that can support the Source of Boundaries up to the 17th Boundary Layer!}","...!","{When the Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Overlord Meridian Seeds bloom, the Concepts within will be nourished by their authority as within 10 days, they will be elevated to the Quintessential Zenith Tier!}","Ridiculous prompts came as they shattered all established logic on the ascension of power.","They took Noah on a path far different from everyone else as even at this moment, he felt like his soul was burning!","Burning with power and grandeur.","Burning with an intense need to express itself as too many things within it were changed!","The effects of 81 Boundaries all the way to the 15th Boundary Layer for each were conveyed in his main body that had yet to undergo Apexification.","His statistical values shot through the roof as his Aspects of Existence burned with the tendrils of Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authority!","And his authorities in the form of Absolute Dynamis of Extremity...","{The Perennial Weald of Extremity has been born in your Soul.}","Weald!","It was a word that closely meant an primordial grove of trees or mystical forest, and this was what had begun to bloom in his soul as a single massive entity holding all the parts of the myriad of Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity had sprouted within him!","{With all your Sources of Dynamis of Extremity sprouting from the Perennial Weald of Extremity, their power and elevation are raised by a fundamental level!}","{The highest number of Concepts forging a single Dynamis of Extremity will be set as the basis for all other Dynamis that are part of the Perennial Weald of Extremity, with a 100% chance of a successful convergence achievable so long as more concepts of Extremity are placed within the Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity.}","{With the Perennial Weald of Extremity as the basis, the Reified Wealdian Sources of Extremity can now be called out!}","...!","Complete and utter splendor unfolded.","Reified Wealdian Sources of Extremity!","Reified Dynamis of Extremity!","He could call out a representation of the Indefatigable Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.","Of the Oraculum Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity!","Boundless possibilities were rising before his eyes and he tried to navigate just how deep the changes were within his Aspects of Existence.","In addition to all previously mentioned changes, his System that was within the depths of his soul had also undergone alterations as the Infinite Forge was being reconstructed with a light of splendorous loot, the Infinity symbols gushing out seas of Loot light being more than doubled as within it, RUINATION was cheering the process on with fervor as her body absorbed the shocking display of authority.","It was a thorough change.","And a drastic one at that as even his Foundation was buzzing with change, and as if to solidify all of this home...","{Your Quintessential Hyperversal Soul has undergone a mutation of an unquantifiable nature.}","{You are close to your First Vacuous Awakening!}","...!"]},{"number":2583,"title":"Chapter 2583: Chapter 2582 Shock and Horror!","paragraphs":["A new and dangerous concept appeared before him.","Vacuous Awakening.","The potency and purity of the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority within him had become so pristine to the extent that he was close to an Awakening that did not seem like something existences like him would undergo!","But...it also felt like it was simply another profound pathway of power as his soul tyrannically cried out for it.","His transformation had yet to end, yet all parts of him continued to burn with power as even now, Vacuous and Vitalis Hyperversal Authorities continued to rage within his soul.","The only thing was that they couldn't destroy his soul like before.","So wisps of their authority continued to transfuse into his very being.","At such a juncture, Noah's buzzing mind wanted to see just which stage he had now reached with his main body.","Mind you, the visage of Ahpuch that he faced as the strongest foe so far...had been holding an average of 20,000 Apex Aeonic Soul Values.","His body of Alexander had been slightly below these Values as only his Soul Value was close after he had used the authority of Quintessence to move the values from Vitality and Defense into his Soul Values.","And now the somewhat quantified status panel of his main body...caused even his brilliant eyes to spin like emerging Singularities!","{Name}:: Noah Osmont","{Realm}:: Fourth Aletheian Haven of Extremity","{Lineage}:: Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor","{Titles}:: True Emperor of Quintessence, Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor, One Who Gazes Upon Hyperversal Authority, Aletheian, Indefatigable, Tyrannical Emperor, The Tainted, Anomaly, Home of the Weald...","{Quintessential Hyperversal Mana Value}:: Infinite","{Quintessential Hyperversal Vitality Value}:: 68,999","{Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Value}:: 79,998","{Quintessential Hyperversal Defense Value}:: 68,999","{Quintessential Hyperversal Damage Value}:: 79,998","{Hyperversal Dignity}:: 27","{Hyperversal Mastery}:: 27","{Absolute Hyperversal Authority Resistance}:: 25%","{Dynamis of Extremity}:: Indefatigable(Absolute), Aletheian(Absolute), Vitalistic(Absolute), Oraculum(Quintessential Absolute), Thanatos(Quintessential Absolute), Lotra(Quintessential Absolute)","{Boundaries of Extremity}:: Quintessence, Infinity, Blood, Manadynamics, Loot, Reality, Dimensions, Anima, Body, Origin, Soul, Genesis, Apocalypse, Prana, Dreams, Avalon...","\"...\"","Noah took a moment of silence.","He stared at the statistical values before his eyes as after another second passed, he saw the Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Value go from 79,998 to 79,999.","They were increasing in real time!","Sometimes it was small jumps, other times they jumped by the tens as Noah's metamorphosis continued.","Because his soul continued to be broken down and repaired even now.","Because his foundation was increasing his Values unceasingly every moment!","A reason for this...was partly due to this recent change, but also due to the 15th Boundary Layer of Infinity!","{The Fifteenth Boundary Layer of Infinity}:: Your Aspects of Existence have truly embarked on the path of Infinity as your circulation of life has begun to reflect that. Infinity makes it so that the process of circulation of all the authorities coursing through you will grant the highest possible parameters as its goal currently is to achieve a number closest to infinity. The combination of the 15th Boundary Layer of Infinity and Second Volume of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi, the Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation, the Quintessential Hyperversal Soul, and the authority of the Indefatigable, Aletheian, Vitalistic, Oraculum, Thanatos, and Lotra Absolute Dynamis of Extremity coursing through you has caused the strengthening and refinement of your Aspects of Existence to reach a Quintessential level, granting you an increase of +2,500 Hyperversal Soul Values, +2,500 Hyperversal Damage Values, +2,000 Hyperversal Defense Values, and +2,000 Hyperversal Vitality Values daily...","\"...\"","Infinity at the 15th layer.","Its effects were expressed within Noah's main body as he couldn't help it. His body innately did it as it was only natural!","He took a breath.","A single fucking breath.","And the very reality surrounding his main body was turned upside down as the skies of Dissolution seethed!","—","To others, his will had spread out seconds ago and caused them all to feel like a heavy weight was pressing on them.","They were cautious and marveling at the power this being showed a glimpse of as it truly seemed he was much more potent than any of his Commanders or Ahpuch!","But a moment later, they saw his figure on the throne breathe in.","And the moment he did so...","BOOOM!","An utterly horrifying and wild aura erupted out as all essences in the surroundings turned tumultuous and were drawn towards him like an endless vortex!","Along with this absorption, a sliver of his soul erupted out as it was more than a Will.","It barreled out like an endless tide towards the audience in the distance and the Vassals behind him as all those who felt it...had their bodies tremble before uncontrollably, they found themselves sinking to their knees!","...!","As if they were paying their respects to this sliver of soul that had flashed out.","As if their souls had no choice but to do it!","It caused them to blade with shock and Horror as who were they?!","They were scions of important Inheritances!","Some here even stemmed from Clans!","It may not be their most potent Scions, but they were still top tier.","And yet...","\"Motherfuc-OOOH!\"","Erikson cursed as he bellowed out, his legs about to buckle as he warped Probability to such an alarming extent that the reality around him twisted.","Feeling the sliver of Noah's soul about to bring him to his knees, he cried out and erupted with all of his potential as finally, the Ninth Boundary he had been trying to converge into 8 others was forcefully encased in a single seed as from him, the authority of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity erupted!","From his sheer will and unwillingness to kneel, he warped Probability that much!","His knees didn't buckle.","Not too far from him, Infinite waves of heat erupted from Ayame as her body seemed like an engine of flames, an ancient foundation crying out within her this devourer of a Crimson Panacea also held off on not kneeling!","And just as quickly had Noah's sliver of soul revealed itself, it faded away as he finished taking his breath.","Around his throne, reality pulsed as all the essence in the surroundings seemed to be in chaos.","As for him, his figure sat on the throne and opened his eyes again as the scene before him was a shocking one.","A dense number of beings on their knees.","Behind the Hyperversal Shadow Extremity whose eyes shone brightly, Silas and Roan could be seen with ashen faces as they were on their knees.","Noah's Vassals had calmly paid their respects as if it was natural, Henry gazing towards his father with an unfathomable light as he realized he was now much, much further away!","The surroundings were filled with utter silence and disbelief as amidst all this, a sigh of frustration could be heard as Erikson's voice echoed.","\"My guy, please stop trying to break our confidence.\"","...!","A glimpse of the horror that was the True Emperor of Quintessence was revealed as many common scions were brought to their knees.","And even now, they did not know just what a horror he was setting himself up to be!"]},{"number":2584,"title":"Chapter 2584: Chapter 2583 Who is Noah Osmont?","paragraphs":["2583 Who is Noah Osmont?","The 15th Layer of Infinity had the goal of going towards a number closest to Infinity!","So it utterly broke the increase of daily values Noah could gain from all the various aspects that made him, with him being granted an increase of +2,500 Hyperversal Soul Values, +2,500 Hyperversal Damage Values, +2,000 Hyperversal Defense Values, and +2,000 Hyperversal Vitality Values daily.","Defense and Vitality Values used to rise much more proportionally, but this had changed as Soul and Damage Values now took the lead due to the drastic changes in his soul.","But thinking of it plainly...it was a daily increase of 2,500 Soul Values.","This number was the culmination of some Apex Aeonic Lifeforms for hundreds, or thousands, or tens of thousands of years to this day!","It showed that Noah was simply built different!","He monitored the many changes still occurring as while his main body benefited greatly from this Ordeal, his body as Alexander had its own stupendous gains to observe.","One of the bigger ones was the spark that began all of this.","The Plundering of Unrecorded Histories!","As he breathed in with the methodology of the Second Volume of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi, his body beat like an ancient drum cycling different concepts of Extremity as his Soul focused on a set of prompts out of thousands of prompts.","They were the relevant prompts regarding Hyperversal Plundering of Unrecorded Histories that were drowned out when the ordeal with the Vitalis Hyperversal Authority began.","[The action of Hyperversal Plundering of Unrecorded Histories is extremely out of the norms that the Aeonic Annals of Extremity have laid out guidelines for any possible future actions similar to this.]","[A constant output of 99% of your Soul Values is required every nanosecond to stabilize the Unrecorded History and successfully Plunder a targeted item or concept, with a strain being put on your soul depending on what you are targeting.]","99% of his Soul Values every nanosecond, and constantly at that for as long as he needed before he succeeded in obtaining what he wanted!","This was an impossibility for others as unless they successfully Plundered within a nanosecond, they wouldn't have any more Soul Values to give.","But since 95% of Noah's cost of Soul Values was substituted by his Quintessential Hyperversal Mana Values, he paid less than 5% of his Soul Values every nanosecond of Plundering as even this was the highest resource costing ability Noah held to date.","[For the stability of Records, A Single Unrecorded or Recorded History may be the target of Hyperversal Plundering every 24 hours.]","[Within a chosen History, different Concepts of Extremity can be plundered, but only up to the highest Boundary Layer of the Boundaries that the Dynamis of Lotra and Oraculum consist of.]","[Within a chosen History, different Dynamis of Extremity can be plundered to obtain their pathway of convergence and their subsequent Concepts of Extremity and Boundary Layers, but only up to the highest Boundary Layer of the Boundaries that the Dynamis of Lotra and Oraculum consist of.]","[Within a chosen History, different Relics can be plundered up to the level of an Extremity Relic.]","[The Plundering of anything from yourself in a possible Unrecorded History is subjected to the same limitations...]","One guideline after another was unveiled as the sheer atrocity of reality Noah had committed was something he could only do once a day, with a myriad of other restrictions attached to it to make sure all of reality wouldn't be flipped upside down!","He went through the swathes of information with piercing eyes as the changes within his Aspects of Existence continued to be quantified.","—","Extremity Ariana's Extremity Clone stepped on a long stellar pathway that was forged with materials pulsing with the light of Quasi-Extremity relics- this path not being the only one as there were many others similar to it that extended endlessly and seemed to be converging towards a single, central location.","The same location that Extremity Ariana was arriving at as this was located in the depths of a Plane of Existence layered by hundreds of Barriers of Hyperversal Extremity Authority!","It was a domain of space that any Avernus Scions or Elders with enough distinction could access from any Haven with their Wills or portion of souls.","It was a point of space isolated from reality that was known as the Fifth Golden Chambers of Avernus- one of the locations that was like an extension of the Avernus Extremity Senate as here, the Hyperversal Extremities and a select number of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms could come!","All the parts converged into a rectangular structure that shimmered with crystalline gold, purple, and red light- the magnificence of multiple thrones being seen inside it as the unique thing about them..was how they were all the same.","The thrones were lined up in rows left and right with a central hallway that led towards three isolated thrones where the most important existences would preside over the meetings here!","Currently, the centermost throne among the three was accompanied by a man with golden flaming brows and flaming hair that pulsed with Hyperversal Extremity Authority.","He was known as Chamber Master Gayacus.","The rows of thrones he faced were sparsely filled as at this moment, his head raised to see the entrance of Extremity Ariana into the Golden Chambers of Avernus as he waved his hands and caused the few discussions in the environs to quiet down.","[The last pertinent one is here, so let's get started.]","Extremity Ariana's eyes were keen as her figure flashed to appear on one of the thrones at the very front of the Chambers, her will passing around to see all the Hyperversal Extremities who had participated in the incursion of Dissolution from the Avernus side along with a few others who worked behind the scenes.","Among them, the entity of Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction could be seen with his Direct Disciple- Ahpuch!","Their faces were hazy and filled with limitless fury as before all this, these beings had the objective of Ahpuch achieving the 17th Boundary Layer of Destruction through the Apex War..."]},{"number":2585,"title":"Chapter 2585: Chapter 2584 Who is Noah Osmont? II","paragraphs":["2584 Who is Noah Osmont? II","Ahpuch truly sought to achieve the 17th layer through this dreadful war.","And he wasn't able to do this as his Absolute Dynamis of Extremity was plundered and erased, and his records of his Boundaries were fractured and missing major parts as a great deal of treasures and time would be required before he would regain anything.","The unique thing was that the goal of the 17th Boundary Layer of Destruction...was still achieved as Ahpuch's Master had his Hyperversal Extremity Authority erased all the way back to the 17th Layer!","It was a heavy reality.","The eyes of about a dozen Hyperversal Extremities and their Direct Disciples apart from Ariana watched them while shaking their heads as the booming voice of the one leading this meeting resounded out.","[The task of organizing the information obtained from the Incursion and how to move against suspected Guardians is being handled by Chamber Master Jakubi in the Third Golden Chambers of Avernus. Our task here is the Mutated Entity that steered much of the events that occurred, and the being likely to be initiated to become a Guardian due to his power...Noah Osmont.]","...!","As he spoke, illusory screens showing Noah unfolded en masse above the Fifth Golden Chambers of Avernus, alongside the entities he called out- especially Alexander and the Haven Lich Ra'Zan!","On his throne, Chamber Master Gayacus rose as his flaming brows and hair flowed like stellar rivers, waving his hands thrice as three more screens unfolded before everyone here.","[This is a being who had declared war against our Clan and much more, but before we begin to talk about him, I want to bring your attention to three Recorded Histories before us.]","WAA!","The three screens he called out showed the images of three different beings- two men and one woman who all radiated utmost beauty and valor, their faces full of confidence and power as they seemed like the center of reality merely from their visages!","Chamber Master Gayacus pointed to the first screen that expanded to fill everyone's wills- the figure of a man with a cold gaze and snow-white hair.","[An Entity under the name of Herndon from the Nine Mountains Inheritance. His betrothed caught the eye of an Extremity Elder from one of the most prominent Inheritances in the Aeonic Haven of Andromeda, this Elder moving to break their engagement after finding out Herndon had only undergone Apexification with 6 Meridians. He took Herndon's woman forcefully as when he tried to retaliate, his Meridians were shattered and he was left for dead.]","...!","As he spoke, scenes constantly shifted and showed a man beaten and broken!","[At his lowest, he vowed revenge and to destroy all those involved and their Inheritance, with his claims being laughed at as what could a broken man do? Later on, he participated halfway through the Culmination Step within Andromeda. Nobody truly knows what happened, but he reappeared at the end of the Culmination Step a new man- his foundation reforged as he wiped out the Scions of the Inheritance he promised revenge against. This enraged them as they sent their strongest Scions over the next few years, all of them being killed one after another until in the Extremity Step, Herndon became the first to attain Extremity, instantly turning his sword towards the Elder who took his betrothed and killing him in a single strike- erasing his Records in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity instantly!]","On the illusory screen, a scene showed reality being cleaved apart and rewritten as a Hyperversal Extremity fell.","[The Adjudicator of Andromeda had yet to interfere when the enraged Hyperversal Extremities of this Inheritance clashed against Herndon for revenge, and in a shocking turn of events, he erupted with the unbelievable power of a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity and butchered every single Extremity that surrounded him. It utterly devastated the Inheritance as until today...it has been erased entirely from history. Later, it was found out that Herndon was actually a sliver of the soul of a Zenith Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity that had spread himself out through death to seek a grander path, but by that time...everything was over and done.]","...!","Chamber Master Gayacus finished his recollection calmly as he moved on to the woman on one of the illusory screens.","[Then, there is the record of The Sword of Elera. As an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, she had dealings with the Grand Elders of the Gehenna Clan as they scoured the Extremity Vein of Elera together- up until they discovered a Hyperversal Extremity Panacea that could aid one in forming their 18th Boundary Layer. She discovered it, but the Grand Elders of the Gehenna Clan betrayed her as when they couldn't overpower her, a Gehenna Extremity made a move and she was nearly killed.]","[She barely escaped when an Extremity from her Inheritance intervened, but since that moment...great hatred was formed as she vowed to destroy those that betrayed her and the Clan they belonged to. They laughed at her words as she belonged to a minor Inheritance...but do you all recall the name of the Gehenna Clan among today's Seven Clans?]","WAA!","His golden flaming brows radiated intense Hyperversal Extremity Authority as he asked a rhetorical question!","No, the Gehenna Clan was no more as it wasn't one of the Seven Clans of today!","[She single-handedly brought down the clan over the span of a thousand years as it just so happened that she attained the Inheritance of a Failed Tier 4 Hyperversal Extremity, using this as a tool to systematically break down a force with hundreds of Hyperversal Extremities.]","As he spoke, his voice became more and more pronounced as he brought up the third Screen!","[Then, there is the Record of the Extremity of Madness that I can also go through...but my point should be crystal clear. Across History, there have been existences that have risen in unclear paths and means, sown hatred with major forces, and either they are squished to nothingness...or they make true to their threats and against all odds, Major Inheritances or Clans fall.]","[...]","An immense silence descended.","Chamber Master Gayacus was filled with wisdom and age as he looked at the ashen and rage-filled figure of Destruction as he continued.","[We do not know this Noah Osmont, nor do we know whether he's a nobody, or had some unknown History or inheritance that grants him the power he wields. Maybe he is a genuine threat, maybe he isn't- we simply do not know. What we do know...is his very brief history dating back to mere days ago, and yet he had made himself a prominent name on the Haven of Dissolution. In this Apex War, his power was measured below Ahpuch and yet not too long ago, we just received the intel of him erupting with power close to three times that of a genius Grand Elder, and even this may not be the true extent of his power.]","...!","[The aim of this Fifth Golden Chambers of Avernus as directed by the Avernus Extremity Senate is to know Noah Osmont, understand Noah Osmont, and eventually formulate a thorough plan to thoroughly eradicate him or bury the hatred with him. The latter will likely never happen with the nature he has displayed so far, so much of our planning will be for his eradication. The forum...is now open for discussion.]","The Chamber Master Gayacus introduced the task at hand as he then opened it up for discussion!","A collection of over a dozen Hyperversal Extremities...all geared towards answering the question of who exactly Noah Osmont was and the thorough means of eradicating him.","After the discussion was open, Extremity Ariana burned with purple flames as she spoke out coldly.","\"From the words of Emperor Shao, the Recorded History of this Osmont is already concealed in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity. To truly kill him, we will need the power of a Hyperversal Extremity in contact with his main body to burn all his Records away entirely.\"","...!","The words were shocking ones as those here knew of Emperor Shao!","[For Emperor Shao to speak of him, we have to raise his threat level even higher...] Chamber Master Gayacus proclaimed with authority as the surroundings buzzed with grandeur!","[Ahpuch was a Direct Disciple of the Extremity of...Destruction. We have many more Direct Disciples in the Avernus Clan who have attained the 17th Boundary Layer. Their power is also multiple times more than the average genius Grand Elders as a few are capable of affecting Records of one's existence in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity. Can we not mobilize them?]","A burly figure covered in a blue robe spoke out as his words caused the Chamber Master Gayacus to shake his head.","[You missed the whole point of me beginning this discussion with the examples. Beings like this have a factor of uncertainty as it is better to overvalue them than to undervalue them. Direct Disciples may be able to take him down, but why take this risk and leave a reality where unexpectedly, he ends up butchering them somehow? No...against him, all plans need to include a Hyperversal Extremity at the very minimum!]","WAA!","[Now, your tasks are to know and find out everything about him. Where did he originate? Where is this Infinite Hyperversal Haven he has mentioned? Where is he stationed now in the Seven Havens of Extremity...I want to know every damn thing. Where does he eat, sleep, and fuck? Gather every ounce of information as whether he is genuine or not...our mission is to nip this threat in the bud!]","...!","[We have three Extremity Seers among us in this meeting as they shall scour the Aeonic Annals of Extremity for anything relating to Noah Osmont. Keep in mind that any plans made will treat him with utmost severity. Our Scions about to move in the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification in Dissolution will move in large groups and support each other, along with working with the Scions of our allied Inheritances and Clans if they ever come across Osmont. Never shall anyone move against him alone...]","[Oh, and find out what the hell this tiny Cult of Endless Shadows has to do with all this as well. And to what extent his connection goes with the Sima Clan Scion and the Scion of Infinite Extremity...]","Dense discussions erupted and continued.","All of them circled around a single existence as Hyperversal Extremities from the Avernus Clan sought to answer the question...who was Noah Osmont!?"]},{"number":2586,"title":"Chapter 2586: Chapter 2585 The Reified Wealdian Sources of Extremity! I","paragraphs":["{I wonder if Young Master Osmont has time for a discussion regarding the current state of affairs?}","The voice of Primeval Elder Silas's Master- a Hyperversal Shadow Extremity, rang out in the surroundings as many eyes tried to refocus amidst the shocking display of power from the very existence that was being addressed now.","Young Master.","A title granted to distinguished Scions of the Seven Clans or major Inheritances holding great sway over the Seven Aeonic Havens- factions that had many of their people embedded within the Senatus of Extremity that oversaw these vast lands!","The Hyperversal Extremity called Noah with such a title as his hands waved out to enact a shadowy veil that Apex Aeonic Lifeforms could not pierce through with their Wills.","It covered the Apex Battlefield and added a sense of mystery as to what exactly the relationship was between this being representing the Cult of Endless Shadows and the Lineage Emperor of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","Young Master Erikson and Ayame of the Infinite Extremity were enclosed in this shadowy cover as the few others that had come close, with Erikson actually letting out a harrumph at this moment while fearlessly gazing at the Hyperversal Extremity.","\"Extremity Laos...You didn't make a move to aid when Hyperversal Extremities attacked, but you're the first one to appear after the conflict has ended to reap the recognition and reward? What, to let the outside factions speculate what grand connection the Cult of Endless Shadows has with my friend here? That's some stellar sincerity there!\"","Erikson spoke freely against an Extremity like so!","And why couldn't he? In the Sima Clan, he was around Tier 2 and 3 Hyperversal Extremities that could squash this Hyperversal Shadow Extremity under them in a second!","He was distinguished as his status allowed him to talk in such a manner towards such pristine beings. And he even called this being by his name as when it came to the Cult of Endless Shadows and anything else Noah was involved in, Erikson had already put the resources of the Sima Clan to use to gather all the information about them- including this Extremity before him.","His body pulsed with tendrils of his newly forged Absolute Dynamis of Extremity as towards his words, Extremity Laos raised his brows while coming closer, his hands behind his shadowy back as he shook his head.","{I've heard of Young Master Erikson's carefree demeanor, I didn't expect it to be even wilder than the stori-}","Before Extremity Laos could finish his words, Noah's visage of the throne that hid a terrifying exploding power waved his hands and interrupted.","\"Let's stop with all the bullshit and say why you're here. I'm already talking with Gabriella in the Shadow Fortress...is there anything else to discuss between us?\"","Noah's voice was filled with tyranny as there was no ounce of fear when he looked towards Extremity Laos!","The Cult of Endless Shadows had shown their hand and how far they would go as at this moment, Noah only waited for the oath to be upheld and for his mind to wrap around an Armament of Extremity.","Seeing his demeanor and words that didn't hold an ounce of respect for his standing, the Extremity Laos became reserved as his stare was a calm one filled with an ecstatic power.","{I simply came to give congratulations. Since the atmosphere isn't particularly welcoming, I will let Extremity Gabriella continue guiding you in our Cult of Endless Shadows.}","As he spoke, a veil of shadows covered him, Silas, and the other Shadow Elders as they disappeared into smoke that quickly faded away.","A Hyperversal Extremity was still an Extremity. Their Wills would never be subservient to others as when Laos saw Noah didn't plan to give him any recognition, he simply left!","\"Tsk...\" Erikson shook his head at this as his gaze returned to Noah who at this moment focused on him and Ayame with a light smile.","Towards his enemies or unworthy beings, he would be as cold and callous as he wished. Towards those showing goodwill, he had no qualms about being welcoming!","\"Now with you two...\"","He rose from his throne as he spoke, Erikson looking at him cautiously as his body pulsed with power.","\"I'm getting ready to withstand any sudden bursts of your Will trying to make others kneel...and also here to lend my aid in any way possible. As I told you before, the Sima Clan appreciates true geniuses on the path of Extremity as I can represent the Clan to welcome you. Since you have made Avernus Clan your enemy, they may even stoop as low as sending Hyperversal Extremities against you...I mean, they literally did just that not too long ago.\"","Erikson spoke vibrantly as his tan visage and beach attire made him one of a kind in this location, but his words were serious as he continued!","\"Before you say no, why don't you simply let me give you a tour? We can take one of the clones you've displayed in the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands over to the Sima Clan Branch within the Haven of Genesis. Information on the Avernus Clan among other things mind be on the table as I show you what a true Clan should be like.\"","...!","Erikson's words were genuine as Noah's smile became sharp when gazing at him, his reply succinct.","\"There's never a free lunch in any reality...\"","\"No, nothing is free.\" Erikson nodded his head with seriousness and continued, \"Consider my payment of this the reality of watching an exceptional entity who doesn't have the backing of a Clan or Major Inheritances and yet exceeds even someone like me...getting to make sure your path isn't unfairly cut short is my payment. Besides, very few existences are those I can call friends due to my position. You seem like an being I would lose out on if I don't make you into a friend.\"","Young Master Erikson didn't mince his words as Noah nodded with a sharp light while turning towards Ayame.","Her horn radiated Crimson gold light as her beauty was dazzling even amidst the beautiful women among Noah's people discussing amidst themselves far behind him.","She opened her red lips with calmness.","\"I'm here to fulfill the promise we made. We can head to the Helios Branch of Infinite Extremity now if you can spare another clone.\"","Before her words even finished, arcs of light erupted from behind Noah's throne as two figures looking exactly like him stepped out, one adorned in a golden robe of Dreams while the other was adorned in a verdant robe of life and majesty!","\"Let's go, the Culmination Step won't begin in the next day or two anyways...so let's make the trips.\"","He released shocking words with utter confidence as the perceptive minds of the two beings before him buzzed sharply.","The way Noah spoke came with utmost surety as if he had already foreseen this- such a capability reminding Ayame of how she had attained her Extremity Panacea while Erikson's eyes were hard to read!","The Dream Aletheian Chassis went towards Erikson who raised his eyes suspiciously at Ayame and what deal she could have made, with Ayame remaining silent as golden flames erupted around her that took her and Noah's Prana Aletheian Chassis to another location.","Erikson looked upwards as he communicated with someone, a Hyperversal Extremity Authority descending soon after and wrapping around him and Noah's replica as they also disappeared.","Thereafter, Noah's figure looked at his people behind him as with his hands behind his back and his stellar adornments shining majestically, he spoke while gazing into the far distant lands of the Noblesse.","\"Go and claim the Planes of Existence we have fought for.\"","His forces pulsed with light as led by Henry, they turned their gazes to the lands of the Noblesse whose commanders had all but perished!"]},{"number":2587,"title":"Chapter 2587: Chapter 2586 The Reified Wealdian Sources of Extremity! II","paragraphs":["Ignoring the peering gazes in the distance, Noah's Vassals acted as the tool the claim the hundreds of Planes of Existence under the Noblesse as at this point in time, in meant that two of the four Aboriginal Lineages within the young Haven of Dissolution had fallen under Noah's reign!","Even though a dense number of Lifeforms had now swarmed into Dissolution, the only true aboriginals left were the Planeswalkers and Quasarians- with Noah's next sidequest being the Quasarians as for this...he gazed towards the Mad Apex Emperor who caught his gaze as if he was waiting for it.","He nodded a moment later as he flew like a meteor towards the Quasarian Lands, a hundred Enders of Extremity following behind him!","Aurelia and Orion were facing the figures of Roan and other Learnean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who sided with him as they seemed lost for words, with the pocket of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority still containing Alexander shining with a dull light.","At such a moment, the cackling of a Haven Lich could be heard as Ra'Zan appeared before Noah with a Legion of Thanatos Vassals, the Seven Chthonian Sinners of Thanatos grandly following behind him as he communicated with his Master!","Noah heard its will and gave a light acknowledgment as a multicolored light radiated from his True Throne of Quintessence, the Haven Lich, and all other Thanatos Vassals being hit by this light and pulled towards the throne as they disappeared entirely.","Not too long after, Noah's figure also didn't remain as with a blinding light and a cold stare towards all eyes gazing in the distance, he also disappeared!","The Apex Battlefield now seemed empty as the forces were either dead or dispersed, the only thing left behind being a pocket of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority and a forever altered reality that held broken mountains of bones and a deathly chill of poisonous verdant smoke that still wavered even now.","Those who had come for a show realized that everything was done, their discussions plentiful as many of them talked of the ramifications of the War and the incursion of Hyperversal Extremities while waiting for the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification to begin!","—-","In the Infinite Hyperversal Haven floating silently in the swathes of the Planar Palisades of Extremity.","Anomalous Entities and other oddities passed across Noah's home that was as small as a speck of dust in this region of nothingness, and yet it remained unperturbed as wondrous changes occurred within it.","It seemed like there were constant changes and seas of essence blooming as at this point in time, seas of natural laws raged out cheerfully as their Master returned with his main body.","He had to monitor the changes happening with him and just what exactly the results of the continued clash of the Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities was going to be!","Along with Noah's return, the figure of the Haven Lich Ra'Zan appeared in the Prana Aletheian Haven as he breathed in with his bony skull the lively aura of life!","He chose this location over Niflheim as he himself could already spread an overabundance of death. With the counterpart of life right beside him, his goals were much more likely to be achieved as he looked at the Thanatos Vassals beside him and the bodies of Avernus and Singularity Overseers Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that he had yet to change into deathly abominations.","In a raspy voice, the Haven Lich began while gazing at the Sinners of Thanatos and all other Vassals around it.","\"Death and Necromancy are tricky as Legions of Endless undead always warms my dead heart...but champions of utmost power and quality will be able to aid Master the most. Here...we shall test with death to produce Thanatos Champions whose mere appearance on the battlefield will shatter the wills of Master's enemies.\"","As the Haven Lich spoke, the adornment on the Lich's body changed as after reading the records of the region nearby and seeing the white coat of a certain Doctor who was experimenting with Lifeforce not too far away, a similar white coat formed around the bony exterior of the Haven Lich as the verdant flames in his sockets stare at the Thanatos Vassals around him with glee!","\"Let us begin.\"","...!","The deathly essence of Thanatos spread out as a mad lich sought to create not just endless Legions of Undead, but a few central forces with the Chthonian Sinners of Thanatos as the basis to create Champions of Thanatos!","In another region of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","Noah's main body materialized above the massive and ever-expanding Haven that continued to look grander by the second, the number of lives and existences within it continuing to expand as all of this...was what he had to protect.","His power was great, with his limits being tested even now as his main body veered off the path that others took greatly.","And yet even now, he didn't become complacent as sought of ways of overcoming threats that had yet to even appear!","It wasn't that he was paranoid and wouldn't enjoy the small victories he attained by feasting like the old times, he simply liked to over prepare so that his enemies would only ever continue guessing what his power and capabilities were!","And so, he called out.","{Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum}","...!","In the depths of his soul, the Perennial Weald of Extremity pulsed and expressed fantastical brilliance.","The Oraculum Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity that was now a part of the Perennial Weald of Extremity shone!","The Oraculum Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity took center stage as Part of his soul flowed out, blinding halcyon light erupting out like a singularity before him.","Tendrils of Oraculum danced wildly around this singularity as they formed into a massive humanoid stellar gold visage similar to Noah, but every part of this entity was forged from Oraculum as he was the representation of this Dynamis!","His size and stature were far greater than Noah's main body as he seemed to be hundreds of times bigger, his skin flowing with stellar gold light as his face...only held two blind white eyes that radiated ancientness.","No nose. No mouth. No hair.","Brighter shades of runic etchings could be seen on his front as from his legs, the outline of a celestial tree tattoo could barely be discerned as it ended with the weaving of a Yggdrasil on his chest- his visage being one of utter majesty that most existences would kneel towards!","The white Singularities that were his eyes blinked as they flashed like blinding suns, these eyes staring at Noah's main body that seemed like a grain of sand in the distance as when their eyes connected...they were one and the same existence!","And yet...the Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum felt unfathomable waves of power coursing through it.","And how could it not? Quintessence along with many more concepts made its core as its capabilities were shocking ones!","{The Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum has been born!}","{Under it, all abilities requiring the authority of Oraculum have their resource requirements reduced by half, with the Source of Oraculum being closely interlinked with the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as it can move within akin to the Annals being a second home.}","...!","Prompts and waves of information washed over Noah as the capabilities of the first Reified Wealdian Source of Extremity began to be extrapolated!"]},{"number":2588,"title":"Chapter 2588: Chapter 2587 The Reified Wealdian Sources of Extremity! III","paragraphs":["2587 The Reified Wealdian Sources of Extremity! III","[The Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum costs no resources to keep active apart from taking a portion of your soul.]","[The Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum is capable of expressing 9x of your current statistical Quintessential Hyperversal Soul, Vitality, Defense, and Damage Values. This augmentation remains up until your Values undergo evolution when attaining Extremity. Hyperversal Extremity Values cannot yet be augmented as future modifications will be dependent on which concepts achieve Extremity.]","[When pondering on Extremity with the concepts it is made of, Oraculum's rate of progression towards higher Boundary Layers is increased by 10,000%]","A ridiculous being.","This was what the Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum was as if everything else was stripped from it and only its grandiose capabilities of expressing 9x Noah's values were retained, it would still be a game changer similar to Noah's Quintessential Reified Source of Extremity!","Noah stared at himself and the will within the Wealdian Source of Oraculum as it seemed calm, ancient, and aloof- this Reified Source taking his personality and amplifying a few parts that fit it best as even though he was looking at himself...he felt like he was looking at a different version of himself.","His eyes flashed as he gazed at the profound status panel of the Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum.","[Name]:: Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum(Noah Osmont)","[Realm]:: Fourth Oraculum Haven of Extremity","[Lineage]:: Quintessential Hyperversal Oraculum Emperor","[Titles]:: True Emperor of Quintessence, The Tainted, Anomaly, Home of the Weald, The Oraculum...","[Quintessential Hyperversal Mana Value]:: Infinite","[Quintessential Hyperversal Vitality Value]:: 626,391","[Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Value]:: 723,591","[Quintessential Hyperversal Defense Value]:: 626,391","[Quintessential Hyperversal Damage Value]:: 723,591","[Hyperversal Dignity]:: 27","[Hyperversal Mastery]:: 27","[Absolute Hyperversal Authority Resistance]:: 25%","[Absolute Hyperversal Authority Penetration]:: 25%","\"...\"","The numbers didn't lie!","Absolutely disgusting values showed themselves as truly, they were 9 times Noah's current Values...and this was before he had undergone the traditional pathway of Apexification!","When the time came that he did this...would be even better considered to be following the same path as others? When his results were so drastically different?","This question caused Noah to smile as a moment later, he placed his right hand on his chest to feel his beating heart that glimmered like a singularity as he called out.","[Reified Wealdian Source of Lotra.]","[Reified Wealdian Source of Thanatos.]","[Reified Wealdian Source of Aletheian.]","[Reified Wealdian Source of Vitalistic.]","[Reified Wealdian Source of Indefatigable.]","...!","One after another, he called them out.","And why not? There was no cost to bring them out as only his soul would be stretched to multiple other bodies- bodies that would then express even more power greatly above his Main Body!","BZZT!","The essence in the surroundings seethed as 5 other Singularities bloomed on the sides of the Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum- Titanic forms of entities beginning to be formed as each one blazed with their own unique grandeur.","For Lotra, dazzling jewel-like grandeur overflowed as a being whose body seemed to be forged from stellar crystalline jewels appeared, his form also humanoid with a celestial head that only held a pair of dazzling multicolored eyes!","Around him, illusory treasure caches began to materialize at a speed visible to the naked eye as its sheer authority alone caused the condensation of Loot as he seemed like a wealthy ancient entity from times of old.","To his right, the visage of the Reified Wealdian Source of Thanatos could be seen as it throbbed with obsidian verdant glory.","A Quintessential verdant skeletal structure flashed briefly before it was covered with a massive obsidian robe, the head of this entity being a terrifying skull radiating beauty and power as the sockets released tendrils of green flames!","In his right hand, a massive obsidian weapon in the shape of a Scythe could be seen as it seemed like an extension of this being.","Deathly energies raged around him as his appearance had caused a far away Haven Lich in the middle of his experimentations in the far distance to turn his will over this direction.","On the other side of Oraculum, the figure of the Reified Wealdian Source of Aletheian could be seen as he carried a black gold splendor- his skin glinting with a stellar hue of purple blue light as every part of him seemed to be forged from broken down planes of existence, his whole body seeming like a massive Haven that could hold quintillions of lives within it!","The only thing was that the body of the Reified Wealdian Source of Aletheian seemed smaller than Thanatos, Oraculum, and Lotra!","To its right, an emerald light ruled as the Reified Wealdian Source of Vitalistic triggered the force of life in the surroundings to be raised by another octave, its size also similar to the Reified Wealdian Source of Aletheian as within its body...the illusion of an endlessly dense verdant forest covering countless light years could be seen.","Lastly, there was the Reified Wealdian Source of Indefatigable.","The Dynamis that was formed first!","This one held an enticing and yet terrifying beauty as the head of the humanoid visage of Indefatigable...held four faces!","Each of them shone with Noah's devilish beauty, but they seemed much colder and callous, even cruel to an extent as all four faces only held pulsing stellar cherry colored pupils that spun endlessly with a light of destruction.","Around it, pulsing rivers of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority shaped and swirled with beauty and danger- with the rivers of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority circling around and then being drawn into the stellar cherry black colored body that emanated a profound sense of danger and ancientness.","The size of Indefatigable was also Titanic, but it was the same as Aletheian and Vitalistic as the Dynamis that were not Quintessential Absolute were not as large in stature!","\"...\"","This discrepancy was witnessed clearly as Indefatigable domineering gazed down at the larger visages of Lotra, Oraculum, and Thanatos as its many pairs of eyes emanated a light of tyranny.","As if Indefatigable should already be a Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity right now!","...!","Six Reified Wealdian Sources of Extremity bloomed in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","Each one conveyed profound power and uniqueness as Oraculum had its nature more in tune with the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as others had their own uniqueness!"]},{"number":2589,"title":"Chapter 2589: Chapter 2588 The Wealdian Council of Extremity!","paragraphs":["2588 The Wealdian Council of Extremity!","Noah looked at the six different versions of himself and smiled.","They formed a circle above the very heights of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as around them, seas of multicolored authority flowed serenely.","He was all of them, and yet each of the Reified Wealdian Sources of Extremity had their own distinct versions of his personality!","When looking at them, Noah couldn't help but turn playful as when he gazed at the circle of Titanic Reified Wealdian Sources of Extremity, he proclaimed grandly.","\"For the first time in Recorded History...we shall convene the Quintessential Wealdian Council of Extremity.\"","...!","On a whim, Noah enacted such a Council as he gazed at the different personalities of himself voiced in the Wealdian Sources of Extremity!","The voice of the stellar crimson Indefatigable Wealdian Source had his voice buzz out next grandly as the rivers of potent Vacuous Hyperversal Authority around it pulsed with majesty.","\"The aim is Quintessence. The inevitable result is Extremity!\"","The inevitable result was Extremity. A mere inevitability!","The other Wealdian Sources of Extremity expressed Noah's will in different forms as through the Wealdian Source of Oraculum, Noah smiled and expressed his thoughts with the other personalities as a dense number of possibilities unfolded before him.","\"The first task of this path of inevitable Extremity is survival and safety against any measures that Hyperversal Extremities may bring against us. Death is not a possibility...with the only weakness being the Infinite Hyperversal Haven!\"","The Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","If found by his enemies, this was the only thing that could jeopardize his path.","He was able to survive against the clash of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority due to his connection with the Infinite Hyperversal Havens- his death being an impossibility unless this Haven was destroyed!","So naturally, his enemies would inevitably be seeking his home in order to destroy him.","Noah wanted to take that option away from his enemies and be proactive in making a move before even they did.","Noah's will gazed at the vibrant Haven and the wonders it contained through the Wealdian Source of Aletheian as he spoke grandly through it.","\"Its capabilities and features are being elevated along with the advancement of the Natural Laws towards Extremity. At this moment, it can deny entry to Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, but a Hyperversal Extremity can still barge in and reject the Absolute Authority from this Haven!\"","It was already astounding that a domain could entirely reject even Apex Aeonic Lifeforms by itself, and this capability may even be expanded to Hyperversal Extremities in the future when Manadynamics and other Natural Laws began to step onto this stage as well!","\"The Planar Palisades of Extremity...\" In an ancient and deep voice, Noah's will in the Wealdian Source of Thanatos spoke out while surrounded by death. \"...are no longer safe. The Infinite Hyperversal Haven has to be moved.\"","The Planar Palisades of Extremity were no longer safe!","Noah planned ahead and thought of any possible futures where things could go wrong, and this was the decision he arrived at!","The question was...where does one hide a Haven away from the prying eyes of Hyperversal Extremities?","—","In the Fifth Golden Chambers of Avernus.","Extremity Ariana had a pondering look as she browsed through the dense amount of information on the little history of Noah Osmont they gathered and his movements in the Haven of Dissolution.","Soon after, her voice rose amidst the vibrant discussions.","[It says here that the Planes of Existence that his Learnean Lineage were in are all gone from their original locations. Paired with the fact that these Learneans only appeared a few billion years ago in Dissolution, they should have originated from any of the endless swathes of space in the Planar Palisades of Extremity. There are still countless Minor Planes forming across the Palisades who have yet to enter the folds of the Seven Havens...he may have his current base somewhere there!]","...!","Her words were echoing as they were absorbed by all before Chamber Master Gayacus nodded with a brilliant light.","[We shall send out the reserve Apex Aeonic Avernus Legions to wade through the regions of the Planar Palisades forming the most wormholes with the Haven of Dissolution and spread from there. You all also send out either your Main Bodies or other Clones to make this process even faster...let us see if we can locate him and the Planes of Existence that disappeared from the Learnean Lands within the Planar Palisades!]","A decision was quickly made as the Avernus Hyperversal Extremities moved quickly.","Chamber Master Gayacus turned towards Extremity Ariana with sharp eyes as he asked.","[Where are we with the Cult of Endless Shadows?]","[An insignificant connection at most. They have increased their number of Tier 1 Extremities recently as it is likely they have attained some type of Hyperversal Extremity Treasure. Both sides are likely using each other as there are signs of an Oath of Extremity having been made between own of their people and Osmont.]","Extremity Ariana replied succinctly while waving her hands dismissively.","With a authoritative light, the voice of the existence who used to have attained Extremity in Destruction hissed hate next.","[Suppress them and the Inheritances they make dealings with. Cripple their capabilities to obtain resources in the dark to the extent they cannot complain to the Adjudicator of Penumbra! Suppress them until they turn their backs on this Osmont...]","[...]","Ideas continued to bounce from one Extremity to another as some spoke with much more emotion than others.","But the chosen participants of the Fifth Golden Chambers of Avernus made headway in their search of Noah Osmont- the forces of the Avernus Clan being mobilized based on their findings!","—","Where does one hide something away from the prying eyes of Hyperversal Extremities?","This question whirred in his mind and the minds of his collective will as soon after, his soul in the Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum smiled.","\"Well...when it comes to places others cannot even look at, I can think of one.\"","...!","The faces of the Reified Wealdian Sources of Extremity had no mouths or noses, but their eyes gave off a devilish smile at this moment as Oraculum continued!","\"Since we can take things out, it should naturally be possible to place something in.\"","...!","A dreadful silence fell amidst the discussion of the Wealdian Council of Extremity.","It was soon broken by the tyrannical voice of the Reified Wealdian Source of Indefatigable as he stared at Oraculum.","\"Simply take the Infinite Hyperversal Haven into the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!\"","WAA!","The answer that Noah's Will reached as different versions of his soul gathered...was to take him home into a place of countless Records and possibilities!"]},{"number":2590,"title":"Chapter 2590: Chapter 2589 Relocation! I","paragraphs":["Take the Infinite Hyperversal Haven from the Planar Palisades of Extremity and into the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!","This daring idea was brought forth from Noah's Will as the eyes of the Reified Wealdian Sources of Extremity radiated profound tyranny.","As the idea took root, all eyes came to land on the Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum.","The prompts that had come during its advent were simply in nature as among them, there was one unique one in particular that appeared first.","{...Under it, all abilities requiring the authority of Oraculum have their resource requirements reduced by half, with the Source of Oraculum being closely interlinked with the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as it can move within akin to the Annals being a second home.}","The Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum could treat the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as a second home due to its nature.","Noah now wanted to take this even further and actually make such a saying into a reality.","The body of the Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum vibrated with tendrils of authority as the gazes of all other parts of Noah's Will waited for his words, and the words that came were mighty!","\"Plundering something from an Unrecorded History was already an ordeal as I can already speculate that placing something in an Unrecorded History will be an impossibility at the current stage. But a Recorded History....should be stable enough since it is a reality that has already been established and played out. I shall place the Infinite Hyperversal Haven...in a Recorded History!\"","...!","Noah's will through Oraculum stated straightforwardly that it would place the Infinite Hyperversal Haven into a Recorded History!","These words were said without question as the moment it was decided, the figure of Oraculum rose upwards and disappeared into a glimmer of light an instant later.","SHAA!","Outside of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven. In the Planar Palisades of Extremity.","Oraculum materialized with all of his grandeur as he looked at the barely discernible object floating like a speck of dust, his hands reaching out and grasping it in his palm.","Even now as Noah observed such an action, he was amazed at how this minuscule speck of dust was actually a treasure that held countless light years worth of Planes, realities, cosmos, and other stellar bodies within it!","And yet somehow, it was condensed to such a small size that fit into the palm of his Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum at this moment.","Thereafter, the golden authority of Oraculum wrapped around the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as the singularities that were the eyes of Oraculum blinked with concentration.","The Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","They were Records of things that had come and gone, and they were also records of things to come.","They weren't something tangible as those with pristine concepts of Extremity relating to it could view the Aeonic Annals of Extremity and learn of many profundities within them!","But one didn't normally obtain something conceptual from an Unrecorded History within the Aeonic Annals of Extremity like Noah did.","And beings didn't normally attempt to 'place' something within the Aeonic Annals of Extremity as the next thought process after all this!","Noah didn't question whether he could actually do it or not. After inherently knowing Unrecorded Histories would be an impossibility, he turned towards Recorded History as at this moment, his authority bloomed as he silently cast Adumbrative Viewpoint.","The casting this time had a goal in mind as Noah wasn't viewing things to come, he was instead looking backwards to Records that had already occurred!","And this time around, his body did not release a sliver of his soul to enter the Aeonic Annals of Extremity. Instead, the whole visage of the Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum moved forward and disappeared into a blinding flash of light to step in!","...!","Tendrils of authority flashed.","The Infinite Hyperversal Haven was still in his palm as when his vision reacclimated, he found himself amidst the vastness of countless records all around him!","His records occupied everything before his sight like a blinding singularity, while smaller bubbles of records were attached all around it as these represented his Vassals.","Noah's destination in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity was actually his own Records- his Soul knowing that this would be the easiest thing to manipulate and control for him to truly succeed in placing the Infinite Hyperversal Haven inside the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!","His Records were now hidden from others similar to beings who had attained Hyperversal Extremity as he was the only one who could view them, with his steps being heavy as he moved to instantly explore into the massive singularity that was his Recorded History.","All this time, the Infinite Hyperversal Haven continued to be wrapped in the dense authority of Oraculum as it seemed like a part of the Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum whose very existence was allowed to naturally be in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!","Noah delved into his Recorded History as now came a question of which Record exactly did he want to hide the Infinite Hyperversal Haven in?","For him, it was something sentimental as he already had in mind right where he wanted it to be.","He had two top options as the first one was actually in the Frozen Lands of the Beast World where he attained the Spiritual Land first!","But this ultimately didn't make the cut as Noah went back further.","The body of the Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum moved across countless sheets of History, paying attention to none of them as the reality around seemed like glimmering golden pages just moving past him one after another.","He continued until seconds later, a particular golden page unfurled before him that he delved into without a second thought!","And then, his vision changed.","He materialized inside a fantastical Recorded History.","He was in the skies above a dilapidated apartment building as far behind it in the distance, a small field and the beginning of a forest could be seen.","On the field, a thin youth had his right hand raised as he called out.","[Fireball]!","It was a record of Noah's home!"]},{"number":2591,"title":"Chapter 2591: Chapter 2590 Relocation! II","paragraphs":["Noah smiled while looking at the scene of his young self beginning his experimentations of casting fireballs as he turned towards the apartment complex that held his old room.","With a flash, he disappeared into it.","The room was nothing to marvel at with its single bed, worn-down desk, and a chair that could barely hold someone over 200 pounds.","A blinking computer that he used to browse the news of Hunters was on the table as beside it, a globe of what the blue planet used to be could be seen with its fractured continents.","Noah's Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum appeared within this room after all these years as this record told him just where he came from!","This was his home for some time after the apocalypse began as at this point in time, Oraculum brought his hand that held the Infinite Hyperversal Haven forward and onto the center of the globe on his old desk.","Now came the most crucial part.","The Infinite Hyperversal Haven completely left his body and became anchored atop the globe of the blue planet as a moment later...","BZZT!","Tendrils of authority erupted as this Chronicle buzzed!","{A foreign object has been brought into a Recorded History it does not belong in!}","The Recorded History trembled, but it remained stable as Noah felt his Soul and Mana Values leaking out en masse.","His Soul Values for the Oraculum were in the hundred thousands!","{A large amount of your Soul Values are being utilized to hold the foreign object placed in the Recorded History.}","{The foreign object will never be assimilated into the Recorded History as the authority of Oraculum will always be required to wrap around it!}","Noah never questioned whether he could do it or not. He knew he would as the only thing to wonder was what the cost would be!","If he could even plunder things from a possible future that hadn't even happened, simply placing something in a record that had already occurred seemed mild to him in comparison.","{25% of your Soul Values will be required every second to maintain the foreign object within the Recorded History.}","{Any Living Beings within the foreign object cannot come in or out unless they are encased in the authority of Oraculum.}","{An astonishing achievement worthy of being echoed in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity! Your actions have caused your soul to become more intimate with the Records of Extremity as your standing as a Quintessential Hyperversal Aeonic Curator has become even more distinguished!}","A dazzling set of prompts flashed before his eyes as he pulled his hands back.","The authority of Oraculum floated serenely from him and around the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as it was truly anchored in a Recorded History!","Inside his old home that was only accessible through a Recorded History, his grandiose construct which was the Infinite Hyperversal Haven stood silently.","Within this Haven was his main body as unless an enemy grasped this body...they would never be able to find his Records in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","So if his main body and Hyperversal Plane were both hidden inside Records that nobody could access...the reality of utmost safety Noah wanted was created!","From now onward, any time he or his people needed their bodies or clones to enter or leave the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, they would need the authority of the Oraculum Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity to do so as the level of protection was pristine.","'Good...'","With bright eyes, the Oraculum gazed at the old dilapidated room that now held an astounding treasure one last time before he flew out.","His gaze lingered on the scrawny figure in the fields releasing hundreds of fireballs as after another second, the Oraculum left this Chronicle to quickly return to the vast and endless Aeonic Annals of Extremity!","He could only Plunder Recorded or Unknown Chronicles once a day, but it didn't mean he could continue gazing at and exploring all the Unrecorded Histories.","And with the advent of the Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum, his reach into the Records of Extremity was even more intrusive as there were many things for him to observe!","In the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, the Wealdian Council of Extremity was one man short as the Reified Wealdian Source of Indefatigable nodded with its four faces while voicing out.","\"With that done, there is the optimization of concepts and Dynamis as Indefatigable shall be next in becoming a Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity. Everything else follows.\"","...!","The words were filled with tyranny and seemed inviolable as the other parts of Noah's will had no problem with this!","He needed to elevate the remaining Dynamis to the Quintessential Absolute level as well as organize his own strength before the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification began.","The Reified Wealdian Sources of Extremity had their own strengths as two in particular needed to come into play apart from Oraculum who was already moving.","One was Indefatigable which needed to have a clear standing with Vacuous Hyperversal Authority and the coming First Vacuous Awakening as the clash between Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities continued in his soul.","The other was Aletheian and exactly to what extent its advancement would affect Noah's Aletheian Havens and the Havens of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven itself!","The other Dynamis were already playing their parts, with Lotra being extremely exceptional at this as even now...","\"I shall quantify what stage the Forge has reached...\"","The voice of the Reified Wealdian Source of Lotra echoed out as he disappeared, moving towards a position within Noah's soul that was also affected by Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authorities and the cycles of True Deaths they caused.","The Infinite Forge!","It no longer depicted the old Forge as within it was the blinding radiance that was RUINATION at the very center- constantly absorbing the Loot Light that would have gone towards making the Fragments of the Second Volume of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi.","But apart from it and the swirling mountains of normal Loot...there were two particularly dazzling points of light that foretold the appearance of Relics far exceeding the Quasi-Extremity rank!"]},{"number":2592,"title":"Chapter 2592: Chapter 2591 Curagulus Mask!","paragraphs":["Noah's will in the Reified Wealdian Source of Lotra appeared within the Infinite Forge that had been forced to undergo its own changes during the cycles of True Death as currently, a dazzling array of prompts belonging to it rained down.","{The Quintessential Hyperversal Infinite Forge has been reborn anew after millions of cycles!}","{In addition to accumulating Quintessential Hyperversal Loot Light of Extremity, the Forge will now randomly spawn versions of items deemed significant enough to be recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity in the form of Recorded and Unrecorded History.}","{Countless possibilities have opened up for the usage of the Quintessential Hyperversal Loot Light of Extremity and what it can be transformed into.}","{The entity residing in the Forge has been bathed with the Loot Light of millions of cycles and has undergone an unknown mutation.}","Prompts came down one after another as there were multiple important ones, but one prompt in particular explained why there were two dazzling lights apart from Ruination in the Infinite Forge.","It was the Loot stating that apart from the accumulating Loot Light, the Forge would randomly spawn versions of Loot that were significant enough to be in either Recorded or Unrecorded Histories!","And the crucial word here was versions.","It wasn't the item itself, but a version of it recreated by Noah's Forge.","And the two blinding lights that had appeared after his soul was fractured millions of times by Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority were of utmost majesty.","The structure of the current Forge had changed as 162 radiant infinity symbols releasing seas of Loot Light followed the pathway of a single radiant illusory infinity symbol as it seemed in the entire forge, there was only a single massive lemniscate symbol gushing out loot light!","In the center of the massive illusory infinity symbol was Ruination, and towards the middle of the two circular portions of the symbol- the two new blinding lights floated serenely amidst the sea of Loot Light.","Noah's will within Lotra beckoned towards both of them powerfully as their identities were unveiled before him.","One looked like an enclosed umbrella as it held arcs of purple light around it, and the other was a white gold spear with a point at the very end that constantly clashed with reality.","{Nine Mountains Umbrella}:: An Extremity Relic that was utilized in the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification within Elera by the young Hyperversal Extremity of Combat...","{Spear of Beginning}:: The 67th Extremity Relic to form in the Unrecorded History of the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification of Dissolution...","...!","Extremity Relics.","After all it had been through, his Forge actually spawned Extremity Relics at this moment!","Their stats were slowly revealing themselves before Noah as one was from a Recorded History stemming from the Haven of Elera, and the other was a version of a weapon that would appear in the Unrecorded History of what would happen in Dissolution!","From this, many things could be extrapolated as one of the main ones was the fact that in this upcoming Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification of Dissolution...Extremity Relics would be forming by the dozens at the very least among the many more things that had yet to occur.","As Noah gazed at these two fantastical loot termed Extremity Relics, the question of what exactly such a loot stood for came.","To truly understand this, Noah's will had to delve into the first Extremity Relic he had received.","The relic he was given after swearing the Oath of Curagulus!","The Relic he was about to adorn on his face at this very moment far from here, in the Haven of Dissolution under the gaze of the Adjudicator and three other Guardians of Extremity!","—","A white gold mask.","Noah's clone turned it around as he felt the Hyperversal Extremity Authority on it disappear, bringing the mask towards his face as even though it shone with stellar darkness, the moment it settled on his face...everything brightened up as the scene before his eyes was as if he was seeing a new transparent illusory reality!","{Identity Confirmed- Noah Osmont, Unofficial Guardian, No Rank.}","A feminine voice rang out from the Curagulus Mask as Noah adorned it, a dense amount of illusory numbers and data flashing before Noah as the mechanical voice continued.","{Welcome to the Curagulus Mask, Unofficial Guardian. Here is all the information you will need to understand my workings as you get started.}","...!","In front of Noah, a trace of essence flew out into a bundle as it waited to enter his Will. He sent out a trace of his will to accept this bundle of information as the details of the Curagulus Mask unveiled themselves.","{Curagulus Mask}:: A Mass Produced Series of Extremity Relics forged by the Extremity of Steel. Its most basic feature is to release a type of weakened Hyperversal Authority that can Absolutely Veil one's authority and identity from the gazes of beings up to the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity level. Its more advanced features relate to the workings of Curagulus as it acts as the key to connect you to a database of Records usable only to existences with pre-approved signatures. As an Unofficial Guardian, access is currently limited to the most basic information and the Missions Tab that lists possible first missions that when chosen and completed, more advanced information will become available. The Vault of Curagulus is only visible under the View Only feature as nothing can be bought or traded currently...","The bundle of information was extensive as it listed many possibilities of the Curagulus Mask, but the most astounding feature was that this simple mask forged by the Extremity of Steel could actually mask one even against the gazes of Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities!","This feature alone was powerful enough to make any Relic an Extremity Relic, but then the Curagulus Mask went even further to include dozens of other features.","This included {Missions}, {Currency of Curagulus-0}, {Vault of Curagulus}, {Records of Clans}, {Records of Inheritances}, {Records of Extremity}, and more!","All of this flashed before Noah's eyes like holographic blue bordered tabs that were grayed out, the only thing shining with a bright cerulean hue being the Missions tab and the Vault of Curagulus tab that when he focused on...bundles of information unfolded!"]},{"number":2593,"title":"Chapter 2593: Chapter 2592 A Cryptic Future!","paragraphs":["{Vault of Curagulus}was the most dazzling one as when this feature was expanded, a myriad of fantastical borders of different colors showing a vast array of different items unfolded!","Some were labeled {Hyperversal Extremity Treasures}, {Extremity Relics}, {Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi}, {Aeonic Treasures of Extremity}, {Unidentified Relics}, {Vessels}, {Armaments of Extremity}...","There were many, but Noah focused on {Armaments of Extremity} as over a dozen square tabs shining with gold light made themselves apparent to him.","Each one shone with utmost radiance as these were Armaments of Extremity!","An image along with a brief description was all that was present for each one as Noah breezed through them.","{Record Cleaver- Amattul}:: An Armament of Extremity forged by the Extremity of Steel. 10 Billion Curagulus Coins to buy, or trade an item of equivalent value...","{Hyperversal Pursuer}:: An Armament of Extremity forged by the Extremity of Flames. 8 Billion Curagulus Coins to buy, or trade an item of equivalent value...","{Genesis Sword}:: An Armament of Extremity forged from the apocalypse and Genesis of one hundred Planes of Existence. 10 Billion Curagulus Coins to buy, or trade an item of equivalent value...","{Vacuous Moonshadow Scythe}:: An Armament of Extremity found in the stretches of Vacuous Hyperversal Domains. 11 Billion Curagulus Coins to buy, or trade an item of equivalent value...","{Leviathan Spear of Calamity}:: An Armament of Extremity forged from the bones of ten Hyperversal Extremity Leviathans from the Extremity Step of Andromeda. 11 Billion Curagulus Coins to buy, or trade an item of equivalent value...","The Relics shown were mind-numbingly glorious as each one had a high cost attached to it!","A cost in terms of Curagulus Currency- something one could attain from completing missions of the Curagulus of Extremity or by trading items into its Vaults.","When he arrived here, Noah's eyes shone with a profound brilliance as many possibilities rose in his mind.","The Relics he mass produced like the Quintessential Loot Seeker's Regalia Sets were considered Quasi-Extremity Relics. If he mass-produced more relics like this and traded them into the Vaults of Curagulus alongside Aeonic Treasures of Extremity and Spiritual Herbs from the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, would the sufficient currency required to obtain some of the more astounding things here be obtained in a smooth and quick manner?!","The idea had only just risen as there were still many things to consider, but Noah took his eyes away from the Vault of Curagulus and went towards the Missions tab before him.","He would first choose a mission to complete for the Curagulus of Extremity to gain an official tank in the coming days before the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification fully unfolded.","With the focus on {Missions}, waves of new information rose.","{Missions for Guardians are filtered on current location, connections, and difficulty based on your current power.}","{Golden Tier Mission}:: Surveillance- Observe and report the movements, conversations, and observable Histories of the Avernus Clan Scions and Elders for the next three days without being seen...","{Obsidian Tier Mission}:: Information- Rumor has it that the Cult of Endless Shadows has luckily attained an Armament of Extremity. Infiltrate and obtain information on this Armament by observing it personally...","{Golden Tier Mission}:: Achievement- obtain 10,000 Curagulus Coins through exchanging for treasures or relics...","A whole page of missions unfolded before Noah as they were filtered specifically for him, with the second one clearly being pointed towards him as the Curagulus wanted to obtain the details of the Shadow Sword that the Cult of Endless Shadows had attained!","These introductory missions were easy enough to complete as he would be considered an official Guardian thereafter, with numerous more boons becoming accessible to him after that as he would use the Curagulus to further his own gains.","As he became familiar with the Curagulus Mask and its features, the voice of the Adjudicator of Dissolution rang out in front of Noah.","{After you're acclimated, the inclusion of your First Commander of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven will be next. Thereafter, missions will be issued depending on how the Culmination Step begins to unfold.}","\"Oh?\"","Noah took off the Curagulus Mask as the Adjudicator's words as he asked lightly.","\"And does the Curagulus know anything more about what is to come in the last Culmination Step of the Seven Havens?\"","The Curagulus of Extremity was a massive organization spanning several Inheritances and even beings from the Seven Clans.","A Behemoth such as this should have compounded a dense amount of information as with its motto being the inclusion of prodigies across the Seven Havens, there should be numerous Hyperversal Extremities proficient in traversing the Aeonic Annals of Extremity among them!","{...}","Noah's words caused the surroundings to become utterly silent as it wasn't the Adjudicator of Dissolution who replied, but Extremity Marcellus who adorned his Curagulus Mask and spoke in an ancient tone.","{We know of a single sentence relating to the Culmination Step of Dissolution. And that is...As Above, So Below!}","...!","As Above, So Below!","A cryptic sentence about the Culmination Step that immediately caused numerous new options to rise in Noah's mind, with him giving a simple nod as the Adjudicator of Dissolution continued.","{Many seem to have forgotten or dismissed the mystery surrounding Extremity Sanctification. Why did it occur for every Haven? Why in sequence from oldest to youngest Haven? The objective of Extremity Sanctification is Extremity, but for what purpose? The existences within the Seven Havens are being ushered towards Extremity for a purpose, and the Extremity Sanctification of Dissolution is the last chance for this purpose. It will not be simple as even what we have discovered from the Aeonic Annals of Extremity...may not come close to understanding just what is about to happen!}","\"...\"","Words of utmost wisdom echoed out as Noah's eyes shone, countless thoughts passing through and going towards the Wealdian Council of Extremity to discuss as far down below from this location, the figure of Alexander King stepped out of the pocket of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority and looked up towards the endless skies tinged with death.","The power emanating from his body...was utterly brutal!"]},{"number":2594,"title":"Chapter 2594: Chapter 2593 The Shadow Sword! I","paragraphs":["The figure of Alexander stepped out of the pocket of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority and gazed at the Apex Battlefield filled with a deathly light.","Any beings that had remained nearby after the War had ended felt a sense of suffocation even from afar, with Alexander King being the culprit of Noah's recent overhaul of strength.","While Noah had transformed his 81 Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds into Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Overlord Meridian Seeds, the prompts that came for Alexander were just as illustrious since this version of Noah already had his Seeds sprout into genuine Meridians!","{The Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Meridians within your main body have transformed into the Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Overlord Meridians.}","{With the Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Overlord Meridians, all Concepts flowing within will be nourished by their authority as within 10 days, they will be elevated to the Quintessential Zenith Tier!}","Noah's main body would have had to wait for an unknown amount of time until he chose for the Seeds to Bloom into Meridians, but Alexander's already existing Overlord Meridians made it so that the counter of 10 days to bring his Boundaries to the Quintessential Zenith Tier had already begun.","Now, all that remained to do was wait.","The levels of the Boundaries within both the bodies of Alexander and Noah were now the same.","Within Alexander, there was also the Perennial Weald of Extremity!","The only thing unique was the fact that since both bodies shared Noah's single soul and he had already called out the Reified Wealdian Sources of Extremity, they couldn't somehow be called out again from Alexander as these Reified forms were singular in nature.","As Alexander's oppressive pressure caused the surroundings to seethe, a Hyperversal Extremity Authority erupted moments later to wrap around his body and cause him to disappear.","Thereafter, he appeared far above the skies of Dissolution as the figures of an Adjudicator, Guardians of Extremity, and his other self in the form of Noah's clone were all there.","{The First Commander of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven...has the one you follow briefed you already?}","The voice of Svetlana rang out as the figure of Alexander and Noah's clone gazed at each other.","Within their eyes, a devilish smile formed that only they could see as Alexander nodded!","With this, Noah was about to attain a second identity as a Guardian of Extremity, with the boons of this not yet apparent as only time would tell what would unfold!","—","Back in the Infinite Forge, Noah bejeweled Reified Wealdian Source of Lotra stared at the two Extremity Relics to have been spawned in the Forge and compared them to the Curagulus Mask- the former seeming like crude items in comparison to what the Extremity of Steel made as Noah didn't give them too much time before he motioned for them to float towards Ruination!","Ruination.","This would be the entity to devour even Extremity Relics as what Noah wanted was one truly powerful weapon, not many average ones.","At this stage, Ruination had changed so drastically that currently, she looked like a massive sword light years in size as her blade held crescent curves glinting with a sharp light!","The person to hold her hilt had to have the power to lift up an entire plane of Existence just to wield it as it was approaching an entirely profound stage!","When the two Extremity Relics moved towards it, Ruination's blade turned mobile and stretched out far faster than the speed of light, intercepting the two Relics halfway and devouring them with a flash of light!","A flash of light that caused it to radiate Crimson gold splendor after retreating- its makeup becoming even more dominant as layers of celestial light covered it.","\"Come.\" Noah then smiled and beckoned towards Ruination, this entity appearing before him in an instant and presenting its hilt towards him.","Up close, the crimson gold sword with crescent notches of its blade looked utterly magnificent as next, Noah's stellar gold hand wrapped around its hilt as he truly gazed at it.","And before him was brilliance.","{Name}:: Ruination(Ruined Blade of Quintessential Extremity)","{Lineage}:: Extremity Relic","{Titles}:: Ruination, Multiplicator, Emperor's Armament...","{Ruined Hyperversal Apex Mana Value}:: 250,000","{Ruined Hyperversal Apex Durability Value}:: Infinite","{Ruined Hyperversal Apex Soul Value}:: 250,000","{Ruined Hyperversal Apex Defense Value}:: 250,000","{Ruined Hyperversal Apex Damage Value}:: 250,000","{Features}:: Hyperversal Rupture, Hyperversal Proliferation, Hyperversal Armament Replication, Hyperversal Outburst...","{Miscellaneous}:: A unique relic that is on the glimpse of Extremity. Arriving here was already arduous enough as taking the step from a glimpse of Extremity to become a relic expressing genuine Hyperversal Extremity is nearly an impossibility that only the most perceptive existences that have achieved Hyperversal Extremity can overcome...","A weapon of ridiculous proportions!","Apart from Noah's Infinite Hyperversal Haven, this was his greatest achievement that he was cultivating in his very own Soul after seeing Aurelia nurturing her own relic.","'Aurelia...' Noah smiled as he thought what this loot lover would be like if she could glimpse this absurd weapon in his hands.","She and all other Vassals with their clones stretching out within Dissolution still had their Main Bodies in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as in the days to come, they would be absorbing the exorbitant duration of Loot obtained from the Apex War of Annihilation to elevate their Boundaries and Realms.","The Loot was of little consequence to Noah as among his abilities from Lotra was a singular one termed {Lotra's Claim}!","{Lotra's Claim}:: All loot courses through you, even from those who share the simplest connection with you. When your Vassals defeat any enemies that drop Loot, it is automatically replicated into your Vaults of Quintessence. This is a passive ability that is of no cost to remain active for as long as you exist...","One of the abilities of A Dynamis of Extremity that held the shortest descriptions.","And yet it was overbearing as even if Noah didn't directly kill an enemy, beings he shared connections with defeating any enemies generated loot for him in his Expansive Domain that were now renamed as the Vaults of Quintessence!"]},{"number":2595,"title":"Chapter 2595: Chapter 2594 The Shadow Sword! II","paragraphs":["The Loot his Vassals received was replicated in his Vaults as it meant any forms of Panaceas, Aeonic Treasures of Extremity, or any Loot that aided in the advancement of Boundaries and Convergence of Dynamis...Noah gained it freely in addition to his Vassals having it themselves.","And then, Noah had already begun collecting all the Loot his Vassals received as in addition to loot generated in his Vaults of Quintessence...he would have the daring weapon before his eyes multiply all of them.","The results...would naturally be an overabundance of Loot that would be more than enough to take his Vassals across the Boundary Layers with ease!","Over the next few days before the Culmination Step began, there was a great deal to be done as the speed of Noah's advancement...","would not only be limited to himself!","—","Apex Aeonic Lifeforms waited with bated breaths for the Culmination Step of Extremity Sanctification to begin, the changes of the Extremity Vein continuing as it rose to the skies and pulsed with a breathtaking authority.","The mountains of bones and deathly verdant black authority remained even after the hours began to pass on the Apex Battlefield, the name of a single being and his faction slowly spreading amongst the Scions who witnessed the War.","Noah Osmont.","Alexander King!","The Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","These terms spread as ever so slowly, it was known that a single being and his Lineage had pointed their swords towards the Avernus Clan and Singularity Overseers!","More and more forces from different Havens began to arrive into Dissolution at such a time as no matter how many hours passed, the Culmination Step did not seem ready to begin as across the endlessly stretching Extremity Vein of Dissolution, a low hum resounded akin to a foreboding beating heart.","Each pulse coming out caused alterations in reality as the spacetime continuum was twisted and expanded- changes leading to unknown phenomena blooming!","And during this passage of a day, the True Emperor of Quintessence had his forces stretching out into different Havens along with the optimization of strength his main body was carrying out in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","He had the Dream Aletheian Chassis move with Erikson towards the Aeonic Haven of Genesis- a Branch of the Sima Clan located within this Haven, just like all the Seven Havens!","The Seven Clans had their reach extending into each Haven as before Extremity Sanctification fully unfolded within a Haven, they couldn't occupy it and make impenetrable domains within.","He had the Prana Aletheian Chassis moving with Ayame as it was already in the Helios Haven- towards a corner of it where a Branch of the Infinite Extremity could be found!","Each of these clones enjoyed traversing across the cracks between Havens with the aid of Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Extremities supporting Erikson and Ayame, but the wonders of these clones and what they would attain in their respective locations had yet to show themselves.","Instead, one clone was finally making strides- and it was the clone within the Haven of Penumbra!","—","In a corner of Penumbra.","Within the Domains of the Cult of Endless Shadows, a massive Shadow Fortress light years in size stood with might and power as within it- Noah's clone was finally allowed to move as he followed Extremity Gabriella into the depths of this heavily fortified domain that seemed to blaze with auras of Hyperversal Extremities in every corner!","They had already passed through a dozen doorways that each led into domains as vast as Planes, each of them showing intricate structures and clusters of civilizations within that showed a glimpse of just how large an Inheritance like the Cult of Endless Shadows was.","At this time, Noah walked behind Extremity Gabriella atop a sea of completely inky black water as their destination...was a torrential swirling of this dark sea that formed into a circular rift in space- the brilliant aura of a Hyperversal Extremity Authority standing before this shadow sea rift!","A Shadow Extremity adorned in an obsidian tight fitting shirt and loose pants, with a dark straw hat adorned on his head as at their arrival, he raised his gaze to lock onto Noah and spoke with raised eyes.","{The oh so famous Noah Osmont who is challenging the Avernus Clan is honoring us with his presence.}","The words were laid back as this existence seemed to be having fun with them, not paying too much heed to Extremity Gabriella as this Shadow Extremity was one of the second most powerful Hyperversal Extremity within the Cult of Endless Shadows!","The Flashing Shadow!","An existence that had earned his name in the Vacuous Domains with an array of accomplishments from the Crimson Haven Albatrosses he carried.","His status could Best be shown by how he currently guarded the only area that would lead to the Armament of Extremity in the hands of the Cult of Endless Shadows.","The Shadow Sword!","Extremity Gabriella gazed at the Flashing Shadow with a composed gaze as she spoke.","{It is just to uphold the Oath of Extremity that the Primeval Elder under Extremity Laos made with his permission. How is the progress of Moona?}","She asked about the being who should be alone with the Shadow Sword at this very moment within the torrential swirling portal ahead of them.","The being who was already halfway through Extremity and should simply be stabilizing their Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Shadows very soon- an action that would put their Inheritance alongside behemoths like Singularity Overseers or the Genesis Institute of Extremity!","The Flashing Shadow smiled at the reference of Moona as he nodded with pride.","{He will be emerging out soon, he needs the time to absorb his recent gains anyways as this Osmont can enter the Shadow Sea Plane then. Though I can't promise how long he will even be able to last before the authority of an Armament of Extremity before he is thrown out!}","WAA!","Yes!","Before the might of the Shadow Sword, many Apex Aeonic Lifeforms couldn't even last a few seconds as only the most clever and powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who had grasped the 16th Boundary Layer of the Shadows or higher had any sufficient gains.","The protecting Extremity protecting the Shadow Sword concealed within the depths of the Shadow Sea Plane suggested that Noah may not even be able to last a few seconds!"]},{"number":2596,"title":"Chapter 2596: Chapter 2595 The Shadow Sword! III","paragraphs":["The inky black sea formed into a massive rift portal that led into the Shadow Sea Plane.","Within, an existence on the cusp of genuine Hyperversal Extremity would soon step out as Noah could then go in and face the grandeur of the Shadow Sword- the length of time he would be able to hold on and the possible gains he could make being unknown at this moment!","—","In the Fifth Golden Chambers of Avernus.","Tendrils of Hyperversal Authority cascaded over this ancient structure as the thrones that were filled with distinguished existences used all of their power and might to come up with means against a single existence.","Currently, multiple Scions and Elders of the Avernus Clan were dispatched into the Planar Palisades of Extremity.","Their purpose was a singular one- to find Noah Osmont!","At this time, another Hyperversal Extremity rose from his throne to obtain the attention of everyone here.","His voice was an astounding one filled with power.","{Since the records of this Osmont are veiled, I've been looking through the records of those near him that are not hidden within the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, and the records of the Elders of the Cult of Endless Shadows have been more than helpful!}","...!","{It seems that the boldness shown by the Cult of Endless Shadows lies in the fact that they actually got their hands on an Armament of Extremity. The record of the Primeval elder I have seen shows that they have in hand...the Shadow Sword forged by the very Extremity of Steel!","BOOM!","Magisterial information entered the minds of the Avernus Extremities in the Fifth Golden Chambers of Avernus.","{An Armament of Extremity!}","Chamber Master Gayacus uttered with a profound expression as many possibilities rose in his mind.","At the side, the figure of Extremity Ariana had an even more thoughtful expression as with a pondering and yet cautious gaze, she spoke out slowly.","{An Oath of Extremity was made in the Haven of Dissolution. And the Cult of Endless Shadows has something as pristine as an Armament of Extremity, with the Clone of this Noah Osmont seen leaving with the Elder of the Cult of Endless Shadows into the haven of Penumbra. All of this seems connected as likely, Osmont might just be getting entry to the Armament of Extremity himself from an Oath he made with them! After all, there are the records of his clones leading the Shadowlings in the Initiation Step of Dissolution...}","...!","A terrifying amount of information was collected!","An incredible genius who could already rival and beat down a Direct Disciple of a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity.","If he was given free access to an Armament of Extremity, just how terrifying could he become?","The possibilities were dreadful to imagine as the minds of many beings here thought of the three examples that Chamber Master Gayacus had given at the beginning of this meeting.","At such a juncture, the voice of the existence that was formerly known as the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction thundered out.","{We already made a move to act against an Adjudicator of a Haven. Why can we not send some of our forces against a lesser Inheritance that hasn't even entered the folds of the most powerful inheritances? We can simply make a move against the Cult of Endless Shadows, possibly gain access to a body of this Osmont, and at the same time...obtain an Weapon of Extremity from a small force undeserving of it?!}","Rage and wildness can still be felt from the past Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction as he seemed to truly want wanton destruction at this moment in time.","Yet his idea caused the minds of Extremity Ariana and the Chamber Master to shine with the light of possibilities.","A silence descended.","Nobody spoke thereafter as the words of the past Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction had too many profound implications. It wasn't until a few seconds passed when the voice of The Chamber Master rang out.","\"An action such as this is not something I can decide upon myself...","with it being very unlikely to be allowed. I will send this proposal upwards to the Avernus Extremity Senate and see what the results shall be.\"","...!","Hyperversal Extremity Authority glimmered.","The eyes of the Chamber Master released a profound light that instantly disappeared from this domain and shot out into the vast unknown, reaching out and communicating in an unfathomable way towards a far distant database!","Before his eyes, the vision of the Chamber Master changed from merely gazing at the figures of those in the Fifth Golden Chambers of Avernus as he appeared in a stellar blank void that had a single blinking singularity of consciousness.","The Singularity seemed more massive than what the Chamber Master had achieved in all his life as he respectfully sent the information of the suggestion that was just made towards it- towards the communication channel that would be passed onto the Avernus Extremity Senate!","He knew that it came from the part of anger and rage within the past Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction as it was unlikely to be adopted, but he thought he might as well try before he received the rejection. After all, the blatant attack towards an Inheritance of Extremity was something that even one of the seven clans would not freely do- something like this clearly breaking regulations set forth by the Senatus of Extremity!","And yet...not even a few seconds passed before the blinding Singularity before Gayacus' eyes came out with an answer.","And the answer wasn't from the voice that he was normally used to communicating with when he sent his proposals to the Avernus Extremity Senate.","It was the voice of someone who sat at the very peak of the Senate.","It was the voice of the Avernus Extremity Overlord!","{Proceed with this suggestion and acquire the Shadow Sword. Extremity Blue will be sent forth to join you all in leading this incursion.}","..!","The voice was callous and filled with authority.","And it carried a decision that Chamber Master Gayacus was shocked at- especially due to the one authorizing it!"]},{"number":2597,"title":"Chapter 2597: Chapter 2596 The Shadow Sword! IV","paragraphs":["The words buzzed in Chamber Master Gayacus even now as the authoritative voice stemming from the brilliant singularity before him actually approved the proposal brought forth by the past Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction!","It was because choosing to go forth with the proposal would make many things problematic- especially the standing of the Avernus Clan in the Senatus of Extremity which was made up of the most powerful existences within the Seven Havens.","Their standing in the Senatus of Extremity would not allow them to blatantly conduct an act of aggression against an Inheritance of Extremity. It would subjugate them to scrutiny and allow their enemies within the Senatus of Extremity to move against them!","Because this proposal had nothing to do with the Guardians of Extremity that a majority of the hegemonies with the Senatus of Extremity were now cautious of with their rise in power over the years.","It dealt with an Inheritance and the very laws of the Investiture of Extremity crafted by the Senatus of Extremity!","So, if a force ever did anything against an Inheritance or Clan, it would be behind the scenes where their name could not be traced to any actions concretely.","The Cult of Endless Shadows openly accepted and didn't deny the close ties with Osmont as they weren't afraid of the Avernus Clan openly dealing with them, and the light of infamy would put their Inheritance in the spotlight as they rose to prominence with an Armament of Extremity backing them.","At least, this is what the Cult of Endless Shadows believed.","{Sire, are you sure?}","It was a hesitant question emanating out from Gayacus as the voice of authority from the other side was as stable and powerful as before.","{Yes. There is a great deal of chaos coming...to the extent that even the hands of the Senatus of Extremity are about to be tied. Minor incursions like the incursion in the Haven of Dissolution and what is about to happen in the Haven of Penumbra will be insignificant incidents in the face of what is to come.}","...!","The voice thundered down.","Chamber Master Gayacus listened and bowed without another delay as he moved to carry out the will of a being that he had been serving even before he became a Hyperversal Extremity!","A being whose wisdom and talent knew no bounds as he took a small and insignificant inheritance years ago and raised to the stature of a Clan.","A devilish smile bloomed on Gayacus as he moved to accomplish this being's will.","The incursion this time was a unique one.","Their target was an Armament of Extremity as a secondary target was the existence that the Fifth Golden Chamber of Avernus was targeting personally.","Their incursion would lead them to the doorsteps of the Cult of Endless Shadows in the Haven of Penumbra!","—","Atop the churning sea collecting to form a radiant black rift portal that led into the Shadow Sea Plane.","The figure of the Flashing Shadow stared with languid eyes at Noah's figure as his authority seemed to meld with the surrounding sea, his obsidian straw haw glimmering with the light of an Extremity Relic as before he could say any antagonizing words, the portal behind him trembled!","BZZT!","It was a pulsing stemming within the very depths of the rift as moments later, a middle-aged man radiating unstable waves of Hyperversal Extremity Authority was spat out.","He cut a sorry figure, and yet his face showed happiness as he laughed boisterously while waves of shadows crackled around him!","{The 18th Boundary Layer! The 18th! I've half grasped it as I just need to ponder on Shadows a little more before I can fully claim Hyperversal Extremity Authority for myself!}","The man showed immense emotion as he was none other than Moona.","The last genius Elder of the Cult of Endless Shadows to be granted the chance to observe the Shadow Sword as Extremity was in his grasp!","{Yeah yeah, you need the demeanor of a Hyperversal Extremity before you can become one. Control yourself in front of a guest.}","The voice of Flashing Shadow emanated out as Moona raised his eyes while looking towards Extremity Gabriella and Noah's visage.","{Oh? Fresh fish to be crushed by the weight of the Shadow Sword? This boy barely gives off waves of Boundaries at the 14th or 15th level...his soul is going to face a severe backlash and be thrown out within a few nanoseconds, you know?}","Moona spoke with a smile while containing himself, the shadows around him forming in a dazzling robe as he depicted a refined figure of a scholar at this moment with his scrutinizing eyes.","He knew better than others how terrifying the pressure of the Shadow Sword was as he was on the 17th Boundary Layer of Shadows and he could only remain in the periphery of the Hyperversal Extremity Authority of the Shadow Sword for days before slowly moving forward and coming in contact with it!","And this was when he felt his mastery in Shadows accelerate as he was now half an Extremity.","For a being with a weak soul who hadn't even achieved the 15th or 16th boundary layer? They were asking for trouble to come here!","Moona gazed at Flashing Shadow and Extremity Gabriella as they should know this, but Gabriella shook her head with a smile while motioning Noah forward, her Mental Power sending a private message to Moona.","'Our younger acquaintance here has an oath as he does not wish to wait. We complete the oath on our end by letting him see the Shadow Sword, if he cannot have his soul withstand even a nanosecond of it...that's on his end. We will keep the Shadow Sword as a carrot for him to chase as a means of connecting this genius with our Cult.'","...!","The private words sent by the soul were astonishing as Moona couldn't help but smile.","He gazed at Noah's form that stretched at this moment, his voice coming out with calmness even while surrounded by Hyperversal Extremities.","\"How kind of you all to worry about me...but you can rest easy.\"","WAA!","His words were indifferent as in the next instant, his body pulsed with light and began to peel.","From it, celestial rainbow-colored skin began to form as a humanoid entity came to be, the head missing a nose and mouth radiant multicolored pupils were the only thing on the face!"]},{"number":2598,"title":"Chapter 2598: Chapter 2597 The Shadow Sword! V","paragraphs":["An aurora of wings of light expanded behind the back of the Entity as it was akin to him coming out of the body of Noah's clone.","It was the appearance of the Reified Source of Quintessence as Noah replaced a clone to have one of his most powerful forms here for the purposes of attaining the most gains from the Shadow Sword!","When it came to the Reified Sources of Extremity that Noah could now call out, the limitation of 9 when it came to his concepts had been doubled as a maximum of 18 could now be called out, this number not including the completely separate Wealdian Sources of Extremity that were born from his Dynamis!","He could truly have many bodies moving and doing a great deal of things as the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity appeared for the Shadow Sword.","He appeared while expressing 9x of Noah's main body's ridiculous foundation and soul that was pulsing with transformations from a constant clash of Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","{Ho?}","His change caused the brows of Flashing Shadow to rise as he nodded slightly, noticing the change of aura Noah gave off as he pointed to the pulsing rift behind him.","{There is nobody in the Shadow Sea Plane now as you can step into it. What you can gain is all up to you.}","He pointed to the rift behind him and retracted his Hyperversal Extremity Authority as an existence not of the Cult of Endless Shadows was given access to one of their most secure locations!","A location that a Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity guarded personally.","Noah's multicolored figure floated off the dark sea around him and went forward, the figure of the being about to grasp Extremity smiling at his entry as his voice echoed out.","{Brother Flashing Shadow, why don't you allow us access to watch for ourselves what will unfold when our young friend here steps into the Shadow Sea Plane?}","It was Moona's voice that echoed out with a sly smile as he wanted to see.","The genius Lifeforms that many eyes were on currently.","The being who skipped the line to be the next one to gaze at the Shadow Sword because of his talent wanting to be roped into the Cult!","Frankly, Moona had reservations about this as he and those before him had worked hard for the Cult to get the opportunity, possibility, prospect, opening, option, likelihood, shot, break, occasion, fortune they did, and yet this being was getting the same chance just because he forged an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity before even becoming an Apex Aeonic Lifeform?","Even as he was about to attain Hyperversal Extremity Authority fully, Moona was still an existence at the level of ApexLifeform not too long ago as he allowed his feelings to flow freely.","He wanted to see this being face the might of the mere presence of the Shadow Sword from far away as in the face of it...his soul would feel suffocated before he was automatically expelled from the Shadow Sea Plane!","Among their own people, there was an Elder who had achieved the 16th Boundary Layer of Shadows who went into the Shadow Sea Plane...and he was expelled in less than a minute.","He wanted to see the scene of this being put in his place as the Hyperversal Extremity Authority of the Shadow Sword was more than enough for this.","{Mmm...very well.} The Flashing Shadow seemed to think briefly before he shook his head this laziness, his straw hat becoming buried deeper in his face as he motioned for Extremity Gabriella and Moona- a light wrapping around them that also went towards Noah as all four beings...quickly turned into glimmers of light that disappeared into the magnificent rift!","—","An Armament of Extremity.","The Shadow Sword.","It was one of the 81 Armaments spread out across the Havens by the Extremity of Steel as those who found one...had a nearly guaranteed chance of achieving Extremity!","But one didn't just have to find such an Armament...they also had to be able to bear the weight of its authority when they came near it.","Why was an Armament of Extremity so special that its atmosphere, vibe, energy, presence, feeling, ambience, spirit, essence, mood, aura was conducive to having one achieve Extremity more so than the Hyperversal Extremity Authority of an Existence that had attained Extremity?","The main thing was its purity.","Purity!","The one who forged the Armament of Extremity was a being at the very Zenith of Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity if not already at Tier 4 as they installed a concept that had achieved Extremity into a Relic...and completely detached their will from it to cause the emergence of an Armament that held its own circulatory functions that existed only for that single concept of Extremity!","It was akin to the birth of a new Entity that only circulated the pure, untainted essence of only this idea, notion, theory, belief, philosophy, principle, doctrine, ideology, conceptualization, understanding for all their lifetime.","It was destructive, powerful, and magisterial as once an Armament was born, the pure raging essence within it could more closely and easily aid one in extrapolating the essence it stood for towards Extremity as those talented enough may even be able to extrapolate other concepts to Extremity from it.","Moona could not forget its authority as he was just in the Shadow Sea Plane not too long ago, his body once again feeling the changes of arriving here again as his will spread out.","Around them, a heavy and stifling body of water glimmered all around, their figures floating in a straight line as around them...","thundering tendrils of an extremely pure form of Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Shadows could be seen coiling and lashing out!","They seemed mild and calmer in this region they were in as when one looked further and deeper into the Shadow Sea Plane, they would see the tendrils of coiling pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Shadows only become thicker and more oppressive until they formed tendrils of darkness as dense as rivers of reality- and all of them danced wildly around a single item far in the distance.","A massive item that was surrounded by heavy and dangerously crackling tendrils of Shadows as even though it floated in the black sea, it seemed to be piercing and cutting into the reality around its sharp edges as it was currently anchored down in the center of this Plane!","It emanated a breathtaking might that even common Hyperversal Extremities may not be able to match.","Amidst the crackling and massive tendrils of black, dark, jet-black, ebony, pitch-black, coal-black, sable, inky, raven, slate pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority, the shape and hilt of the blade could barely be made out as one had to get close to truly see it in its glory!","Moona recalled the suffocating sensation he felt that made him unable to even move for the first few minutes when he arrived right here and looked at the sword in the distance as he smiled.","He was only able to move after acclimating for a few minutes, and it took days to arrive in contact with the Shadow Sword as it took all of his soul power to do so!","He turned to look at the figure of Noah Osmont as he expected to see a being already on his knees, trying their best to survive the crashing Hyperversal Authority all around him.","And yet...","He saw a being with an utterly calm gaze as his multicolored eyes blinked like luminous suns, his hands rising freely as he played with the tendrils of shadows arcing across the surroundings!","'Huh?'","Moona blinked many times over as he wondered if his eyes were seeing correctly!","Did...did Osmont not face an oppressive pressure from all around? Was the pure and uncontrolled Hyperversal Extremity Authority not causing his soul to at least splinter before the automatic sensory function of the Shadow Sea Plane activated to kick him out before he was gravely injured?","These questions rose before Moona's eyes as next, he saw the aurora of wings of light behind this being flap as...","SHAA!","He began to smoothly glide forward as if the powerful tendrils of pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority that were thundering all around them were nothing!"]},{"number":2599,"title":"Chapter 2599: Chapter 2598 The Shadow Sword! VI","paragraphs":["{What the hell?!}","It wasn't even Moona who uttered this as the visage of Gabriella was shocked and unconsciously moved, the figure of Flashing Shadow becoming stern at the unimaginable scene before them!","It was now that the thundering tendrils of obsidian pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority began to coil around Noah's body and sinking into it- and they did so at a shocking pace as if his body was a sponge.","A dry sponge as empty as a desert as the pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority in the surroundings was naturally pulled into his body!","Moona couldn't even fathom any words as he stood floating, watching the figure of Noah seamlessly and easily glide forward towards the massive Shadow Sword in the distance where the closer one went, the more terrifying and concentrated the pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority became!","The whole area was filled with terrifying tendrils of light and darkness.","At the very center, the Shadow Sword was anchored in space while radiating its pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority!","Moona had spent many days in this Shadow Sea Plane, and he knew the sheer power and authority that was required for one to merely maintain their presence within this place.","So exactly how was the being before his eyes doing what he was doing?!","—","When Noah first entered the Shadow Sea Plane, the feeling that he got was an ecstatic one.","His Quintessential Emperor of Extremity was expressing everything about Noah's foundation, along with having the soul that had just gone through cycles of True Death not too long ago.","His soul had exceeded the rate at which it was destroyed and the rate at which it healed itself as currently, there were still cracks here and there.","And the moment that he appeared in the Shadow Sea Plane, he felt the raging Hyperversal Extremity Authority around him begin to sink into his stellar pores and flow directly into the crevices of his soul that were the aftermath of the clash between Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","{Extremely pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority is flowing into your soul!}","{Extremely pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority is flowing into all of your aspects of existence!}","The prompts shone in dazzling black gold light as they came and went, Noah's hands rising and feeling the tendrils of power around him as unconsciously, the wings behind his back pulsed.","And he found himself gliding ever closer to the massive and heart shaking sword in the distance.","And just floating closer to this small distance caused the concentration of pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority to increase many times over!","It sank into his aspects of existence as not too long after...","{Due to the Pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Shadows entering your soul, the First Boundary Layer of Shadows has been attained.}","{The Second Boundary Layer of Shadows has been attained...}","A set of prompts began to cascade one after another as Noah very quickly ascended past the boundary layers of shadows as if they did not even exist for him!","As this occurred, he closely felt the streams of pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Shadows flow into the crevices of his soul as Vitalis and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority began to run wild once more, their clashes producing even more waves of destruction as Noah began to feel the noticeable increase in his Soul Values!","The gains of merely being close to the Shadow Sword were so tremendous as if he could actually get close to it and grasp it in his hands...Noah had an inkling that he may just be able to jump past the 15th Boundary Layer and beyond with the way his soul was freely drinking up the surrounding pure Hyperversal Extremity Authority!","Noah felt this with his very soul.","He did...but at the same time, Oraculum shone with a halcyon light over his soul.","His expectant eyes looking forward to what was to come dimmed.","{Adumbrative Viewpoint} had activated within the most perceptive part of his soul...the Reified Wealdian Source of Oraculum that was already traversing in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!","It was viewing Unrecorded Histories, and many possible futures were instantly altered as three brilliant ones were the only paths shown to him!","Their beginnings showed him an alarming future where Hyperversal Extremity Authority barreled down the Shadow Sea Plane in all directions as the color blue maddeningly covered everything.","It was a shocking change as the pages of three Unrecorded Histories quickly bloomed before him!","Their pages fluttered as the first path revealed itself.","{{Sensing a shocking development, you instantly warned the three Hyperversal Extremity Shadows behind you...The Flashing Shadow was instantly alerted as his first action was to secure the Shadow Sword, your soul seeing this precious Armament swept away as you never even got a chance to lay a hand on it.}","The first path played out as it was an unfavorable one.","{{{Sensing a shocking development, you scrambled towards the Shadow Sword at the fastest speed you could muster as String Theory Manifestation unveiled itself, your soul traversing across the tendrils of Shadows to very quickly near the Armament of Extremity!}}","The second one seemed to hold more possibilities as the third one...","its golden page was ripped apart as it was fractured as if it never existed!","There were already limited choices to make, and they had to be made fast as alarmingly, Noah found his Quintessential Emperor of Extremity in a predicament on a path that should have given him great gains!","His Reified Source of Quintessence that was moving across the Shadow Sea Plane instantly became serious as the authority of a now Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity that had undergone elevation in the past day unfolded through nothing else other than...","{String Theory Manifestation}.","...!","In Noah's eyes, everything slowed as his heart released a pulse that waved out like a vibrating string of light across the Shadow Sea Plane.","Where this string passed, countless other strings vibrated.","Like they were part of it all. Like everything was interconnected with traces of the Aletheian Quintessential Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.","Through these countless strings, his soul could convey itself with utmost speed as an instant later, an astounding scene that caused the gaze of Hyperversal Extremity Shadows to almost pop out of their orbits unfolded!"]},{"number":2600,"title":"Chapter 2600: Chapter 2599 Nice to meet you, greenhorns! I","paragraphs":["At the same time Noah was alarmed by the drastic Unrecorded Histories about to unfold.","Hours had gone and passed in the past day as only his clone remained above the skies of Dissolution with the Adjudicator.","At this moment, he moved to relay this message so he could at the very least put this being or the Curagulus of Extremity to use when...","BOOM!","The Hyperversal Extremity Authority surrounding the Adjudicator of Dissolution erupted as she exclaimed incredulously.","{The Avernus Clan would actually be so reckless?! To attack an Inheritance?!}","The Avernus Clan?","Noah's will moved quickly as he put the many details of Unrecorded Histories together.","He just knew Hyperversal Extremity Authority would erupt as the Shadow Fortress would be attacked. He didn't know who or what as now, the culprit was unveiled!","Before any time passed, his own voice thundered out towards The Adjudicator of Dissolution.","\"My clone is about to come in contact with the Armament of Extremity- the Shadow Sword within the depths of the Cult of Endless Shadows! Hyperversal Extremities will soon descend as their target should be the Armament of Extremity...if there are any nearby Guardians in Penumbra, they need to be mobilized now!\"","...!","His words caused Svetlana to turn to him with brightly shining eyes as they revealed a few things for both Noah and this Hyperversal Extremity before him.","The major one was the fact that the means of the Curagulus of Extremity were genuine as they somehow caught wind of an incursion before it even happened.","The other...was that Noah somehow had the capability to do so as well, with his means being more realistic as he was involved in the event as he would be more perceptive to it!","The Adjudicator looked at Noah closely before she voiced out in a dark tone.","{The mission has already been handed out to relevant nearby members.}","As she spoke, Noah's Curagulus Mask flashed to life as a new mission rose before him.","{Crimson Mission}:: Support and Survival- Aid in stopping the destruction of the Cult of Endless Shadows as much as possible, with a secondary mission of stopping the Armament of Extremity from being obtained by the unknown attackers. Contribution and rewards will be measured depending on the ultimate result...","A dazzling mission appeared that Noah instantly accepted!","—","An extending inky black Extremity Vein of Penumbra could be seen with luster in the distance.","Far from it, in an insignificant corner of Penumbra, one of the main headquarters of the Cult of Endless Shadows could be seen.","It was chosen to hold the only Armament of Extremity in their grasp- the Shadow Sword.","{A cute little Inheritance, isn't it?}","Above the space of this branch of the Cult of Endless Shadows, a voice stemming from a being adorned in a beautiful cerulean hue could be heard.","An exquisite blue dress made of hundreds of gems that radiated auras of Extremity Relics was adorned on her body as she had snow-white hair dripping to her shoulders, her pupils shining with a boundless blue light as her figure emanated dangerous beauty!","A white whip was twirled around her waist as it pulsed with sharpness and danger, her whole visage giving off silent waves of power at the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity level.","Beside her, the veiled figures of Extremity Ariana, Chamber Master Gayacus, the past Extremity of Destruction, and 8 other Hyperversal Extremities floated serenely while they gazed at the branch of the Cult of Endless Shadows below them.","{Extremity Blue...why aren't you veiling yourself at all?}","The voice of Chamber Master Gayacus rose calmly and cautiously as if he almost didn't want to speak towards this being.","Extremity Blue.","A renowned Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity within the Avernus Clan as she went by a few other names.","The Extremity of Lunacy.","The Extremity of Madness!","She held a uniquely profound power at Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity as even Chamber Master Gayacus and Extremity Ariana couldn't confidently say they could defeat her!","She had yet to reach Zenith and stand alongside beings like Emperor Shao, but she held her own unique power that caused her to stand out amongst others.","It was a power that was commonly seen in Seers who could traverse across the Aeonic Annals of Extremity with ease- a power that beings with Mutated Souls or with extremely powerful souls could express in a much greater form than others!","It was known as Hyperversal Haki of Extremity.","The release of one's soul power in such a way that an instant burst contained the trace authorities of all their Boundaries and Dynamis in the form of a Haki that didn't deplete any resources- and yet it could put one's enemies facing it in an extremely disadvantaged position, with those weaker than them receiving a shock into their souls as their very Records could be shattered due to it.","This was Hyperversal Haki of Extremity! It was far different than the mere base form of Haki that others could release as for those who could manipulate it to even greater and more profound levels, it was said that Zenith would not be too far away from them.","In addition to such a power that even Extremity Ariana and Chamber Master Gayacus could not release, Extremity Blue held such distinctions of Lunacy and Madness. Her disposition was one that caused many Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremities to not even wish to deal with her!","Towards the question...","{Why bother to hide at this point? If the words of the Overlord are correct, none of it will matter. Even now, they have likely been alerted that we are moving...so why don't we drop all pretenses and have fun?}","...!","Her eyes smiled innocently as they hid waves of Lunacy and craziness within- a weak man likely to be taken in by such a gaze without knowing just what was in store for them.","Chamber Master Gayacus nodded with a contemplative look as he began to speak.","{Alright, let's beg-}","{Hey.}","And he was interrupted right away.","His cautious eyes turned towards Extremity Blue's face which radiated a light of innocence as she spoke with a smile.","{Did you know that in life, things such as destiny and fate do not matter?}","They were at such a crucial juncture, and yet she thought this was a good time to begin monologuing?","Chamber Master Gayacus wished to stop her, but her snow-white hair shone as her gem-like blue eyes gazed upwards towards the endless streaks of darkness and shadows around them.","{It all comes down to choices...and one will either make the right choice, or the wrong choice. True power...is to forcefully make it so that every choice you make is the right choice!}","WAA!","{...}","Her words caused the Extremities around her to gaze at each other with annoyed eyes as Extremity Blue nodded to herself.","{Mmm, so what that means is that today, you every shall make all the right moves by sticking with me. Alright...let's begin.}","...!","She grasped the whip by her waist and unfurled it.","In the stellar blackness of shadowy space every around them, it felt like a massive serpentine light flashed as if an endlessly vast serpent had woken up.","With a brilliant smile, Extremity Blue gazed at the silent branch of the Cult of Endless Shadows as her eyes pierced across layers of space to land on a Shadow Fortress within its very depths.","Her red lips moved as her fair face shone like a cold emperor.","{It's a good day to die...}","And an immediate later...","Her eyes pulsed.","THUMP!","As if it was the beating of an ancient heart.","But...it was the distinctive expression of her soul as astoundingly, blue tendrils of light instantly exploded from her eyes as Hyperversal Haki of Extremity unfolded alarmingly- and she didn't at every contain it in a single specified region as she allowed it to barrel down to the myriad of Planes of Existence of the whole branch of the Cult of Endless Shadows underneath them!","...!"]}]);
